langen^The glittering rose petals on these bushes...were all golden.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　その黄金の薔薇園に舞い散る花びらのように、@にぎやかに舞っていた黄金の蝶たちの群は、どこにも見ることが出来ない…。\
langen^The cloud of gold butterflies that had once danced through this golden rose garden like fluttering rose petals...^@^was no longer anywhere to be seen...^\

