advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　笑えば笑うほどに品を失う彼女のあの笑い声を、…もう聞くことは出来ない。\
langen^That laugh of hers, which lost its grace more and more the longer it continued, ......could no longer be heard.^\

bg new_rose_3ap,2
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　黄金の魔女ベアトリーチェは、@黄金の薔薇園に負けない美しき装飾のデッキチェアに、人形のように座っている。\
langen^The Golden Witch Beatrice...^@^sat like a doll, resting in a deck chair adorned as beautifully as the golden rose garden itself.^\

