;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800003.ogg":^"...If only he'd been sick in bed for a year or so first.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800004.ogg":^  I do wish he could have died after a grace period during which the proper arrangements could have been made."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a1_def1.png",80
