advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　喪主として万事を取り計らい、葬式外交を完全にこなして、@右代宮家が依然、政財界に大きな影響力を持つことをアピールしなくてはならない。@
langen^He would have to arrange everything as the host of the event, carry out funeral diplomacy perfectly, ^@^and make it clear to all that the Ushiromiya family still had enormous influence in the political and financial spheres.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

