langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900015.ogg":^"...Please, stay strong.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900016.ogg":^  There are a great many people who will plan to devour everything Father has left behind.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900017.ogg":^  We must fight to protect Father's honor and wealth.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900018.ogg":^  That is the first responsibility of the Ushiromiya Head."^\

