langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900024.ogg":^"Can't you do something about that...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900025.ogg":^  Even though he has passed away, Father's body is precious.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900026.ogg":^  Any damage done to it would not be acceptable..."^\

