langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900027.ogg":^"...Understood.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900028.ogg":^  Please keep it to an absolute minimum.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900029.ogg":^  Make sure that Father's dignity is not damaged, even by mistake."^\

