;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\51900013.ogg":^"That will be fine.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\51900014.ogg":^  Do not worry.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\51900015.ogg":^  ...In any event, leave Kinzo-san to us and stay by Krauss-san's side.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\51900016.ogg":^  ...Things will start to get quite difficult from here on out."^\

