;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900046.ogg":^"What's wrong, dear...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900047.ogg":^  Have I said something rude...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900048.ogg":^  If so, please forgive me."^\

