advsetwindow "03"

langjp「えぇ、わかっています。@心を整理するためにも必要です。@…私たちはその時間をあなたにあげようと、ここから静かに出て行くだけですよ…？」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900049.ogg":^"Yes, I understand.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900050.ogg":^  It's important to sort things out inside your heart.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900051.ogg":^  ...We were just going to leave this place in silence to give you some time, okay...?"^\

