langjp「だからそれを待てというのだ……。@……いいか、誰もその場から動くな。@一歩たりともだ…。@……疲れたなら椅子にでもソファーにでも好きに座ればいい。@だから何もしゃべらずに静かに黙って、何もせずにいろッ！」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800017.ogg":^"And I'm telling you to wait before doing that......^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800018.ogg":^  ......Listen up.  No one move.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800019.ogg":^  Not even an inch...^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800020.ogg":^  ...If you're tired, then feel free to sit in whatever chair or sofa you want.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800021.ogg":^  So just stay quiet and don't talk, don't do anything!"^\
