langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800034.ogg":^"Yeah, I did!^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800035.ogg":^  And there were people here and there who lent me a hand along the way!^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800036.ogg":^  If I'm going to repay them, I can't just sit around on my hands!^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800037.ogg":^  You need money to repay people!^\:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800038.ogg":^  You need money to make money!^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800039.ogg":^  You can't even get started without money!^@/

