langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800112.ogg":^"Yes, let's have Jessica help us too.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800113.ogg":^  Maybe some things can only be solved with a child's sensitivity!^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800114.ogg":^  This is a family crisis.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800115.ogg":^  All of us have to stick together!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800116.ogg":^  Yes, it's a fanciful riddle that Father created...!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800117.ogg":^  We should be able to solve it, ...and there's no reason we wouldn't be able solve it...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800118.ogg":^  It's the only way!!"^\

