langjp……妾は奔放にして自由！@　誰の命令も聞かぬ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700022.ogg":^  ...I am free to run rampant!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700023.ogg":^  I listen to no one's orders."^\

cl c,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_akuwarai1.png",0
_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「それを、世界でたった一人。@私だけが支配した。@……だからこそ、右代宮家の当主たりえるのだ。」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500034.ogg":^"And there's only one person in the world who can control her.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500035.ogg":^  Me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500036.ogg":^  ...That is why I am qualified to be the Ushiromiya Family Head."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_1_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「ふっ。@その傲慢さこそが右代宮家当主の資格だと言うか。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700024.ogg":^"Hmph.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700025.ogg":^  So, it's that pride of yours that qualifies you?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「傲慢とは即ち、自信であり勇気である。@そしてそれに見合う力を得ようとする、飽くなき向上心の現われである。@…だからこそ、私はお前を支配した。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500037.ogg":^"Pride requires self-confidence and bravery.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500038.ogg":^  And, it is the embodiment of the insatiable desire to gain power to match those traits.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500039.ogg":^  ...That is why I control you."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「………傲慢を語る男が、それを実現していく様を見るのは心地よいものだ。@不言実行は強運なる者の言い訳に過ぎぬ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700026.ogg":^"......Watching men who speak of pride turn those desires into reality can be quite pleasant.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700027.ogg":^  The `quiet man of action' is nothing more than an excuse used by the extremely lucky.^\/
advsetwindow "27"

;ld l,BEA_DefA2,80

langjp…真の王者は持たぬ物さえも語る。@そしてその傲慢を確かに実現して見せるのだ。@……妾を支配できる者には、その王者の傲慢が必要だ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700028.ogg":^  ...A true monarch also speaks of what he doesn't have.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700029.ogg":^  And he makes that pride a reality without fail.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700030.ogg":^  ......If one is to control me, they must possess such a monarch's pride."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a12_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「わかるか、夏妃よ。@真の王者は、あらゆる苦難を恐れぬ。@必ず乗り越えられると公言する。@その算段がなくともだ。@だから弱者は希望を持つ。@集い、崇め、協力を誓う。@そこに力が生まれ、有言は実行されるのだ。@それを心に刻め。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500040.ogg":^"Do you understand, Natsuhi?^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500041.ogg":^  A true monarch fears no hardship.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500042.ogg":^  They declare that they will overcome anything without fail.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500043.ogg":^  Even if they haven't yet figured out how.^\:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500044.ogg":^  This gives hope to the weak.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500045.ogg":^  They gather, revere the monarch, and swear to assist him.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500046.ogg":^  This is where power is gained and his word is carried out.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500047.ogg":^  Engrave that into your heart."^\

