langjp「私は、……愚かでした…。」@
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900146.ogg":^"I...was foolish..."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「…………………。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500048.ogg":^"............"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「…右代宮家の一大事に、泣き言を言う暇などあるわけもありません。@そして、お父様から右代宮家を引き継いだ以上、私たちは何があってもその名誉を守り抜きます。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900147.ogg":^"...Of course there's no time for crying when an Ushiromiya family crisis is upon us.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900148.ogg":^  And now that we have inherited the Ushiromiya family from you, Father, we must protect its honor no matter what."^\

bg new_mlib_1b,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_1_warai1.png",23
_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「ほぅ。@……どうやって蔵臼の借金を返済するか、その青写真も描けぬのにか。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700031.ogg":^"Hoh.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700032.ogg":^  ...Even though you can't even draw a blueprint on how to repay Krauss's debts?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　ベアトリーチェは、嫌らしく笑いながら、@……いや、違う。@
langen^Beatrice laughed unpleasantly...^@^...no, that wasn't it.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　夏妃に、真の王者としての心構えがあるかどうかを、試す。\
langen^She was testing Natsuhi, to see whether she possessed the mental readiness to be a true monarch.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　だから夏妃はもう戸惑わない。@
langjp　はっきりと、その目を見据えて答える。\
langen^Natsuhi wasn't confused anymore.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^She answered clearly, gazing into Beatrice's eyes.^\

bg new_mlib_1a,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",24
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「はい。@今はどうすればいいのか、その方法をまだ見つけることは出来ません。@しかし、私の夫は新しき右代宮家の当主であり、私はそれを支える妻です。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900149.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900150.ogg":^  At this moment, I have not yet discovered the method we should pursue.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900151.ogg":^  However, my husband is the new Head of the Ushiromiya family, and I am his supporting wife.^@/
advsetwindow "03"

;ld r,NAT_OdorokiA1,80

langjpですから、夫に代わり、私が宣言します。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900152.ogg":^  So, I will proclaim it in my husband's place."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「聞こう。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700033.ogg":^"Let us hear it."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「右代宮蔵臼と夏妃は、必ずやこの苦難を乗り越え、右代宮家の名誉を守って見せます。@お父様にご心配をお掛けすることはありません。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900153.ogg":^"Ushiromiya Krauss and Natsuhi will definitely overcome these trials and protect the honor of the Ushiromiya family.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900154.ogg":^  You have nothing to worry about, Father."^\

bg new_mlib_1c,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_fukigen1.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「……蔵臼の借金の規模と、惨憺たる状況については知っておるな？」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500049.ogg":^"...Do you know the scope of Krauss's debt, as well as the horrible state things are in?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_zutuu1.png",23
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「はい。@この屋敷さえも、明日には立ち退けと命じられても拒めぬという最悪の状況です。@遺産分配となれば、親族たちに刑事告発さえされるかもしれません。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900155.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900156.ogg":^  If the worst happens and we are ordered to leave this mansion tomorrow, we won't be able to refuse.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900157.ogg":^  During the distribution of the inheritance, the relatives might even file a criminal complaint."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「しかし、心配には及びません。@そうなる前に借金を全て返済し、名誉を取り戻します。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900158.ogg":^"However, there is no need to worry.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900159.ogg":^  We will repay all of the debts before then and restore our honor."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　直立不動の姿勢で、そして毅然とした態度で、夏妃はそれをはっきりと、@右代宮金蔵とベアトリーチェの立会いの下、宣言する。\
langen^As she stood at attention with a resolute attitude, ^@^Natsuhi proclaimed this clearly with Ushiromiya Kinzo and Beatrice as witnesses.^\

bg black,22
bg new_mlib_1e,2
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　しばらくの間。@夏妃の決意を量るかのように、金蔵たちは沈黙した。@
langen^For a while,^@^ they remained silent, as though weighing Natsuhi's resolve.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そして金蔵は、ふっと薄く笑ってから背を向ける…。\
langen^Then Kinzo chuckled and turned away...^\

bg new_mlib_1a,26
_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「……惜しい。@……なぜにこやつが、我が息子ではなかったのか。」@
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500050.ogg":^"...How vexing.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500051.ogg":^  ...Why couldn't this person have been my son...?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_futeki2.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「その資質を持つ女を息子がめとったことさえ、これもまたそなたの強運よ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700034.ogg":^"The very fact that a woman with such a disposition married your son is another sign of your great luck."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_fumu1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「…………………。@ベアトリーチェ。@私の最後の命令だ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500052.ogg":^".........^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500053.ogg":^Beatrice,^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500054.ogg":^ this is my final order."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_1_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「当主でないそなたの命令を、もはや聞く義理はないぞ。」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700035.ogg":^"Now that you are no longer the Head, I am not obligated to obey your orders."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「ほぅ。@ならば、新しき右代宮家当主の命令に従え。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500055.ogg":^"Hoh.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500056.ogg":^  In that case, obey the orders of the new Ushiromiya Family Head."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「そなたはすでに当主でなく、蔵臼は未だ当主ではない。@妾は誰に仕えよというのか。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700036.ogg":^"You are no longer the Head, and Krauss is not yet the Head.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700037.ogg":^  Whom are you suggesting that I serve?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「お前にそれを委ねる。@右代宮家の当主を受け継ぐ資格があるかどうか、そして片翼の鷲の紋章を背負うに相応しいかどうか。@……お前が確かめるのだ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500057.ogg":^"I will leave that to you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500058.ogg":^  It is up to you to decide who is qualified to succeed the Ushiromiya Family Head, and who is fitting to bear the mark of the One-Winged Eagle.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500059.ogg":^  ...You will ensure that it is so."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_1_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「断るぞ。@当主でなき男の命令など聞けぬわ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700038.ogg":^"I refuse.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700039.ogg":^  I won't listen to the orders of a man who isn't the Head."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「いいや違うぞ。@これは遺言である。@当主が遺したお前への最後の命令である。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500060.ogg":^"No, this is different.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500061.ogg":^  This is a will.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500062.ogg":^  The last order that the Head left behind for you."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「……くっくっく。@ならば従わぬわけにはいかぬか。@妾もつくづく付き合いが良い。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700040.ogg":^"...*cackle*^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700041.ogg":^  Then it seems I will have to obey.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700042.ogg":^  After all, I can be quite accommodating."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「違うな。」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500063.ogg":^"Liar."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「ほぅ？」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700043.ogg":^"Hoh?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「興味を持ったからであろうが。」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500064.ogg":^"You're only doing this because it caught your interest, aren't you?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「つくづく、そなたには隠し事が出来んな。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700044.ogg":^"I can't hide anything from you, can I?"^\

bg black,24
bg new_mlib_1b,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",24
_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「夏妃。」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500065.ogg":^"Natsuhi."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_zutuu1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「はい、お父様…。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900160.ogg":^"Yes, Father..."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「乗り越えてみよ、この苦難を。」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500066.ogg":^"Go and overcome your hardship."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「…は、………はいっ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900161.ogg":^"...Y-Yes."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　その返事は、夏妃にとってはただの返事に過ぎないが、@金蔵とベアトリーチェにとっては、もっと重要な意味を持つようだった。\
langen^That might have seemed like a mere response to Natsuhi,^@^ but to Kinzo and Beatrice, it seemed to be something of much greater significance.^\

bg new_mlib_1c,23
_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_nayamu1.png",24
_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_1_warai1.png",26
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　ベアトリーチェは深く頷くと、@優雅なドレスに負けない優雅な仕草で、夏妃の前で深々とお辞儀をした…。\
langen^Beatrice nodded deeply,^@^ and with a motion as elegant as her dress, she bowed deeply before Natsuhi...^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「右代宮家顧問錬金術師、黄金の魔女ベアトリーチェ、ここに。@右代宮家の苦難を再び乗り越えるため、そなたの力となろうぞ…。」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700045.ogg":^"The Ushiromiya family alchemist, the Golden Witch Beatrice, is present.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700046.ogg":^  I shall give you my aid to assist the Ushiromiya Family in overcoming another crisis..."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_nayamu3.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「……ありがとう。@あなたの力が必要です。@私たちは、必ずこの苦難を乗り越えます。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900162.ogg":^"...Thank you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900163.ogg":^  I will need your power.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900164.ogg":^  We will most certainly overcome these trials."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_futeki2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「そのために助力は惜しまぬが、先に断らねばならぬ。@かつて金蔵の窮地を救ったように、そなたに再び莫大な黄金を与えれば、この度の苦難は解決することはわかっている。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700047.ogg":^"I will not hold back on my support for your cause, but there is something I must warn you about beforehand.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700048.ogg":^  I understand that your troubles now could be solved if I were to grant you a vast quantity of gold, like I did when I saved Kinzo from his crisis.^@/
advsetwindow "27"

;ld r,BEA_MajimeA3,80

langjpしかし、それは出来ぬのだ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700049.ogg":^  However, that is something I cannot do."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_tukare1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「………そうですか。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900165.ogg":^"......Is that so?"^\

bg new_mlib_1a,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_fumu1.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「すまんな、夏妃。@ベアトリーチェの黄金は、私一代限りという契約なのだ。@そして、それを受け継ぐためには、魔女の碑文を解かねばならぬのが取り決め。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500067.ogg":^"Sorry, Natsuhi.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500068.ogg":^  Beatrice's gold came from a contract limited to my generation.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500069.ogg":^  It was agreed that it could only be passed on to another if that person solves the witch's epitaph."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_nayamu1.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「黄金は碑文にて封じられている。@だから、それを解けぬ限り、そなたに黄金の魔法は与えられぬ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700050.ogg":^"The gold is sealed away by the epitaph.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700051.ogg":^  As long as that is not solved, you cannot be given the golden magic."^\

bg new_mlib_1c,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_tukare1.png",24
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「………わかりました。@ならば他の方法で、この窮地を脱する方法を模索しましょう。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900166.ogg":^"......I understand.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900167.ogg":^  Then I shall search for another method by which we can save ourselves from this crisis.^@/

_ld c,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp……主人は時間を掛けるとは言っていますが、必ず借金は返済できると言っています。@その為の時間を得ることが出来れば、この苦難は乗り越えられます。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900168.ogg":^  ...My husband said his plan would take time, but he also said that it would surely be sufficient to repay our debts.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900169.ogg":^  If we can buy enough time for that to happen, we will be able to overcome this trial."^\

bg new_mlib_1b,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai1.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「良いぞ、夏妃。@続けよ。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500070.ogg":^"Good, Natsuhi.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500071.ogg":^  Continue."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_akuwarai1.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「しかし、金蔵はもう死んでいるぞ。@医者と使用人は葬儀の準備。@そなたは親族たちにその連絡だ。@そなたは自ら、その金策の猶予時間を終わらせる宣言をすることになる。@くっくくくく、自ら刃を下ろす断頭台も愉快なものよ…。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700052.ogg":^"But Kinzo is already dead.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700053.ogg":^  The doctor and servants are preparing his funeral.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700054.ogg":^  You were about to contact the family members.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700055.ogg":^  By your own hand, you will bring an end to this ploy for time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700056.ogg":^  *cackle*cackle*  How charming is the guillotine where you lower the blade yourself..."^\

bg new_mlib_1e,25
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「…………………ぁ、」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900170.ogg":^"...............Ah-"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　夏妃は、はっとして天井を見上げる。@
langen^Startled, Natsuhi looked up at the ceiling.^@
advsetwindow "-1"

;br
langjp　そこに何かがあったわけではない。@……しかし、夏妃は何かを見つけていた。\
langen^There wasn't actually anything there.^@^  ...But even so, Natsuhi had found something.^\

bg new_mlib_1b,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai2.png",26
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「降りたか、……魔力が。」@
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500072.ogg":^"So, ...the magical power has descended."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「夏妃。@……決まったか？@　妾に望む奇跡の魔法が。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700057.ogg":^"Natsuhi,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700058.ogg":^  ...have you made up your mind?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700059.ogg":^  What magic of miracles do you desire from me?"^\

