langjp「……あ、……あぁ。@１年、…いや、せめて半年あれば、必ず実る計画なんだ！@　しかし、今すぐにはどうしても無理なのだ……。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800131.ogg":^"......Y-Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800132.ogg":^  Give it a year...no, just half a year, and it will certainly bear fruit!^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800133.ogg":^  But it's just impossible to hope for anything right now..."^\

