langjp「繰り返します。@お父様は未だにご健在であられます。@ご自身の研究がお忙しいので、これまで以上に書斎を出ることは出来ません。@ですから私たちは、お父様が研究に専念できるように、外務を全て執り行い、@お父様に不要なお仕事が及ばないようにしなくてはなりません。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900176.ogg":^"I will say it again.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900177.ogg":^  Father is still in good health.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900178.ogg":^  He is busy with his research, so he'll be even less able to leave his study than usual.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900179.ogg":^  Because of this, we must handle all external affairs ourselves...^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900180.ogg":^so that Father can devote himself to his research without being burdened by meaningless tasks."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

