langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900190.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900191.ogg":^  Once we've managed to pay back the debt and finish our preparations for laying Father to rest, we will then announce that Father has disappeared."^\

