;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500073.ogg":^"...Natsuhi,^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500074.ogg":^ let me first make one thing clear.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500075.ogg":^  I did not coax you into doing this because of my attachment to life."^\

