advsetwindow "01"

langjp「うむ。@むしろ、心地よいくらいだ。@……これが死後の世界の感覚ならば、幽霊気取りも捨てたものではないぞ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500078.ogg":^"Hmmm.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500079.ogg":^  Actually, it feels quite pleasant.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500080.ogg":^  ...If this is what the world after death feels like, playing the ghost might not be half bad."^\

