langjp「これにてどうか、夏妃。@金蔵は蘇った。@ゆえに葬儀は不要。@そなたの苦難はこれにて解決だ！」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700069.ogg":^"How is this, Natsuhi?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700070.ogg":^  Kinzo has revived.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700071.ogg":^  That means a funeral is unnecessary.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700072.ogg":^  Your hardship has been resolved!"^\

