langjp　戸惑いながらもお礼を言おうとする夏妃に、@ベアトリーチェは立てた人差し指を振りながら言う。\
langen^As Natsuhi tried to find words of gratitude amidst her confusion,^@^ Beatrice waggled her pointer finger and spoke.^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「感謝の言葉はいらぬぞ。@支配者は傲慢であれば良い。@妾は頼みは聞かぬが、命令には従うのでな。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700073.ogg":^"There is no need for thanks.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700074.ogg":^  A ruler is allowed to be proud.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700075.ogg":^  I will not pay heed to requests, but I will follow orders."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_tukare2.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「それでも言います。@……ありがとう。@これで、……主人のために時間が稼げます…。@……後は私たちの仕事です。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900200.ogg":^"Even so, I'll say it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900201.ogg":^  ...Thank you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900202.ogg":^  This way, ...you've bought some time for my husband...^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900203.ogg":^  ...We will handle the rest."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_majime4.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「しかし夏妃、心せよ。@確かに金蔵は蘇ったが、それは永遠ではない。@我が魔力が続く限りである。@……反魔法の毒素により、魔法は破られてしまうかもしれぬことを心せよ。@魔法の理を正しく理解し、その維持に努めよ。@妾はそなたに奇跡を見せるが、それを掴み、留めるのはそなたの役目だ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700076.ogg":^"Be warned, Natsuhi.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700077.ogg":^  Kinzo may have revived, but that is not an eternal thing.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700078.ogg":^  It will only continue as long as my magic does.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700079.ogg":^  ...Be warned that the magic-resisting toxin might destroy the magic.^\:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700080.ogg":^  You must understand the laws of magic correctly and work hard to maintain it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700081.ogg":^  I can show you a miracle, but it is your role to grasp it and hold it."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「無論です。@あなたにもらったこの奇跡を、私たちは決して疎かにしません。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900204.ogg":^"Of course.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900205.ogg":^  We definitely won't neglect the miracle you have given us."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「それで良い。@…なるほどな、主と畳は新しい方がいいというのは本当らしい。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700082.ogg":^"Very well.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700083.ogg":^  ...Yes, it would appear masters need to be changed out every once in a while, just like floor mats.^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjpくっくくくく！@　気に入った。@妾はそなたに仕えようぞ。@右代宮夏妃！@　我こそは右代宮家顧問錬金術師、黄金の魔女ベアトリーチェ…！！@　いつでも我が名を呼ぶがいい。さすれば現われ、妾はそなたに奇跡を授けるであろう。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700084.ogg":^  *cackle*cackle*!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700085.ogg":^  I like it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700086.ogg":^  I shall serve you,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700087.ogg":^ Ushiromiya Natsuhi!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700088.ogg":^  I am the Ushiromiya family alchemist, the Golden Witch Beatrice...!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700089.ogg":^  Call my name whenever you wish.  I shall appear and grant you a miracle."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「ありがとう。@私は右代宮夏妃。@あなたを使役し、右代宮家の名誉を守ります…！！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900206.ogg":^"Thank you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900207.ogg":^  I am Ushiromiya Natsuhi.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900208.ogg":^  I will employ you and protect the honor of the Ushiromiya family...!!"^\

