_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「反魔法の毒素の塊である、親族どもが押し掛けてくるのだぞ。@鉢合わせになったら、そなたの魂など、一瞬で蒸発してしまうぞ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700092.ogg":^"Those relatives are like a massive lump of the magic-resisting toxin, and they'll be intruding in on us.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700093.ogg":^  If you bump into them, your soul will evaporate in a instant."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai2.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「ふっ。@すでに死んだ身だ。@蒸発もまた、小気味が良いというもの。」@
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500089.ogg":^"Hmph.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500090.ogg":^  I am already dead.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500091.ogg":^  Evaporating would be no detriment."^\

cl r,23
_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a12_odoroki2.png",24
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「……そういうわけには参りません。@どうか右代宮家のために、もうしばらくお力をお貸し下さい。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900215.ogg":^"...We can't have that happen.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900216.ogg":^  Please, for the sake of the Ushiromiya family, lend us your strength just a little longer."^\

cl l,24
_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「夏妃。@親族どもの乗った船がこちらへ向かったようだぞ。@そろそろ散歩は終わりにした方が良かろうな。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700094.ogg":^"Natsuhi,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700095.ogg":^ it seems the boat carrying the relatives has left the harbor.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700096.ogg":^  Perhaps it's about time to bring an end to this walk of yours."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_zutuu1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「……そうですか。@ありがとう。@…お父様は書斎へお戻り下さい。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900217.ogg":^"...Is that so?^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900218.ogg":^  Thank you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900219.ogg":^  ...Please return to the study, Father."^\

bg new_rose_1af,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_fumu1.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「やれやれ…。@この絶好の日和なのにな、残念だ。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500092.ogg":^"My, my...^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500093.ogg":^  How tiresome, to go back inside when the weather is this perfect."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「愚痴るな金蔵。@今のそなたは、妾に生かされているだけの幽霊であろうが。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700097.ogg":^"Don't grumble, Kinzo.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700098.ogg":^  Right now, you're nothing more than a ghost I gave life to.^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjpそなたに毒素で消し飛ばれては、妾も夏妃も困るのでな。@大人しく書斎へ閉じ篭り、布団でも被っておれ。@くっくくくくく！」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700099.ogg":^  It'll be troublesome for both me and Natsuhi if you're scattered away by the toxin.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700100.ogg":^  Just be a good boy, shut yourself away in the study, and wrap a blanket around yourself or something.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700101.ogg":^  *cackle*cackle*!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「ふっ。@……死してなお薔薇を愛でる機会を与えられただけでも、幸運とする他ないな。@わかった。@書斎へ戻ろう。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500094.ogg":^"Hmph.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500095.ogg":^  ...Merely receiving the chance to enjoy these roses after death makes me an extremely fortunate man.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500096.ogg":^  I understand.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500097.ogg":^  I shall return to the study."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「だが紅茶はもらいたい。@嘉音、源次に紅茶を届けるように伝えよ。@今日はマルコポーロでももらおう。」@
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500098.ogg":^"But I would like some black tea.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500099.ogg":^  Kanon, tell Genji to bring me some.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500100.ogg":^  Perhaps some Marco Polo would do well today."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\kan\1\kan_a12_nayamu1.png",24
advsetwindow "16"

langjp「……かしこまりました。」\
;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\50600004.ogg":^"...Certainly."^\

bg black,23

bg new_rose_g1af,23
_ld c,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_def1.png",4
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「では解散しよう。@夏妃。@……私抜きで見事、親族会議をこなして見せよ。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500101.ogg":^"Then let us go our separate ways.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500102.ogg":^  Natsuhi,^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500103.ogg":^ ...you must conduct the family conference splendidly in my absence."^\

cl c,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_def1.png",0
_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_warai1.png",24
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「もちろんです、お父様。@彼らの前で名乗ることは出来ませんが、主人はすでに右代宮家当主。@私もその妻として恥ずかしくないよう、微力を尽くします。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900220.ogg":^"Of course, Father.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900221.ogg":^  He can't say it in front of them, but my husband is already the Ushiromiya Family Head.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900222.ogg":^  And, I will do all I can to ensure that I don't embarrass him as his wife."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_fumu1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「……朝から胃痛を起こしている蔵臼に比べ、夏妃はなんと落ち着いたことか。@……我が息子が情けない。」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500104.ogg":^"...Compared to Krauss, who's had a stomachache since this morning, you are so very composed, Natsuhi.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500105.ogg":^  ...My son is quite hopeless."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_zutuu1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「主人にも主人の才能があります。@その及ばぬところを支えてこそ、私は妻なのです。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900223.ogg":^"My husband is talented in his own way.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900224.ogg":^  Supporting him where he's weak is my duty as his wife."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「うむ。@しっかりやれ。@私は、茶番の邪魔にならぬよう、大人しく閉じ篭っているとしよう。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500106.ogg":^"Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500107.ogg":^  Carry out your task with precision.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500108.ogg":^  I will make sure to stay shut away, so that I don't get in the way of this farce."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「嘉音。@お父様を書斎までお連れしなさい。@それから源次に紅茶の手配を。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900225.ogg":^"Kanon,^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900226.ogg":^ go with Father to the study.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900227.ogg":^  And then have Genji prepare some black tea."^\

bg new_sky_1a,25
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「肩を借りるほどもうろくしておらぬわ。@よっこらせっ……。」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500109.ogg":^"I'm not so senile that I need your help to stand up.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500110.ogg":^  Here I go..."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　肩を貸そうとする嘉音を断り、金蔵は腰掛けていた花壇から立ち上がる。@
langen^Refusing Kanon's attempt to lend him a hand, Kinzo rose from the flower bed he had been sitting on.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;lol rose

;br
langjp　引退した当主は、全てを夏妃に任せ、穏やかな足取りで書斎へ戻るのだった……。\
langen^The retired Head left everything in Natsuhi's hands and returned to the study at a gentle pace...^\

bg black,22
bg new_garden_1cf,22
_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「……様になっているぞ。@金蔵の亡き妻にも似た貫禄があるな。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700102.ogg":^"...You're looking well.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700103.ogg":^  You possess a sense of dignity reminiscent of Kinzo's deceased wife."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_tukare1.png",23
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「万一、お父様が反魔法の毒素にやられたら、@……魔法は瞬時に解けてしまうのですか。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900228.ogg":^"On the off-chance that the magic-resisting toxin does reach Father,^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900229.ogg":^ ...will the magic dissolve in an instant?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「うむ。@瞬く間だ。@……妾は姿を消せば良いが、@すでに亡者の金蔵は、姿を失えばたちまちのうちに太陽の風に吹き飛ばされ塵と消える。@用心せよ。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700104.ogg":^"Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700105.ogg":^  In the blink of an eye.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700106.ogg":^  ...I can vanish whenever I please,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700107.ogg":^ but if someone already dead such as Kinzo loses his form, he'll be instantly tossed away like dust by the winds of the sun.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700108.ogg":^  You must take care."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_zutuu1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「えぇ。@わかっています。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900230.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900231.ogg":^  I understand."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_futeki2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「………そなたには、魔女の才能があるかも知れぬな。@反魔法の毒素を溜めに溜めて歳を重ねたが、@それでもなお、そなたは魔法を理解した。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700109.ogg":^"......You may have talent as a witch.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700110.ogg":^  The magic-resisting toxin has been building up in your system over the years,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700111.ogg":^ and yet you are still able to understand magic.^@/
advsetwindow "27"

;ld r,BEA_NayamuA1,80

langjp……妾との出会いが幼少の頃であったなら、そなたは今頃、偉大なる魔女だったかも知れぬ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700112.ogg":^  ...If you and I had met during your youth, you might have become a powerful witch by now."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「私は右代宮蔵臼の妻で、当主夫人です。@名誉を守るためならば、魔女にも鬼にもなりましょう。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900232.ogg":^"I am the wife of Ushiromiya Krauss, the Family Head.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900233.ogg":^  I would become even a witch or a demon to protect his honor.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_tukare2.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp……あなたの魔法の力には、深く感謝します。@右代宮家の名誉は、あなたの力なくして守れませんでした。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900234.ogg":^  ...I am deeply grateful for the power of your magic.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900235.ogg":^  I wouldn't have been able to protect the honor of the Ushiromiya family without you."^\

