langjp「くすくす！@　やっぱわかるゥ？！@　それでほらほら、戦人はどう答えてみせるわけ？@　こうして金蔵が闊歩していることを〜。@いつものゲームみたいに頭を抱えて、コンナノワケワカンネェヨ〜って泣き言聞かせてよ。@そして全然ダメダゼ！ってお約束の口癖で、お得意のトンデモでぜひ反論を聞かせてよ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200095.ogg":^"*giggle*!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200096.ogg":^  Figured it out?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200097.ogg":^  Then come on, how are you gonna answer, Battler?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200098.ogg":^  Kinzo was just out for a stroll.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200099.ogg":^  Why not act like you always do and start holding your head, crying `THIS MAKES NO SENSE!!'...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200100.ogg":^  C'mon, use that old `IT'S ALL USELESS' catch phrase, and then gimme one of your classic nonsensical counterarguments."^\

