;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100111.ogg":^"Lambda, who's in charge of the witch's side, is fantasy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100112.ogg":^  I'm the one who's fighting her, mystery.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100113.ogg":^  What are you?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100114.ogg":^  You're just barely anti-fantasy, doing nothing but dodging over and over and denying fantasy.^\:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100115.ogg":^  You're opposed to absolutely everything, but you can't make any counter-proposals.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100116.ogg":^  You're like a politician from some country.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100117.ogg":^  *giggle*giggle*."^\

