langjp　これはこれで、惣菜パンとしてなら、子どもに人気が出るだろう。@
langen^To describe it in Japanese terms, it was like fried dumplings stuffed with mashed, curry-flavored potatoes.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^As a household dish, it would probably be pretty popular with the kids.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　しかし、紅茶のお茶請けは甘いお菓子という先入観を持っていた夏妃には、衝撃的なようだった。\
langen^However, it was something of a shock to Natsuhi, who expected that a treat to go with tea would be sweet.^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_warai4.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「知らんのか。@ディンブラと言えばこれだぞ。@紅茶ならクッキー。@あぁ、チョコでも良いな。@日本茶なら羊羹だが、塩昆布でも良い。@中国茶なら小籠包。@妾は月餅も好きだ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700121.ogg":^"Didn't you know?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700122.ogg":^  Dimbula always goes with this.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700123.ogg":^  Black tea always goes with cookies.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700124.ogg":^  Oh, but chocolate is good too.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700125.ogg":^  You must have sweet bean jelly with Japanese tea, although salted konbu also works.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700126.ogg":^  Chinese tea goes with Chinese dumplings.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700127.ogg":^  Though I like moon cakes too."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a12_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「……驚きました。@ずいぶんと文化に詳しいのですね。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900262.ogg":^"...I'm surprised.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900263.ogg":^  You know a lot about various cultures, don't you?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_futeki2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「まー、伊達に千年は生きておらぬ。@世界の銘茶は一通り試した。@お茶の世界旅行と言ったところか。」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700128.ogg":^"Well, I haven't been living a thousand years for nothing.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700129.ogg":^  I've tried refined teas from all over the world.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700130.ogg":^  Perhaps you could call it a journey through the world of tea."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a12_tukare2.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「確かに、それは立派な世界旅行ですね。@このような紅茶の楽しみ方もあると、今日初めて知りましたので。@これは貴重な体験です。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900264.ogg":^"That does seem like it would be a wonderful way to travel the world.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900265.ogg":^  Before today, I never knew that one could enjoy tea like this.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900266.ogg":^  I will treasure this experience."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_1_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「妾は六軒島より出られぬ身。@これくらいしか、旅をすることは出来ぬでな。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700131.ogg":^"I cannot leave Rokkenjima.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700132.ogg":^  This is the only way I can travel.^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjpそなたはどうか。@富豪の妻らしく、世界を優雅に旅して来たのであろうが。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700133.ogg":^  What about you?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700134.ogg":^  I'm sure you've elegantly traveled the world like any wealthy wife might."^\

