langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900272.ogg":^"Unlike Father, my husband is fond of Asian nations.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900273.ogg":^  Hong Kong, Taiwan, Korea, Thailand.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900274.ogg":^  I think we also went to Malaysia."^\

