langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700153.ogg":^"I have no desire to act like the chief prisoner here.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700154.ogg":^  Let's be friendly as fellow birds in this cage.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700155.ogg":^  I've taken a liking to you."^\

