langjp「あなたはかつてのゲームで言ったわ。@これは互いを苛む永遠の拷問だとね。@そうよ。@ベアトにとっても拷問だった。@そして、その拷問ゲームに、あなたは勝ったのよ。@……だからベアトの魂は殺され、人形同然の屍に成り果てた。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100127.ogg":^"You said something interesting in a previous game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100128.ogg":^  You said this would be torture where you both torment each other.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100129.ogg":^  That was right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100130.ogg":^  It's torture for Beato as well.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100131.ogg":^  And, you won that torture game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100132.ogg":^  ...That's why Beato's soul was killed, why she became a doll-like corpse."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_nayamu1_chiru.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

