langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100138.ogg":^"In the past, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100139.ogg":^I supported you when it looked like you were gonna give in.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100140.ogg":^  Though you probably couldn't perceive it, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100141.ogg":^I assisted you by giving you hints and making things go your way.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100142.ogg":^  That's why you're able to be here now.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100143.ogg":^  ......Remember?  Remember how I saved you?"^\

