langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100144.ogg":^"In the same way, Lambda is supporting Beato.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100145.ogg":^  And this time, Beato is on the verge of giving in.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100146.ogg":^  That's why Lambda's been giving her support this round, to keep her from giving in.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100147.ogg":^  That's what the shackle is.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100148.ogg":^  By refusing to let her resign, she's rescued Beato within the game."^\

