langjp「本来、ゲームは２つの終わり方があった。@どちらかが負けを認めて投了するか、@どちらかがチェックメイトでゲームに勝つか。@ベアトはその前者に抵触しかけた。@だからラムダはそれを潰し、敗北をぎりぎりのところで回避したの。@ゲーム上は立派なサポートだわ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100149.ogg":^"Normally, there are only two ways for this game to end.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100150.ogg":^  Either one side will accept defeat and resign, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100151.ogg":^or one side will win the game with a checkmate.^\:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100152.ogg":^  Beato was about to collide with the first way.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100153.ogg":^  That's why Lambda crushed that chance and managed to just barely avoid losing.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100154.ogg":^  By the rules of this game, that's an impressive bit of support."^\

