langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100213.ogg":^"...That's right, if we're talking about our game, the two-day period from October 4th to October 5th in 1986.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100214.ogg":^  But I have no desire to question whether or not witches exist outside that game board."^\

