langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100215.ogg":^"In the first place, the Devil's Proof argument makes it impossible to deny the existence of witches.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100216.ogg":^  And, according to the rules of this game, saying something like what you did in red is a forbidden move that leads to a stalemate.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100217.ogg":^  You can't deny the existence of witches, not even with the red truth."^\

