langen^Spread out on the table were the blueprints and designs for a building, as well as documents related to expenditures and the like,^@^ ...so packed that even a tea cup would have gotten in the way.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　表向きは蔵臼への進捗報告となっているが、@……実際は、蔵臼が夏妃に聞かせるために、彼らをわざわざ六軒島へ招いたのだった。@
langen^Officially, they were here to give Krauss a progress report,^@^ ...but in actuality, Krauss had called them all the way over to Rokkenjima so that Natsuhi could hear from them directly.^@
advsetwindow "-1"

;br
langjp　夏妃に、事業がどういう状況にあるのか、蔵臼以外の人間から説明する必要が生じたためである。\
langen^This was because Natsuhi needed to hear someone other than her husband explain what condition their business was in.^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　……つまり、金蔵不在の親族会議が、再び近付きつつあったにもかかわらず、@未だに事業はカネを生み出せずにいたのだ。\
langen^...In other words, even though another family conference without Kinzo was approaching, ^@^their business had not yet earned them any money.^\

;se1 16
bg new_m1f_p1b,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　蔵臼は、来客たちにしばしくつろぐように伝えると、@廊下に夏妃を連れ出し、状況を再び要約して説明した…。\
langen^After telling the guests to wait for a short while, ^@^Krauss took Natsuhi out into the hall and once again summarized the situation...^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_akuwarai2.png",80
advsetwindow "02"

langjp「……つまり、我々の想像をはるかに超えて、事業は素晴らしくうまく行っていると彼らは言っているのだ。@ここで私と知事との私的なコネクションが大きく利いてきた！@　もはや絶対に釣り落とすことはない。@それどころか、例の委任状だけでなく、これまでの損失さえも一気に取り戻すことが可能なくらいの大きな話になりつつあるのだ！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800169.ogg":^"...In short, they say the work is proceeding even better than we imagined.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800170.ogg":^  This is where my personal connection to the governor really starts to pay off!^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800171.ogg":^  By now, it's absolutely impossible for this catch to get away from us.^\:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800172.ogg":^  To the contrary, it's growing so big that in one go, we'll be able to regain not just that power of attorney, but everything we've lost up to this point as well!"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　蔵臼は熱っぽく語る。@
langen^Krauss spoke passionately.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……むしろその仕草が胡散臭さを掻き立てるのだが、@今回に限り、実際に順調であることを夏妃も認めざるを得なかった。\
langen^...This made it seem all the more suspicious to Natsuhi,^@^ but this time, at least, she had to admit that everything really did seem to be going well.^\

bg new_m1f_p1c,25
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　確かに蔵臼が豪語した事業は、この一年でさらに規模が大きくなり、@当初の見込みを大幅に上回る利益を約束しつつあった。@
langen^Certainly, this business Krauss boasted of had expanded in scope over the last year...^@^and was promising an even greater payoff than had been anticipated initially.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　勝ち馬には放って置いても出資者が集まり、資金が見る見る集まる。@
langjp　カネがカネを呼ぶとはまさにこのことだろう。\
langen^Whether it would prove to be a winner or not, investors had gathered around it, and they were rapidly gaining funds.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^This must be what they mean when they say money summons money.^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　恐らく、蔵臼のこれまでの人生で、もっとも成功した、@
langen^It was probably the greatest success of Krauss's life so far.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp……いや、成功する事業と^~ib~^なる^~ib~^だろう。\
langen^...No, it probably ^^~ib~would be~ib~^^ his greatest success yet.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　夏妃が危惧するのはその一点だった。@
langjp　確かに確実な話で、蔵臼が言うように、もはや釣り落とすことはない。@
langen^That point was where Natsuhi's misgivings lay.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^True, it was certain, and as Krauss had said, they wouldn't lose this catch now.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　しかし、………掛かった魚が大きくなり過ぎたのだ。\
langen^However, ......the fish on the line had gotten too big.^\

bg new_m1f_p1b,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_nayamu1.png",26
advsetwindow "02"

langjp「必ず釣り上げられる魚だ。@何も焦る必要はないのだよ。@親父が生きていたなら、ぜひ見せて誇りたいほどの大成功なのだ…！」@
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800173.ogg":^"We'll definitely be able to reel this fish in.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800174.ogg":^  There's no need to rush.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800175.ogg":^  It's such a success that I wish I could show it to Father, if he were still alive...!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_odoroki2.png",24
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「えぇ、それはわかっています。@ですが、あなたは昨年、私に約束したはずです。@必ず、１年で何とか出来ると…！」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900301.ogg":^"Yes, I know.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900302.ogg":^  However, I believe you made me a promise last year.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900303.ogg":^  You said you were sure you could manage something within a year...!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_nayamu2.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　蔵臼は苦い顔をする。@
langjp　大成果を保証する肥えた魚を、確かに彼らは釣ってはいる。@
langen^A pained look rose to Krauss's face.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^They certainly had hooked a fat fish that guaranteed great success.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　しかし、引き上げるには、それに相応しい時間が必要になるのだ……。\
langen^However, it would require an appropriate amount of time to reel it in...^\

bg new_m1f_p1c,25
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　夏妃は何とか今年の親族会議までにカネを作れないのかと蔵臼を問い詰めるが、@蔵臼は、あともう１年だけ待って欲しいと繰り返す…。\
langen^Natsuhi pressed Krauss, asking if there was any way for them to make money before this year's family conference,^@^ but Krauss kept saying that he needed just one more year...^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　蔵臼としては、この空前の成功を切っ掛けに、@未来の新しい挑戦への踏み台にしたいという目論見がある。@
langen^Krauss planned to use this unprecedented success to catapult them into further challenges in the future.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そのため、おかしな金策で奔走していることで、妙な不信感を持たれたくないという気持ちがあるのだ…。\
langen^Because of this, he didn't want to do anything that would raise suspicions by making it seem like they were rushing to get money...^\

bg new_m1f_p1b,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_odoroki2.png",0
_ld l,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_nayamu2.png",26
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　確かに、運気というのは小さなケチで転ぶこともある。@
langjp　慌てる乞食は何とやら……。@
langen^Certainly, fortune tends to turn against people who take it for granted even in the slightest.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Anxious beggars never prosper...^\
advsetwindow "-1"

;br
langjp　蔵臼はこれまで、じっくり待てば必ず利益が上げられた事業を、@いくつも焦って清算し、自ら勝ち馬を降りるような真似をしてきた。\
langen^On many occasions before now, Krauss had gotten cold feet and sold off businesses that would surely have brought in a profit had he just waited, ^@^and had, in effect, given away his winning picks.^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_zutuu1.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　夏妃もそれはわかっている。@
langjp　夫にもっとも足りないものが胆力なのだとわかっている。@
langen^Natsuhi also knew this.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^She knew that guts were the thing her husband lacked most.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;Especially in EP2...
;br
langjp　だからこそ、もう１年だけ慎重に行きたいと言う蔵臼のそれを、否定することが出来なかった……。\
langen^That's why she was unable to refuse when Krauss said he wanted to prudently wait just one more year...^\

textoff
bg black,2
wait 2000
bg new_m2f_p1cf,6
wait 2000
bg black,4
bg new_mlib_1c,24

;■金蔵の書斎

_ld c,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai1.png",24
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「……はっはははははは。@順調で良かったではないか。@ということはどうやら、私はもうしばらくここで幽霊を続けねばならぬようだな。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500111.ogg":^"...Hahahahahahahaha.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500112.ogg":^  How wonderful that things are going well.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500113.ogg":^  It would appear I'll have to sit around here as a ghost for a little longer."^\

bg new_mlib_1b,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_akuwarai1.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「まんざらでもなかろうが。@そなたの命など、この世を去れば、すぐに悪魔どもに食い尽くされる運命よ。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700182.ogg":^"You don't look too disappointed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700183.ogg":^  You're fated to be chewed to bits by demons the moment you leave this world."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_komaru1.png",23
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「……申し訳ありません、お父様。@…また、今年も、…お父様にはお休みいただけないかもしれません。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900304.ogg":^"...My apologies, Father.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900305.ogg":^  ...For one more year, ...you might not be granted peace."^\

cl r,23
_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「良い。気にするな夏妃。@右代宮家当主はすでに私ではない。@書斎の幽霊は大人しく、現在の当主の命令に従うべきだ。@……蔵臼の資料は読ませてもらったが、なかなかに悪くない。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500114.ogg":^"It is fine.  Fear not, Natsuhi.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500115.ogg":^  I am no longer the Ushiromiya Family Head.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500116.ogg":^  The ghost of the study should obediently follow the current Head's commands.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500117.ogg":^  ...I've taken a look at Krauss's charts, and they aren't bad at all."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「お父様からご覧になってもですか。」\
;＜夏妃＜安堵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900306.ogg":^"Even from your perspective, Father?"^\

bg new_mlib_1a,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def1.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「……ふむ。妾から見てもなかなかのものよ。@誰もが勝利を確信し、相当の魔力が集中している。@その結果、さらに勝利が厚くなり、ますますに人と魔力を集め、黄金を生み出そうとしている。@錬金術の王道を見事に体現しているぞ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700184.ogg":^"...Hmmm.  They're pretty good even from my perspective.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700185.ogg":^  Everyone is confident in victory, gathering together a significant quantity of magical power.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700186.ogg":^  As a result, that victory is growing ever deeper, involving more and more people and magic, beginning to create gold.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700187.ogg":^  A perfect embodiment of classic alchemy."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai2.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「ほぅ。@黄金の魔女の太鼓判まで付くなら、これは心強い。@喜べ、夏妃。@この蔵臼の事業は、必ずや右代宮家の危機を救うだろう。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500118.ogg":^"Hoh.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500119.ogg":^  If you've earned even the Golden Witch's approval, that is very reassuring.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500120.ogg":^  Rejoice, Natsuhi.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500121.ogg":^  This business of Krauss's will save the Ushiromiya family from its crisis without fail."^\

bg new_mlib_1b,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_odoroki2.png",23
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「あ、…ありがとうございます。@……そして、そのためにまた……。」@
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900307.ogg":^"Th-Thank you very much.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900308.ogg":^  ...And, if you would once again..."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「ふむ。@もう一度、親族会議を乗り越えねばならんな。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700188.ogg":^"Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700189.ogg":^  We'll have to overcome one more family conference, won't we..."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_nayamu3.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「えぇ。@昨年はうまくやり過ごせたつもりですが、不審に思う親族も現われるでしょう。@………今年は正念場になると思います。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900309.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900310.ogg":^  I think things went well last year, but I imagine some of the relatives will find it suspicious.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900311.ogg":^  ......I think this year's conference will be a critical time."^\

bg new_mlib_1c,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai1.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「去年の親族会議の時、@ひょっとしたらもう一度同じことになるかも知れぬと予見したそなたは正しかったな。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500122.ogg":^"During last year's family conference,^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500123.ogg":^ you were correct to predict that the same thing might have to happen again."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_futeki2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「……最悪のケースを想定するのは、魔女ならずとも世渡りの基本だ。@……それで、今年はどうする？」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700190.ogg":^"...Even for those who aren't witches, preparing for the worst-case scenario is one of the basics for getting on in this world.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700191.ogg":^  ...So, what will you do this year?"^\

bg new_mlib_1b,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_odoroki2.png",23
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「去年同様、会議当日はお父様の秘密を知る使用人を集中的に配置します。@……お父様の不在を気取る親族もすでにいるかもしれません。@不用意な演出は、むしろ馬脚を現す危険性もあります。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900312.ogg":^"Just like last year, I will see to it that a high concentration of the servants who know Father's secret are there on the day of the conference.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900313.ogg":^  ...Some of the relatives may already have noticed that Father isn't around.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900314.ogg":^  A careless show might actually put us in more danger of exposure."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_def1.png",24
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「ふむ。@過ぎたるは及ばざるが如しとも言う。@……なれば、どうする？」@
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500124.ogg":^"Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500125.ogg":^  It is said that too much is as bad as too little.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500126.ogg":^  ...Then what will you do?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「今年は昨年とは逆に、最後まで書斎をお出にならないという筋書きで行こうと思います。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900315.ogg":^"Unlike last year, I think we'll go with a plan that has you staying inside your study until the end."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_fumu1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「それが良かろうな。@篭城は単純にして最後の切り札だ。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500127.ogg":^"That would be suitable.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500128.ogg":^  Barricades are straightforward and simple, a final trump card."^\

bg new_mlib_1a,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_nayamu1.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「どれほど屋敷が毒素に満ちようとも、@この部屋を密室結界に閉ざす限り、金蔵の存在を否定することは出来ぬ。@それは妾も保証する。@……だが、篭城すれば囲まれるは必至。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700192.ogg":^"No matter how strongly the toxin fills this mansion,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700193.ogg":^ as long as the closed room barrier remains around this room, it will be impossible to deny Kinzo's existence.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700194.ogg":^  I guarantee that myself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700195.ogg":^  ...However, when forming a barricade, it is inevitable that you will be surrounded."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_nayamu3.png",24
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「承知しています。@……それでも何卒、もう一度だけ、お父様とベアトリーチェの力をお貸し下さい…。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900316.ogg":^"I know.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900317.ogg":^  ...Even so, I beg that both of you lend us your power just one more time..."^\

cl l,24
_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai2.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「私は新しき当主の命令には逆らえぬ。@そして、幽霊もまた、生者の命令には逆らえぬしな。@この部屋から出るなと言うのであれば、それに従おう。」@
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500129.ogg":^"I cannot disobey the orders of the new Head.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500130.ogg":^  Furthermore, a ghost cannot disobey the orders of the living.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500131.ogg":^  If you tell me not to leave this room, I will obey."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「ありがとうございます……。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900318.ogg":^"Thank you very much..."^\

bg new_mlib_1b,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_akuwarai1.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「妾は嫌だぞ。@力を貸せと願われても、願い如きでは聞いてやれぬ。」\
;＜ベアト＜くすくす
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700196.ogg":^"I'm not satisfied.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700197.ogg":^  If you want me to lend you my power, I won't listen to a mere request."^\

cl c,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_akuwarai1.png",0
_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_zutuu1.png",23
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「えぇ。@あなたは顧問錬金術師。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900319.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900320.ogg":^  You are the family alchemist.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjpですから、貸せと願いません。@貸しなさいと命じます。@……あなたの魔法だけが頼りです。@その力で、もう一度だけ、お父様の幻想を。」@
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900321.ogg":^  So, I won't ask you to help.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900322.ogg":^  I order you to help.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900323.ogg":^  ...Your magic is the one thing we can rely on.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900324.ogg":^  Use that power to create an illusion of Father just one more time."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「ならば良し。@心得たぞ。@そなたの貫禄、なかなかに心地良し。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700198.ogg":^"Very well.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700199.ogg":^  I hear and obey.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700200.ogg":^  I find your confidence quite pleasing."^\

