langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600027.ogg":^"That I cannot do.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600028.ogg":^  Madam gave strict orders that the three of us be scheduled to work on that day."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_majime3.png",23
