langjp「……紗音。嘉音。@……すでにお仕えするお館様はお亡くなりになっている。@しかし、本当の意味でお亡くなりになるまで、我らの奉仕は続く。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600029.ogg":^"...Shannon.  Kanon.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600030.ogg":^  ...The Master we serve has already passed away.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600031.ogg":^  However, until he has truly passed on, we will continue to serve.^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\gen\1\gen_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "14"

langjp……あの書斎は無人ではない。@今なお、お館様がおられ、日々の研究に勤しまれているのだ。@それを深く心得よ。」\
;＜源次
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600032.ogg":^  ...That study is not empty.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600033.ogg":^  The Master is still there, hard at work on his usual research.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600034.ogg":^  Make sure you take that to heart."^\

