advsetwindow "05"

langjp「お父様が、すでに亡くなっている…？！@　そんな馬鹿な…！」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000007.ogg":^"Father has already passed away...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000008.ogg":^  That's insane...!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\hid\1\hid_a11_majime1.png",24
advsetwindow "06"

langjp「まぁまぁ…。@例えの話や。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100006.ogg":^"Settle down...^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100007.ogg":^  It's only a possibility.^@/
advsetwindow "06"


langjp武田信玄は、その死を３年の間、秘密にするよう遺言したっちゅう、有名な故事があるやろ。@知らんか？」@
;＜秀吉
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100008.ogg":^  It's well known that Takeda Shingen said in his will that his death was to be kept secret for three years.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100009.ogg":^  Know about that?"^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「……そんな話もあったかしら。@日本史はよくわかんないわ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000009.ogg":^"...Is that how it went?^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000010.ogg":^  My Japanese history isn't so great."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\hid\1\hid_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "06"

langjp「当時、武田は織田や徳川との戦の真っ最中だった。@そこで信玄が死んだなんて話になったら、戦況に悪影響が出るやろ。@そやから、自分の死を３年隠すように遺言したんや。@……秀吉かてそうやで？@　主君、織田信長の死を敵方に知られんように、徹底的に情報規制を行い、@素早く毛利と和解して、中国大返しを行い明智を討ったんやないか。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100010.ogg":^"At the time, Takeda was in the middle of a war with Oda and Tokugawa.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100011.ogg":^  If people learned about his death at a time like that, it'd probably have had a bad impact on the war.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100012.ogg":^  'Cause of that, he left a will sayin' that his death should be kept hidden for three years.^\:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100013.ogg":^  ...Hideyoshi did the same thing, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100014.ogg":^  He totally suppressed information about the death of his master, Oda Nobunaga, so that the enemy wouldn't find out,^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100015.ogg":^ quickly made peace with Mouri, and defeated Akechi in the Battle of Yamazaki."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\hid\1\hid_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "06"

langjp「一方の柴田勝家はそこで失敗したんや。@敵の上杉に信長の死を知られ、思わぬ反撃を受けて足止めを食らい、@その後の秀吉との後継者争いで大きく遅れを取ることになったんや。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100016.ogg":^"On the other hand, Shibata Katsuie failed at this.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100017.ogg":^  The enemy, Uesugi, learned of Nobuyuki's death, so Shibata had to deal with an unexpected counterattack and got slowed down.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100018.ogg":^  That's why, later on, he suffered a great loss against Hideyoshi in the fight for the succession."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　戦国武将に強い憧れを持つ秀吉は、ここぞとばかりにウンチクを語り出す。@
langen^Hideyoshi, who had a strong fascination with the commanders of the Sengoku period, would always show off his knowledge when he got the chance.^@

;br

_ld l,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_komaru4.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　絵羽は辟易としながら、話を戻させる。\
langen^Wincing slightly, Eva made him get back to his point.^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\hid\1\hid_a11_komaru2.png",80
advsetwindow "06"

langjp「……早い話が、…わしは去年の親族会議から、@ずっと違和感を持っとったんや。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100019.ogg":^"...So basically, ...the whole time since last year's family conference,^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100020.ogg":^ I've felt as though somethin' was strange."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「あれは、私や留弗夫が遺産の話をしてたのを、廊下のお父様に聞かれてしまってそれで、」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000011.ogg":^"You mean the time when Rudolf and I were talking about the inheritance and Father overheard us from the hall-"^\

cl r,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\hid\1\hid_a11_majime1.png",24
advsetwindow "06"

langjp「そこや。@……夏妃さんや使用人たちは、どこそこにお父さんがいた、不機嫌そうだったと口を揃えたが、@わしら親族は、誰一人、お父さんを見てないんやで？」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100021.ogg":^"That's just it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100022.ogg":^  ...Natsuhi-san and the servants kept saying Father was here or there and that he seemed to be in a bad mood, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100023.ogg":^but not a single one of us relatives saw Father, right?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_ikari2.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「もしあなたの想像が本当なら……。@……どういうこと？！@　兄さんが遺産の独り占めを狙ってるということ？！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000012.ogg":^"If what you're thinking is right, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000013.ogg":^...what does that mean?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000014.ogg":^  Does it mean Nii-san's trying to keep all of the inheritance for himself?!"^\

;bg black,25
bg new_bui_r1d,26
advsetwindow "06"

langjp「もちろん、死んだことを隠すなんてかなり危険なことや。@果たして、遺産を独り占めするためだけに、それだけのことを蔵臼さんがやってのけるのか、わしも確信は持てん。@だが、可能性はある。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100024.ogg":^"Of course, hidin' someone's death is a very dangerous thing to do,^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100025.ogg":^ and all things considered, I'm not sure Krauss-san would be willin' to do it just to have the inheritance to himself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100026.ogg":^  But it is possible."^\
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「……た、…確かに、兄さんは昔から強欲よ。@兄弟全員でと受け取ったものを着服するなんてよくあることだったわ…。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000015.ogg":^"...W-Well, it's true that Nii-san has always been greedy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000016.ogg":^  He always used to take things that were meant for all of the siblings, keeping them all for himself..."^\
advsetwindow "06"

langjp「蔵臼さんは、わしら兄弟の中では一番裕福なはずや。@…そんな蔵臼さんが、お父さんの死を隠すなんて危険を冒してまで、遺産の独り占めを目論むとは、@…わしにはちょいと信じられんのだがな。@だが、そう疑いたくなるくらい、去年の親族会議はおかしかったんやで。」@
langjp「……………………………。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100027.ogg":^"Krauss-san is supposed to be the richest of the siblings.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100028.ogg":^  Krauss-san schemin' to keep the inheritance all to himself to the point of acceptin' the risk of hidin' Father's death...^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100029.ogg":^sounds a tad unbelievable to me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100030.ogg":^  Even so, last year's family conference was so strange, I can't help but wonder."^\
advsetwindow "05"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000017.ogg":^".................."^\

