langjp「……確かに、疑ってみる価値はあるわね…。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000018.ogg":^"...It certainly is worth suspecting, ^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b21_komaru4.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjpでも、本当に兄さんがお父様の死を隠すなんて大それたことをするかしら…。@……傲慢なくせに、おかしなところで小心な人よ。@そんな一世一代の大博打を、本当にするかしら……。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000019.ogg":^but I wonder if Nii-san really would do something as appalling as hiding Father's death...^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000020.ogg":^  ...For all his pride, that man has a coward's side to him.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000021.ogg":^  Would he really make such a once-in-a-lifetime bet...?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\hid\1\hid_a11_komaru2.png",80
advsetwindow "06"

langjp「いずれにせよ、今年の会議では、きっちりお父さんのご尊顔を拝謁した方がええやろな。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100031.ogg":^"Either way, it'd probably be a good idea to make sure we get a chance to meet with Father durin' this year's conference."^\

