langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\51200023.ogg":^"All we want is your approval.  We aren't gonna ask you for money or anything like that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\51200024.ogg":^  The most important thing is that the three of us stick together.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\51200025.ogg":^  Got it?"^\

