langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\51200035.ogg":^"Now do you wanna hear?^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\51200036.ogg":^  I know it's a bit sudden, but let's meet next Sunday, 19:00, at that coffee shop you like in Ginza.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\51200037.ogg":^  That's the only time Aneki's schedule and mine match.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\51200038.ogg":^  Any problems?"^\
