langjp「……熊沢は嘘をつくのが上手なようですから心配しませんが、…南條先生が少し心配です。@……隠し事が苦手そうでおられますから。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900354.ogg":^"...Kumasawa is a good liar, so I'm not worried about her, ...but I am a little concerned about Doctor Nanjo.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900355.ogg":^  ...I get the feeling he's bad at hiding things."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\gen\1\gen_a11_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "14"

langjp「………お任せを。@可能な限り、私が南條先生のお近くで補佐するつもりです。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600050.ogg":^"......Leave that to me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600051.ogg":^  I intend to support Doctor Nanjo from nearby as much as possible."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_tukare1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

