langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900356.ogg":^"It's so reassuring to have you there.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900357.ogg":^  ......It truly does help a lot.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900358.ogg":^  ...Without your strength, we wouldn't be able to succeed."^\

