langjp「……うむ。@やはり去年の時点で相当の不審感を持たれていたのであろうな。@凄まじき毒素を溜め込み、振りまいておるわ。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700212.ogg":^"...Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700213.ogg":^  It seems that some considerable suspicions were aroused last year.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700214.ogg":^  The terrible toxin has accumulated and is being spread all around."^\

