langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100025.ogg":^"......With this much of the magic-resisting toxin filling up the place,^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100026.ogg":^ it will probably be difficult to preserve Lord Goldsmith's magic for yet another family conference."^\

