;＜ロノウェ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100027.ogg":^"Greetings, Madam Natsuhi.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100028.ogg":^  My name is Ronove.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100029.ogg":^  It is a pleasure to meet you..."^\

