langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\53700001.ogg":^"......In that case, I guess I'll introduce myself next.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\53700002.ogg":^  <Hi>, Riiche.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\53700003.ogg":^  Long time no see..."^\

