langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\53700004.ogg":^"...Well, I only came to have some fun.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\53700005.ogg":^  ...If you need an extra hand, let me know.^@/

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a12_def1.png",80
