advsetwindow "31"

langjp「ぷっくっく。@こちらのガァプはなかなかの悪戯者…。@先日、奥様が自室にてお召しになろうとして、床に落とし見つけられなかった頭痛薬。@ガァプの仕業でございますよ。」\
;＜ロノウェ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100033.ogg":^"Pu ku ku.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100034.ogg":^  Gaap here is quite the prankster...^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100035.ogg":^  Remember that headache medicine you dropped on the floor of your room and lost as you were getting dressed?^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100036.ogg":^  Gaap was the one behind that."^\

