;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700224.ogg":^"Whenever you set something small down somewhere but can't find it later, it's always a good idea to suspect that it's one of her pranks.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700225.ogg":^  ...Long ago, she used to tease me all the time!"^\

