;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900367.ogg":^  ...In any event, this is the Ushiromiya mansion.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900368.ogg":^  As long as you are here, you will obey us.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900369.ogg":^  You understand, correct?"^\

