langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100037.ogg":^"Of course.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100038.ogg":^  We understand.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100039.ogg":^  ...Think of me as a Genji of the magic world, and give me orders whenever you wish."^\

