langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100039.ogg":^"...It always helps to be prepared.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100040.ogg":^  It's probably all thanks to the life jacket.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100041.ogg":^  Without that, she might've drowned."^\

