langjp「１８人いるはずの島が、…祖父さまが実は死んでて１７人になった。@……そこにベルンカステルの駒が１人追加され……。」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100315.ogg":^"There were supposedly 18 people on the island, ...but since Grandfather's actually dead, that became 17.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100316.ogg":^  ...And now one piece of Bernkastel's has been added..."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;＜戦人
;br
langjp　再び、この島の人間は１８人に、戻った……。\
langen^The number of humans on this island has returned to 18...^\

mend
