;■時間経過演出。廊下。

langjp「朱志香の昔の服、あんなに似合うなんて思いませんでした。」@
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900382.ogg":^"I'm surprised Jessica's old clothes suit her so well."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\gen\1\gen_a11_komaru1.png",23
advsetwindow "14"

langjp「……熊沢が、勝手にお嬢様の昔の服を使用してしまいました。@お許し下さい。」\
;＜源次
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600069.ogg":^"...Kumasawa made the decision on her own to use Milady's old clothes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600070.ogg":^  Please forgive her."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　ヱリカの着ていた服は、朱志香の昔の余所行きの服だった。@
langen^The clothes Erika wore were Jessica's old formal attire.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　大人顔負けの貫禄を持つ客人も、体格はまだ中学生くらいだ。@朱志香の昔の服のサイズがぴったりだった。\
langen^Though the guest possessed a dignity that would put most adults to shame, her body was still physically similar to a middle-schooler's.^@^  Jessica's old clothes fit her perfectly.^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「いいえ。@お客様に相応しい身なりでしたよ。@もし彼女が気に入るようでしたら、お近付きの印に、プレゼントしても良いでしょう。」@
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900383.ogg":^"Not to worry.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900384.ogg":^  They match this guest perfectly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900385.ogg":^  If she likes them, we might even let her keep them as a sign of friendship."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\gen\1\gen_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "14"

langjp「……かしこまりました。@ありがとうございます。」\
;＜源次
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600071.ogg":^"...Certainly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600072.ogg":^  Thank you very much."^\

bg new_m1f_p1cr,25

bgm1 30
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「警察やご家族には連絡しましたか？」@
;＜夏妃
langjp「はい。@先方も大層ご心配なされていたようでした。」\
;＜源次
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900386.ogg":^"Have you contacted the police and her family?"^\
advsetwindow "14"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600073.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600074.ogg":^  They seemed to have been quite distressed."^\

bg black,22

fede 10,1000
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「…………ところで。@……客人は本当に、事故、…でしょうね？」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900387.ogg":^".........By the way,^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900388.ogg":^ ...our guest really was...involved in an accident, right?"^\
advsetwindow "14"

langjp「……ご本人は、帰港中のボートから転落したと仰っております。」@
;＜源次
langjp「裏付けはありますか？」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600075.ogg":^"...She herself said she fell from a boat as it was returning to port."^\
advsetwindow "03"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900389.ogg":^"Is there anything to back up that claim?"^\

bg new_m1f_p1b,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\gen\1\gen_a11_majime1.png",26
advsetwindow "14"

langjp「海保に問い合わせて確認しました。@プレジャーボートの後部から転落したそうで、他の乗員たちは気付かなかったようです。@実際の転落地点はわかりませんが、おそらくはここの近海でしょう…。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600076.ogg":^"I checked with the Coast Guard.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600077.ogg":^  It seems she fell from the rear of a pleasure boat, unnoticed by the others on board.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600078.ogg":^  We don't know the exact location she fell from, but it was probably somewhere near this island..."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime2.png",23
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「………この悪天候に船遊びなど、愚かなことです。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900390.ogg":^"......It was foolish to play on a boat with such a bad weather forecast.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjpしかし、……近海で溺れて、この島に漂着することは考えられるのですか？」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900391.ogg":^  However, ...is it really conceivable that she nearly drowned in the nearby waters and drifted to this island?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\gen\1\gen_a21_kashikomari1.png",80
advsetwindow "14"

langjp「ありえないことではありません。@この辺りの島には大抵、漂流民が流れ着いた伝承がございます。」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600079.ogg":^"It is not impossible.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600080.ogg":^  Tales of drifters washing ashore exist in several of the islands around this area."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_tukare1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「………………………。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900392.ogg":^".................."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\gen\1\gen_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "14"

langjp「……恐らく、事故は真実ではないかと。@……この台風です。@島のどこであろうとも、船での接岸は不可能です。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600081.ogg":^"...I believe it likely that an accident occurred.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600082.ogg":^  ...We're in the middle of a typhoon.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600083.ogg":^  It would not be possible to land a boat anywhere on this island."^\

bg black,22
;bg M1F_P1cR,22

me1v 16,50
advsetwindow "-1"
langjp　源次はすでに察している。@
langen^Genji had already considered what she now suspected.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　夏妃は恐らく、親族会議というもっともナーバスな期間に突如現われた謎の来客を、@何者かの陰謀の手先ではないかと疑っているに違いない。\
langen^Natsuhi probably suspected that this mysterious guest, who had arrived during the already high-stress family conference,^@^ might be the agent of some conspiracy.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　だから、事故が真実で、古戸ヱリカが本名かどうか、@不審なところはないかどうか、先に調べていたのだ……。\
langen^So, Genji had already checked to make sure that the accident was real, that Furudo Erika was her real name,^@^ and that there was nothing suspicious going on...^\

bg new_m1f_p1b,26
_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「……わかりました。@主人も、丁重にもてなすようにと指示しています。@粗相のないようになさい。@……ですが、………わかっていますね？」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900393.ogg":^"...I understand.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900394.ogg":^  My husband has ordered that she be politely entertained.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900395.ogg":^  Make sure that there are no blunders.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900396.ogg":^  ...However, ......you do understand, don't you?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\gen\1\gen_a21_kashikomari1.png",23
advsetwindow "14"

langjp「はい。@……親族会議には一切近付けません。@夕食後は、ゲストハウスへお引取り願います。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600084.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600085.ogg":^  ...I won't let her anywhere near the family conference.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600086.ogg":^  After dinner, I will see that she retires to the guesthouse."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_nayamu3.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「客人をお父様に挨拶させろ、というような流れにもならないよう、よく注意するのですよ。」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900397.ogg":^"Make sure they don't start trying to force us to let her meet Father, or anything like that."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\gen\1\gen_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "14"

langjp「もちろんです。@心得ております。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600087.ogg":^"Of course.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\51600088.ogg":^  I will keep that in mind."^\

