advsetwindow "27"

langjp「………ほう。@…古戸ヱリカとな。@この六軒島に来客とは珍しい。@楽しませてくれそうではないか。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700230.ogg":^"......Hoh.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700231.ogg":^  ...Furudo Erika, was it?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700232.ogg":^  It's rare for guests to come here to Rokkenjima.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700233.ogg":^  Doesn't this look like it'll be interesting?"^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\ron\1\ron_a11_akuwarai1.png",24
advsetwindow "31"

langjp「ベルンカステル卿の駒でしょう。@……ニンゲンのルールに従うとはいえ、プレイヤーは魔女です。@侮ることは出来ませんよ。」\
;＜ロノウェ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100040.ogg":^"She's probably Lady Bernkastel's piece.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100041.ogg":^  ...Though she will follow the rules of Humans, the player is a witch.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100042.ogg":^  We mustn't underestimate her."^\

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_futeki2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「ふ、問題ない。@仮にベルンカステル卿本人であろうとも、ニンゲンである以上、妾たちの敵ではない。@……何しろ、ガァプもいる。@ニンゲンはガァプに絶対に勝てぬ！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700234.ogg":^"Hmph, there is no problem.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700235.ogg":^  Even if she were Lady Bernkastel herself, since she's a Human, she's no match for us.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700236.ogg":^  ...After all, we have Gaap with us.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700237.ogg":^  Humans certainly cannot win against Gaap!"^\

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_warai2.png",23
advsetwindow "32"

langjp「…………ありがと。@でも、買い被り過ぎはよくないわ。@……魔女の定義は、魔法が使えることだけを意味したりはしない。」@
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\53700010.ogg":^"......Thanks.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\53700011.ogg":^  Still, it's not a good idea to overestimate yourself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\53700012.ogg":^  ......The definition of a witch doesn't only imply the ability to use magic."^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\ron\1\ron_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "31"

langjp「ですな。@……ジョーカーであり、台風の目である。@それが魔女というもの…。」\
;＜ロノウェ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100043.ogg":^"True.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100044.ogg":^  ...A joker and the eye of a typhoon.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100045.ogg":^  That is what a witch is..."^\

mcl a,0

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a31_akuwarai2.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「ふっ。@この六軒島で魔女と名乗ってよいのはこの妾。@黄金の魔女にして無限の魔女、ベアトリーチェのみである！@　ベルンカステル卿め、縁寿の次なる駒がどの程度のものか。@じっくりと観覧させてもらおうぞ…！」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700238.ogg":^"Hmph.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700239.ogg":^  I'm the only one who gets to call herself a witch on this Rokkenjima.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700240.ogg":^  Only I, the Golden Witch and Endless Witch, Beatrice!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700241.ogg":^  Let's see how good Lady Bernkastel's next piece after Ange is.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700242.ogg":^  I intend to watch very closely...!"^\

