langjp　ヱリカの席は、序列で言うと一番の末席。@つまり、下手の正面席。@
langen^Erika's seat was the lowest one in rank.^@^  In other words, it was at the inferior end of the table.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　上手の正面席である金蔵の席は不在であるため、@引っ繰り返して見たならまるで、ヱリカがこの晩餐の主催のようにさえ見えた…。\
langen^Since Kinzo's seat at the high end of the table was empty, ^@^if you spun the whole thing around, it sort of looked like Erika was the host of this dinner...^\

