langen^Kinzo would pass on the title of Family Head, but he would only give up the 20 billion yen in gold to the person who solved the epitaph.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……これでは、真に当主を継承しているとは到底言えない。\
langen^...You really couldn't call this passing on the Headship in the truest sense.^\

