langjp「うん。@………黄金郷って単語、何度も出てくるでしょ？」@
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400046.ogg":^"Well,^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400047.ogg":^ ......at the end here, it says you'll receive the Golden Land's four treasures `once and for the last time', right?"^\
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「出てきますね。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100412.ogg":^"Yeah, it does."^\
advsetwindow "12"


langjp「なぜか、……第十の晩だけ、旅は終わり、黄金のキョウ、いえ、サトね。@黄金の郷へ至るだろうって書かれているの。@…どうしてここだけ、“黄金の郷”と書かれているのか、気になってね。」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400048.ogg":^"Why mention that you're reaching the Golden Land just once, and then say it's for the last time?^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400049.ogg":^  It's almost as though he's repeating the same thing twice.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400050.ogg":^  I've just been wondering whether he had some reason for putting it like that."^\

clr_text_bg

bg new_glob_1ar,22
_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_oya2.png",26
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「…………本当だ。@…確かに。@他はみんな黄金郷って書かれてるのに……。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100413.ogg":^".........You're right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100414.ogg":^  ...Like you said,^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100415.ogg":^ there's got to be a more straightforward way of saying that."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　みんな黄金郷なのに、第十の晩だけ、わざわざ“の”が入って、@“黄金の郷”になっている……。@
langjp　何か、特別な意味でもあるんだろうか………。@
langen^That line should've been a key part of the riddle, where you wouldn't expect the writer to waste words needlessly...^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Could it have been done for some special purpose...?^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　………………………。\
langen^...............^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ros\1\ros_a11_warai2.png",23
advsetwindow "12"

langjp「しかし、……戦人くんと、あのヱリカちゃんって子はすごいわね。@発想が本当に柔らかい。@…私なんかはもうオバサンだから、頭が全然回転しないのよ。@今日の、鍵の選びし六人は、６文字を間引けという意味だ、という推理は見事だったわ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400051.ogg":^"Still, ...you and that Erika-chan girl are incredible.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400052.ogg":^  Your minds really are flexible.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400053.ogg":^  ...I'm already an old lady, and my brain just doesn't work that fast.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400054.ogg":^  That theory about the six chosen by the key signifying six characters to be removed was very impressive."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ros\1\ros_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "12"

langjp「そう聞かされちゃったら、もうそうにしか思えないけれど、@それまでは、全然そうだと思わなかったものねぇ…。@自分の頭の硬さが嫌になるわ。」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400055.ogg":^"After hearing that, I can't see it as being any other way,^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400056.ogg":^ but before then, I didn't think it was like that at all...^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400057.ogg":^  I'm feeling let down by my own dull mind."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「そんなことないっすよ。@楼座叔母さんだって頭、充分柔らかいっすよ。@その“黄金の郷”って発見は、何かの鍵になるかもしれないじゃないっすか。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100416.ogg":^"That's not true.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100417.ogg":^  You've got a flexible mind yourself, Aunt Rosa.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100418.ogg":^  This `last time' thing might be really important somewhere down the line."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ros\1\ros_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "12"

langjp「とんでもない。カチカチよ。@……私なんて、ついこの間までは、第一の晩というのは黄金郷までの道中の、十分の一の場所だとか思ってたんだから。」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400058.ogg":^"Not at all.  My mind's very stiff.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400059.ogg":^  ......Up until now, I've always thought that this `first twilight' was nothing more than a place one-tenth of the way on a road to the Golden Land."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_warai3.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「……何すか、それ。@面白そうだから聞かせてくれませんか。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100419.ogg":^"...What's that?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100420.ogg":^  Sounds interesting.  Mind telling me about it?"^\

