langjp「それを知るには、スタート地点とゴール地点がわからないとね。@……スタート地点はわかってるの。@お父様が懐かしむ故郷はわかってる。@お父様は少年時代を、とても遠方で過ごされたのよね。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400071.ogg":^"For my ten day theory to work, you'd have to know both the start point and the end point.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400072.ogg":^  ...I know the start point.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400073.ogg":^  I know the hometown Father loved.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400074.ogg":^  The place Father spent his time when he was a boy really is far away."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ros\1\ros_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "12"

langjp「……でも、問題はゴールの黄金郷ね。@一体、どこのことなのかしら。@……それがわからなきゃ、私の説もさっぱり。@長いこと、ここで行き詰ってたんだけど、@今日の戦人くんたちの推理を聞いてて、やっぱり私の恥ずかしい勘違いだったんだわって思い知ったわ。」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400075.ogg":^"...But the problem is the goal, ...the Golden Land.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400076.ogg":^  What does that really mean?^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400077.ogg":^  ...If we don't know that, my theory gets us nowhere.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400078.ogg":^  I've been stuck at this spot for a long time,^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400079.ogg":^ but after listening to your reasoning today, I've realized what an embarrassing mistake I've been making."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「………いや、それはそれで、…きっと面白い発想だと思います。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100427.ogg":^"......No, ...I think that's still an interesting idea.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_nayamu1_chiru.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp……………………。@スタートとゴール、十日間の旅。@…その、最初の一晩目の到達点……。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100428.ogg":^  ...............^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100429.ogg":^A start and a goal, a ten-day journey.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100430.ogg":^  ...And the place reached at the very first twilight..."^\

