;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400080.ogg":^"Believe it or not, I think you might solve this one easily, Battler-kun.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400081.ogg":^  ...If you do solve it with your aunt's hint, share some with me.  Even 5% would be great.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\51400082.ogg":^  It's a promise♪"^\
