;quakey 4,800

langjp@　それを気取られれば、言い繕う余地など何もない！@　主人の横領は白日の下に晒され、右代宮家の名誉は失墜します！@　断固として、それだけは防がねばなりません…！」/
langen@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900409.ogg":^  If it's discovered, we'll have no chance to talk our way out of it!^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900410.ogg":^  My husband's embezzlement will be exposed to the light of day, and the Ushiromiya family's honor will be destroyed!^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900411.ogg":^  We must remain firm and prevent that no matter what may happen...!"^@/
langjp!sd\
langen!sd\

