langjp今年を乗り切れば何とかなるのだ。@だからうろたえるでない。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700254.ogg":^  If we can just make it through this year, we'll manage.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700255.ogg":^  So don't get flustered."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a12_odoroki3.png",23
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「しかし、去年と同じ手では無理だとして、取った作戦がこの篭城なのですよ？@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900412.ogg":^"But we used this strategy precisely because we wouldn't be able to pull off the same trick as last year, right?^@/
advsetwindow "03"

;ld l,NAT_OdorokiA1,80

langjp　一度は無理と切り捨てた作戦を再び選ぶのは愚の骨頂ではありませんか…？！@　一体、今さら、どういう筋書きを作るというのですか…！」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900413.ogg":^  Isn't it the height of stupidity to return to a plan you previously abandoned because it was impossible...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900414.ogg":^  Just what sort of plan could we hope to make at this point...?!"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\wal\1\wal_a11_fuman1.png",24
advsetwindow "30"

langjp「それは私とロノウェで用意します。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200032.ogg":^"Ronove and I will prepare one.^@/
advsetwindow "30"

;ld c,WAL_WaraiA1,80

langjpお任せを、幻想を生み出すのは魔女たちの役目。@……夏妃さまは、そのご許可を下さるだけで結構でございます。」\
;＜ワルギリア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200033.ogg":^  Leave it to us, for creating illusions is what witches do.^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200034.ogg":^  ...All you have to do is give us your permission, Natsuhi-sama."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「………お師匠様もロノウェも、こういう時は実に頼れるぞ…！@　片翼の鷲の使用人どもも、家具としては優秀だ。@お師匠様たちが魔法を再構築すれば、それを守るために働くだろう。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700256.ogg":^"......Teacher and Ronove are quite reliable at times such as these...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700257.ogg":^  And the servants of the One-Winged Eagle are top-notch furniture.^\:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700258.ogg":^  Once Teacher and Ronove rebuild the magic we need, I imagine the servants will work hard to protect it.^@/
advsetwindow "27"

;ld r,BEA_futekiA2,80

langjp…今からでも決して遅くはない。@金蔵を書斎から出し、その幻想を歩き回らせよう…！」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700259.ogg":^  ...It still isn't too late.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700260.ogg":^  Let's take Kinzo out of the study and make that illusion walk around...!"^\

se1 21

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a12_ikari1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「その作戦を長く検討し、それでも有効なものが見出せなかったから篭城を選んだことを忘れましたか？！@　急場にうろたえ、軽々しく当初の作戦を投げ出すなど、愚かしいことです！」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900415.ogg":^"Did you forget we chose our current strategy because we considered plans like that...and couldn't find anything that would work?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900416.ogg":^  It would be the height of foolishness to get flustered in an emergency and carelessly throw away our primary plan!"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\wal\1\wal_a11_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "30"

langjp「しかし夏妃さま…！@　篭城ではもはや凌ぎ切れぬことは、毒素の真っ只中でそれを感じ取っておられた夏妃さまが一番ご存知のはずです…！」\
;＜ワルギリア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200035.ogg":^"But Natsuhi-sama...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200036.ogg":^  As you stand there amidst the toxin, you must realize better than anyone else that we will no longer be able to outlast this siege...!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a12_ikari3.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「………私は、篭城の方針は変えずに、何とか他の作戦を考えられないかと提案します。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900417.ogg":^"......I propose that we try and think of another plan without changing our objective of holding the fort.^@/
advsetwindow "03"

;ld l,NAT_OdorokiA1,80

langjp……とにかく、この部屋を密室に保ちさえすれば、誰もお父様の存在を否定は出来ないのです。@開けることの出来ぬ猫箱の中身を断定することなど、何人にも出来ないのですから……！」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900418.ogg":^  ...In any event, as long as we can keep this room sealed, no one will be able to deny Father's existence.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900419.ogg":^  After all, one cannot determine the contents of a cat box that no number of people could ever hope to open...!"^\

