langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700261.ogg":^"...Well, that may be true, ^@/

_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_fukigen1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjpニンゲンどもは不条理であるぞ。@密閉した猫箱とて、ケーキの箱に群がる黒蟻のように、箱を食い破って中に入ることもありえる。@…………ベルンカステル卿の駒も気になるしな。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700262.ogg":^...but Humans are capable of defying reason.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700263.ogg":^  It's possible for them to eat into an airtight cat box and go inside, like black ants closing in on a box of cake.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700264.ogg":^  ......Lady Bernkastel's piece also worries me."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ron\1\ron_a11_akuwarai1.png",23
advsetwindow "31"

langjp「………ヱリカさまが晩餐の話題をさらって下さったのは幸いでした。@お陰で、今夜の親族会議をお開きに出来る雰囲気を生み出してくれたのですから。@……普段のように、即座に親族会議となっていたら、今夜にも結界は破られていたかもしれません。」\
;＜ロノウェ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100055.ogg":^"......It was fortunate that Erika-sama stole the show at tonight's dinner.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100056.ogg":^  By doing that, she created an atmosphere in which it was possible to close down the family conference for the night.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100057.ogg":^  ...If you all had returned directly to the family conference as usual, the barrier might have broken tonight."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\wal\1\wal_a11_ikari1.png",24
advsetwindow "30"

langjp「しかしそのせいで、より濃密に毒素は練り上げられました。@……明日まで練り上げられた毒素は、密室結界を容易く冒すでしょう。@篭城を続けるにせよ、やめるにせよ、@どちらにせよ新しい作戦と結界を用意しなくては明日は乗り越えられません。」\
;＜ワルギリア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200037.ogg":^"However, it also made the toxin grow even thicker.^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200038.ogg":^  ...After it thickens all night, it might manage to penetrate the closed room barrier with ease.^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200039.ogg":^  Whether we continue to hold down the fort or not, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200040.ogg":^we will not make it through tomorrow unless we prepare a new strategy and a new barrier."^\

