langjp「碑文の黄金が見つかったのよ！！@　お父様にご報告するのが筋でしょうが…！！@　それとも何？@　お父様にはそれを伝えられない都合でもあるのぉ？！」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000096.ogg":^"The gold of the epitaph has been found!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000097.ogg":^  It's only natural that we should inform Father about this...!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000098.ogg":^  Or else what?^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000099.ogg":^  Is there some reason you can't tell Father about this?!"^\

