langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000103.ogg":^"I don't care about that!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000104.ogg":^  Come on, just open this door!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000105.ogg":^  Let me see Father!!^@/

