langjp「戦人が、………碑文の謎を解いたというのか……！」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700305.ogg":^"Battler......solved the riddle of the epitaph, you say...?!"^\


ut_mld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_fumu1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「うむ。@……ヱリカなる娘にだいぶ助けられたとはいえ、辿り着いたのは戦人だった。@ヱリカは黄金郷の権利を放棄すると宣言している。@……よって、戦人が、黄金郷に辿り着きし者だ。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500147.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500148.ogg":^  ...Though he had a lot of help from that Erika girl, Battler was the one who reached the answer.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500149.ogg":^  Erika has proclaimed that she will abandon her rights to the Golden Land.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500150.ogg":^  ...Therefore, the one who reached the Golden Land...is Battler."^\

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\ron\1\ron_a11_akuwarai1.png",24
advsetwindow "31"

langjp「………運命とは、実に面白いものです。@戦人さまが、…辿り着くとは。」\
;＜ロノウェ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100080.ogg":^"......Fate can be truly amusing.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100081.ogg":^  To think that Battler-sama...would make it there."^\


mcl l,24
ut_mld l,":b;sprites\wal\1\wal_a11_majime1.png",23
advsetwindow "30"

langjp「どうするのです、ベアト。@……碑文の謎を解く者が現われたなら、儀式は取り止める約束ですよ。」\
;＜ワルギリア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200063.ogg":^"What will you do, Beato?^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200064.ogg":^  ...You promised to stop the ceremony if anyone solved the epitaph's riddle."^\

mcl a,23
ut_mld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「うむ。@…そういう取り決めであったな。」@
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500151.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500152.ogg":^  ...That was the deal."^\

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_nayamu1.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「………そういう取り決めだ。@うむ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700306.ogg":^"............That was the deal.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700307.ogg":^  Indeed..."^\

mcl r,23
ut_mld r,":b;sprites\ron\1\ron_a11_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "31"

langjp「戦人さまはどうやら、黄金郷の主となられるおつもりがないようだ。@……我らの主となる者は、もはや現われぬようですな。」@
;＜ロノウェ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100082.ogg":^"Apparently, Battler-sama does not intend to become the master of the Golden Land.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100083.ogg":^  ...It now seems that no one will become our master."^\

mcl l,24
ut_mld l,":b;sprites\wal\1\wal_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "30"

langjp「それもまた運命です。@ゴールドスミス卿とのご縁でニンゲンの世界に顕現して数十年。@……とても楽しい時間でしたよ。」\
;＜ワルギリア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200065.ogg":^"That is also fate.^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200066.ogg":^  It has been several decades since we first manifested in the Human world through our bond with Lord Goldsmith.^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200067.ogg":^  ...The time since then has been so very fun."^\


ut_mld c,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "32"

langjp「………やぁだ、リーア、ババ臭ァい。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\53700056.ogg":^"......Come on, Lia, you sound like an old lady.^@/

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "32"

langjp……で、どうするわけ？@　リーチェとゴールドスミスのルールなら、戦人が碑文を解き、主となることを選ばない以上、@私たちはこれでお役御免じゃないの？」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\53700057.ogg":^  ...So, what're we going to do?^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\53700058.ogg":^  If we go by Riiche and Goldsmith's rules, now that Battler's solved the epitaph and decided not to become our master,^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\53700059.ogg":^ we've been relieved from duty, right?"^\

mcl l,24
ut_mld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai1.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「そうであるな。@……私に未練は何もない。@いつでもコキュートスへ蹴落とされる覚悟は出来ておるぞ。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500153.ogg":^"That's true.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500154.ogg":^  ...I have no regrets at all.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500155.ogg":^  I've been prepared to be kicked down into Cocytus all this time."^\

mcl c,0
mcl r,23
ut_mld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_majime2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「待て。@そうは行かぬ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700308.ogg":^"Wait.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700309.ogg":^  We can't let that happen.^@/

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_futeki2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp……そなたの心残りはないかもしれぬが、妾はまだ夏妃に仕えておるぞ。@戦人が碑文を解いたからお役御免では、あまりに義理を欠くというもの。@……魔女は契約違反を許さぬが、不義理もまた許されぬ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700310.ogg":^  ...You might not have any regrets, but I will keep on serving Natsuhi.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700311.ogg":^  It would be quite irresponsible to let ourselves be relieved from duty just because Battler solved the epitaph.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700312.ogg":^  ...Witches are forbidden from breaking contracts, but they also must not fail to show gratitude."^\

mcl l,24
ut_mld l,":b;sprites\ron\1\ron_a11_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "31"

langjp「……でしょうな。@親族会議を終えるまでは、きっちりとお仕えするべきでしょう。」\
;＜ロノウェ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100084.ogg":^"...True.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100085.ogg":^  We should serve her until the family conference ends."^\


ut_mld c,":b;sprites\wal\1\wal_a11_warai1.png",24
advsetwindow "30"

langjp「となると、ゴールドスミス卿も、もうしばらくはお役御免とはなりませんね。@……無事に親族会議を乗り越え、せめて夏妃さまにお別れの挨拶と、@……もし出来るなら、これまでの努力を労われるべきかと。」\
;＜ワルギリア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200068.ogg":^"In that case, you won't be relieved from duty for a while either, Lord Goldsmith.^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200069.ogg":^  ...Perhaps you should wait until you've overcome this family conference safely, said goodbye to Natsuhi-sama at the very least,^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\53200070.ogg":^ ...and if possible, rewarded her for all her efforts."^\


mcl r,23
ut_mld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_def1.png",24
advsetwindow "01"

