langjp「貴様など、片羽をもがれた堕天使ではないか。@揃わぬ翼なら、置き土産に捨てて行けぃ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700313.ogg":^"You're a fallen angel with one of its wings plucked off, aren't you?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700314.ogg":^  Just leave the other wing as a parting gift and go."^\


