langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500158.ogg":^"...Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500159.ogg":^  ...Perhaps that would be fitting.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500160.ogg":^  Natsuhi may be worthy of bearing my wing.^@/

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp…しかし、………ここからが正念場となるぞ。@……褒美は用意した。@無事にこの試練を乗り越えてみよ……、夏妃…。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500161.ogg":^  ...However, ......we are approaching the critical moment.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500162.ogg":^  ...Your reward is waiting for you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\51500163.ogg":^  Try to make it through this test unscathed, ...Natsuhi..."^\


