langjp　様々な感情が入り混じる黄金の山の前に歩み出て、@……これがショーなら司会者が振舞うように、ヱリカが言った。\
langen^After stepping forward in front of the pile of gold that had caused these mixed emotions,^@^ ...Erika spoke as though she were an announcer in some show.^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_def2.png",24
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「………この世がカネなら、この黄金は幸せの結晶です。@……おめでとうございます、皆さん。@この発見が、皆さんの人生をより豊かなものにすることを、心よりお祈りいたしております。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500184.ogg":^"......If this world is money, then this gold is the embodiment of happiness.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500185.ogg":^  ...Congratulations, everyone.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500186.ogg":^  I pray that this discovery makes all of your lives richer."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\kir\1\kir_a13_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "09"

langjp「脱帽だわ……。@……この島に来て、丸一日さえ過ごしてないあなたが碑文を解いてしまうなんて。」\
;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\51300053.ogg":^"I take my hat off to you...^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\51300054.ogg":^  ...To think you'd solve the epitaph within a single day of coming to this island."^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「………一日で解けないなら、何日を掛けようとも解けません。@灰色の脳細胞は、閃きを与えるのに、瞬きする以上の時間を必要としませんので。@……そして、私一人ではこの謎を解くことは出来ませんでした。@戦人さんの功績も、どうか讃えて上げて下さい、皆さん。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500187.ogg":^"......If you couldn't solve it in a single day, then you wouldn't be able to solve it no matter how many days you had.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500188.ogg":^  After all, it doesn't take more than an instant for your little gray cells to give you a flash of intuition.^\:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500189.ogg":^  ...Also, I wouldn't have been able to solve this riddle myself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500190.ogg":^  I ask that you praise Battler-san's achievement as well, everyone."^\


bg new_sub_r1b,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_nayamu1_chiru.png",24
