langjp　目を離している間に、黄金を誰かが持ち去るのでは、とも考えたが、@１０ｔもの黄金を、人間の手でわずかの時間にどうにか出来るわけがない。\
langen^They thought of the possibility that someone might snatch the gold away while their backs were turned,^@^ but of course, no one could manage much with just human hands and a small amount of time when it's 10 tons of gold they're dealing with.^\
