;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100530.ogg":^"...Every time she performs these bizarre serial murders,^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100531.ogg":^ she's willing to spend an incredible amount of effort to politely send advance notice...^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100532.ogg":^and then kills us one by one in accordance with the epitaph, never getting exposed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100533.ogg":^  So all of that is meaningless to her...?"^\

