langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100101.ogg":^"If you got found out, you were in for it big time!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100102.ogg":^  Those Americandy people are scary!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100103.ogg":^  Their strength's in another league 'cause of all that beef they eat.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100104.ogg":^  If you got caught, it'd end with them shooting you or <death by hanging>!^\/

