langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100109.ogg":^  Get it?  <Death by hanging>!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100110.ogg":^  Oh yeah, and then, I figured it out.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100111.ogg":^  It's all about the meat!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100112.ogg":^  Japanese people gotta eat more meat!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100113.ogg":^  And that's when I got the revelation...that I needed to start up a business to win over people's stomachs!"^\

