;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800246.ogg":^"If we do such a thing, ...Eva and the others will doubtless make a fuss that our actions were suspicious.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800247.ogg":^  They aren't worried about appearances as long as they can squeeze some money out of us.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800248.ogg":^  ...It might end up in some odd magazine and cause serious damage to the confidence placed in me."^\

