langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900503.ogg":^"Damage is something we can live with, right...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900504.ogg":^  If by any chance Father's secret is discovered, we'll face a lot worse than mere damage...!!"^\


