langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800249.ogg":^"There's nothing wrong with persisting until the last possible second tomorrow.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800250.ogg":^  If we're able to make it through safely, we won't have to lose anything.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800251.ogg":^  There's no need to get impatient and use that trump card...!"^\


