langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800253.ogg":^"Calm yourself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800254.ogg":^  Being exposed to Eva and the others' venom too much has made you lose your composure, that's all.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800255.ogg":^  ...Only two keys exist that can let anyone into that study!^\:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800256.ogg":^  And you have both of them right here.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800257.ogg":^  That means no one can go inside.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800258.ogg":^  That door is of a very special make.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\50800259.ogg":^  No matter what kind of tools they bring out of the storage room, it won't even budge."^\

