langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100657.ogg":^"I want to hear you say you are happy, murderer.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100658.ogg":^  How dare you act like a normal, neat-freak mother.  You make me want to vomit.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100659.ogg":^  Do you want that to land on your husband and daughter as well?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100660.ogg":^  You don't, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100661.ogg":^  You want me to keep quiet, don't you?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100662.ogg":^  Okay, I'll keep quiet.  Come on, aren't you happy?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100663.ogg":^  Aren't you?!"^\

