langjp「あんたは今夜もう、その部屋を出てはならないし、どこにも電話を掛けてはならない。@電話が掛かってきても取ることも許さねぇぜ。@そして今すぐ灯りを消し、布団を被って寝ろ。@そしていつもの時間に起床しろ。@…………くっくくくく。@健康的な生活でいいなぁ。@カアサンの体を労わるなんて、本当に俺は親孝行者だよ……。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100697.ogg":^"You may no longer leave that room tonight, and you may not make a phone call to anywhere.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100698.ogg":^  If a phone call comes for you, you are not allowed to take it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100699.ogg":^  You will turn the lights off right now, get in bed, and sleep.^\:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100700.ogg":^  Then you will wake up at your ordinary time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100701.ogg":^  .........Heheheheheh.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100702.ogg":^  It sure is nice to live a healthy life.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100703.ogg":^  I really am such a good son, working so hard for the sake of my Mother's body..."^\

