langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100120.ogg":^"...That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100121.ogg":^  Father'd probably just barge in here without knockin'...^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100122.ogg":^  The doors and windows of this mansion are locked now, right...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\51100123.ogg":^  In that case, the only people who coulda conceivably left the letter there are Krauss-san, Natsuhi-san, and Genji-san."^\

