langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000164.ogg":^"No, this is the real thing!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000165.ogg":^  I've always dreamed about wearing this ring on my finger someday.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000166.ogg":^  Even though Father wore this on his finger, I know more about it than anyone else.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000167.ogg":^  ...This is Father's ring, no doubt about it!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000168.ogg":^  Why is it here?!"^\

