;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900620.ogg":^"I've never forgotten the bitter pain I felt that day...^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900621.ogg":^  ...It's not as though I didn't want a child...^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900622.ogg":^  ...However, no matter how much I prayed, I couldn't get pregnant...^\:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900623.ogg":^  Thinking that something to do with my body might be the cause, I went to see several famous doctors.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900624.ogg":^  But even so, no matter how hard I tried, ...I couldn't become pregnant..."^\


