langjp「お父様を恨んではいません。@……もし恨めるのなら、……ただただ、自分の体が恨めしかった…！@　憎かったんです！@　子を宿せぬ我が身がひたすらに、……憎かった……！！@　だから私は祈りました。@天使と悪魔の両方に！！@　そして、その両方が叶いました…！」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900625.ogg":^"I don't hate Father.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900626.ogg":^  ...If anything, ...I hated my own body...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900627.ogg":^  I detested it!^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900628.ogg":^  I truly detested my own body for being unable to bear a child...!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900629.ogg":^  So I prayed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900630.ogg":^  I prayed to both angels and demons!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900631.ogg":^  And my wishes were granted by both...!"^\
