langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900632.ogg":^"I prayed for a miracle in my body...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900633.ogg":^  If there was something wrong with my body, I could accept that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900634.ogg":^  In that case, I wanted to overcome that defect and somehow be granted the miracle of being given my husband's child...!"^\


