langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100721.ogg":^"As long as you follow my orders, I will keep your secret, Mother.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100722.ogg":^  ...Do not disobey me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100723.ogg":^  ...I am already very close by to you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100724.ogg":^  I can easily tell whether you have turned your lights off, or whether you are on the phone.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100725.ogg":^  ...If I wished to, I could even kiss your sleeping face."^\
