langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200355.ogg":^"Your reasoning goes like this, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200356.ogg":^  The four of them weren't actually dead, they were just playing dead.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200357.ogg":^  Then, when no one else was around, they hid somewhere.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200358.ogg":^  Am I right?"^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「誰の死亡宣言をも、赤では出す気ないんでしょう？」@
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100367.ogg":^"You don't intend to proclaim any of their deaths in red now, do you?"^\

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「当然よ。@ベアトのクルクルパーと違って、私は濫りに赤をサービスしたりしないわぁ！」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200359.ogg":^"Of course I won't.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200360.ogg":^  Unlike that dolt Beato, I don't give red out for free!"^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai4.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「なら、喜んで青き真実を使わせてもらうわ。@この程度のこと、いくらでも抜け道は思いつくもの。」@
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100368.ogg":^"In that case, I'll be glad to use the blue truth.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100369.ogg":^  I can think of many ways to work around something of this level."^\

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_futeki3.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「くすくす。@はいはい、どうぞ〜！@　青き真実ターイム！」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200361.ogg":^"*giggle*^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200362.ogg":^  Sure, go ahead!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200363.ogg":^  Blue truth time!"^\

