langjp#5DECFF実は犠牲者は死んでいなかった。@死んだフリをしていて、こっそりどこかに隠れたのよ。@何しろあんたは、誰の死亡についても赤き真実で宣言してないものね。#ffffff」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100371.ogg":^#5decff  The victims aren't actually dead.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100372.ogg":^  They pretended to be dead, then secretly hid themselves somewhere.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100373.ogg":^  After all, you haven't proclaimed anyone's deaths with the red truth.#ffffff"^\


ut_mld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_futeki1.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「あっはは！@　例え、傷口ばっくり見せられちゃっても、赤くなきゃそう来るわよねぇ基本よねぇ？！@　でも駄目よ。@赤き真実なんてサービスしないわよぅ！@　何しろ、ゲームの最後、１０月５日２４時にちょいと一ヶ所、否定すればいいんだもんねぇ！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200364.ogg":^"Ahhaha!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200365.ogg":^  Even through you've been shown their gaping wounds, you're still trying that one on principle, as long as there's no red, right?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200366.ogg":^  But don't get your hopes up.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200367.ogg":^  I'm not giving you a freebie red truth!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200368.ogg":^  After all, I just have to deny it all at once at the end of the game, at 24:00 on October 5th!"^\

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「あぁ、魔女側は有利だわぁ！@　バカ戦人ならこれで終わるところでしょうけど、ベルンは違うわよねぇ？！」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200369.ogg":^"Ah, the witch's side has such a big advantage!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200370.ogg":^  It'd all be over now if that stupid Battler was my opponent, but you aren't like that, right, Bern?!"^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「当然よ。@こんなのは誰もが思いつく下らない一手。@まだ続けるわよ。@２つ目。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100374.ogg":^"Of course.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100375.ogg":^  Anyone could've thought of that silly move.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100376.ogg":^  I have more.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100377.ogg":^  Second one.^@/
se1 2
advsetwindow "28"
langjp#5DECFF遺体は蔵臼が運んで隠した。@蔵臼は、あんたがさらってどこかに監禁されてるように演出されてるけど、実際はフリーなのかもしれない。@蔵臼にアリバイはないわ。@蔵臼が彼らの死体を隠したのよ。#ffffff」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100378.ogg":^  #5decffKrauss carried the corpses off and hid them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100379.ogg":^  You've acted it out so that it looks like you've kidnapped Krauss and locked him up somewhere, but he might actually be free.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100380.ogg":^  Krauss has no alibi.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100381.ogg":^  Krauss hid their corpses.#ffffff"^\

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_futeki2.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「あぁ、そうよねぇ。@赤き真実で蔵臼の監禁を宣言したわけじゃないものねぇ。くすくすくす！@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200371.ogg":^"Yeah, that's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200372.ogg":^  It's not like I proclaimed that Krauss was being confined with the red truth.  *giggle*giggle*!^@/

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_futeki3.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp　言うもんね、敵を騙すには味方から！@　夏妃に、自分が捕らわれてるように嘘を吐いた、っと！@　うっふふふふふふ！！@　他には？！」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200373.ogg":^  You know how they say you've gotta confuse your friends before you can confuse your enemies!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200374.ogg":^  So he lied to Natsuhi, making it seem like he'd been captured?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200375.ogg":^  Heheheheheheh!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200376.ogg":^  Any others?!"^\

