se1 2
advsetwindow "28"
langjp#5DECFFそもそも死体が別人。@犠牲者そっくりの身代わり死体よ。@譲治たちは最初から隠れていて、その後に身代わり死体を片付けた。@死体は最初から死んでるから、島の人数にはカウントされない。#ffffff」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100383.ogg":^  #5decffThe corpses were different people in the first place.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100384.ogg":^  They were substitute corpses that closely resembled the victims.^\:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100385.ogg":^  George and the others were hiding from the beginning, and later cleared up those substitute corpses.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100386.ogg":^  These corpses were dead from the very beginning, so they don't count towards the number of people on the island.#ffffff"^\


ut_mld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai5.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「あっはっはっははははははははッ！！@　何それ超イカス！！@　つまり、あれだけの人間が寄って集って死に顔を見て、全員が全員、身代わり死体を見抜けなかったと？」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200377.ogg":^"Ahhahhahhahahahahahahahaha!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200378.ogg":^  That's messed up!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200379.ogg":^  So even though all those people gathered around and saw their dead faces, none of them realized they were substitute corpses?"^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「赤き真実をあんたが行使しない以上、全員が全員、遺体の身元確認を誤認した可能性だってあるわ。@あんたに、“誰も人物を誤認しない”って復唱要求に応える気があるなら、直ちに引っ込めるけど…？」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100387.ogg":^"Since you haven't used the red truth, there's a possibility that everyone misidentified all of the corpses.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100388.ogg":^  Though if you feel like repeating `no one would misidentify a person', I'll withdraw that claim immediately, okay...?"^\

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai3.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「嫌ですよぉ〜だ♪　そんな挑発には乗らないわよぅ！@　赤き真実はね、もったいぶるから効果的なのよ？@　たくさんの青き真実の中から、たった一つだけを選び、赤で叩き切る！@　そして、その他全ての青き真実は、それが正しかったのかどうかも明かされないまま、闇に葬られて消える！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200380.ogg":^"No way♪  I'm not falling for that!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200381.ogg":^  The red truth's only useful if you use it with flash, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200382.ogg":^  I'll take a single truth out of a large pile of blue and smash it with the red!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200383.ogg":^  Then, the rest of the blue truths will be swallowed up by darkness before you can find out whether they were right or wrong!"^\

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_futeki1.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「その闇こそ、魔女の世界！@　あんたに与えられる真実なんて、何も存在しないッ！@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200384.ogg":^"That darkness is the world of witches!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200385.ogg":^  You won't be given any truth at all!^@/
se1 37
advsetwindow "29"
langjp　うっふふふふっふっふっふ！！」\
;＜ラムダ
