langjp　とりあえず、私も死体消失について、思いつく仮説を３つほど上げてみた。\
locate 0, 6 ;<CENTER_TEXT>
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100396.ogg":^In any event, I've thought up a full three theories about the disappearing corpses.^\
;advsetwindow "28"
;locate 0,4;utmeta-break
langjp　１つの謎に対し、３つの青き楔。@
locate 0, 4 ;<CENTER_TEXT>
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100397.ogg":^Three blue wedges for a single riddle.^@
br
;advsetwindow "28"
langjp　だから、３つのうち、１つを否定すればいいわけじゃない。@
langjp　３つの楔を全て抜かない限り、この謎は貫かれてる。@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100398.ogg":^That doesn't mean she can just deny one of those three.^@
;advsetwindow "28"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100399.ogg":^Unless she eliminates all three wedges, this riddle has been defeated.^@
br
;advsetwindow "28"
langjp　それが、魔女狩りの鉄則。\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100400.ogg":^That's the ironclad rule of witch hunting.^\
;advsetwindow "28"
;locate 0,3;utmeta-break
langjp　楔は一本じゃ全然足りない。@
locate 0, 4 ;<CENTER_TEXT>
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100401.ogg":^A single wedge isn't nearly enough.^@
br
;advsetwindow "28"
langjp　楔一本で死んでくれるのは吸血鬼程度。@
langjp　魔女に比べりゃ、吸血鬼なんて貧弱なもんよ。@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100402.ogg":^Only vampires die from a single stake.^@
;advsetwindow "28"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100403.ogg":^Compared to witches, vampires are weak.^@
br
;advsetwindow "28"
;locate 0,4;utmeta-break
langjp　……本物の魔女はね、楔で滅多刺しにしなきゃ死なないのよ？\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100404.ogg":^...True witches won't die unless you stab them all over with stakes, right?^\
;advsetwindow "28"
;locate 0,3;utmeta-break
langjp　殺し屋だってそうでしょ？@
locate 0, 3 ;<CENTER_TEXT>
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100405.ogg":^It's the same with assassins, isn't it?^@
br
;advsetwindow "28"
langjp　殺し屋がキレイに一発の弾丸だけで相手を殺すなんて、日本の漫画の中だけよ。@
langjp　本当の殺し屋なら、弾倉が空になるまで全弾ブチ込むわ。@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100406.ogg":^It's only in Japanese manga that you see assassins kill their targets with a single perfect shot.^@
;advsetwindow "28"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100407.ogg":^Real assassins will empty out an entire magazine's worth of bullets.^@
;locate 0,4;utmeta-break
br
;advsetwindow "28"
langjp　…………あんただって、そうするでしょう？@　無論、私もよ。\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100408.ogg":^......That's how you do things, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100409.ogg":^  Of course, it's the same for me.^\
;advsetwindow "28"
;locate 0,4;utmeta-break
langjp　でもこんなの、この子のことだから、赤一つで一刀両断にしてくるでしょうね。@
locate 0, 4 ;<CENTER_TEXT>
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100410.ogg":^But it's this girl we're talking about, so she might slice it all in two with a single swipe of the red.^@
br
;advsetwindow "28"
;locate 0,4;utmeta-break
langjp　彼らの死亡宣告と蔵臼の無実。@この辺をちょいちょいっと赤で語るだけで、私の楔は三本とも抜けてしまう。\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100411.ogg":^By simply letting off a few quick lines confirming their deaths and Krauss's innocence with the red,^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100412.ogg":^ she can remove all three of my wedges.^\
;advsetwindow "28"
;locate 0,4;utmeta-break
langjp　まぁ、それでいいんだけどね。@
