langjp　赤き真実が出てきたら、それに合わせて、再び青き楔で滅多刺しにしてやるだけのこと。@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100414.ogg":^When the red truth does come out, I just need to follow along with it and stab her full of blue wedges again.^@
br
