langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000266.ogg":^"If Father were to die, an investigation would be conducted for the distribution of the assets and your embezzlement would be exposed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\51000267.ogg":^  That's why you hid the fact that Father's already dead!!"^\

