langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900832.ogg":^"Y-Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50900833.ogg":^  I have said repeatedly that I came to deliver a report for the day and to say good night...!"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_akuwarai3.png",80
