;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500489.ogg":^  ...This Kinzo you speak of is the Ushiromiya Kinzo-san we all know of, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500490.ogg":^  It isn't a different person or thing with the same name, is it?"^\


