;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500491.ogg":^"I see.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500492.ogg":^  In that case, can you repeat what I'm about to say?^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500493.ogg":^  If you aren't tricking or deceiving us in any way, you should be able to do it."^\

