langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500514.ogg":^"Kinzo-san is not inside this room.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500515.ogg":^  Furthermore, this room is a perfect closed room.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500516.ogg":^  From the above two points, I can state this fact:^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500517.ogg":^ this room was empty the whole time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500518.ogg":^  Natsuhi-san lied about having met Kinzo-san here last night!^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500519.ogg":^  That makes this checkmate, Beatrice-san...!"^\

