langjp「結果を闇に閉ざす魔法は邪悪デス。@私たちは許さナイ。@しかし、過程を包む魔法は邪悪とは限りマセン。@私の敵は邪悪であって、魔法そのものではないのデス。」\
;＜ドラノ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600126.ogg":^"Magic that hides the result in darkness is EVIL.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600127.ogg":^  I will not permit IT.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600128.ogg":^  However, magic that enshrouds the process is not necessarily EVIL.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600129.ogg":^  My foe is evil itself, not MAGIC."^\


