;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100963.ogg":^"I see.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100964.ogg":^  ...The important thing is that you're being served some tea,^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50100965.ogg":^ so it's just common courtesy to avoid complaining about how it was made."^\

