;＜ドラノ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600134.ogg":^"When giving a child candy, you can take a crumpled up one out of your pocket,^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600135.ogg":^ or you can use some clever sleight of hand to take the candy OUT.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600136.ogg":^  The impression given by each method varies GREATLY."^\

