;＜ドラノ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600140.ogg":^  The important thing is the result: that the girl received the candy and REJOICED.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600141.ogg":^  And it is significant that it was embellished ^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600142.ogg":^in a way that made her REJOICE."^\

