langen:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600143.ogg":^"That is how I act in my capacity as an Inquisitor of HERESY.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600144.ogg":^  It is my JOB.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600145.ogg":^  However, when I am away from my job, I don't enjoy being quite so cold-HEARTED."^\


