langen:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600146.ogg":^"As an Inquisitor of Heresy, hunting witches is my JOB.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600147.ogg":^  ...However, I personally find witches PITIABLE.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600148.ogg":^  Despite this, I carry out judgment mercilessly as an INQUISITOR."^\

