langen:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600149.ogg":^"...In the end, that doesn't change the fact that I sentence witches to DEATH.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600150.ogg":^  ...In the end, my pity is nothing more than a useless EMBELLISHMENT.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600151.ogg":^  Whether I have it or not, nothing CHANGES.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600152.ogg":^  So, it would be better if I DIDN'T..."^\

