langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500694.ogg":^"...I see.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500695.ogg":^  No matter how much I toy with it, it's impossible for anyone except those in the guesthouse group to create the knocking sound, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500696.ogg":^  Like me, for example.^@/
