langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200428.ogg":^"But even this doesn't work, okay?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200429.ogg":^  The action of `stopping the serving cart' would indirectly lead to `placing the letter in the hallway'.^@/
