;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200430.ogg":^  That would mean Shannon and Kanon, who were pushing the cart, had `indirectly and unintentionally' placed the letter there!^\:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200431.ogg":^  So even this is no good!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200432.ogg":^  Furthermore, setting it up so that the letter peeled off with the passage of time...^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200433.ogg":^would mean that the people pushing the serving cart had `coincidentally and unintentionally' placed the letter there.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\52200434.ogg":^  Of course, this is also no good!!"^\

