langen:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600249.ogg":^"...<Miss> Erika,^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600250.ogg":^ why don't we postpone the riddle of the letter for NOW?^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600251.ogg":^  ...Your blue stake about `someone outside the mansion playing it with a cassette tape' is still VALID.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\54600252.ogg":^  If it was possible for sound, then perhaps it wasn't impossible for a letter as WELL."^\
