langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500722.ogg":^"That's right, my blue truth regarding the knock is still valid...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500723.ogg":^  It's not true that everything's been denied...!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500724.ogg":^  My master!  I will solve the riddle of the letter without fail.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500725.ogg":^  Please allow me to postpone that for now...!!^\/

