langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700718.ogg":^"Mere confirmation of facts doesn't even approach the red truth...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700719.ogg":^  No matter how much everyone claims to have truly witnessed their deaths, the red truth doesn't exist in the human world!^\/

