;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700720.ogg":^  Because the corpses don't exist, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700721.ogg":^Natsuhi can discount their words as a mistake, some sort of trick, or she can say they were all lying,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700722.ogg":^ and it's possible for her to do this over and over to buy time for herself."^\

