langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100152.ogg":^"True.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100153.ogg":^  However, beauty is something to be sought only after victory.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\53100154.ogg":^  When those without victory seek it, it is naught but poison."^\


