;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500874.ogg":^  First off, following dinner, Kumasawa-san left the mansion with me and the others and went to the guesthouse,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500875.ogg":^ entered the waiting room, and slept until morning.^\:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500876.ogg":^  It's the same for Gohda-san.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500877.ogg":^  Once he finished with his job, he chatted with us in the lounge and went to sleep afterwards.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500878.ogg":^  Neither of them had the opportunity to commit murder."^\


