;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500900.ogg":^"After I watched Kumasawa-san, who returned to the guesthouse with me, say goodnight and enter the waiting room, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500901.ogg":^I used this to seal the door.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500902.ogg":^  Then, in the morning,^\:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500903.ogg":^ when the crime was discovered and caused a big uproar, I immediately went to check Kumasawa-san's waiting room,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54500904.ogg":^ where I confirmed that the seal was still set.^@^  Therefore, I can prove Kumasawa-san's alibi!"^\


