advsetwindow "28"

langjp「………ヱリカの封印が、郷田が午前１時まで使用人室に篭っていたことを証明するわ。@そして、午前３時までのアリバイを、@一緒にラウンジで過ごしたヱリカが証明するわ。@そして、それ以降の朝までに２階へ一切、立ち入ってないことも、@ヱリカが証明するわ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100533.ogg":^"......Erika's seal proves that Gohda was holed up in the servant room until 1:00 AM.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100534.ogg":^  And Erika has proven his alibi from ^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100535.ogg":^then until 3:00 AM, since she was passing the time in the lounge with him.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100536.ogg":^  And Erika has also proven that he never set foot ^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100537.ogg":^on the second floor until the morning after."^\

