langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700835.ogg":^"After Battler returned at 3:00 AM, you went up to the second floor with him.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700836.ogg":^  And I believe you also went to your own room and slept.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\50700837.ogg":^  You may have gone to the cousin room at 24:00, but I don't think you went there after 3:00 AM."^\

