langjp「我が主は完璧です。@私は主に命じられたままに、全てを完璧に証明しただけです…！」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501014.ogg":^"My master is perfect.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501015.ogg":^  All I did was prove everything perfectly by following my master's orders...!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_akuwarai3.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「見事よ、ヱリカ。@私の分身、私の駒…！@　どう、ラムダ？@　これでラウンジでのヱリカの見張りは、アリバイ構築上、絶対の信頼性を持つことが証明されたと思うけど…？」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100576.ogg":^"Well done, Erika.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100577.ogg":^  My double, my piece...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100578.ogg":^  What do you think, Lambda?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100579.ogg":^  Doesn't this prove that Erika's lookout in the lounge contains absolute reliability as far as constructing alibis...?"^\



