langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501027.ogg":^"Then let us continue.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501028.ogg":^  Let's examine the alibis of the remaining suspects, the people in the mansion.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501029.ogg":^  After all, we only have to worry about the single hour between 24:00 and 1:00.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501030.ogg":^  That shouldn't be difficult at all."^\

