langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100585.ogg":^  #ff0000At 24:00, Natsuhi, Krauss, and Genji were in the corridor on the second floor of the mansion.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100586.ogg":^  The rest of them were in the dining hall on the first floor.#ffffff^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100587.ogg":^  And as you know, there was a mysterious knock, and a letter with the One Wing seal on it appeared.^\:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100588.ogg":^  The discussion surrounding that continued on until 1:00.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\52100589.ogg":^  I will say it with the red truth.^@/

