langen^During the hour between 24:00 on October 4th, 1986 and 1:00 the next day,^@^ Ushiromiya Natsuhi went to the cousins' room on the second floor of the guesthouse and the servant waiting room on the first floor of the mansion.^\^  There, she carried out the murders.^@
