langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501098.ogg":^"Well, now that we have all gathered,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501099.ogg":^ just what is it that drove Ushiromiya Natsuhi-san to commit these terrible murders?^@/

_ld c,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_warai4.png",80
