langjp「この日記帳から浮かび上がったのは。@夏妃さんは、蔵臼さんと特殊な事情でご結婚なされたらしいということです。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501108.ogg":^"And this is what I found from these diaries.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501109.ogg":^  Natsuhi-san ended up married to Krauss-san due to special circumstances."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「……ここにいらっしゃる皆さんは私よりご存知なのでは？@　夏妃さん蔵臼さんご夫婦は、恋愛結婚でも、お見合い結婚でもありません。@……言わば、人質のような結婚でした。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501110.ogg":^"...I imagine that all of you here know much more about this than I do.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501111.ogg":^  Natsuhi-san and Krauss-san were not married because of love or as a normal arranged marriage.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501112.ogg":^  ...If anything, it was more like taking a hostage."^\

bg black,26
bg new_m1f_s1ar,22
