langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\51800089.ogg":^"......Y-Yes, that's correct.^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\51800090.ogg":^  ...I did catch wind of something similar to what you describe...^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\51800091.ogg":^  ...I think that by now,^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\51800092.ogg":^ ...only Doctor Nanjo and I know of the details regarding Madam's marriage..."^\


