langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501149.ogg":^"You lying Human who can't speak the truth!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501150.ogg":^  Humans lacking the red truth have no right to speak of love or the heart or truth!^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501151.ogg":^  Did you know?^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501152.ogg":^  Men aren't as stupid as you women think they are.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\54501153.ogg":^  Men never really take it seriously when a woman says `I love you'...!"^\

