langjp　幻想裁判第0147−007982号（１９８６年１０月５日２４時）により、以下が確定したことを公示する。@
langen^Due to the result of Illusion Trial #0147-007982 (24:00, October 5th, 1986), we announce that the following has been determined:^@
;advsetwindow "-1"
langjp　右代宮夏妃が、犯行を認めたこと。@
langen^That Ushiromiya Natsuhi did admit to her crime.^@
