langen:delay 1200:dwave 0, "voice\03\50901087.ogg":^...satisfied now......?^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50901088.ogg":^  ...This...^@/
advsetwindow "03"
langen:delay 2000:dwave 0, "voice\03\50901089.ogg":^...is what you wanted to make me say, right...?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　夏妃伯母さんが嗚咽交じりに、そう口にする。/
langen^Aunt Natsuhi sobbed as she spoke.^@/
