;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\50901101.ogg":^"No,^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50901102.ogg":^ this is not about what has happened today and yesterday.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\50901103.ogg":^  ......I will confess to a murder that occurred 19 years ago."^\

