;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900006.ogg":^  ...They read them based merely on the name of the author and the brand and think that they've actually read them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900007.ogg":^  ...No matter what I write in my books, they don't truly read anything.^\:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900008.ogg":^  They just pretend to read so they can look smart and knowledgeable and keep up with the current fad.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900009.ogg":^  ...Why on earth should I expose myself to these people?^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900010.ogg":^  Why indulge such trash?"^\

