langjp　にもかかわらず、作者本人は決して表に出ず、謎のベールに包まれてきたが、@つい先日、ついにサイン会にてその姿を現し、サングラスとマスクで顔を隠した文字通りの覆面作家として、さらに注目を浴びたのだが…。@
langen^Despite all of this, the author herself never appeared in public, and everything about her was wrapped in a veil of secrecy.^\^  However, just a few days ago, this author finally made a public appearance for a book signing, showing up with a mask that covered `his' face and drawing even more public attention...^@
