;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000007.ogg":^"That's it exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000008.ogg":^  ...I do not want you to be my piece.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000009.ogg":^  I have always been a mere observer, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000010.ogg":^and I have no intention of sticking my neck into their game..."^\

