;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000014.ogg":^  ...However, now that he has succeeded the position of Game Master, he is not a suitable observer.^\:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000015.ogg":^  I am following this tale with true and earnest intentions.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000016.ogg":^  It would be such a waste to observe it through the eyes of Battler as he is now, like reading a detective novel backwards..."^\

