;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000054.ogg":^ to the Witch of Theatergoing, Featherine Augustus Aurora.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000055.ogg":^  Until you finish reading, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000056.ogg":^I shall bring calamity to all who attempt to hinder your task."^\


