langjp　観劇の魔女、フェザリーヌがそれを宣言すると、……縁寿は眩い光に包まれる。\
langen^When the Witch of Theatergoing, Featherine, spoke this, ...Ange was wrapped in a bright light.^\

;se1 55
se3 22
;mov %ENJ_Isyou,3
bg white,48
;se2v 52,100
bg new_fea_r1ap,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_def1.png",2
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　縁寿自身は特に何も変化を感じないが、@……人ならざる者には知覚できる何かが、確かに彼女に与えられていた。@
langen^Ange didn't feel any particular change herself,^@^ ...but she definitely had been given something that only nonhumans could sense.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　これにより、縁寿は今、観劇の魔女の眷属であることが示されている。\
langen^It signified that from this point forward, Ange would be the Witch of Theatergoing's subject.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　それによって、縁寿に何か特別な力が与えられるわけではないが、@……少なくとも、彼女にちょっかいを出そうとする者は、観劇の魔女フェザリーヌを、敵に回す覚悟が必要になるだろう…。\
langen^That didn't mean that Ange would gain some sort of special power,^@^ ...but at the very least, it probably meant that anyone wanting to cause her harm would first have to take on Featherine herself...^\

bg new_fea_r1cp,0

_ld r,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def1.png",2
_ld l,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "11"
langjp「あんたの名前、ずいぶんと長いのね。@ローマの偉人みたい。@……何と呼べば？」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000089.ogg":^"...Your name is pretty long.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000090.ogg":^  Sounds like some Roman person from the history books.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000091.ogg":^  ...What should I call you?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「親しくない者はアウグストゥス・アウローラと呼ぶ。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000057.ogg":^"Those not familiar with me call me Augustus Aurora."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「………私に敬意を示してくれたあんたに、私も敬意を示して。@フェザリーヌと呼ぶわ。@問題は？」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000092.ogg":^"......After all the respect you've shown me, it's only fitting that I respond in kind.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000093.ogg":^  I'll call you Featherine.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000094.ogg":^  Any problems?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「ない。@……病んだこの身には名を呼ばれることさえ、噛み締めがいのある愉悦だ。人の子よ。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000058.ogg":^"None at all.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000059.ogg":^  ...For an ailing witch such as myself, even being called by my first name will be an experience to be treasured and pondered over, child of man."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_fuman2.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「縁寿よ、私の名前。」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000095.ogg":^"I have a name.  It's Ange."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b12_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「……ふふ。そういうやり取りさえも、心地良きかな。@……縁寿、我が巫女よ。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000060.ogg":^"...Heheh.  Even conversations like this are pleasant every once in a while.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000061.ogg":^  ...Ange, my miko."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　縁寿は受託する。@
langjp　観劇の魔女とともに、物語を観劇することを。@
langen^Ange accepted her role.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^She would observe this story with the Witch of Theatergoing.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　第６の物語が、幕を開ける……。\
langen^The curtain was rising on the sixth tale...^\

