langjp　もしあの時、ラムダデルタでなく、ベアトがゲームマスターだったなら、@その時にゲーム盤も消え去り、全ては終わるはずだった。\
langen^If Beato had been the Game Master at that time instead of Lambdadelta, ^@^the game board itself would have vanished at that moment, and everything would've ended.^\
