langjp　しかし、このゲーム盤の世界を遊び続けたい魔女たちが、ラムダデルタがそれを許さず、@呪いの枷で彼女を縛った。\
langen^However, the witches wanted to keep playing in this game board world, ^@^so Lambdadelta bound Beato in place with that cursed shackle.^\

