langjp　たとえベアトが戦う意思を失っても、@ゲーム盤が消え去らないように、枷で固定したのだ。\
langen^She used that shackle to fix the game board in place and prevent it from disappearing,^@^ even if Beato did lose the will to fight.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　それはさながら、チェスで言うなら、@制限時間を撤廃して無限にしたようなもの。@
langen^In chess, this would be the equivalent of removing the set time limit for each turn, making it endless.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　しかし、だからといって、無限にベアトの手番で止まってしまっていては、魔女たちは退屈の病で死んでしまう。@
langen^However, simply having the game endlessly paused on Beato's turn would cause the witches to die from their illness of boredom.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　だから、ラムダデルタがゲームマスターを引き継いだ。\
langen^That's why Lambdadelta took the position of Game Master.^\

