langjp　……その時、ベアトの存在が、このゲームの存在する前提条件で、なくなった。@
langen^...Starting then, Beato's existence was no longer one of the conditions necessary for the game's existence.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　多分、それが理由で、彼女をゲーム盤に縛る枷が解けたのだろう。\
langen^That's probably why the shackles binding her to the game board were released.^\
;br

