langjp「……お兄ちゃんは。@ベアトに、真相に辿り着いたことを教えるには、/
langjp!d900…１つゲームが遅かったということね。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000126.ogg":^"...So, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000127.ogg":^when Onii-chan managed to reach the truth, ^@/
advsetwindow "11"
langen:delay 3400:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000128.ogg":^...it was one game too late for him to tell Beato about it."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「第５のゲームなど、ラムダデルタの慈悲だ。@……戦人の、絶対に真相に辿り着きたいという信念に、絶対の魔女が慈悲を示しただけのこと…。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000096.ogg":^"The 5th game was a form of charity on Lambdadelta's part.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000097.ogg":^  ...She merely showed Battler some mercy as the Witch of Certainty, acknowledging his strong desire to reach the truth no matter what..."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a21_fuman2.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「………何が慈悲よ。@ただの魔女たちの暇潰しの気まぐれじゃない。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000129.ogg":^"...How can you call that charity?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000130.ogg":^  It's just those fickle witches killing time.^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp……話を戻すわ。@じゃあ、あのおかしなベアトは、プレイヤーのベアトじゃないってことになる。@駒のベアトということだわ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000131.ogg":^  ...Let's get back to the point.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000132.ogg":^  So, that means this weird Beato isn't the player Beato.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000133.ogg":^  She's just a piece Beato."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "50"
langjp「そうだ。@……だったら、誰もがよく知るベアトになるはず。@……戦人も、そういうベアトを望んだはず…。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000098.ogg":^"True.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000099.ogg":^  ...If that is the case, she should eventually become the Beato everyone knows.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000100.ogg":^  ...I imagine that is the Beato that Battler wants..."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a31_komaru3.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「…………………。@……ぬいぐるみじゃ、/
langjp!d900…嫌だったってこと？」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000135.ogg":^"......^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000136.ogg":^...You mean, ^@/
advsetwindow "-1"
langen!d900^...he wasn't satisfied with just a doll?"^\

bg black,22
