;＜源次
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\61600009.ogg":^"That is when the two sides of the tale do not meet, creating a contradiction.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\61600010.ogg":^  ...When this happens, it becomes a fatal violation of the rules known as a logic error, and the game board will immediately collapse and be destroyed.^\:dwave 0, "voice\14\61600011.ogg":^  It is the greatest and worst form of error that the witch side can make, and one which must always be avoided."^\

