;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000132.ogg":^"...We can read this as saying that Beato did not exist six years ago,^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000133.ogg":^ or it could simply mean that she had no connection to Battler at that time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000134.ogg":^  However, either way, Battler did not visit Rokkenjima at all for the next six years..."^\

