langjp「ベアトリーチェとお兄ちゃんは、この１９８６年１０月４日が初対面のはず。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000164.ogg":^"October 4th, 1986 should have been the first time Beatrice and Onii-chan met.^@/

