langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\61800013.ogg":^"Beatrice-sama has revived.^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\61800014.ogg":^  However, the old Beatrice-sama lived for a thousand years.^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\61800015.ogg":^  ...This Beatrice-sama, on the other hand, was only born a short while ago...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\61800016.ogg":^  If she appears to be a different person, well, that just can't be helped...!"^\

