langjp「ましてや、ベアトリーチェは千年を経た魔女。@……人は三日あれば、死ぬことだって生まれ変わることだってできる。@それが千年じゃ、………どうにもならないわね。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000189.ogg":^"And on top of that, Beatrice is a witch who lived a thousand years.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000190.ogg":^  ...People can die and be reborn in just three days.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000191.ogg":^  A thousand years...is such a huge amount of time."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_a11_def2.png",23
advsetwindow "57"
langjp「………あなたはなかなか出来る読者のようですね。@…並の読者相手だったら、同一の人間であっても、その生い立ちと時間によって、@別人になりうることを説明するために数百ページを割かねばならぬというのに。」\
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900071.ogg":^"......It seems you're quite a skilled reader.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900072.ogg":^  ...For most of my readers, it would be necessary to spend several hundred pages to explain ^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900073.ogg":^how a single person can become different people depending on their upbringing and time."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a13_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「あまり読者を舐めないで。@私たちはただ読んでるだけじゃない。@読んで、考えてるの。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000192.ogg":^"Don't underestimate your readers.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000193.ogg":^  We aren't just reading.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000194.ogg":^  We read, ...and we think."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "57"

langjp「……１００人に読ませれば、９０人くらいは読める。@しかし意味がわかるのは、５０人。@そしてそこからさらに考えられるのは２０人もいない。@……よく噛んで飲み込みなさいと。@…ただそれだけの話なのに。くすくす。」\
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900074.ogg":^"...If I make a hundred people read it, about 90 will be able to.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900075.ogg":^  However, only 50 will actually understand what it means.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900076.ogg":^  And not even 20 will actually think beyond that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900077.ogg":^  ...And all I ask is that they think it over a bit.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900078.ogg":^  ...Nothing more than that.  *giggle*"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "57"
langjp「しかし、“あなた”はどうやら…、その貴重な２０人の中の１人らしい…。@だからここへ招いたのです、人の子よ…。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900079.ogg":^"However, it seems that `you' are one of those precious 20 readers...^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900080.ogg":^  That's why I invited you here, child of man..."^\



