langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600050.ogg":^"If you really do know, then why did you ask?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600051.ogg":^  Your head and your heart are completely filled by George-sama, aren't they?!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600052.ogg":^  And it's that sincerity of yours that I love!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600053.ogg":^  That's why...I'm rooting for you in the only way I can!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600054.ogg":^  Otherwise, ...even I...!!"^\
