langjp「お嬢様も僕も、この島に閉じ込められて、何の希望もなく生きてるのはまったく同じだった…！@　なのにお嬢様は自らの道を自ら照らし、自らの足で運命を切り拓くんだ…！@　それが眩しくて、羨ましくてッ！！@　お嬢様と一緒になら、……こんなみすぼらしい自分じゃない、別な、本当の自分を見つけられそうな気がして…！！」\
;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600066.ogg":^"Both of us are exactly the same, locked up on Rokkenjima and living without any hope at all...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600067.ogg":^  And yet, Milady was able to light her own path and create her own fate...!^\:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600068.ogg":^  She was so dazzling that I envied her!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600069.ogg":^  I felt as though, if I could be with her, ...I could find my true self, instead of being the pitiful person I am now...!!"^\
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「お嬢様の告白を拒絶して。@……悲しかった？」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500062.ogg":^"When you turned down Milady's confession, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500063.ogg":^...were you sad?"^\
advsetwindow "16"

langjp「悲しかったッ！！/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600070.ogg":^"I was!!^@/
se1 11
quakey 3,300
advsetwindow "16"
langjp@　自分につく嘘が、こんなにも辛くて悔しくて悲しいなんて知らなかった！！@　そして僕のそんな嘘が、お嬢様を傷つけたのが、堪らなく許せなかった！！@　そんな自分に、もう二度と恋をする資格なんてないと思ってたッ！！」\
;＜嘉音
langen@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600071.ogg":^  I never realized that a lie you make to yourself could be so sad, so painful, so excruciating!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600072.ogg":^  And I couldn't forgive myself for hurting Milady with that lie!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600073.ogg":^  I believed that I didn't have what it takes to ever fall in love again!!"^\
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「あるよ。@恋の資格はね？@　自分だけが与えられるの。@家具だから駄目とか、そんなの関係ない。@駄目だって自分で決めたら、もう駄目なの。@決め付けちゃ駄目。@だから私は与えたよ、この身の程知らずな家具の身に、恋の資格を。@だから嘉音くんにだってあるよ。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500064.ogg":^"But that wasn't true.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500065.ogg":^  Do you know what's needed to fall in love?^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500066.ogg":^  It's something you can't get from anyone but yourself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500067.ogg":^  Being furniture or not has nothing to do with it.^\:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500068.ogg":^  If you decide for yourself that it won't work out, then it won't.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500069.ogg":^  You mustn't leap to such rigid conclusions.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500070.ogg":^  That's why I, overambitious furniture that I am, gave myself what's needed to fall in love.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500071.ogg":^  So you have it too, Kanon-kun."^\
advsetwindow "16"

langjp「恋をする資格が？」@
;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600074.ogg":^"You mean, I have what it takes to fall in love?"^\
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「うん。@あなたにあげられないなら、私があげる。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500072.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500073.ogg":^  If you won't give it to yourself, I'll give it to you."^\
advsetwindow "16"
langjp「ありがとう。@/
langjp!s1……僕は、/
langjp!d800……やっと、/
langjp!d800……海が、/
langjp!d700…見られる気がする……。」/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600075.ogg":^"Thank you.^@/
advsetwindow "16"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600076.ogg":!s1^  ...I...^@/
advsetwindow "16"
langen:delay 900:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600077.ogg":^feel as though...^@/
advsetwindow "16"
