langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500081.ogg":^"If...^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500082.ogg":^...if you do love Milady from the bottom of your heart, and if your feelings are at least as strong as my feelings for George-san,^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500083.ogg":^ ......then you and I will have to settle whose feelings are really stronger."^\

