;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300001.ogg":^"This is your first time meeting Gohda-san and Kanon-kun, isn't it, Battler-kun?"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_a22_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「うー！@　真里亞も戦人初めて！@　きゃっきゃ！」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\60400001.ogg":^"Uu-!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\60400002.ogg":^  It's my first time meeting Battler too!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\60400003.ogg":^  *giggle*!"^\

bg new_beach_1a,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\goh\1\goh_a11_hohoemi1.png",24
_ld r,":b;sprites\rud\1\rud_a11_warai1.png",24
advsetwindow "08"
langjp「郷田さんは凄腕のシェフでいらっしゃるんだぜ。@この島に来る唯一の楽しみさ。」@
;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200001.ogg":^"Gohda-san's a great chef.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200002.ogg":^  He's the only reason anyone'd ever want to come to this island."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\goh\1\goh_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "17"

langjp「光栄でございます。@戦人さま、どうか滞在中のお食事はご期待いただければ幸いです。」\
;＜郷田
langen:dwave 0, "voice\17\61700004.ogg":^"I am most honored.^@:dwave 0, "voice\17\61700005.ogg":^  Battler-sama, I do hope that you look forward to your meals during your stay."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_warai1.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「そりゃ楽しみだぜ…！@　よろしく！」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100147.ogg":^"I can't wait...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100148.ogg":^  I'm counting on you!"^\

bg black,24
bg new_beach_2a,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\ros\1\ros_a11_warai1.png",24
advsetwindow "12"

langjp「嘉音くんもお久し振りね。@今日は元気そうね。@良かった。」@
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400001.ogg":^"Long time no see, Kanon-kun.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400002.ogg":^  You seem to be in high spirits today.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400003.ogg":^  That's great."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kan\1\kan_a11_majime1.png",23
advsetwindow "16"

langjp「……そ、そうでしょうか…。」\
;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600105.ogg":^"...Y-You think so...?"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\kir\1\kir_a13_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "09"


langjp「そうね。顔色が悪くないわ。@血色がいいというか、目つきが凛々しくなったというか。」@
;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300001.ogg":^"Oh yes.  Your face is looking brighter today.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300002.ogg":^  Maybe it's your complexion, or maybe it's that your gaze looks a bit more gallant."^\

cl r,23
_ld r,":b;sprites\rud\1\rud_a11_akuwarai1.png",24
advsetwindow "08"

langjp「ははっ、成長期なんだろ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200003.ogg":^"Hahah, it must be a growing phase.^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\rud\1\rud_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "08"

langjpそうして少年は大人になってくんだなぁ。」\
;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200004.ogg":^  That's how a boy becomes a man."^\

bg new_ship_s1a,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\hid\1\hid_a11_def1.png",0
_ld l,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_a11_hohoemi1.png",23
_ld l,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「普段のあんたは今にも貧血で倒れちゃいそうな顔ばっかしてるのに。@今日は少し違うわ。」@
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000001.ogg":^"You usually look as though you're about to pass out from anemia.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000002.ogg":^  You're a bit different today."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\hid\1\hid_a11_odayaka1.png",80
advsetwindow "06"

langjp「生気があるんや。@男子は三日ありゃ成長するもんなんやで。@嘉音くんも少しずつたくましくなってるっちゅうことやな！」\
;＜秀吉
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100001.ogg":^"You've got some spunk.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100002.ogg":^  A boy can change a lot in just three days.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100003.ogg":^  I guess this means even Kanon-kun's gettin' a bit more manly!"^\

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\ros\1\ros_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "12"

langjp「からかわれてないわよ。@みんな褒めてるのよ。くす。」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400004.ogg":^"We aren't making fun of you, okay?^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400005.ogg":^  We're all complimenting you.  *giggle*"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　……嘉音は、今日から少しだけ、生き方を変えようと誓ってはいた。@
langjp　でも、それは胸の中だけの話で、それを表に出したつもりはまるでなかった。@
langen^...Kanon had sworn to start changing the way he lived bit by bit.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^However, he had only meant to change within himself, and hadn't expected that it would show on the outside.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　それを、開口一番に見破られたようで、@……そんなにも自分の顔は普段と違うのかと、戸惑いさえした。\
langen^He was a bit shocked to hear that his expression had changed so much...^@^that people had apparently noticed as soon as he opened his mouth.^\

mcl c,0
bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　いや、……むしろ、@普段の表情が、そんなにも顔色が悪く見えるものだったのかと、そちらを驚くべきだった。\
langen^No, ^@^...maybe the real surprise was that his normal expression must've looked so incredibly sullen in comparison.^\

bg white,22
bg new_beach_1a,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　一行は郷田を先頭にゲストハウスへ向かう。@
langjp　嘉音はしんがりで、熊沢の買い物の荷物を手伝っていた。\
langen^Gohda led the way up to the guesthouse.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Kanon brought up the rear, helping to carry some of Kumasawa's shopping.^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kan\1\kan_a11_majime1.png",24
advsetwindow "16"

langjp「……僕、…今日はそんなにも顔色がいいでしょうか。」@
;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600106.ogg":^"...Does...my face really look that bright today?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kum\1\kum_a11_warai1.png",23
advsetwindow "18"

langjp「ほっほっほ…。@私にもそう見えますよ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\61800019.ogg":^"Hohohoh...^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\61800020.ogg":^  It looks that way to me as well.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\kum\1\kum_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "18"

langjp……何かいいことありましたぁ？@　くすくすくす。」\
;＜熊沢
langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\61800021.ogg":^  ...Did something good happen?^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\61800022.ogg":^  *giggle*giggle*"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　熊沢にまで言われる。@
langjp　……嘉音は自分の顔がどんなのかわからず、気恥ずかしくなって俯いてしまう。\
langen^Even Kumasawa was saying it.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^...Kanon, unable to see what his own face looked like, hung his head in embarrassment.^\

