langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\60200017.ogg":^"You aren't furniture, Kanon-kun.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\60200018.ogg":^  And you weren't born just so you could become a servant!^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\60200019.ogg":^  A boy your age should be enjoying life much, much more...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\60200020.ogg":^  Hah, hahahaha.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\60200021.ogg":^  I'm dazzled too.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\60200022.ogg":^  You're so dazzling, ...I can hardly see."^\

