langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000165.ogg":^"As you get closer to the world of gods, the concept of time becomes increasingly vague.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000166.ogg":^  Six years can become a thousand, and a thousand years can be nothing more than a quick nap.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000167.ogg":^  ...One can fit an eternity long enough to be deserving of the title `hundred-year-old witch' in a mere two weeks..."^\
