langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500077.ogg":^"Mystery's a genre ^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500078.ogg":^that ended a half-century ago.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500079.ogg":^  At least as far as I'm concerned.^@/

