;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500080.ogg":^  ...However, thanks to countless ignorant fools, I get to play my part as a detective.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500081.ogg":^  *giggle*giggle*giggle*giggle*...!"^\

