;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\60200089.ogg":^"Yep.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\60200090.ogg":^  After all, this insanely huge portrait really stands out.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\60200091.ogg":^  Shortly after it was put up, everyone was talking about what it might be.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\60200092.ogg":^  ...And then, when the accident happened shortly afterwards, people started calling it Beatrice's curse."^\

