;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\60200093.ogg":^"Grandfather.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\60200094.ogg":^  He'd always start freaking out and yelling `my beloved witch Beatriiice'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\60200095.ogg":^  Though until we saw that portrait, we had no idea what she looked like."^\
