langjp「……確かに。@こんなに古風な薄暗いお屋敷で、ずっとこんな風雨の音を聞いていたら、@そういう怪談の一つや二つ、生まれてもおかしくはなさそうです。@……まぁ、所詮は怪談、妄想、おとぎ話。@取るにも足らない、寝惚けた虚け者の戯言以下ですが。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500156.ogg":^"...True.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500157.ogg":^  It wouldn't be strange for a few ghost stories to arise ^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500158.ogg":^in an old, gloomy mansion with the sound of wind and rain present in the background for so long.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500159.ogg":^  ...Well, it's nothing more than a ghost story, a delusion, a fairy tale.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500160.ogg":^  Worth less than the useless drivel of a half-sleeping nitwit."^\

