langen:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700137.ogg":^"I also wish to know.^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700138.ogg":^  I understand that you are also `me'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700139.ogg":^  ...Why is it that you speak that way, and why must you serve Battler?^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700140.ogg":^  Until we grow to understand this, it seems both of us will remain immature."^\

