langjp「い、いいえ。@何ですか、お姉様。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700179.ogg":^"N-No.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700180.ogg":^  What is it, Onee-sama?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\be3\1\be3_b11_majime2.png",80
advsetwindow "71"

langjp「うむ。@魔女の時代はもはや遠い過去。@……万物を支配したとのたまうニンゲンどもは、我らの存在を否定する、強い毒を持つに至ったのだ。」\
;＜髪ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700181.ogg":^"Well,^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700182.ogg":^ the time of witches has long since passed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700183.ogg":^  ...Those vile Humans who claim to rule over everything came to deny our existence and possess a powerful toxin."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a15_odoroki2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「その毒は、私たちには有害なのですか…？」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700184.ogg":^"Is that toxin harmful to us...?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\be3\1\be3_b11_1_majime5star.png",80
advsetwindow "71"

langjp「極めて危険だ。@浴びればたちどころに我らの姿を蒸発させてしまうだろう。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700185.ogg":^"It is extremely dangerous.^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700186.ogg":^  If we were exposed to it, our forms would probably evaporate in an instant.^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\be3\1\be3_b11_futeki2.png",80
advsetwindow "71"

langjpしかし、不幸中の幸いなことに、我らの存在は未だ極めて希薄だ。@そのお陰で、毒の影響も甚大ではない。@せいぜい、一時、姿を霞にされてしまうくらいだ。」\
;＜髪ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700187.ogg":^  However, one thing we do have in our favor is the fact that our existence is still extremely weak.^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700188.ogg":^  Because of that, the toxin does not affect us greatly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700189.ogg":^  At worst, it can only transform us into mist for a time."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a15_fukigen3.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「しかし、好んで浴びたいものではない、ということですね。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700190.ogg":^"However, we'd rather avoid it if we can, right?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\be3\1\be3_b11_1_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "71"

langjp「その通り。@さすがは妾。@理解が早い。」\
;＜髪ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700191.ogg":^"Correct.^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700192.ogg":^  Yes, I see that you are indeed me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700193.ogg":^  You catch on quickly."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　姉は、一見すると横柄そうに見えるが、@………自分の分身にして妹という存在が嬉しくて仕方ないのか、どんなことでも懇切丁寧に教えてくれた。\
langen^The older sister appeared to be haughty at first,^@^ ......but, perhaps because she was so happy to have met her double and little sister, she was more than willing to teach her anything she wanted to know.^\

bg black,25
