langjp「我らが魔力を蓄え、それをニンゲンも認めたなら、その毒は限りなく軽減される。@即ち、我らの存在を認めさせることが、ニンゲンたちから毒を失わせ、@再び彼らの前に降臨することも出来るというわけだ。」\
;＜髪ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700200.ogg":^"If we stock up magical power and have it acknowledged by humans, that toxin can be reduced drastically.^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700201.ogg":^  In other words, by having our existence acknowledged by humans, we make them lose their toxin,^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700202.ogg":^ making it possible for us to appear before them once more."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a15_1_warai8.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

