langjp　フェザリーヌの書庫で読んだ、過去の偉大なるベアトリーチェは、@ニンゲンの前に堂々と姿を現し、自由自在に弄んでさえいた。@
langen^The powerful previous Beatrice, whom she had read about in Featherine's library,^@^ had appeared openly in front of Humans and had even toyed with them at will.^@
