advsetwindow "27"

langjp「そうですね。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700214.ogg":^"That's right.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a15_1_odoroki5.png",80
advsetwindow "27"
langjp……それでお姉様。@そのための努力と、こうして窓の鍵を開けて回ることにどんな関係が…？」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700215.ogg":^  ...Anyway, Onee-sama,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700216.ogg":^ how is that goal connected to going around unlocking windows like this...?"^\

