langjp「………ちょっとわかるわ。@お兄ちゃんや朱志香お姉ちゃんみたいなタイプの人って、男女問わず誰とでも仲良くなれるタイプよね。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000274.ogg":^"......I sort of understand.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000275.ogg":^  People like Onii-chan and Jessica onee-chan can get along with anyone, whether that person's a boy or a girl.^@/

