langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300116.ogg":^"Back then, my conceit was at its peak.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300117.ogg":^  ...So, when everyone gathered at the family conference,^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300118.ogg":^ I believed that I was the most attractive, and that all the servant girls who played with us loved having me there.^@/


