;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300120.ogg":^"No, it's the opposite.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300121.ogg":^  ......You didn't say anything at all.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300122.ogg":^  My conceited delusion that I was the only one ever reflected in your eyes...was crushed."^\

