langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300123.ogg":^"...One day, I suddenly realized it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300124.ogg":^  ...All of you were getting along with Battler-kun and Jessica-chan far better than with me,^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300125.ogg":^ ...playing around and having a good time."^\

