langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300133.ogg":^  ...He's a pretty funny guy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300134.ogg":^  Even though he got in fights with Battler-kun all the time, ...he always paid close attention to what his son was up to."^\

