;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500181.ogg":^  ...I think even Asumu-sama was exasperated by it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500182.ogg":^  ...She thought all his popularity with the girls at school and the unceasing trouble this caused must have been because of Rudolf-sama's blood."^\

