;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300135.ogg":^"And Jessica-chan too.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300136.ogg":^  I hear she built up a huge number of friends, both boys and girls, and that she was always right in the middle of things.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300137.ogg":^  ...When I talked with her myself, I could see that this was no exaggeration."^\

