locate 0, 5 ;<CENTER_TEXT>
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300149.ogg":^Every time my determination began to waver, ...I'd remember that day.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300150.ogg":^  ...That day I saw you two forget about me entirely and play around happily.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300151.ogg":^  And the fact that those eyes of yours, which I always assumed were attracted to me, never noticed me at all.^\

