langjp「初恋じゃなかったら、結ばれちゃいけないんですか…？@　初恋の人を忘れたら、それは裏切りなんですか…？@　恋って、……そんな単純じゃない。@いえ、……単純かもしれない。@……だって、恋なんて簡単。@……常に、今の。@……今の自分の正直な気持ちだけが、正解なのだから。@だから昔の話も馴れ初めも、何も関係ないんです。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500189.ogg":^"Is there some rule saying that people can't get together just because they weren't each other's first love...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500190.ogg":^  Is it betrayal to forget the first person you fell in love with...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500191.ogg":^  Love...isn't that simple.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500192.ogg":^  Well, ...it might be simple.^\:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500193.ogg":^  ...After all, love is easy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500194.ogg":^  ...At all times, whatever you feel now...^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500195.ogg":^only the honest feelings you feel now can tell you the right answer.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\60500196.ogg":^  So, things of the past or how our relationship started aren't important at all."^\

bg black,22
