langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500356.ogg":^  ...Got it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500357.ogg":^  I'm still not satisfied, but I'll back off there for now.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500358.ogg":^  What I don't understand is why Beatrice can't stand spiderwebs."^\

