langjp「しかしそれ、悪食島伝説の話です。@そもそもベアトリーチェの魔女伝説の発祥は、この島に引っ越してきた右代宮金蔵が、@ミステリアスな黄金伝説と、それを授けた魔女という名の愛人を吹聴してから始まったものです。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500359.ogg":^"But that's just the legend of Akujikishima.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500360.ogg":^  The origins for the legend of the witch, Beatrice, came after Ushiromiya Kinzo moved to this island,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500361.ogg":^ when rumors sprouted about the mysterious legend of the gold, as well as the witch mistress who gave it to him."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_akire1.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「つまり、悪食島の悪霊と、黄金の魔女ベアトリーチェは本来、まったく異なる存在のはずなんです。@なのに、設定が同じになっています。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500362.ogg":^"In other words, the evil spirits of Akujikishima and the Golden Witch Beatrice were originally completely different things.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500363.ogg":^  And yet, the stories treat them like they're the same."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kum\1\kum_a11_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "18"

langjp「さ、……さてはて、……。」\
;＜熊沢
langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\61800056.ogg":^"...W-Well now..."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　悪食島の悪霊は蜘蛛の巣が苦手。@ベアトリーチェも苦手。@
langjp　そういう論法でずっとまかり通ってきた。@
langen^The evil spirits of Akujikishima couldn't stand spiderwebs.^@^  So neither could Beatrice.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^That sort of reasoning has been applied all over the place.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……それがおかしいと指摘され、熊沢は何と答えればいいか困惑してしまう…。\
langen^...When it was pointed out that this was strange, Kumasawa was lost for an answer...^\

bg black,22
bg new_m_door2k,26
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「金蔵さんの書斎のドアノブは、サソリの魔法陣が描かれていて、それは西洋魔術では魔除けを意味する。@だから西洋魔女のベアトリーチェは、ドアノブに触れられない。@……これは理解できるんです。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500364.ogg":^"The doorknob to Kinzo-san's study has a scorpion magic circle drawn on it, which represents a charm against evil in western sorcery.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500365.ogg":^  That's why the western witch Beatrice can't touch it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500366.ogg":^  ...I can understand that part."^\

bg new_glob_1ar,22

_ld l,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_majime2.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「でも、蜘蛛の巣に限っては、ベアトリーチェが嫌う理由がありません。@私の知る限りでも、西洋魔女の苦手なものに、蜘蛛の巣があったという記憶はありません。@むしろ蜘蛛は、魔女の仲間や眷属では？」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500367.ogg":^"But there's no reason for Beatrice to dislike spiderwebs.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500368.ogg":^  I don't remember spiderwebs ever being included among things witches can't stand.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500369.ogg":^  On the contrary, wouldn't spiders be the friends and minions of a witch?"^\

