advsetwindow "46"

langjp「思うに。@……悪食島伝説の悪霊と、魔女伝説のベアトリーチェ。@この２つの異なる伝説が、少し混交しているように思います。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500370.ogg":^"In my opinion,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500371.ogg":^ ...those two legends about the evil spirits of Akujikishima and the witch Beatrice...^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500372.ogg":^have been mixed together a little.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

langjpいえ、混交どころか融合かもしれません。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500373.ogg":^  In fact, maybe they've been fully fused together as one."^\

