langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500384.ogg":^"...So, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500385.ogg":^if there really was someone claiming to be the Golden Witch Beatrice,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500386.ogg":^ I'd really like to ask her ^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500387.ogg":^whether she actually does hate spiderwebs or not.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500388.ogg":^  ...What happens when she touches them?"^\

