langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500389.ogg":^"Hmph, that's not bad.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500390.ogg":^  A splendid witch trial.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500391.ogg":^  ...If the spiderweb touches her and she gets burned, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500392.ogg":^then she's an evil spirit, not a witch.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500393.ogg":^  ...And if nothing happens, then it proves she's just a Human."^\

