langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500394.ogg":^"In other words, ......whether she's burned or not,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500395.ogg":^ it will prove that the Golden Witch doesn't exist.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500396.ogg":^  ...The legend of the witch is nothing more than the legend of Akujikishima re-boiled with a new face on it."^\

