langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000295.ogg":^"Exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000296.ogg":^  Now that George onii-chan has sworn to protect his lover for the rest of their lives, he has no need to fear opposition and disinheritance from his parents.^\:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000297.ogg":^  ...On the contrary, you might even consider that a perfect test of his love for her.^@/
