langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000310.ogg":^"And there you go.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000311.ogg":^  It means that Shannon has accepted George's proposal,^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000312.ogg":^ ...but she knows that there's still some kind of barrier that can't be overcome without a magical miracle.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000313.ogg":^  And that barrier isn't something that they can overcome by their own efforts.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000314.ogg":^  That's why they need this miracle called magic."^\

