langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000317.ogg":^"And that same question applies to Kanon as well.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000318.ogg":^  ...The love between him and Jessica onee-chan has just begun, but their emotions are pure.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000319.ogg":^  There's nothing standing in their way.^\:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000320.ogg":^  They're already in a loving relationship even without the golden butterfly brooch.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000321.ogg":^  ...The relationship they've started might easily last for years, eventually resulting in marriage.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000322.ogg":^  There's nothing standing in their way either."^\
