;＜髪ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700360.ogg":^  However, just as how a witch can manifest herself if her existence is acknowledged by a great many Humans and the anti-magic toxin disappears,^\:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700361.ogg":^ the power of that magical item can also be preserved if it is believed in by a great many Humans."^\

