langjp「“愛がなければ視えない”。@それは理解できてるの。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000336.ogg":^"`Without love, it cannot be seen'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000337.ogg":^  That much I understand."^\

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def2.png",23
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「これを手品だと断じるも良し。@魔法だと信じるも良し。@……その者の毒素次第であろうな…。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000235.ogg":^"It may be viewed as a trick.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000236.ogg":^  It may also be believed to be magic.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000237.ogg":^  ...It all depends upon the toxin of the individual..."^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「でもこれは、……かつての魔法の一部を説明は出来るけど、全てを説明することは出来ないわ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000338.ogg":^"Then again, ...while this can explain some of the magic that's been used in the past, it can't explain everything."^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「話を戻すけれど、この程度の、魔法やおまじないを信じるという程度の話では、@“頑なに恋が出来ないと嘆いていた家具たちに、それを許すことの出来る、黄金蝶のブローチとは一体何か？”@という問いに、答えられない。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000339.ogg":^"To get back to the point, all this stuff about believing in magic and rituals...^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000340.ogg":^  It doesn't answer the question: `What was this golden butterfly brooch, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000341.ogg":^which allowed the furniture, who strongly believed that they could not love, to finally find love?'"^\

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「……そこにいる２人のベアトの話を鵜呑みにするなら、@……魔法には、彼らの“諦め”を取り除く力があると考えるのが妥当であろう？」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000238.ogg":^"...If we blindly accept the story of those two Beatos as true,^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000239.ogg":^ ...might we assume that magic had the power to cancel out their feelings of `resignation'?"^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「“どうして家具は恋をしてはいけないの？”。@“どうして魔法のブローチの力が必要なの？”。@……確かに、あんたやベアトたちの話は一見、それにおぼろげとはいえ、答えを与えてるような気がする。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000342.ogg":^"`Why mustn't furniture fall in love?'^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000343.ogg":^  `Why is the power of the magic brooch necessary?'^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000344.ogg":^  ...Yes, it does seem at a glance as though what you and the Beatos are saying provides an answer, though a vague one.^@/
advsetwindow "11"

;mld r,ENJ_NayamuA1,80

langjpでも、朗読者だから言わせて。@……それでは納得が行かないの。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000345.ogg":^  However, let me say this as a Reader.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000346.ogg":^  ...I can't accept this as you've presented it."^\

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def3.png",80
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「納得とは…。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000240.ogg":^"You cannot accept it, you say...?"^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_fuman2.png",80
advsetwindow "11"
langjp「……家具たちは、もっともっと悲壮な宿命に抗おうとしているわ。@恋愛成就のお守りを託されたくらいで、自己改革が出来る程度のものだったとは思えないの。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000347.ogg":^"...The tragedy those furniture are struggling to resist is way too big to be explained away by that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000348.ogg":^  I doubt they could reform their way of thinking just because they were given some charm for making relationships."^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「現に紗音はかつて、譲治お兄ちゃんとの出会いのきっかけを作ったのはブローチのお陰だけど、@それ以降は魔法の力を借りずに関係を深めたいと言って、ベアトにブローチを返そうとさえしたわ。@彼女はその時点で、一度は魔法の奇跡と決別したはず。@……なのになぜ再び、その力を必要としているの？」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000349.ogg":^"It's true that the brooch gave Shannon the chance she needed to get together with George onii-chan, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000350.ogg":^but some time after that, she said she wanted to deepen their relationship without borrowing the power of magic, and she even tried to give the brooch back to Beato.^\:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000351.ogg":^  At that point, she supposedly rejected the miracle of magic for a time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000352.ogg":^  ...So, why would that power be necessary again?"^\

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「さぁて。@……恋と結婚は別物としか、言い様がないであろうな。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000241.ogg":^"Well now...^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000242.ogg":^  ...Perhaps there is no way to say it except that love and marriage are very different things."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　フェザリーヌは薄く笑う。@
langen^Featherine laughed lightly.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……多分、彼女なりの仮説はすでに立ててあって、まだそれに至らぬ縁寿を嘲笑っているのだろう。\
langen^...She had probably formed a theory of her own and was laughing at Ange, who hadn't reached it yet.^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_fuman2.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「聞かせてよ。@あんたの見解。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000353.ogg":^"Let me hear it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000354.ogg":^  What's your view?"^\

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「もう少し寝かせたい。@……それに、疑問を持ち、思考を巡らすそなたを見ることもまた、朗読の楽しみだ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000243.ogg":^"I'd like to keep that to myself for just a while longer.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000244.ogg":^  ...And of course, watching you form doubts and let your mind race is one the joys of being read aloud to.^@/
advsetwindow "50"

;mld l,FEA_DefA2,80

langjp私の見解を話せば、そなたはそれに納得し、思考を止める。@それでは朗読が面白くない。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000245.ogg":^  If I gave you my views, you would accept them and stop thinking.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000246.ogg":^  Then, having you read aloud would be no fun."^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「………すでに答えを知ってる推理小説を読ませて、右往左往するところを見て楽しんでるってわけね。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000355.ogg":^"...So, you're having me read a mystery novel you already know the answer to, just so you can enjoy watching me blunder about."^\

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「それが観劇の魔女というものだ。@……悪趣味と笑いたくば笑うが良い、我が巫女よ。」@
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000247.ogg":^"Well, I am the Witch of Theatergoing.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000248.ogg":^  ...If you wish to laugh at my bad taste, please do not hold back, my miko."^\


ut_mld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_fuman2.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

