langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600227.ogg":^"The magic of this brooch gave Shannon the chance she needed to start her relationship with George-sama.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600228.ogg":^  ...However, before that magic was fully realized, she left it to me.^@/
