;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600236.ogg":^"......^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600237.ogg":^...Both Shannon and I...^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600238.ogg":^need magic to succeed in love.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600239.ogg":^  The key for that is this brooch.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600240.ogg":^  ...I stepped on it and crushed it, so we each have one part now."^\
