langjp　かつてのベアトリーチェは、恋の火種に悶え苦しむ人間模様を、熟れた果実と呼んで悪趣味に楽しんだ。\
langen^The old Beatrice had said that humans tormented by this spark were like ripe fruit, ...which she crudely used for her own enjoyment.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

