langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700473.ogg":^"My soul, femininity, sparkling personality, and splendid character were cultivated over a thousand years spent as a witch.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700474.ogg":^  Unless an exactly identical thousand years is traversed, nothing can become me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700475.ogg":^  And so, ...at the moment you decided to create me, my personal history was different."^\


