langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300231.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300232.ogg":^  That's it exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300233.ogg":^  At this moment, we are being tested.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300234.ogg":^  Tested to see who can display the strength of our feelings more strongly."^\

