langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300235.ogg":^"It doesn't matter whether I support it or not.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300236.ogg":^  ...When I gave Shannon that engagement ring, I swore to fight all trials and barriers that stand in my way.^@/

