langjp　先方のご両親は？@　両家の交流は？@　あんた、野良猫じゃないのよ？！ 右代宮譲治なのよ？！@　ひょっとしたらお祖父さまの後継者に指名されるかもしれないこの時期に、どうしてそんな軽率なッ！！@　どうして、母さんに相談してくれなかったの…！！」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000014.ogg":^  What about her parents?^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000015.ogg":^  Relationships between the two families?^\:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000016.ogg":^  Are you some stray alley cat, or are you Ushiromiya George?!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000017.ogg":^  How could you be so rash now, when you might even be selected as Grandfather's Successor?!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000018.ogg":^  Why didn't you consult me...?!!"^\


