langjp「そして、母さんという良き理解者の伴侶がいたからだよ。@紗代は僕を支え、より強く生まれ変わらせてくれる人だ。@……母さんが、たくましくなったと褒めてくれた今の僕は、彼女がいなかったらありえない。」\
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300267.ogg":^"And he got through it because he had a wonderful life partner by his side, ...you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300268.ogg":^  Sayo is the kind of person who'll support me and make me be reborn as an even stronger man.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300269.ogg":^  ...You've praised me for becoming the adult I am, but that could never have happened without her."^\

