;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000023.ogg":^"What...?!!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000024.ogg":^  Are you listening?!  George?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000025.ogg":^  Just let your mother handle this for now.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000026.ogg":^  Cool your head and think very carefully!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000027.ogg":^  Shannon isn't the only person interested in you, right...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000028.ogg":^  Ayumi-san from that marriage meeting really took a liking to you!!"^\
