;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000029.ogg":^"I thought you knew...!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000030.ogg":^  Her parents were also very impressed by you!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000031.ogg":^  If you really dream to build your own castle like your father, Ayumi-san is the one who'd really be able to help you, right?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000032.ogg":^  Do you intend to betray her feelings?!"^\

