langjp「……裏切るも何も。@僕は亜由美さんと、特に交流があったわけじゃない。@お見合いをして、その後、親たちが勝手に盛り上がってるだけじゃないか。@数度、無理やり引き合わされたけど、僕たちは互いに、目さえ合わせちゃいない。」\
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300271.ogg":^"...There's nothing to betray.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300272.ogg":^  There was never any special relationship between Ayumi-san and me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300273.ogg":^  We just had a marriage meeting and our parents got all fired up afterwards.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300274.ogg":^  You made us go out together several times, but we never even looked at each other."^\

