langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000033.ogg":^"Ayumi-san is a well-bred, modest woman, isn't she?!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000034.ogg":^  She just couldn't look at you because you're a man and it would be embarrassing and ill-mannered...!!^@/
