;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000035.ogg":^  If you can't feel anything from her unless she looks at your eyes, then just tell her that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\61000036.ogg":^  I'm sure she'll look at you in the future...!!"^\

