langjp「あなたに学習姿勢を叩き込んでくれる素晴らしい先生だったわよ！@　弁護士の相談費用並のお月謝を払った甲斐が本当にあったわァア！！」\
;＜エヴァ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\34\63300048.ogg":^"He was a wonderful teacher who drilled a scholarly attitude into you!^@:dwave 0, "voice\34\63300049.ogg":^  His monthly fees were on par with a lawyer's consultation fee, and it was well worth it!!"^\

