langjp「………そして迎える日曜日と、塾の予定がない月曜日だけが、僕の安息日だった。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300344.ogg":^"......Then, on the Sundays and Mondays that followed, I didn't have any extra school and could finally rest.^@/

