langjp………これは皮肉だね。@火曜日から土曜日までの塾が、僕を抑え付けてきたのか。@……まさに僕は、孫悟空だったわけだ。」\
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300345.ogg":^  ...How ironic.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300346.ogg":^  Have those extra classes from Tuesday until Saturday held me down all this time?^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\60300347.ogg":^  ...I really am just like Sun Wukong."^\

