langjp　そうね、私の手の平から逃れたいなんて思い上がりは、お釈迦様に五行山で潰してもらうといいわぁ！！」\
;＜エヴァ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\34\63300051.ogg":^  Yeah, if you're arrogant enough to think that you can escape from the palm of my hand, you'll be crushed by Buddha's five mountains!!"^\

