langjp　神の座を欲した孫悟空は、@火、水、木、金、土、の五つの行を司る五つの山に押し潰されて封じられた。@
langen^Sun Wukong, who wanted to become a god,^@^ was crushed by the five mountains of fire, water, wood, metal, and earth, and sealed away.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^These are the five elements that the days of the week, Tuesday through Saturday, are named after in Japanese.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　孫悟空に憧れた譲治にとって、この歳になって気付く最大の皮肉だった。\
langen^Only now did George, who had always admired Sun Wukong, recognize this greatest of ironies.^\

