langjp「世界で一番知的で、あなたのために全てを捧げてくれる女性を用意してあげる！！@　全ての成功も、それに至る道も、全て全てママが用意してあげるわッ！！@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\34\63300058.ogg":^"I've found the most intellectual woman in the world, willing to devote herself to you entirely!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\34\63300059.ogg":^  I'll arrange for all of your successes, and even prepare the roads leading to them!!^\/

