langen:dwave 0, "voice\34\63300060.ogg":^  And eventually, you will be chosen for the highest honor in the Ushiromiya family, the position as Successor to the Headship!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\34\63300061.ogg":^  Only then will you begin your true life...!"^\

