langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000433.ogg":^"...It was after Asumu-san suddenly moved into Dad's family register.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000434.ogg":^  ...Mom learned about her pregnancy after that and plotted several times to split Asumu-san and Dad apart, but..."^\

