langjp「間違ってないわ。@……二人で水をやり、世話をして、育む。@……そして最後に結実するのが、愛という実なの。@知ってる？@　結実して終わりじゃないのよ？@　……愛を収穫しなきゃ、恋は成就したことにならないの。」\
;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300105.ogg":^"That's not wrong.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300106.ogg":^  ...The two of you need to water it, care for it, and nurture it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300107.ogg":^  ...And in the end, it will finally bear the fruit called love.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300108.ogg":^  Did you know?^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300109.ogg":^  Love doesn't end when it bears fruit.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300110.ogg":^  ...If you don't harvest it as well, the romance you started with will never amount to anything."^\
advsetwindow "04"

