;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300111.ogg":^"You need to think about that yourself, Jessica-chan.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300112.ogg":^  ...If you make it bear fruit without harvesting it, it can sometimes grow rotten.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300113.ogg":^  And bugs will often gather around it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300114.ogg":^  In fact, ...sometimes thieves will come by and pluck it off the branch."^\
