;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300115.ogg":^"Young kids like you, Jessica-chan, think that love ends with nurturing.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300116.ogg":^  ...That is naive.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300117.ogg":^  ...If you don't harvest it, you will never be rewarded for your love."^\
