langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300132.ogg":^"Right now,^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300133.ogg":^ ...I would do anything to keep Rudolf-san by my side.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300134.ogg":^  And I will show no mercy against his enemies.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\61300135.ogg":^  ...If he wished it, I might not even hesitate at murder."^\

