langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400065.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400066.ogg":^  ...That day, when I naively said that I wanted to support his dream, I was probably already dead.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400067.ogg":^  ......I guess that really was a regretful day, in the end.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400068.ogg":^  `I have dreams.  I want to go overseas.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400069.ogg":^  I'll fly out of this tiny country, make it big, and come back to you'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400070.ogg":^  ...That takes me back..."^\

