langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400079.ogg":^"......That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400080.ogg":^  ......If I had sobbed and told him to stop on that day, I might not have fallen into hell.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400081.ogg":^  ...Seeing him off with a smile was my victory?^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400082.ogg":^  Of course not.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400083.ogg":^  It's as though I lost by default by refusing to fight when the time came."^\

