;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400084.ogg":^"...I only glorified that loss, ...saw him off with a smile as he went to take on the world overseas,^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400085.ogg":^ and became intoxicated with the illusion that I was some brave woman waiting patiently for her man's return with her daughter.^\:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400086.ogg":^  ......Even though I didn't get a single call from him, and mail sent to the address he'd given me came back `forwarding address unknown'..."^\

