langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400087.ogg":^"...This is hell.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400088.ogg":^  ...In this hell, I'll regret not fighting when I should have until the day I die.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\61400089.ogg":^  ...I've even dragged my daughter into it.^@/

