;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000451.ogg":^"...Y-You cleverly tried to distract us with this love trial stuff,^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000452.ogg":^ but exactly six people have died, setting up the first twilight.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000453.ogg":^  Impressive."^\

