langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\63000022.ogg":^"Oh, you're right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\63000023.ogg":^  I hadn't realized."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　一本取られたとでも言わんばかりに、天草が手を打つ。@
