;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900091.ogg":^  The fact that it matched to the number of the first twilight was half coincidence, half design.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900092.ogg":^  ...It's a bit more interesting that way.  Feels more like fate."^\

