langjp「物語は、書き手が何かを伝えるために書くものよ。@そしてそれはどういうわけか、直接書いたら無粋という、奥ゆかしい面倒な作法がある。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000467.ogg":^"Stories are written because the writer has something they want to communicate.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000468.ogg":^  And some writers feel that it's unrefined to lay everything out too directly.^@/
advsetwindow "11"

;ld r,ENJ_FumanA1,80

langjp………愛がなければ真実に至れない云々という描写は、これまでの作品にも頻出するわ。@それがこの新作ではさらに顕著。@……書き手が一番伝えたくて、考えて欲しいのはそれ、ってことになるわ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000469.ogg":^  ......All of this about how you'll never reach the truth without love has shown up many times in the works before this one.^\:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000470.ogg":^  This new work makes that even more striking.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000471.ogg":^  ...It means that that is the one thing the writer wanted to tell the most, ...the thing that they want us to think about the most."^\

