langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200044.ogg":^"Well that's dumb.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200045.ogg":^  If the people inside are alive, handling any kind of closed room is like pissing in a toilet.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200046.ogg":^  ...Still, with this closed room,^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200047.ogg":^ it's pretty hard to think of any other answer."^\

