langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200031.ogg":^"Why was there only one servant in the mansion on such an important day?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200032.ogg":^  Why was someone as important as Genji-san on duty in the guesthouse?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200033.ogg":^  Does that make any sense?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200034.ogg":^  Why was the servant room left empty...?!!"^\

