langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100018.ogg":^"But Krauss nii-san...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100019.ogg":^  This is the family conference, right?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100020.ogg":^  The most important day of the year, right?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100021.ogg":^  Why was Gohda-san left as the only person on shift in the mansion...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100022.ogg":^  If there had been just one more person, everythin' would be different, wouldn't it?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100023.ogg":^  Right?  Right?!"^\
