langjp……憎むべきは犯人であって、……たまたま当番だった郷田ではない…。@……とにかく、落ち着こう。@……私とて悔しい。@だが、今は我々が率先して冷静さを取り戻さなくては、どうしようもない。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\60800028.ogg":^  ...The culprit is the one we should hate, ...not the servant who just happened to be on duty...^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\60800029.ogg":^  ...At any rate, let's calm down.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\60800030.ogg":^  ...I feel as terrible as the rest of you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\60800031.ogg":^  However, we must take the initiative now and regain our composure."^\


