langjp「……そ、……そや。@……わしにも譲治がおる。@蔵臼兄さんには朱志香ちゃんがおる。@そして留弗夫くんも、帰りを待つ縁寿ちゃんがおるはずや。@犯人と刺し違えたるッ、思うんは、……まだ、…早いんや……。」\
;＜秀吉
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100024.ogg":^"...H-He's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100025.ogg":^  ...I still have George.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100026.ogg":^  Krauss nii-san still has Jessica-chan.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100027.ogg":^  And Rudolf-kun, you still have Ange-chan waitin' for you to return, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100028.ogg":^  It's still...too soon...to start pointin' fingers..."^\

