advsetwindow "02"

langjp「……彼女の言うとおりだ。@右代宮の島で、これ以上、犯人の好き勝手にさせるわけにはいかん。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\60800035.ogg":^"...She's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\60800036.ogg":^  We can't let the culprit do as they please any longer on our island."^\

