;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\60800037.ogg":^"The most important thing now...^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\60800038.ogg":^...is to make sure no more of our beloved family members are taken from us.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\60800039.ogg":^  ......Rudolf,^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\60800040.ogg":^ if something happens to you, what will happen to Ange-chan back home?"^\

