langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200039.ogg":^"...Kyrie, ......Battler......^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200040.ogg":^  ......Dammit...dammiiiiiiit...^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200041.ogg":^  ...I never...had a chance...to tell you the truth......"^\

