;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500659.ogg":^"Listen up.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500660.ogg":^  This crime happened during a short break in the family conference.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500661.ogg":^  ...In that tiny span of time, six people were killed without anyone noticing.  I can't imagine a crime improvised on the spot going so smoothly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500662.ogg":^  This crime was committed by someone who knew the layout of this mansion well, inside and out."^\


