langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200047.ogg":^"So, Aniki killed Kyrie and the others?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200048.ogg":^  Or am I supposed to suspect Hideyoshi nii-san?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200049.ogg":^  It's impossible, ...unthinkable!!"^\


