;＜秀吉
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100041.ogg":^"I never even considered suspectin' Krauss nii-san or Rudolf-kun...!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100042.ogg":^  All of the siblings had excellent relationships with their spouses!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100043.ogg":^  True, the Ushiromiya family may be strict with discipline and money.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100044.ogg":^  But that doesn't mean we treasure our own families less than anyone else...!"^\


