langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100045.ogg":^"Isn't it a little early to suspect Gohda-san?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100046.ogg":^  Gohda-san came to bring us drinks in the dining hall during the break.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100047.ogg":^  ...He was with us for quite some time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100048.ogg":^  He couldn't have had time to kill six people...!"^\


