;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500681.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500682.ogg":^  Under the current circumstances, they are the most suspicious.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500683.ogg":^  ...The second reason to suspect them is the closed rooms with the chain locks."^\

