advsetwindow "06"

langjp「そんなの密室やないで。@マスキーの１本もあれば、誰だって密室に出来るわ。」@
;＜秀吉
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100058.ogg":^"Then they wouldn't be closed rooms.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\61100059.ogg":^  With a single master key, anyone could make 'em."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\rud\1\rud_a14_ikari1.png",24
advsetwindow "08"

langjp「……そういうことか…、なるほどな…。@………使用人たちが疑われないためには、チェーンでロックする必要があった、ってことか…。」\
;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200061.ogg":^"...I see...^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200062.ogg":^  ...The servants had to seal them with the chains so that they wouldn't be suspected..."^\

