langjp「その通りです。@……チェーンを掛けることで、彼らは疑われずに済む。@…逆を返せば、チェーンを掛けねば、彼らマスターキーの所持者は、疑いを免れないのです。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500685.ogg":^"Exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500686.ogg":^  ...By setting the chain, they don't have to worry about being suspected.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500687.ogg":^  ...To turn it around, if the chains weren't set, they wouldn't be able to avoid suspicion, since they hold the master keys."^\

