;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500693.ogg":^"Exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500694.ogg":^  All industries have little tools that can easily open things that normally can't be opened.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500695.ogg":^  ...It wouldn't be particularly surprising if the servants of a mansion had something of the sort."^\

