langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500696.ogg":^"I plan to tell Krauss-san what I've told you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500697.ogg":^  ...I'm not saying that all the servants are culprits.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500698.ogg":^  However, it's very likely that one of them is a culprit or has been assisting the culprit.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500699.ogg":^  ...We should split them apart and have people with guns keep an eye on them."^\

