langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100461.ogg":^"It feels strange.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100462.ogg":^  ......I used to think that the witch's side had such a huge advantage.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100463.ogg":^  But now that I'm on that side, I see that that's ridiculous.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100464.ogg":^  It's almost like that game where you stick knives in a barrel and try not to stab the mustache guy inside."^\

