langjp「……前回のゲームで、戦人が真相に辿り着いた時点で。@……もはやこのゲームは終わりだったのよ。@今回のゲームは、実は第６のゲームじゃない。@……戦人がゲームマスターとして、記念に最後に執り行う、フィナーレのゲームなのよ。@もう決着は前回、ついている。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100100.ogg":^"...When Battler reached the truth during the previous round,^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100101.ogg":^ ...this game was already finished.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100102.ogg":^  This isn't really the 6th game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100103.ogg":^  ...It's just a finale, so that Battler can have a chance to serve as Game Master at the end.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100104.ogg":^  The result was already decided last game."^\

