langjp「ま、そういうことよねぇ。@無限にゲームが続かなくなり、私とベルンの賭けは私の負け。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200088.ogg":^"Yeah, pretty much.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200089.ogg":^  The games won't continue forever, and I've lost my bet with Bern.^@/

