langjp………今回、戦人がゲームの真相に至ったことを証明して、@ベアトのゲームは見事打ち破られて、ニンゲン側の大勝利。@そしてベルンも大勝利。@……のはずなのに、なぜか不服なのよねぇ？」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200090.ogg":^  ......In this game, Battler will prove that he's reached the game's truth,^\:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200091.ogg":^ and then Beato's game will be destroyed in a big victory for the Human side.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200092.ogg":^  And a big victory for Bern too.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200093.ogg":^  ...Well, supposedly, but you look unsatisfied for some reason."^\

