;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100105.ogg":^"......Yeah, I'm not satisfied.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100106.ogg":^  I didn't want such a boring victory."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai3.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「ベルンが望む勝利は、ベアトのゲーム盤を徹底的に引き裂き、@ベアトのみすぼらしい正体を暴いて、徹底的に泥を舐めさせて踏み躙ること。@……だから戦人のこの勝利は、ちょーっと違うのよねぇ…？」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200094.ogg":^"The victory you did want had Beato's game board being torn to bits...^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200095.ogg":^and Beato's true, pathetic form exposed, humiliated, and trampled on.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200096.ogg":^  ...But this victory of Battler's isn't quite like that, is it...?"^\

