langjp「……愛だの、……約束だの。@……静かにゲームを終わらせて、安らかに眠らせる？@　……そんなゲロ臭い終わり方、誰が望んだってのよ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100107.ogg":^"...All this about love...and promises.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100108.ogg":^  ...He wants to end the game quietly and let her sleep in peace?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100109.ogg":^  ...That sort of ending would make anyone vomit."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「私はね、そんな終わり方のために、戦人に助言を与えたわけじゃないのよ。@……妹を背中で挽き肉にしてやったわ。@両親や親族を何度も何度も惨たらしく殺させてやったわ。@それは全て、ベアトに対し、怒りの復讐を掻き立てるためよ？」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100110.ogg":^"I didn't give Battler all that advice so that he could end things like that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100111.ogg":^  ...I had his little sister turned to scrap meat behind his back.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100112.ogg":^  I had his parents and family killed horribly over and over again.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100113.ogg":^  That was all to spark a desire for revenge against Beato."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_niramu1.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「それが、…………この終わり方は何…？@　私の勝利？@　とんでもないッ、……戦人は、私もあんたも喜ばせない勝利を手にしたわ。@…私はね、ベアトリーチェがずたずたのぼろぼろに引き裂かれるところが見たくて、@はるばるこんな辺境までやって来て、気の遠くなる退屈な時間に耐えてここにいたのよ。@こんな、………腐りかけのヨーグルトみたいなカケラを啜らされるためじゃないッ！」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100114.ogg":^"And now, ......what kind of ending is this...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100115.ogg":^  Have I won?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100116.ogg":^  Of course not!  ...Battler's gotten his hands on a victory that neither you nor I can stand.^\:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100117.ogg":^  ...I had to withstand a staggering period of boredom just to come all the way out to this backwoods territory,^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100118.ogg":^ just so that I could see Beatrice lamely and pathetically torn to little bits.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100119.ogg":^  I didn't come here to sip from a rotten yogurt Fragment like this!"^\

