;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100140.ogg":^"...Ah, Battler.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100141.ogg":^  I had a look at your first twilight.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100142.ogg":^  Quite impressive closed rooms.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100143.ogg":^  I'm sure you're even more talented than Beato."^\

