;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100497.ogg":^"It's just a rehash of the closed rooms Beato made in the past.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100498.ogg":^  I'll take that as a compliment aimed at her."\

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai1.png",24
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「ヱリカとの攻防も、まずまずだったみたいじゃなぁい。@連続殺人は、順調に行っちゃいそう？」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200101.ogg":^"It seems your fight with Erika wasn't bad either.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200102.ogg":^  Think your serial murders will move along smoothly?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_niramu4.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「……さぁな。@俺の役目は、連続殺人を遂行することじゃない。@その過程で貴様らに、魔法以外では不可能な密室を提示して、@魔女側として勝利を収め、俺がこのゲームを完全に理解したことを証明することだ。@……いや、もう一つあるな。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100499.ogg":^"...Who knows?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100500.ogg":^  My role isn't to carry out serial murders.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100501.ogg":^  It's to use that process to show you closed rooms that are impossible without magic,^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100502.ogg":^ and thereby achieve victory for the witch side and prove that I've fully understood this game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100503.ogg":^  ...No, there's one more thing."^\

