langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100520.ogg":^"This fight is between me and Erika.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100521.ogg":^  ......We're gonna fight with all we've got.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100522.ogg":^  That way, we'll be able to accept it whether we win or lose.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100523.ogg":^  There's no need for a mastermind behind the scenes like you."^\

