langjp「したければ、どうぞ？@　私を追放するなら、ヱリカは私の駒だから持って帰るわ。@今回のゲームはお流れで、あんたは真相に至ったことを証明できなくなる。@……観劇者は観測者。@観測者なき真実は幻想と同じ。@……あんたは、ベアトのゲームを終えるために、観劇者という立会人を欠かせないのよ。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100152.ogg":^"If you want to, go ahead.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100153.ogg":^  If you chase me out, then I'll head back with my piece, Erika.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100154.ogg":^  This game will be cancelled, and you won't be able to prove that you've reached the truth.^\:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100155.ogg":^  ...A theatergoer is an observer.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100156.ogg":^  A truth with no observers is the same as an illusion.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100157.ogg":^  ...You need a theatergoer as a witness until Beato's game ends."^\

