;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100527.ogg":^"...Our truth only needs to pass between the two of us!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100528.ogg":^  If you get in the way any further, I will boot you out by force.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100529.ogg":^  ...Then you can writhe around in boredom for a few centuries until you find another way to kill time."^\

