langen:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600159.ogg":^"UNDERSTOOD.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600160.ogg":^  ...Lady Erika will also retroactively adjust her movements, starting before the discovery of the first twilight, and taking into account that the application of this privilege is now POSSIBLE.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600161.ogg":^  ...As soon as these changes affect the progression of the game, they will be reported to the Game MASTER."^\

