;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100581.ogg":^"Quiet.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100582.ogg":^  And don't misunderstand.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100583.ogg":^  ...I'm not being arrogant or soft here.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100584.ogg":^  ......Erika, use this weapon and come at me with all you've got.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100585.ogg":^  Then I'll crush you with all I've got.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100586.ogg":^  So, hold your head up high and use those three.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100587.ogg":^  That is all."^\

