langjp…だからお前も、俺に手加減するな。@……これは最後のゲームなんだ。@俺がベアトに、真実に至ったことを証明するための。@……俺たちの勝敗はもはや、それを左右しない。@だから、これは純粋に、好敵手と認めたお前と決着をつけたいという気持ちなんだ。@………ゲームの上では敵として全てを疑え。@だが、プレイヤー同士としては、信頼しろ。@……それが、ゲームのマナーだ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100597.ogg":^  ...And don't you go easy on me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100598.ogg":^  ...This is the final game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100599.ogg":^  I'm playing to prove to Beato that I've reached the truth.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100600.ogg":^  ...By now, who wins and who loses doesn't affect that goal.^\:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100601.ogg":^  So, I just want to accept you as a rival and settle this.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100602.ogg":^  ......In the game, let's suspect each other over everything as enemies.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100603.ogg":^  But as fellow players, let's trust each other.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100604.ogg":^  ...That's how this game is supposed to be played."^\

