;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200078.ogg":^"Anyway, we can't let the servants go unsupervised.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200079.ogg":^  I've already talked with Hideyoshi-san about this, but we've decided to split everyone into two rooms on the second floor and hole up in there."^\

