langjp「この３人を、特にマークすべきだと思う。@そこで、この３人を隔離し、俺と兄貴で監視する。@２丁の銃、俺と兄貴なら咄嗟の時、連携も出来る。@少しでもおかしな動きを見せたらズドン！だ。」\
;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200080.ogg":^"I think we need to pay those three special attention, Aniki.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200081.ogg":^  This way, we can isolate that group, and you and I can keep a close eye on them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200082.ogg":^  With two guns, the pair of us could cooperate on a moment's notice.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\61200083.ogg":^  If they make even a single suspicious move, *boom*!"^\

