langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500806.ogg":^"Right now, Hideyoshi-san is upstairs, dividing everyone into the two rooms.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500807.ogg":^  We'll gather the ones being isolated in the cousin room, and the others will go into the next room over."^\

