langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500808.ogg":^"We were planning to have five people in the cousin room and seven in the next room over.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500809.ogg":^  If Jessica-san wants to go to the cousin room, it'll be split clean down the middle.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500810.ogg":^  If this was a wolves and sheep puzzle, there are now three servant wolves and you two sheep in that room.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500811.ogg":^  If you add in Jessica-san, it'll be balanced out."^\
