;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500932.ogg":^"It's an advance notice for a crime.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500933.ogg":^  No, I should say it's a report after the fact.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500934.ogg":^  ...Apparently, they have taken Ushiromiya Battler's corpse.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500935.ogg":^  It's basically saying `please try looking for it'."^\

