langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500949.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500950.ogg":^  I promised that I'd report on it right away, but I completely forgot until just now.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500951.ogg":^  You have my sincere apologies."^\

