langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500958.ogg":^"Well,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500959.ogg":^ ...after all, Battler-san has been playing this game ignorant of the fact that his corpse was sealed in the guest room.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500960.ogg":^  ...Because of that, ...I thought...^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64500961.ogg":^that it might possibly change things regarding the appearance of this letter."^\

