;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000512.ogg":^"This world is a game that's possible to explain with humans.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000513.ogg":^  ...In other words, it must be possible for all magic to have been done `by tricks as well'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000514.ogg":^  ...If it's impossible to do with tricks, then the human side has no move and we get a stalemate."^\

