langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000324.ogg":^"True.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000325.ogg":^  This is far too soon for them to get flustered.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000326.ogg":^  ...All he has to do is change his move so that Erika's seals and the placement of the letter don't contradict each other."^\

