;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200165.ogg":^"Of course, Erika can take advantage of this rule as well.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200166.ogg":^  ...If you revise your trick to be a new one, she can deal with that in a different way."^\

