langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100211.ogg":^"......Lambda,^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100212.ogg":^ Battler has already finished making his move.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100213.ogg":^  Players can't take back a move once it's made.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100214.ogg":^  ...Act as an impartial judge, carry out our motion,^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100215.ogg":^ and see whether or not Battler's escape from the closed room is logical, ...and whether there has been a logic error or not."^\

