langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501160.ogg":^  ...You told me I could make the detective proclamation whenever I wanted, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501161.ogg":^  ...Well, unfortunately,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501162.ogg":^ ...I am no longer capable of making that proclamation."^\

