_ld c,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_akuwarai4.png",26
_ld c,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_akuwarai3.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「……今回のゲームでは。@……探偵権限のないニンゲンには、完全な検死は出来ない。@……だから死者は全員死んだふりで、……それで自在に歩き回って数々のトリックを行なっている。@……そのロジックで、以後の不可能犯罪を進めようと思われていたのでしょう。@……私が探偵宣言をしないと言い出した時。@あなたは内心、これで勝ったと、思ったはずです。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501163.ogg":^"...In this game,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501164.ogg":^ ...it is impossible for Humans without the detective's authority to examine corpses perfectly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501165.ogg":^  ...So, ...there have been several tricks where the dead have all been faking and walking around where they please."^\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501166.ogg":^"...You probably thought you could use that logic to create several impossible crimes after this.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501167.ogg":^  ...When I said that I wouldn't make the detective proclamation,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501168.ogg":^ somewhere on the inside, you must have said `I've won'."^\
_ld c,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_akuwarai2.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「………あなたも狡猾ですね。@ガムテープの封印を与え、一見、慈悲を与えたように見せましたが、それは、第一の晩の犠牲者６人が全員、生きていて。@結託して以後の犯行を行なえる手はずを整えてあったからです。@ですから、６人を下回る３部屋分しか与えなかったのです。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501169.ogg":^"...You're pretty sly yourself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501170.ogg":^  You gave me the packing tape seals, seemingly out of mercy,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501171.ogg":^ but that was because you planned to have all of the first twilight victims survive, band together, and carry out the crimes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501172.ogg":^  So, you gave me only three rooms' worth, which wouldn't cover all six people."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_akire1.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「どの部屋をどう封じようと、あなたの手下は誰かが自由に行動できる。@………その辺りから、うまく私を追い込んで行こうと企んでいたのでしょう。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501173.ogg":^"No matter which rooms I sealed, at least one of your underlings could move freely.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501174.ogg":^  ......You must've been plotting to use that to corner me.^@/

_ld c,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_futeki1.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

langjp……しかし残念ですね。@つくづく、あなたの甘さにはうんざりします。@……馬鹿な男ですッ。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501175.ogg":^  ...But too bad.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501176.ogg":^  Your naivety really pisses me off.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501177.ogg":^  ...Stupid man!"^\

bg new_different_space_1c,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_kuyasigaru1.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「………………認める。@……お前らの猿芝居にまんまと騙され、@……お前に慈悲を与えるという驕りを見せたことを、……俺は認める。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100863.ogg":^"......I admit it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100864.ogg":^  ...I admit that I fell for your monkey show...^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100865.ogg":^and that in my pride, I tried to show you some mercy.^@/
advsetwindow "10"

;ld r,BUT_kuyasigaruA1,80

langjp………そうだな。@……探偵権限などなくても、……ニンゲンには、あるんだ。@……絶対、検死を誤らない方法が。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100866.ogg":^  ......That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100867.ogg":^  ...Even without the detective's authority, ...there is a way for Humans to do it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100868.ogg":^  ...A way to make sure that a corpse examination cannot fail."^\

bg black,22

fede 10,100
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　目の前に横たわる人間が、生きているのか、死んでいるのか。@
langen^Is the human lying in front of you alive or dead?^@
br
