langjp　それを調べるのが、検死。\
langen^You can answer that question by examining the corpse.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　ぱっと見ただけでは、生きているも死んでいるも、五分五分。@
langen^With just a quick glance, your chances of being right are 50-50 either way.^@
br
