langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100277.ogg":^"That's why we have the wire...^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100278.ogg":^  ...Beforehand, Battler will have to wrap the wire around his wrist, then stretch the other end out into the corridor through the crack in the door.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100279.ogg":^  ...You should be able to fit just a wrist through the crack left by the chain lock."^\

