langjp「………………これは、……地獄の生還者からの忠告よ。@……この賑やかさを、よく楽しんでおきなさい。@………あんたをムカつかせる悪口雑言さえ、@……永遠の静寂の中では、正気を保つ温かな思い出になりうるんだから。\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200280.ogg":^"......Here's...some advice from a survivor of hell.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200281.ogg":^  ...Enjoy this noise while you can.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200282.ogg":^  ......Even the annoying insults you hear now...^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200283.ogg":^...will bring you fond memories to preserve your sanity amidst the eternal silence."^\
