langjp「私は、諦めません…。@………あの密室は、心を急速に蝕みます…！@　一刻も早く助け出さなければ、………戦人さんの心が壊れてしまうッ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700908.ogg":^"I won't give up...^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700909.ogg":^  ......That closed room rapidly eats away at the heart...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700910.ogg":^  Unless I can save Battler-san as soon as possible, ...his heart will be crushed!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\be3\1\be3_b11_aseru1.png",24
advsetwindow "71"

langjp「…………無論、妾も知恵を貸すことは厭わぬ。@……しかし、妾とてあの密室は見当もつかぬのだ…。」\
;＜髪ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700911.ogg":^"......Of course, I have no reservations towards lending my own wisdom.^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700912.ogg":^  ...However, even I cannot make anything out of this closed room..."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a15_komaru4.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「私たちで知恵を出し合えば、それはきっと、一なる私たちが至るのと同じ答えのはずっ。@……どうかお姉様も諦めずにお知恵をお貸し下さい…！！」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700913.ogg":^"If we put our heads together, I'm sure we'll find the same answer that we would if we were joined.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700914.ogg":^  ...Please, don't give up, and lend me your wisdom...!!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\be3\1\be3_b11_gaman4.png",80
advsetwindow "71"

langjp「………どうして、あの戦人のためにそこまでせねばならぬのかは、相変わらずわからぬが、@……いいとも。@他ならぬ自分自身の頼みである。@妾も知恵を絞ろうぞ……。」\
;＜髪ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700915.ogg":^"......I still cannot understand why you are willing to go so far for Battler,^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700916.ogg":^ ...but I shall do as you ask.^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700917.ogg":^  After all, it is a request made by myself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700918.ogg":^  I will add my wisdom to yours..."^\

