langjp「また出たわ、“愛がなければ視えない”。@……そのキャッチコピーが、概念的なものとしては通用するのも理解するわ。@でも、密室トリックは情愛のカケラの一切混じらない、純粋かつ冷酷な算数パズルよ。@………一体、この悪魔たちは、何をヒントだと語っているの…？」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000528.ogg":^"There it is again.  `Without love, it cannot be seen'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000529.ogg":^  ...I get how that catch phrase works as an abstract concept.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000530.ogg":^  But closed room tricks are part of a genuine, ruthless mathematical puzzle, without room for a fragment of affection within it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000531.ogg":^  ......Just what kind of hint could these demons be talking about...?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def1.png",24
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「……私はすでにある答えを持っている。@……この悪魔たちの発言は、それが正しいことをさらに教えてくれている…。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000336.ogg":^"...I already have a certain answer.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000337.ogg":^  ...What these demons have said supports that even further..."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「はいはい、あんたは凄いわ。@いつだって勝手に正解がわかってる。@そして私には一言も教えてくれないんだわ。@……観測者ルールに則るなら、あんたがそれを私に教えない限り、@あんたは正解がわかったフリをしてるだけの、嘘吐きの可能性もあるってわけだわ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000532.ogg":^"Yeah, okay, you're incredible.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000533.ogg":^  You always know the right answer.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000534.ogg":^  And you'll never tell me any of it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000535.ogg":^  ...Going by the rule of observers, until you tell me about it,^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000536.ogg":^ it's possible that you're just pretending that you know and lying."^\



;bg black,0
bg new_fea_r1ap,23
_ld c,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def2.png",23
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「ふっ、………はっはははははははははは。@……やはり、口の悪い巫女は良い。@良いぞ、人の子よ。@私にとっては、巫女の皮肉や雑言は神楽と同じ……。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000338.ogg":^"Pft, ......hahahahahahahahahahaha.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000339.ogg":^  ...Yes, I believe I do prefer a bad-mouthed miko.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000340.ogg":^  Very well, child of man.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000341.ogg":^  To me, a miko's sarcasm and abuse is like a ceremonial dance in my honor..."^\

bg new_FEA_R1cP,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_fuman1.png",1
se1v 11,70
quakey 2,200
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「あぁ、本当にイラつくご主人様だわ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000537.ogg":^"You really are an irritating master.^@/
_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_ikari1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"
langjp………お兄ちゃんの馬鹿、@…どうしてあんな密室を、……自ら……。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000538.ogg":^  ......Stupid Onii-chan,^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000539.ogg":^ ...why'd you make a closed room like that...yourself..."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「考えるがいい、人の子よ。@……考えるのは、物語の中の人物だけの仕事ではないぞ。@……朗読者のそなたにも、思考を楽しむ権利がある。@……私はそれを見るのが、楽しい。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000342.ogg":^"Think, child of man.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000343.ogg":^  ...Thinking is not only a job for the characters within the tale.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000344.ogg":^  ...As a Reader, you too have the right to enjoy thinking.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000345.ogg":^  ...And I enjoy watching you as you do."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_fuman1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「……賭けてもいいわ。@あんた、前の巫女には絶対、愛想を尽かされて逃げられたんだわ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000540.ogg":^"...I'm willing to make a bet.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000541.ogg":^  Your last miko ran out of patience and ran away from you, didn't she?"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「私を詰って楽しむもよし。@二人のベアトとともに、悩むもよし。@……そなたが考えぬ限り、物語は進まぬぞ。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000346.ogg":^"You are free to enjoy yourself by scolding me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000347.ogg":^  You are also free to worry over the problem, along with the two Beatos.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000348.ogg":^  ...Unless you think, the tale will not continue."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「どうしてよ。@私は朗読者でしょ？@　ただ黙々と読み進めればいいだけの話でしょ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000542.ogg":^"Why?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000543.ogg":^  I'm a Reader, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000544.ogg":^  Can't I just stay quiet and read?"^\

textoff

