langjp「クール……！@　これはお嬢が一本取られましたぜ？@　はっははははははははは、あっはっはっはっはっは…！」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\63000030.ogg":^"Cool...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\63000031.ogg":^  Looks like she got you, Lady!^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\63000032.ogg":^  Hahahahahahahahaha, ahhahhahhahhahhahha...!"^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"
langjp　ここまでタダで読ませておいて、……いよいよ面白くなってきたところでお預けとは。@その悪徳商法ぶりに、堪らず天草は笑い転げる。\
langen^Letting you read only so far for free, ...and then stopping when it finally gets to the good part.^@^  Amakusa couldn't stop laughing at this evil business practice.^\

;cl l,0
