langjp「あなたなりの、意見が。@……推理が欲しいのです。@……それを先に私に話してくれたら、……この続きの原稿をお渡ししましょう。」\
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900124.ogg":^"Your own views and reasoning.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900125.ogg":^  ...That's what I want.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900126.ogg":^  ...If you tell me those now, ...I'll hand over the rest of the manuscript."^\

cl c,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_a11_def1.png",0
_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_fuman1.png",24
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「馬鹿にしてるわ。@こんなふざけた真似をされてまで、あんたの言いなりになると思う…？」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000547.ogg":^"Quit mocking me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000548.ogg":^  You think I'll just do whatever you say after something like this...?"^\

cl c,23
_ld c,":b;sprites\ama\1\ama_a11_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "20"

langjp「お嬢、まままま、落ち着いて。@俺も先が読みたいですから、頭を冷やして下さいって。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\63000033.ogg":^"Come on now, Lady, calm down.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\63000034.ogg":^  I want to read on too, so please just chill a bit."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\ama\1\ama_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "20"

langjp「……八城先生、原稿の続きですが、@……密室トリックの答えや、……いろんな謎の真相も書かれているんですよね？」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\63000035.ogg":^"...About the rest of the manuscript, Madam Hachijo.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\63000036.ogg":^  ...You write about the answer to the closed room trick and the truth behind a bunch of riddles, right?"^\

;cl r,23
;bg FEA_R1c,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_a11_def2.png",24
advsetwindow "57"

langjp「もちろん。@………もっとも、何も考えぬ思考なき者が読んでもわかるようには書いてありませんが…。」\
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900127.ogg":^"Of course.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900128.ogg":^  ......However, I've written it so that those who fail to think or consider won't understand..."^\

;cl c,0
;cl l,23
_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_majime1.png",23
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「……あんた、いつか熱烈な読者に、裏切られたーって刺されるわよ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000549.ogg":^"...Someday, your passionate readers are gonna say you've betrayed them."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "57"

langjp「それをわかっているから、人前に出ないのですよ。@人の子よ。」\
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900129.ogg":^"I understand that, which is why I don't go out in the open,^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900130.ogg":^ child of man."^\

bg black,23
bg new_FEA_R1c,23
_ld l,":b;sprites\ama\1\ama_a11_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "20"

langjp「とにかく、八城先生はこう仰いたいわけだ。@……まずは答えを聞かせろ。@答え合わせはその後だ、と。」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\63000037.ogg":^"Anyway, this is what Madam Hachijo's trying to say:^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\63000038.ogg":^  ...First, tell me your answer.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\63000039.ogg":^  Afterwards, you can check to see if it's right."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_a12_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "57"

langjp「……その通りです、青年。@………意地悪がしたいのではない。@…本当の意味で、物語の結末をしっかりと理解してほしいから尋ねているのです。」\
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900131.ogg":^"...Correct, young man.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900132.ogg":^  ......It is not my intention to be mean.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900133.ogg":^  ...I ask this because I want you to truly understand the tale's conclusion."^\

cl r,23
_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_fuman1.png",24
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「天草、……あんた、すっかり楽しんでるでしょ。@……あぁ、そういえばあんたは、テレビのクイズ番組とか、めちゃくちゃ大真面目に挑戦してたもんね。@……なるほど、人生をあんたの方が私より、数段楽しんでるみたいだわ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000550.ogg":^"...You're really enjoying this, aren't you, Amakusa.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000551.ogg":^  ...Yeah, come to think of it, you always take those TV quiz shows totally seriously, trying to win them from your couch.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000552.ogg":^  ...I guess life's many times more fun for you than it is for me."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ama\1\ama_a11_akuwarai1.png",80

