;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200349.ogg":^"......Oh, it's you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200350.ogg":^  ...Congratulations on your big victory.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200351.ogg":^  ......Heheh, that's strange.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200352.ogg":^  I think I remember saying the same thing to you right here at the end of the last game."^\

