;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501278.ogg":^"I heard that you have also...^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501279.ogg":^...had the experience of being toyed with as a piece on some great witch's game board, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501280.ogg":^then sealed away in some awful hell..."^\

