;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200355.ogg":^  ...I wonder how many years I was shut up in there.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200356.ogg":^  ...Maybe I should've counted them like Bern...^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200357.ogg":^  ......No, it's probably best that I didn't.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200358.ogg":^  Counting the years...is what made Bern break."^\

