langjp「えぇ。@………あの子の主、……これがまた酷いヤツでねぇ。@……自分で作ったゲームのはずなのに、途中でゴールがわからなくなっちゃって。@……スタートとゴールがつながった、@ドーナツみたいな、壊れたすごろくを作ってしまったのよ。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200364.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200365.ogg":^  ......That kid's master...is another bad one.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200366.ogg":^  ...Though she created the game herself, partway through, she lost sight of what her goal was.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200367.ogg":^  ...She ended up creating something like a broken game of backgammon, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200368.ogg":^where the start and goal were connected like a donut."^\

