advsetwindow "46"

langjp「……猿が、無限の時間の中でデタラメにタイプライターを打ち続ければ。@……いつか偶然にも文字列が、ハムレットとまったく同じ文章になるかもしれないという理論、@いえ、暴論ですね。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501287.ogg":^"...It's a theory...no, an absurdity...^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501288.ogg":^arguing that, if a monkey hits random letters on a typewriter for an infinite amount of time,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501289.ogg":^ ...he'll probably end up with the exact same set of letters as Hamlet by coincidence, sooner or later."^\
advsetwindow "29"

;ld r,LAM_FutekiA2,80

langjp「………ひどい地獄よね。@………ベルンは、無限の時間の間、意味もわからずデタラメにタイプライターを叩かせられて。@………ゲームマスターは、自分さえ思いつかないゴールを、@彼女に作らせようとしたのよ。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200376.ogg":^"......Wouldn't that be a horrible hell?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200377.ogg":^  ......Bern was forced to type randomly on a typewriter for an eternal period of time, without even knowing the meaning of what she was doing.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200378.ogg":^  ......The Game Master was trying to get Bern to create a goal ^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200379.ogg":^that this Game Master hadn't even thought of."^\

