langjp　百回を数えたら終わる仕事と、百分の一の確率を得るまで繰り返させられる仕事では、@……算数的には同じに見えても、……まったく、その残酷な意味が異なる。\
langen^A job you have to do a hundred times...and a job with a 1/100 chance of success that you have to keep doing repeatedly...^@^  Probabilistically, they may look very similar, ...but the difference in cruelty between them is great.^\

