langjp「タイプライターの鍵盤数っていくつくらい？@　百個くらいかしら。@……それをデタラメに叩いて、ハムレットになる確率って、何分の一だと思う…？」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200380.ogg":^"How many keys are there on a typewriter?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200381.ogg":^  About a hundred, maybe.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200382.ogg":^  ...What do you think the odds are of hitting those at random and getting Hamlet...?"^\

