langjp「そ、そんなことはないです…！@　我が主の駒となれて、私は光栄ですっ。@我が主は強き者、虐げる者です。@弱者を踏みつけるのは当然の権利なのです。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501293.ogg":^"Th-That's not true...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501294.ogg":^  I am honored to be my master's piece.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501295.ogg":^  My master is a powerful persecutor.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501296.ogg":^  Trampling over the weak is her natural right."^\

bg black,23
