;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501301.ogg":^"......If you'll pardon me for saying,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501302.ogg":^ ...I think it's the depth of the hell that's important, not the length of time spent there."^\

