langjp「ふぅん……。@……言うじゃない、………真実の魔女、ヱリカ。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200409.ogg":^"Oho...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200410.ogg":^  ...You think so, ...Witch of Truth, Erika?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_akire1.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「ラムダデルタ卿の潜られた地獄を、私は存じません。@……そして、私が地獄にいた時間など、きっと瞬き一つ分程度でしょう。@……しかし、その深みでは、私は何ら劣ることはないと思っています。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501303.ogg":^"I don't know what kind of hell you were in, Lady Lambdadelta.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501304.ogg":^  ...And I'm sure the time I spent in hell was nothing more than a blink compared to yours.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501305.ogg":^  ...However, I don't think the depths of my hell were any shallower than yours."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai5.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「………あんたの戦勝祝いも兼ねて、反論しないで聞いてあげるわ。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200411.ogg":^"......In part to celebrate your victory, I'll listen to what you have to say without arguing back."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「私に言わせれば。@……我が主の落ちた、奇跡があれば抜けられる地獄も、@……存じ上げませんが、絶対の意思があれば抜けられるラムダデルタ卿の地獄も、@……どちらも“抜けられるように出来ている”程度の地獄です。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501306.ogg":^"From my point of view,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501307.ogg":^ ...both the hell my master fell into, which could only be escaped from with a miracle,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501308.ogg":^ ...and the hell you fell into, which I don't know about but could be escaped from with certain willpower,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501309.ogg":^ ...were `hells made to be escapable'."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_b21_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "29"
;bg black,22
langjp「へぇ……。@……言うじゃなァい。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200412.ogg":^"Aha...^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200413.ogg":^  ...That's pretty bold, coming from you."^\

