advsetwindow "46"

langjp「……わからぬ者にはわかりません。@それを正視できなかったからこそ、@あなたたちは真実の魔女たりえないのではありませんか…？」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501316.ogg":^"...Those who don't know cannot understand.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501317.ogg":^  Perhaps you two couldn't become Witches of Truth ^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501318.ogg":^because you couldn't bear to look at it directly..."^\

