langjp「領主は、古戸ヱリカ。@………あんたの望む物語は全てが叶うわ。@……領主は、神。@…おめでと、あなたはこの小さいけれどステキな世界の、神になるのよ。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200433.ogg":^"Territory lord, Furudo Erika.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200434.ogg":^  ...Any tale you wish will come true.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200435.ogg":^  ...The territory lord is God.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\62200436.ogg":^  ...Congratulations, you're going to become the god of this small but wonderful world."^\

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_hanbeso1.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「……は、……ははははは、…はっはははははははははははは…。@それは、……本当ですか、…我が、……主……！！@　私が、……この世界の、……神に……。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501334.ogg":^"...Ha...hahahaha...hahahahahahahahahahahaha...^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501335.ogg":^  Is that...true, ...my...master...?!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501336.ogg":^  Will I...become this world's...god...?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai4.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「それが、私があなたに最後に与える褒美よ。@戦人の指輪を得て、あなたは自らの世界を作りなさい。@……その時、あなたはもう私の駒じゃない。@一人の立派な、そして素敵な魔女だわ。@………おめでとう、ヱリカ卿。@そしていつか、かつてベアトがそうしたように、また訪れる私を歓待しなさい。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100310.ogg":^"That is the final reward I will give to you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100311.ogg":^  Take Battler's ring and create your own world.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100312.ogg":^  ...When that happens, you won't be my piece anymore.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100313.ogg":^  You'll be your own witch, and a splendid one at that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100314.ogg":^  ......Congratulations, Lady Erika.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100315.ogg":^  And, one day, you must welcome me when I come to visit, just like Beato once did."^\

;ld r,ERI_HanbesoA1,80
mcl c,0
bg black,22
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「はッ、はいッ、我が主…！！@　これほどの栄誉はありません…！@　そして、気に入りました、戦人との結婚ッ！@　……くすくす、思えば、これほどの陵辱はないわけです！@　何しろあのベアトリーチェは、戦人に尽くしたい、好かれたいという感情から生まれたらしいじゃないですか。@そんな魔女が生み出した世界で私が、……戦人を、娶り、穢すッ、辱しめるッ！！@　くすくすくす、くっくくくくくくくくくく！！@　あぁ、わかります。@恋焦がれる人を奪われる苦しみ、よぉくわかります！！@　私はついに、それを与える側に回れたのですね…！！@　光栄ですッ、これほどの栄誉はありませんッ！！」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501337.ogg":^"Y-Yes, my master...!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501338.ogg":^  There could be no greater honor...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501339.ogg":^  And I'm starting to like this marriage thing!^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501340.ogg":^  ...*giggle*  If you think about it, there could be no greater disgrace!^\:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501341.ogg":^  After all, that Beatrice has apparently grown a desire to serve Battler and be liked by him.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501342.ogg":^  In the world that witch created, ...I'll marry, defile, and humiliate Battler!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501343.ogg":^  *giggle*giggle*, *cackle*cackle*cackle*cackle*!!^\:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501344.ogg":^  Oh yes, I understand.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501345.ogg":^  I sooo understand how painful it feels to have the one you love stolen away from you!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501346.ogg":^  And now, I'm finally the one dealing out the pain...!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\64501347.ogg":^  Truly, there could be no greater honor!!"^\

