;＜髪ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700955.ogg":^"A duel over love, is it...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700956.ogg":^  How old-fashioned they are.^@:dwave 0, "voice\60\60700957.ogg":^  ...I have seen many duels with pistols during my thousand years, ...but I have never seen one like this."^\

