;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700963.ogg":^"I'm sure...it's because they want a miracle of magic.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\60700964.ogg":^  ...It seems we cannot be successful in love without such a miracle..."^\

