langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\63100012.ogg":^"I hear she has gone to see Zepar and Furfur.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\63100013.ogg":^  ...Since that powerful pair controls love, they could force even a demon king to retreat.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\63100014.ogg":^  ...I do hope they prove to be helpful in some way..."^\

