_ld r,":b;sprites\wal\1\wal_a11_komaru1.png",24
advsetwindow "30"

langjp「………とにかく、戦人くんの心を密室から助け出せれば何とかなるのです。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\63200016.ogg":^"......At any rate, if we can just free Battler-kun's heart from that closed room, we should be able to manage something here.^@/
advsetwindow "30"
;ld r,WAL_KomaruA2,80

langjp……ガァプは密室が大好物なんでしょう？@　何か妙案は思いつかないのですか…？！」\
;＜ワルギリア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\63200017.ogg":^  ...Closed rooms are your favorite, are they not, Gaap?^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\63200018.ogg":^  Can you think of any tricks...?!"^\

