_ld c,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_akuwarai3a.png",23
advsetwindow "32"

langjp「酷い密室よ。@戦人とヱリカの二人で赤き真実だらけのガッチガチ。@……内部からの単独脱出は不可能だと断言できるわ。」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700018.ogg":^"This is a nasty one.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700019.ogg":^  Battler and Erika have been dropping red truths all over the place.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700020.ogg":^  ...I can say for certain that it's impossible to escape from the inside on one's own."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ron\1\ron_a11_majime1.png",24
advsetwindow "31"

langjp「やはり、誰かが入れ替わりで内側に入り、チェーンを閉める他ありませんな…。」@
;＜ロノウェ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\63100017.ogg":^"So, after all, the only way is to have someone else trade places with him and set the chain..."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "32"

langjp「……その誰かが現れてくれれば、戦人を助けるのは容易よ。@１１人もいるんでしょ？」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700021.ogg":^"...If someone does appear like that, saving Battler should be easy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700022.ogg":^  There's a full 11 people, right?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wal\1\wal_a11_fuman1.png",23
advsetwindow "30"

langjp「その１１人は、ゲストハウスの２階にそれぞれ封じられています…。@何とか、そこを抜けられれば…！」\
;＜ワルギリア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\63200019.ogg":^"Those 11 are sealed on the second floor of the guesthouse...^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\63200020.ogg":^  If we could somehow slip them out of there...!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ron\1\ron_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "31"

langjp「……なるほど。@……戦人さまの密室を解くのと、ゲストハウス２階の２つのどちらかの密室を解くのは同じこと、というわけですな。」\
;＜ロノウェ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\63100018.ogg":^"...I see.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\63100019.ogg":^  ...Solving the problem of Battler-sama's closed room is equivalent to solving the problem of either closed room on the guesthouse's second floor."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "32"

langjp「そういうことよ。@戦人の客室だけに拘るのは、思考的密室も同然だわ。@……戦人を助けるために開く密室は客室じゃない。@ゲストハウスの密室なのよ…！」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700023.ogg":^"Exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700024.ogg":^  Limiting your thoughts to just Battler's guest room would be like getting trapped in a mental closed room of your own.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700025.ogg":^  ...The closed room we need to break open to save Battler isn't the guest room.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700026.ogg":^  It's the closed rooms in the guesthouse...!"^\

textoff

