langen:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600276.ogg":^"However, that was quite IMPRESSIVE, <Miss> Gaap.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600277.ogg":^  You realized that the closed room you should destroy to save Battler is in the GUESTHOUSE.^@/
