langjp「いいえ、構いマセン。@……存分に現場の封印を確認なされて絶望された方ガ。@……心の底から式を祝福できるに違いないですカラ。」\
;＜ドラノ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600279.ogg":^"That is no PROBLEM.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600280.ogg":^  ...Surely, if you first have the seals around the scene confirmed and fall into DESPAIR,^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600281.ogg":^ ...you will be able to celebrate this ceremony more SINCERELY."^\

