;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700029.ogg":^"How confident...^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700030.ogg":^  ...I'll take that challenge.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700031.ogg":^  ...Lia, let's have ourselves a little snack before the ceremony."^\

