;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700032.ogg":^"Don't be stupid, everyone.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700033.ogg":^  Who's in this room doesn't matter anymore.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700034.ogg":^  We need to find out how to escape from it."^\

