;＜ワルギリア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\63200024.ogg":^"Y-You're right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\63200025.ogg":^  ...The door and windows are sealed, so we must somehow escape from some other place..."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_warai3.png",24
