se1 11
quakey 2,200
advsetwindow "47"

langjp「……それはコーネリアのミスではありマセン。@その叱責は上司の私が賜りマス。」\
;＜ドラノ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600285.ogg":^"...That was no fault of Cornelia's.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600286.ogg":^  The blame rests on her superior, ME."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "32"

langjp「金蔵の書斎の時とまったく同じよ。@窓よ。@窓からこの密室は破れるわ。@……バレバレなのよ、あんたたちの手口は。」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700041.ogg":^"This is exactly the same as Kinzo's study.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700042.ogg":^  It's the windows.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700043.ogg":^  This closed room can be broken by the windows.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700044.ogg":^  ...This trick of yours is just plain obvious."^\


bg new_g2f_r1ar,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\wal\1\wal_a11_komaru1.png",24
advsetwindow "30"

langjp「ど、どうしてです…？！@　ヱリカ卿は、部屋単位で封印をしたのですよ…？@　窓の封印ももちろん含まれ、部屋を丸ごと封じたはずです…！」\
;＜ワルギリア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\63200026.ogg":^"H-How...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\63200027.ogg":^  Lady Erika sealed the entire room, right...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\63200028.ogg":^  That means the entire room is sealed, including the windows...!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ron\1\ron_a11_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "31"

langjp「……なるほど。@……どうやら、私たちは封印の定義を勘違いしてしまっているようですな。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\63100024.ogg":^"...I see.^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\63100025.ogg":^  ...It would seem that we have been misinterpreting the definition of these seals.^@/
advsetwindow "31"

;ld c,RON_WaraiA2,80
langjpガムテープで封じられた密室は、@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\63100026.ogg":^  Closed rooms sealed by packing tape^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\63100027.ogg":^ ~ib~are not impossible to break~ib~.^@/
advsetwindow "31"
;br
langjp^~ib~^破れない^~ib~^わけではありません。@牢屋ではないのです。」\
;＜ロノウェ
;＜点処理：破れない
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\63100028.ogg":^  They form no prison."^\

bg black,23
bg new_g2f_r1ar,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_warai3.png",23
advsetwindow "32"

langjp「そういうことよ。@……封印は確かに密室を保証するわ。@でも、密室を維持することを保証はしないわ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700045.ogg":^"That's it exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700046.ogg":^  ...Seals definitely prove that a room is a closed room.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700047.ogg":^  However, they don't prove that the room will remain as such.^@/
advsetwindow "32"
langjp^~ib~^ガムテープが破られない限り^~ib~^、密室であることを保証するだけ。」\
;＜ガァプ
;＜点処理：ガムテープが破られない限り
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700048.ogg":^  They only prove that the room is a closed room ~ib~as long as the packing tape is not broken~ib~^."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\dla\1\dla_am11_def3.png",24
advsetwindow "47"

langjp「我々は何も誤解させるつもりはありマセン。@…………ガムテープが維持される限り、密室を保証スル。@それだけデス。」\
;＜ドラノ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600287.ogg":^"We are not trying to deceive you in any WAY.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600288.ogg":^  ......As long as the packing tape is intact, they are guaranteed to be closed ROOMS.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600289.ogg":^  That is ALL."^\

cl l,24
_ld l,":b;sprites\wal\1\wal_a11_komaru2.png",23
advsetwindow "30"

langjp「そ、それで、どうして窓から…？！@　どうして窓からなら密室を破れるのですか！」\
;＜ワルギリア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\63200029.ogg":^"Th-Then why the windows...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\63200030.ogg":^  Why is it that we can break this closed room with the windows?!"^\

bg new_g2f_r1br,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_warai3.png",24
advsetwindow "32"

langjp「簡単じゃない。@ガムテープをぶっ千切って、外へ飛び出すだけよ。@……ゲストハウスの外壁の構造は知らないけど、@あの小娘が、誰にも知られずに這いずり回って、外からガムテープが張れる程度には足場もあるはず。」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700049.ogg":^"It's simple.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700050.ogg":^  We just tear the packing tape apart and jump out.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700051.ogg":^  ...I don't know what the outside wall of the guesthouse is like,^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\63700052.ogg":^ but it must have enough of a foothold for that girl to crawl up it and stick packing tape on the outside without anyone noticing."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\dla\1\dla_am11_def3.png",23
advsetwindow "47"

langjp「………ガムテープを破れば、封印が破られたことが直ちにわかりマス。@そして私たちは、封印が健在であることを、戦人のロジックエラー時にも証明しているはずデス。」\
;＜ドラノ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600290.ogg":^"......If you break the packing tape, we will immediately know that the seal has been BROKEN.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600291.ogg":^  And we have already proven that the seals were intact at the time of Battler's logic ERROR."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "32"

