langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000553.ogg":^"Wh-What the hell...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000554.ogg":^  That's low!  That's the answer, isn't it?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000555.ogg":^  I also noticed that they hadn't proven that the windows' seals were intact.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000556.ogg":^  But if they can't use the blue truth, what are they supposed to do?!^@/
