;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000351.ogg":^"I also realized that the windows of the next room over were left available...^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000352.ogg":^  ...However, I hadn't imagined that the use of that argument would be prevented..."^\

