langjp「……あるいは、……窓の話をせずに、隣部屋の５人の誰かが助けに来られたことを説明するか。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000355.ogg":^"...Or, ...it may be possible to explain, without discussing the windows, how one of those five came to Battler's rescue."^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_fuman2.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「窓の話をしないってことは、窓を使わずに部屋を出るってことだわ。@それでは隣部屋だって密室と変わらない…！」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000564.ogg":^"If they can't talk about the windows, they'll have to find a different way to leave that room.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000565.ogg":^  That practically makes the next room over a closed room...!"^\

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「……ふむ。@……だから私も困ってしまった。@……このおかしな封印宣言のせいで、２つの部屋は再び密室に戻ったも同然になってしまった。@……恐らくだが、」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000356.ogg":^"...Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000357.ogg":^  ...That is why I am also stuck.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000358.ogg":^  ...Because of these strange seal proclamations, the two rooms have once again become closed rooms.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000359.ogg":^  ...Most likely-"^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_ikari1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「恐らく何？@　八百万を束ねて超えるっていうあんたの知能ならどんな答えが見つかるの？！」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000566.ogg":^"Most likely what?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000567.ogg":^  If you're so vastly intelligent, what kind of answer have you found?!"^\

