advsetwindow "50"

langjp「隣部屋の窓以外に、出口はない。@……にもかかわらず、隣部屋の窓を推理に組み込むことが許されぬ。@…………この密室を解く答えは、恐らく、ない。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000361.ogg":^"There is no way out except for the windows of the next room over.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000362.ogg":^  ...And yet, we are not allowed to include those windows in our reasoning.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000363.ogg":^  ......There probably is no answer...for this closed room."^\

