;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000571.ogg":^"So we have no moves left...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000572.ogg":^  In other words, that statement of Dlanor's...was the final blow?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000573.ogg":^  Doesn't this make it checkmate?!!"^\


