langjp　あー、俺ってさ。@家庭的な子とか案外苦手なんだよな。@この通り、ガサツな性格だろ？@　……レディーファーストとか、女の子の前では礼儀正しくとか、そういうのはさっぱり苦手なんだよな。@……だから強いて好みはって言われると……。\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100972.ogg":^Well,^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100973.ogg":^ I'm actually not a big fan of the family-oriented type of girl.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100974.ogg":^  You see how crude I am, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100975.ogg":^  ...I just can't handle acting politely in front of girls, ladies first and all that stuff.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100976.ogg":^  ...So, if I had to say what type I liked...^\
advsetwindow "-1"

;ld c,BUT_futekiA1,80
langjp　……そうだな、朱志香みたいなタイプの女なら結構好きかもな。@俺がガサツなように、向こうもガサツが丁度いいんだ。@……お互いよ、汚ぇ言葉遣いで気疲れなく、男女とか気にしないでバカがやれる、ラフな関係が理想かもな…！\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100977.ogg":^...Well, I'd probably like a Jessica-ish girl.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100978.ogg":^  If I'm crude, why shouldn't she be too?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100979.ogg":^  ...It'd probably be just perfect to have a rough, relaxed relationship, where we could mess around without worrying about gender and be rude with no worries...!^\
advsetwindow "-1"

;ld c,BUT_DefA1,80

langjp　だからもしも俺に彼女が出来るとしたら、@……いつも俺が朱志香とバカやってるみたいに、ハチャメチャな関係がいいよな…！\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100980.ogg":^So, if I ever get a girlfriend,^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\60100981.ogg":^ ...I hope it's someone I can joke around with all the time...!^\
;ld c,BUT_OdorokiA2,80
bg new_cg__ex02,80
