langjp「だって密室なんて。@………体のある人間たちの問題じゃないか。」\
;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600397.ogg":^"But it's a closed room.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600398.ogg":^  ...That's something for humans with bodies to worry about, right?"^\

