advsetwindow "27"

langjp「……嘉音さん……。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\60701060.ogg":^"...Kanon-san..."^\

ut_mldg r,":b;sprites\kan\1\kan_a11_warai3.png",80
advsetwindow "16"

langjp「敗者同士の仲さ。@………いいよ。@僕が行ってきてあげるよ。@僕がお屋敷の客室へ行って、戦人さまを外に出し、@入れ替わりでチェーンを掛けて、代わりにクローゼットに隠れる。@……それでいいかい。」\
;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600405.ogg":^"Seeing as you're a fellow loser,^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600406.ogg":^ ......okay.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600407.ogg":^  I'll go for you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600408.ogg":^  I'll go to the guest room in the mansion, let Battler-sama out,^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600409.ogg":^ set the chain behind me, and hide in the closet in his place.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600410.ogg":^  ...Is that enough?"^\

ut_mldg l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a15_1_odoroki5.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「き、気持ちは嬉しいです…。@でも、嘉音さんは、いとこ部屋から出たくても……、ヱリカさんの封印のせいで…。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\60701061.ogg":^"I-I'm glad for the sentiment...^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\60701062.ogg":^  However, even if you wanted to leave the cousin room, ...because of Erika-san's seals..."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　隣部屋と違い、嘉音のいとこ部屋は、窓も含め完全な密室が保証されている。@
langjp　救出どころか、脱出の術もないはず……。\
langen^Unlike the next room over, the cousin room containing Kanon was a guaranteed, complete closed room, even counting the windows.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Not only did he have no way to save Battler, he couldn't even escape himself...^\

