langjp「僕の知ってる黄金の魔女、ベアトリーチェというのは。@……とびっきりの魔法で、誰にもわからない難問を生み出して、煙に巻いて嘲笑ってやるヤツを言うんだ。@………誰にもわからない最悪の謎を作って、徹底的に煙に巻いて、扱き下ろしてやれ。@相手に出された謎で頭を抱えるのはね、君じゃない。君の相手の仕事さ。」\
;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600424.ogg":^"The Golden Witch I know...^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600425.ogg":^would have used insane magic to create a puzzle that no one could understand, confusing everyone and sneering.^\:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600426.ogg":^  ...Create a horrible riddle that no one can get, spin everyone around, and bad-mouth them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600427.ogg":^  You aren't supposed to clutch at your head worrying about your opponents' puzzles.  That's your opponents' job."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a15_komaru3.png",22
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「悩むのは、……私の相手の仕事………、」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\60701071.ogg":^"Worrying...is my opponents' job..."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kan\1\kan_a11_ikari2.png",22
advsetwindow "16"

langjp「右代宮戦人をどうやって密室から出すかを悩むんじゃない。@……チェーンロックの密室？@　馬鹿馬鹿しいね。@……なら君は、そんなのより、もっともっと飛びっきりの、最高の密室を作ってやって、@あいつらを悩ませてやろうじゃないか。@………僕も手を貸すよ。」\
;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600428.ogg":^"Don't worry about how Ushiromiya Battler got out of the closed room.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600429.ogg":^  ...A chain lock closed room?^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600430.ogg":^  How trivial.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600431.ogg":^  ...You need to create a much more spectacular, ultimate closed room...^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600432.ogg":^and make it so that they're the ones worrying.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600433.ogg":^  ......I'll even lend a hand."^\

