langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\60701072.ogg":^"I'm...not the one who worries..."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kan\1\kan_a11_ikari3.png",80
advsetwindow "16"

langjp「あいつらの方さ。@地獄の悪魔も平伏して絶句する、@最悪の密室トリックを無限に使いこなす、無限の魔女ベアトリーチェの本当の恐ろしさを、@そろそろ連中も思い出してもいい頃だ…！」\
;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600434.ogg":^"That's for them to do.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600435.ogg":^  It's about time they learned the true terror of the Golden Witch Beatrice,^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600436.ogg":^ the one who can create endless closed room tricks of the most horrific kind,^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\60600437.ogg":^ tricks that can make even the demons of hell prostrate themselves in shock...!"^\

