;＜ドラノ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600364.ogg":^...Please, forgive my ARROGANCE.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600365.ogg":^  ...I felt that I needed to protect YOU.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600366.ogg":^  ...When I realized what a frail truth you live by,^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600367.ogg":^ when I saw you being tormented by the tyranny of a mixture of truth and lies that seemed more plausible,^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\64600368.ogg":^ ...I wanted to protect YOU."^\

