langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\MAID7001.ogg":^"Y-You must be joking...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\MAID7002.ogg":^  Wh-Wh-Why would I kill the Master I loved and respected so...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\MAID7003.ogg":^  I have no motive, no reason...!"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「……誰が、如何にして犯したか。@それのみが立証できれば充分であると知り給え。@謹啓、謹んで申し上げる。@ミステリーに、動機は不要であると知り給え。」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\SHINM7005.ogg":^"...Who did it and how.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\SHINM7006.ogg":^  Know that establishing these is more than sufficient.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\SHINM7007.ogg":^  Please, allow me to speak.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\SHINM7008.ogg":^  Know that motives are unnecessary in mysteries."^\
