langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400017.ogg":^"True, the Great Court does assume that everyone besides the maid has an alibi.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400018.ogg":^  But that's just because they heard you say so, and they've mistaken your overconfidence and conceit for wisdom.^\:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400019.ogg":^  If any one of the other suspects loses their alibi, your evidence so far proves nothing.^@/
