langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400020.ogg":^  ...Just look at how pathetic some of these other alibis are.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400021.ogg":^  Did the clock in the reception hall chime midnight at exactly the right time?^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400022.ogg":^  Did the dog by the back door bark at everyone?"^\

