langjp「な、なら貴方に！！@　そのメイドが犯行を犯さなかったことが証明できる也や？！@　犯行時刻に彼女が台所を離れていたことは明らかと知り給え！@　彼女は犯行時刻にどこで何を！@　その女にも本官にも貴方にもッ、誰にも証明は不可能なりや！@　なればこそ審問の拷問具で、赤き真実を搾り出す他なき也ッ！！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\SHINM7044.ogg":^"Th-Then what about you?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\SHINM7045.ogg":^  Can you prove that this maid didn't commit the crime?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\SHINM7046.ogg":^  Know that she was clearly away from the kitchen at the time of the crime!^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\SHINM7047.ogg":^  What was she doing then, and where?!^\:dwave 0, "voice\99\SHINM7048.ogg":^  She can't prove it, I can't prove it, and you can't prove it!  No one can!^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\SHINM7049.ogg":^  That's why we have no choice but to use these torture devices to interrogate her until the red truth is squeezed out!!"^\

