langjp「だ、だからこそ貴方は甘いと批判されるもの也…！@　疑わしきは全て審問！@　それが我ら異端審問官の魔女裁判であると知り給え！！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\SHINM7050.ogg":^"Th-This is why everyone says you're too soft...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\SHINM7051.ogg":^  All the suspicious must be interrogated!^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\SHINM7052.ogg":^  That is how we Inquisitors of Heresy conduct our witch trials!!"^\

