langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400066.ogg":^"It won't come to that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400067.ogg":^  Exposing the secrets between lovers is a job for third-rate magazines.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400068.ogg":^  That's not mystery.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400069.ogg":^  ...I'll never allow for heartless reasoning."^\

