langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400070.ogg":^"...I'm sure you two will be happy together.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400071.ogg":^  Still, meeting together in secret while on the job is hardly praiseworthy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400072.ogg":^  Try to keep that to a minimum."^\
