;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100025.ogg":^"How do you intend to spend the rest of your life?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100026.ogg":^  Is Wizard-hunting Wright going to give up witch hunting?"^\

