;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100037.ogg":^"There is none.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100038.ogg":^  There's no one to stand in your way.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100039.ogg":^  I just want to sit back and watch you make your beautiful checkmate in this game...^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100040.ogg":^  I've even found you an ally.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100041.ogg":^  That's what this Lion is for."^\

