langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300079.ogg":^  ...Ah, well.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300080.ogg":^  It's about time I stopped finding that odd.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300081.ogg":^  I'm sure you'll just start speaking in riddles again."^\

