;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400191.ogg":^"Everyone knows Beatrice.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400192.ogg":^  And yet, no one knows her.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400193.ogg":^  Kinzo's the only one who's ever met her."^\

