;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400194.ogg":^"That was quick.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400195.ogg":^  ...I thought you'd resist a bit more than that."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_def1.png",80
