langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900010.ogg":^  This funeral is a ceremony for the Head to repay his benefactor for all he received while that person still lived.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900011.ogg":^  That is what I have been told, and there is nothing more to it than that."^\

