;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400052.ogg":^"However, that wasn't enough to bother me on that day.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400053.ogg":^  ...After all, I wanted to disappear into the forest and vanish forever.^\:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400054.ogg":^  ...If, by some chance, there really was a witch's mansion in the depths of the forest,^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400055.ogg":^ ...I hoped that she might take me to the some paradise, or else turn me into a frog and make me a resident of the forest."^\

