_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a13_fuman1.png",24
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「どうやら、この葬儀は、@隠したがゆえに弔うことが出来なかった二人のベアトリーチェのためのようですね……。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300141.ogg":^"So, it would seem that ^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300142.ogg":^this funeral exists for the two Beatrices he couldn't mourn, because they were kept secret..."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime1.png",23
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「楼座。@思い出したくねぇだろうが、事故の時の話を頼む。@ベアトリーチェが転落した時、まだ息はあったのか。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400258.ogg":^"Rosa,^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400259.ogg":^ I know you probably don't want to remember, but tell me about that accident.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400260.ogg":^  After Beatrice fell, was she still breathing?"^\

bg black,22

me2v 17,70

bg new_blood_1a,22
advsetwindow "12"

langjp「いいえ。@……目を大きく見開いていた。@頭から真っ逆さまに落ちて、岩浜の岩の、鋭い角に頭をぶつけて。@それも、あの高さから……。@…………頭部は陥没して裂けてたわ。@……美しい黄金の髪がみるみる内に赤黒く溢れる血に染められて……。」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400073.ogg":^"No.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400074.ogg":^  ...Her eyes were open wide.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400075.ogg":^  She fell upside down, head first, and knocked her head against a sharp crag on the rocky beach.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400076.ogg":^  And she fell from such a height...^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400077.ogg":^  Her skull had split and caved inwards.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400078.ogg":^  ...That beautiful golden hair was stained red with blood almost instantly..."^\
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「一目見て、死んだと確信できる外傷だったのか。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400261.ogg":^"Was it the sort of wound that clearly showed that she was dead?"^\

bg new_blood_1ar,22
advsetwindow "12"

langjp「えぇ。@割れた頭の中身を見たわ！@　それも握り拳大に陥没して…！@　あれを見て、生きてて欲しいなんて、幾らなんでも虫が良すぎるわ！」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400079.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400080.ogg":^  I saw the insides of her cracked head!^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400081.ogg":^  It had caved in deep enough to fit your fist inside it...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400082.ogg":^  No one could be naive enough to see that and still hope that she was alive!"^\

bg black,22

