;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000019.ogg":^"Oh, the one in front of the chapel?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ros\1\ros_a11_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "12"

langjp「いえ、裏のよ。@……とにかく、私は屋敷に帰りついた。@誰にも話せない、話したくない。@私は夜まで黙っていたわ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400088.ogg":^"No, the one behind it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400089.ogg":^  ...Anyway, I made it back to the mansion.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400090.ogg":^  I couldn't tell anyone, and I didn't want to.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400091.ogg":^  I stayed quiet until nightfall.^@/

