;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400264.ogg":^"How is a first aid kit going to help with a crushed cranium?^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400265.ogg":^  ...You didn't kill her.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400266.ogg":^  Don't worry about that anymore."^\

