;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400095.ogg":^"...That night, I turned over in my bed so many times.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400096.ogg":^  I couldn't sleep.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400097.ogg":^  ...Late that night, I quietly...^@/
