langjp「自分に全て任せ、誰にもこのことは言わないようにと。@……後日、きっとお父様に呼び出されてひどく叱られるだろうと、数日の間、怯えたわ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400099.ogg":^"He told me to let him handle everything and to speak of this to no one.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400100.ogg":^  ...I spent the next several days terrified that Father would call for me and scold me brutally.^@/

