langjpでも、……それはなかった。@源次さんはいつものように静々と仕事をする日々。@……お父様は相変わらずの書斎篭りで、何もわからない……。」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400101.ogg":^  But...he didn't.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400102.ogg":^  Genji-san kept on doing his job quietly, just like normal.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400103.ogg":^  ...Father stayed locked up in his study, not knowing any of it..."^\

