langjp「……古戸ヱリカの推理は正しいだろう。@元々、六軒島に存在した悪霊の伝説。@そこに金蔵のオカルト趣味と謎の女、ベアトリーチェの名前や肖像画、@碑文が次第に加味されていき、黄金の魔女伝説に統合された。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400318.ogg":^"...Furudo Erika's reasoning was probably correct.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400319.ogg":^  It started out as a legend of evil spirits on Rokkenjima.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400320.ogg":^  Later on, elements such as Kinzo's occult hobbies, the name and portrait of the mysterious woman, Beatrice,^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400321.ogg":^ and the epitaph got mixed in, and it was all integrated into the Legend of the Golden Witch."^\

