;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400322.ogg":^"...Then, the darkness of the night gained the personality of a witch.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400323.ogg":^  That's the third Beatrice.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400324.ogg":^  This became the veil for the serial murders."^\

