me1v 13,50
advsetwindow "-1"

;br
langjp　金蔵の目つきがぎょろりと険しくなる。@
langen^Kinzo's gaze grew sharp.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　理御は、あぁどうしてこの人はつくづく単刀直入なのかと、眩暈を起こす。\
langen^Lion felt a bit lightheaded and wondered why this guy had to be so direct.^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_ikari1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「聞いてどうする。@お前は誰でもないのであろうが。@ベアトリーチェのことを知ってどうするという。@何の意味があるというのか。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500014.ogg":^"Why do you ask?^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500015.ogg":^  You're no one, aren't you?^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500016.ogg":^  Why do you want to know about Beatrice?^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500017.ogg":^  What is your purpose?"^\

;ld l,WIL_FutekiA1,80
_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「俺が、誰でもないからこそ。@お前の物語を公正に聞き、残すことが出来る。@お前は直にこの世を去るだろう。@その時、ベアトリーチェのことを何も語らずに死んだなら、@お前の子供たちは、彼らが好き勝手に考えた物語でベアトリーチェを修飾し、記録に残すだろう。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400370.ogg":^"Because I'm no one,^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400371.ogg":^ I can listen to your tale impartially and record it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400372.ogg":^  You'll probably leave this world before too long.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400373.ogg":^  If you die without telling anyone anything about Beatrice,^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400374.ogg":^ your children will adorn Beatrice with whatever tale they please, writing that into their memories."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a21_akuwarai2.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「ふ、はっはははははははは！@　面白い若造だ。@お前は遺言屋を気取ろうというわけか！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500018.ogg":^"Pft, hahahahahahahahahaha!^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500019.ogg":^  You entertain me, boy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500020.ogg":^  Do you plan on writing my will for me?!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_ikari1.png",80

se1v 12,50
quakey 2,200
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「だが、それは余計なお世話というものよ。@ベアトリーチェは、私だけのベアトリーチェだ。@誰が何を語ろうとも、@私とあれの物語は、誰にも汚せぬ。何の意味も持たぬ！@　蔵臼たちがどう曲解しようとも、痛くも痒くもないわッ。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500021.ogg":^"But that is none of your business.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500022.ogg":^  Beatrice is mine alone.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500023.ogg":^  No matter what other people say,^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500024.ogg":^ no one can defile our tale.  What they say is of no consequence!^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500025.ogg":^  No matter how Krauss and the others misconstrue it, it will be neither painful nor vexing to me."^\

bg black,23
