langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500028.ogg":^"Boy,^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500029.ogg":^ what do you know of Beatrice?^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500030.ogg":^  A truly ignorant person wouldn't even be interested in learning more.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500031.ogg":^  The mere fact that you know Beatrice's name shows that you are neither ignorant nor unconnected."^\

