langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400380.ogg":^"Good point.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400381.ogg":^  ...The Beatrice I know of...^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400382.ogg":^is the woman you loved, the one you met before the mansion on Rokkenjima was even built.^@/
