langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400395.ogg":^"Reincarnation.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400396.ogg":^  You didn't think of your daughter as a child Beatrice left behind.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400397.ogg":^  You believed that the dead Beatrice had revived into a new body.^@/

