;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400410.ogg":^"However, it wouldn't be strange if you slowly began to wonder whether that child, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400411.ogg":^whose blue eyes and beautiful blonde hair reminded you of a younger Beatrice,^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400412.ogg":^ might actually be Beatrice reborn."^\

