langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400413.ogg":^"Your daughter grew to be beautiful, and nearly identical to her mother.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400414.ogg":^  You must've been ecstatic.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400415.ogg":^  However, I doubt you'd be completely satisfied by that alone.^@/
