langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700004.ogg":^...But that isn't me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700005.ogg":^  I cannot use any magic.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700006.ogg":^  ...I simply have the soul of that witch sealed inside my body.'^\


