langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\71600014.ogg":^"......Willard-sama,^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\71600015B.ogg":^ thanks to powerful magical ceremonies, the Master gained a reborn child of the dead Beatrice-sama.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\71600016.ogg":^  That cannot be denied."^\


