;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400427B.ogg":^"I won't deny the stork.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400428.ogg":^  And I don't intend to doubt the depths of Kinzo's love for this woman called Beatrice.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400429.ogg":^  ...How a man shows his affection for a child who's the only living reminder of her mother is no one's business.^\:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400430.ogg":^  If she grew to look more and more like Beatrice, and Kinzo's love gave rise to a new, special emotion,^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400431.ogg":^ I find that a very human reaction."^\


