bgm1 82


me1v 5,50
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　第二次世界大戦。@太平洋戦争。@
langen^World War II.^@^  The Pacific War.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　日本は東西に戦線を広げ過ぎ、その風向きは変わりつつあった。\
langen^Japan had extended their war fronts too far to the East and West, and the tide of war was changing.^\

bg black,22
mono 0

bg new_oda_r1a,6
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　私は長老たちの働き掛けにより、徴兵が免除されていた。@
langen^Thanks to the influence of the elders, I was able to avoid conscription.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……もちろん慈悲ではない。@
langjp　彼らの大切なお人形だからだ。\
langen^...Of course, this was not out of compassion for me.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^It was because I was their precious puppet.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　だから戦争を、それほど身近に感じていなかった。@
langjp　しかし、私が自らそれを返上したいと望めば、それはとても容易い。\
langen^So, the war never really felt that close to me.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^However, when I personally decided to abandon their protection, it was very easy.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　その頃には、右代宮家は完全に没落しかかっており、@長老たちは、自分たちの寿命分程度には財産をくすねられたようで、@もはや用済みの私が何をしようと、関心はないようだった。\
langen^At that time, the Ushiromiya family had almost completely collapsed,^@^ and since the elders had apparently gathered enough of the scraps to last them the rest of their lives,^@^ they seemed to care little for what I did, now that they no longer had any use for me.^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　だから私は、ようやく、死ねる時を得たのだと悟った。@
langen^So, I realized that I had finally found my time to die.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　私は自らを吊っていた糸を、/
langjp!d400一本一本、/
langjp!d400切り落とし、@……死ねる場所を探し始めた。\
langen^One by one, ^@/
advsetwindow "-1"
langen!d400^I cut the threads I was hanging from, ^@/
advsetwindow "-1"
langen!d400^...and began to search for a place to end my life.^\


mono off
bg new_different_space_2b,6
_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime2.png",24
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「戦地で死を、求めようとしたのか。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400473.ogg":^"So, you searched for death on the battlefield?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_nayamu1.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「……同じ死ぬなら、御国の役に立つべきと思った。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600041.ogg":^"...I thought that if I was going to die anyway, I should try to be of some use to my country.^@/
advsetwindow "01"

;ld l,KI2_AseruA1,80

langjp……いや、違うな。@私には自らの命を絶つ気力さえなかったのだろう。@もっともらしく死ねる理由が、戦争だったのだ。」\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600042.ogg":^  ...No, that's a lie.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600043.ogg":^  I probably just lacked the willpower to end my own life.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600044.ogg":^  War was a suitable excuse for death."^\

bg new_different_space_2a,23
_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_def3.png",23
advsetwindow "53"


langjp「お祖父さまは土木・建築の知識がありましたので、@海軍設営隊にて、施設造成などに従事されたと聞いています。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300208.ogg":^"I heard that Grandfather had knowledge necessary for public works projects and construction, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300209.ogg":^so he was tasked with setting up facilities for the Navy construction team."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_nayamu3.png",24
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「ふっ、とんだ誤算よ。@何の取り得もないと言っておけば、すぐにも死ねる最前線へ送られたものを…。」@
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600045.ogg":^"Hmph, and what a foolish mistake that was.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600046.ogg":^  If only I had just said that I had no useful skills, I could have been sent to the dangerous front lines right away..."^\

cl l,24
_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「最前線に行かずに済んだのか。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400474.ogg":^"So, you didn't need to go to the front lines?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_nayamu4.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「幸いと喜ぶ仲間もいたよ。@私には逆だった。@御国のために戦って死ぬという、出来すぎた美酒のヤケ酒が欲しかっただけなのだ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600047.ogg":^"Some of the others were overjoyed at their luck.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600048.ogg":^  It was the opposite for me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600049.ogg":^  I had only wanted to get drunk on the liquor known as dying for the sake of one's country.^@/
advsetwindow "01"

;ld r,KI2_NiramuA2,80

langjp……忘れられた島の上空を、米軍の編隊は横切っていくだけ。@……彼らは私のために、爆弾一つどころか、鉛弾の一つさえ恵んではくれなかったのだよ。」\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600050.ogg":^  ...The US planes did nothing but cut across the skies of that forgotten island.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600051.ogg":^  ...They didn't have even a bullet to spare for me, much less a bomb."^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_majime1.png",24
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「お祖父さまは、その日々の中で、ベアトリーチェにお会いになられたのですか……？」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300210.ogg":^"Is this the time you met Beatrice, Grandfather...?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_futeki3.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「そうだ。@あれは、海からやってきた……。」\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600052.ogg":^"Correct.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600053.ogg":^  She came to me from the sea..."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「どこで会った。@島と言ったが。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400475.ogg":^"Where did you meet her?^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400476.ogg":^  You mentioned an island."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_futeki1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「ここだよ。@この島に、やって来たのだ。」\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600054.ogg":^"Yes.  This island.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600055.ogg":^  That's where she arrived."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime2.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「……お前たちは、六軒島で出会っていたというのか。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400477.ogg":^"...So, you met here, on Rokkenjima?"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「どういうことですか…。@……お祖父さまが六軒島を買い取るまでは、無人島だったと聞いています。@この島に日本軍の基地があったなどとは、初耳です。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300211.ogg":^"What's going on...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300212.ogg":^  ...I heard that Rokkenjima was uninhabited until you bought it, Grandfather.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300213.ogg":^  I never knew there was a Japanese military base here."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_futeki4.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「ふっ、はっはっはっはっははは……。@そうだな、あんなものは基地とは呼ばぬ。@ただの岩窟よ。@私は、その岩窟の番人だったのだ。」\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600056.ogg":^"Pft, hahahahahahahaha...^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600057.ogg":^  Ah, yes, you could hardly call that a military base.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600058.ogg":^  It was just a cave.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600059.ogg":^  I was one of the guards of that cave."^\

