;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600064.ogg":^"Establishment?^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600065.ogg":^  Certainly, if you can call digging out a cave `establishment'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600066.ogg":^  Not only that, the base was abandoned before its completion."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_majime1.png",24
