langen^Could the fact that it was a hidden base actually have sealed our fate?^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　何の役にも立たない無用の岩窟は、もはや上層部にも完全に忘れ去られていたのだ。@
langen^The higher-ups had already completely forgotten about this useless and pointless cavern.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　私たちはただ、岩窟の番人をするだけで、何も命じられることはなかった。\
langen^We were nothing more than guards for a mere cave.^\

;bg black,22

me1v 2,50

bg new_hill_1bf,2
