langjp　上空を横断する米軍の編隊を眺めながら、@毎日、畑作と釣り、土いじりで過ごした。@
langen^We spent our days farming, fishing, and playing with the dirt,^@^ all the while gazing up at the American formations flying past.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……ある者は、このまま自分たちは忘れ去られて、@一度も実戦を経験することなく終戦を迎えられるだろうと安堵していた。\
langen^...Some of our group were relieved at the prospects of the war ending before anyone remembered we were here...^@^ and before any of us had to face a real battle.^\

bg new_sea_3af,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　無論、私は逆だった。@
langjp　早く米軍が押し寄せてきて、私を殺してほしいと願っていた。@
langen^Of course, it was the opposite for me.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^I hoped and hoped for the American troops to advance and kill me as soon as possible.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そんな、虚ろな日々のことだった。\
langen^Those days were empty and blank.^\
