langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700045.ogg":^"<Forgive me, Kinzo.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700046.ogg":^  I didn't stop to consider why a high-class person like you ^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700047.ogg":^would choose to take the position of a common soldier.>"^\

