langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600125_A.ogg":^"<I...don't give a damn about my family line.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600125_B.ogg":^  When I die, the name Ushiromiya will have no hold on me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600125_C.ogg":^  Then, I'll finally be free.>"^\

