langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700055.ogg":^"<Kinzo,^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700056.ogg":^ you may be a foreigner I met in a distant land,^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700057.ogg":^ ...but I can tell that your heart is sensitive and beautiful.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700058.ogg":^  If we had grown up in the same neighborhood, I'm sure we would've become fast friends.^@/

