langjp「その潜水艦基地の名残とやらは、今も残っているのか。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400488.ogg":^"Is there anything left of that submarine base today?"^\
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「九羽鳥庵の近くに、今も残っている。@外界からは見えぬ入り江の影だ。@不吉がって漁師たちも近寄らなかった島だ。@私以外に知る者はもはやいるまい。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500113.ogg":^"Yes, it's still there, near Kuwadorian.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500114.ogg":^  It's in the shadows of a cove that can't be seen from the outside.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500115.ogg":^  After all, fishermen never approach this supposedly ill-omened island.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500116.ogg":^  It's unlikely that anyone besides me still knows of its existence."^\

;bg black,22
