advsetwindow "54"

langjp「九羽鳥庵と屋敷を結ぶ、２ｋｍにも及ぶ地下道は、その基地の名残なのか。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400489.ogg":^"Is the two-kilometer-long underground passage between Kuwadorian and the mansion a remnant of that base?"^\
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「そうだ。@鍾乳洞を改造した広大な地下壕で地下を網羅し、@島内各地を要塞化する、……などという寝言の残骸だ。@私はその地下道を生かし、島の両端に二つの屋敷を作らせたのだ。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500117.ogg":^"That is correct.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500118.ogg":^  There was some nonsense about fortifying several locations across the island and connecting them with tunnels carved out of limestone caverns.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500119.ogg":^  I made use of that underground passage and built two mansions, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500120.ogg":^one at each end of the island."^\

