langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500121.ogg":^"......Correct.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500122.ogg":^  ...It was something I needed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500123.ogg":^  ...Another place for me to escape from the cursed name of Ushiromiya."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",23
