advsetwindow "01"

langjp『しかし、同情するよ。@遥々、日本までやって来て、任務を成し遂げられなかったとは、気の毒の限りだ。』\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600133.ogg":^"<Still, I do feel bad for you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600134.ogg":^  It must be awful to have come all the way out here and be unable to fulfill your mission.>"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_c11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp『パパの任務が何だったか、よくわからないわ。@どこか遠くへ逃げ、大切な日まで“それ”を隠さなければならないと言っていた。』@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700069.ogg":^"<I don't really know what Papa's plan was.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700070.ogg":^  He said we needed to run far away to hide `it' until the time came.>"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_oya1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp『“それ”とは？』\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600135.ogg":^"<And what is `it'?>"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_c11_fuman3.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp『わからないわ。@……“それ”はとても大切なもので、@大切な日まで、何年も隠しているつもりだったみたい。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700071.ogg":^"<I don't know.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700072.ogg":^  ...`It' was something very important, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700073.ogg":^and he planned to hide it for many years until the right moment.^@/
advsetwindow "27"


langjpいえ、それと一緒に隠れているつもりだったみたい。@私に、異国の地で長い時間を過ごすことになるかもしれないと謝っていたから。』\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700074.ogg":^  Oh, and he planned to hide himself along with it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700075.ogg":^  I know because he apologized to me for sending us to live a long time on foreign soil.>"^\

bg new_sky_1a,22
advsetwindow "01"

langjp『アンジェロ少尉は、積荷は特になく、@君の父上が輸送すべき要人だったと言っていたが？』@
;＜若金蔵
langjp『少尉はあなたたちを信用してないわ。@私でさえ知っていることを、いくつも隠してる。@……ひょっとすると少尉は、パパの目的と積荷を知っているのかも。』\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600136.ogg":^"<Didn't that second lieutenant of yours say that you had no cargo in particular,^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600137.ogg":^ and that you were transporting your father instead?>"^\
advsetwindow "27"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700076.ogg":^"<Lieutenant Angelo doesn't trust you or the others.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700077.ogg":^  Even I know a few things he's kept hidden from you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700078.ogg":^  ...He might even know what Papa's goal was...and what the cargo is.>"^\
advsetwindow "01"

langjp『それが何だったにせよ、それはイタリア軍の任務さ。@俺らには関係ないね。@むしろ、同盟国なんだ。@頼ってくれればいいのに。』\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600138.ogg":^"<Whatever it is, that's a mission for the Italian military.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600139.ogg":^  It has nothing to do with us.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600140.ogg":^  After all, we're allies.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600141.ogg":^  We should be able to trust each other.>"^\
advsetwindow "27"

langjp『金蔵が良い人であることは疑わないわ。@少尉にも、あなたは信頼できる人間だと伝えてるんだけれど。@……どうして男というのは、異郷ではむやみやたらと厳格になるの？@　普段はみんな、もっと陽気な人たちばかりなのに。@ここへ来てからみんな、妙に空気が張り詰めているわ。@……少尉は部下たち全員に常時、銃を手放さないように命じてる。@まるでここが敵地かのようだわ。』\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700079.ogg":^"<I have no doubts that you're a good person, Kinzo.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700080.ogg":^  I even told Lieutenant Angelo that you're a man we can trust, but...^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700081.ogg":^  ...Why is it that men always get so rigid and uptight when they're in a strange land?^\:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700082.ogg":^  Normally, they're all very bright and cheery people.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700083.ogg":^  Ever since we came here, there's been this strange feeling of tension.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700084.ogg":^  ...Lieutenant Angelo has ordered that his subordinates be armed at all times.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700085.ogg":^  It's almost as though we're in enemy territory.>"^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　それは事実だった。@
langjp　イタリア人たちは皆、リラックスしているようには到底見えなかった。@
langen^That was true.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^The Italians were clearly the very opposite of relaxed.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　日本人たちはそれを見て、彼らが自分たちのことを信用していないのではと訝しがっていた。\
langen^The Japanese soldiers, watching this, began to suspect that the Italians didn't really trust them at all.^\

bg new_hill_1bf,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_oya1.png",22
_ld c,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_futeki4.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp『軍人ならおかしいことじゃないさ。@むしろ、こういう時こそ規律を引締めて、友軍に恥ずかしいところを見せたくないんじゃないか。』\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600142.ogg":^"<That's normal for a soldier.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600143.ogg":^  This is precisely the time for them to straighten up their guard, so they don't embarrass themselves in front of a friendly army.>"^\

bg new_hill_1af,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_c11_fukigen3.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp『就寝時には必ず不寝番を立てるし、@もう航行できないスクラップ同然の潜水艦に、今もあなたたちを近付けないように見張りを立てているわ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700086.ogg":^"<They have a person stand watch every time they sleep,^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700087.ogg":^ and they're still keeping a lookout to make sure none of you approach the submarine, even though it's nothing more than an unusable scrap heap now.^@/
advsetwindow "27"


langjp私は何だか、日本人を露骨に毛嫌いしているように見えて、気持ちが悪い。』\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700088.ogg":^  It almost feels as though they're clearly prejudiced against the Japanese, and that bothers me.>"^\

mbg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　確かに、彼らは潜水艦に常に歩哨を立て、日本人の接近を一切、許さなかった。@
langjp　そのことは、日本人たちの間でも不快に思われていた。@
langen^True, they had set up a constant sentry by the submarine and had refused to let any of the Japanese soldiers come near.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^This hadn't made the Japanese particularly happy.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……しかし、潜水艦はどこの国でも機密扱いだ。@
langjp　濫りに外国人を近付けないのは、当然と言えば当然かもしれないが。\
langen^...However, submarines are treated as classified in all countries.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Maybe it was just natural for them to stop foreigners from approaching it without reason.^\

