advsetwindow "01"
langjp『慣れない生活を強いられて、みんな気が立ってるんだろう。@……天候とお上の都合で、君たちを本土へ運ぶ船の派遣がまた遅れてる。@君たちをいつ、本土へ送ってあげられるやら…。』\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600144.ogg":^"<They're probably uncomfortable with being made to live in a way they aren't used to.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600145.ogg":^  ...The boat that's supposed to take you back to the mainland is still being delayed by weather and problems up the command chain.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600146.ogg":^  Just how long will it take before they can send you there...>"^\

bg black,22

me2v 3,50

bg new_sea_3af,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　本土の方から直接、迎えの船が来ることになっているのだが、@天候とお上の都合、あと、先日の空襲の影響があるようで、@こんな忘れられた島に船を送る余裕がないようだった。\
langen^We had been told that a boat was being sent for them directly from the mainland,^@^ but apparently, thanks to the weather, problems up the command chain, and the recent air raids,^@^ they had no ships they could spare on a forgotten island like this.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　ひょっとすると、外交上のトラブルもあるのかもしれない。@
langen^There may have been political issues as well.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……何しろ、彼女らの母国はすでに、連合国に降伏しているのだから。\
langen^...After all, the Italians' homeland had already surrendered to the Allies.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　……細かい事情はわからない。@
langen^...I didn't know the details.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　確実にわかるのは、@彼女らが六軒島にやって来てから２週間も足止めされ、未だに迎えが来ないことだけだ。\
langen^The only thing I knew for sure was that they'd been stuck on Rokkenjima for two whole weeks, and no one had come to get them.^\

bg black,22
bg new_sea_1bf,22
advsetwindow "-1"
langjp　もちろん、六軒島にも小船はある。@
langjp　近くの島に彼らを運べないわけじゃない。@
langen^Of course, we had some small boats on Rokkenjima.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^There was nothing physically stopping us from taking them to a nearby island.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　しかし、六軒島は秘密基地という建前があり、島外との接触は厳しく禁じられていた…。\
langen^Still, Rokkenjima was technically a top-secret base, and contact with the outside world had been strictly forbidden...^\

