langjp『……アンジェロ少尉だよ。@君に用事みたいだ。』@
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600148.ogg":^"<...It's Lieutenant Angelo.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600149.ogg":^  Looks like he wants you for something.>"^\

