advsetwindow "27"

langjp『またお小言かしら。@日本人とあまり親しくするなと、最近うるさいのよ。』\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700091.ogg":^"<Probably to scold me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700092.ogg":^  These days, he keeps yapping on about how I shouldn't get too friendly with the Japanese soldiers.>"^\

