advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　少尉はやって来ると、金蔵に敬礼し、@通訳を求めるようにベアトリーチェの方をちらりと見てから、イタリア語を話し始める。@
langen^The second lieutenant approached, saluting Kinzo,^@^ and after glancing at Beatrice as though asking her to translate something, he began to speak in Italian.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　口調からして、どうやらかなり真剣な話のようだった。\
langen^Judging by his tone, it sounded like something serious.^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_c11_majime4.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp『……少尉は、とても重要な話があるから、あなたたちの指揮官に会わせてほしいと言ってるわ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700093.ogg":^"<...Lieutenant Angelo has something very important to say, so he wants to talk with your commanding officer.^@/
advsetwindow "27"


langjp……協力を求めたいと言っている。@何のことかわからないわ。』@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700094.ogg":^  ...He wants your help with something.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700095.ogg":^  I don't know what.>"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_komaru2.png",24
advsetwindow "01"

langjp『重要な話…？@　わかった。@山本中尉を探そう。』\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600150.ogg":^"<Something important...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600151.ogg":^  Got it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600152.ogg":^  I'll go find Lieutenant Yamamoto.>"^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　アンジェロ少尉は、２名の下士官を引き連れて、かなりの真剣な表情を浮かべていた。@
langjp　彼らが重要な話を口にせずとも、それをうかがうことが出来た……。\
langen^Lieutenant Angelo had two of his subordinates with him and wore a stern expression on his face.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^They didn't have to say anything...for us to realize that this had to be something very serious...^\

