advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　それは、黄金のインゴットの山だった。\
langen^It was...a mountain of gold ingots.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　緻密に積み上げられたそれが、ゆっくりと、次々と、貨物倉から引き上げられて行く……。@
langen^Those carefully-piled bars were being slowly lifted out of the cargo hold, one group after another...^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　この黄金こそが、彼らの本当の積荷だったのだ。\
langen^This gold had been their true cargo.^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　彼らがそれを、どこへ運び込もうとしていたのかはわからない。@
langen^I don't know where they were planning to take it.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　同盟国の日本へ運び込もうとしたのかもしれないし、@……あるいはどこかの辺境へ、それを隠しに行く途中だったのかもしれない。\
langen^They might've been trying to sneak it into Japan, one of their allies,^@^ ...or they might've been on their way to hide it in some remote area.^\

bg new_submarine_o1a,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　何かの作戦？@　陰謀？　横領？@　極秘輸送？@
langjp　あまりの桁違いの黄金に、あらゆる邪推が交錯するが、真実など何もわかりはしない。@
langen^Was it some sort of strategy?^@^  A conspiracy?  Embezzlement?^@^  Top-secret transportation of wealth?^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^This incomprehensible amount of gold led to all sorts of dark suspicions, but we didn't know anything about the truth.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　その莫大な黄金の総量は、１０ｔ。@
langjp　それだけが、今、理解できる唯一の真実だった……。\
langen^All told, the gold weighed an incredible 10 tons.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^That was the only truth we could wrap our minds around at the moment...^\

bg black,22

fede 12,1000
E_M2
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　彼らはそれを極力、我々には見せたくないようだった。@
langjp　しかし、潜水艦が航行不能に陥り、さらに浸水も続いていたらしい。\
langen^They had strongly resisted showing this to us.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^However, the submarine could no longer make sea, and it was apparently continuing to take in water bit by bit.^\

bg new_sub_p3c,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　六軒島の設備は極めて未熟な状態で放置されており、修理能力はまったくない。@
langen^Rokkenjima had been outfitted in an extremely slipshod way, so we had no means of repairing it.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　また、荷揚げは出来ても、沈没して着底した潜水艦を引き上げることなど到底出来ない。\
langen^Also, though we could unload the sub, there was no way we'd be able to lift it up again once it had filled with water and sunk to the bottom.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　このままでは黄金が完全に輸送不能になってしまうことが明白となり、@…………彼らは荷揚げする決断をしたらしい。@
langen^Now that transporting the gold away had clearly become an impossible goal,^@^ ...they had apparently decided on unloading it.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　もちろん彼らは、この黄金が何であるかは一切説明しない。@
langjp　ただ、荷揚げしてほしいと依頼してきただけだ……。\
langen^Of course, they made no effort to explain the reason behind all this gold.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^They just asked us to help them take it out...^\

bg black,22
bg new_sub_p2a,26
_ld r,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_niramu2.png",24
advsetwindow "01"

langjp『なぜ、こんな大量の黄金を国外へ…？@　これだけあれば、イタリアの戦局を変えられたかもしれないのに…？』\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600155.ogg":^"<Why would they take so much gold out of the country...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600156.ogg":^  Couldn't they have changed the course of the war with this much wealth...?>"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_c11_majime4.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp『……戦局を変えるのは武器よ。@でも戦後は何の役にも立たないわ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700098.ogg":^"<...Weapons change the course of war,^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700099.ogg":^ but after the war, they aren't useful for anything.^@/
advsetwindow "27"


langjp……確かにお金も戦局を変えはするでしょうよ。@でも、戦後にもその価値は、変わらないわ。』\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700100.ogg":^  ...Money can also change the course,^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700101.ogg":^ but it remains just as valuable after the war.>"^\

bg new_gold3,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　もう戦局は覆らない。@
langjp　枢軸国は全て降伏し、連合国の勝利に終わるだろう。@
langen^There's no longer any way to change the course of this war.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^The Axis powers will probably all surrender, leading to an Allied victory.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　それは連日、空を往復する米軍機の群を見て誰もが知っている。\
langen^Anyone could tell that simply by looking at the American planes flying across the sky day after day.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　しかし、戦争が終わっても、黄金の価値は、変わらない。@
langen^However, gold does not lose its value after war.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp!s0　誰もがウィンチに吊り上げられる、/
langjp!d900黄金の鈍い輝きを……、/
langjp!d1000呆然と見上げていた……。/
langen!s0^Everyone stared upwards, dumbfounded,^@/
advsetwindow "-1"
langen!d900^ ...as the winch slowly lifted the dully sparkling gold...^@/
langjp!sd\
langen!sd\


