advsetwindow "01"

langjp「中尉。@イタリア人たちは、この黄金のことを、本土へ報告しないことを望んでいます。」@
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600157.ogg":^"Lieutenant Yamamoto,^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600158.ogg":^ the Italians don't want us to tell the mainland about this gold."^\
advsetwindow "-1"


langjp「………ふふん。@我が国に横領されたくないからであろうな。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700020.ogg":^"...Heheh.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700021.ogg":^  So, they don't want our country to snatch it away from them."^\

bg black,23
bg new_sub_r2a,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_c11_fukigen3.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp『彼は何と？』\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700102.ogg":^"<What did he say?>"^\

;ld l,KI2_DefA1,23
;cl a,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_komaru2.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp『日本が黄金を横領するのを恐れているから、報告されたくないのだろうと言っている。』\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600159.ogg":^"<He's saying your group probably doesn't want it reported...because you fear that Japan will steal it away from you.>"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_c11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp『少尉はむしろ、イタリア本国に知られることを恐れているわ。@私たちにとって、今の祖国は連合国の傀儡政権。@彼らに知られれば、黄金は返還することになる。@しかしそれは、私たちの敵に黄金を渡すようなもの。』\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700103.ogg":^"<Lieutenant Angelo is actually more afraid of Italy itself finding out.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700104.ogg":^  To us, our homeland's current government is a mere puppet set up by the Allied Forces.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700105.ogg":^  If they find out, the gold will be returned to them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700106.ogg":^  However, that would be the same as handing the gold over to our enemies.>"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　敵の手に黄金を渡さないために、彼らはここまでやって来たのだ。@
langen^They'd come all this way to make sure that the gold didn't fall into enemy hands.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　彼らの真の祖国が復興する日まで、@この黄金を傀儡の祖国の手から、彼らは隠さなくてはならない…。\
langen^They needed to hide it from that puppet government until their homeland could be truly restored...^\

bg black,23
bg new_sub_r2a,23
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「右代宮。@イタリア人たちに提案せよ。@我々は協力を申し出たいとな。」@
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700022.ogg":^"Ushiromiya,^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700023.ogg":^ make a proposal to the Italians.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700024.ogg":^  Tell them that we wish to offer our assistance."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_nayamu4.png",24
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「協力とは…？」\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600160.ogg":^"What sort of assistance...?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「イタリア人たちの言い分はこうであろう？@　彼らはその黄金を、祖国に知られることなく隠したいわけだ。@しかし、この島から運び出そうとすれば、輸送船を手配せねばならなくなる。@そうすれば、本土に知られ、さらにはイタリア本国にも知られることとなる。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700025.ogg":^"Let's see if I've got this straight.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700026.ogg":^  They want that gold kept secret, so their homeland doesn't find out about it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700027.ogg":^  But they'll need to find at least a transport ship if they plan to carry it off this island.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700028.ogg":^  If they try that though, the mainland will hear about it, which means the Italian government will too."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「そうなります。@……つまり、あの黄金は、もう六軒島からは運び出せない。」\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600161.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600162.ogg":^  ...In other words, there's no longer any way to take that gold off Rokkenjima."^\

bg black,22
bg new_gold3,8
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　彼らの任務は恐らく、祖国再興の日まで、あの黄金を極秘の場所に隠すことだったに違いない。@
langen^Their mission must have been to hide the gold in absolute secrecy until the day of their homeland's restoration.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　ナチスドイツも、降伏直前にその隠し財産を、南米などの某所に極秘で運搬して隠した、@などという噂がまことしやかに流れる。@それは妥当な想像だった。\
langen^Later on, several plausible rumors would circulate about how Nazi Germany also moved much of its secret wealth to certain hidden areas in South America just prior to its collapse.^@^  It was a very natural conclusion to reach.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　唯一の極秘輸送手段であった潜水艦は完全に航行不能で、@浸水は止められず、近い内に完全に沈没するだろう。@
langen^That submarine was their only method of transporting the gold in secrecy, and it's become completely useless.^@^  They can't fully stop the water from seeping in, and it'll probably sink completely before much longer.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　黄金を極秘に輸送する手段は、もはや存在しないのだ。\
langen^There's no longer any way for them to transport the gold in secrecy.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　それはつまり、彼らの任務がこの極東の地で、失敗に終わったことを示していた。@
langen^In other words, their mission has ended in failure here in the Far East.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　その上で、山本中尉は何の協力を申し出ようと言うのか……。\
langen^So, just how is Lieutenant Yamamoto proposing that we assist them...?^\

bg black,22

fede 0,1000
E_A



bg new_sub_r2a,22

bgm1 36
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「この六軒島基地は、誰も知らぬ秘密基地だ。@近隣の島民たちは、この島を不吉な無人島と信じて近寄りもしない。@……言っている意味がわかるか、右代宮。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700029.ogg":^"The Rokkenjima base is top-secret, and no one knows about it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700030.ogg":^  The islanders in the surrounding area think this island's ill-omened and deserted, so they never come near it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700031.ogg":^  ...Catch my drift, Ushiromiya?"^\

bg new_sub_r2a,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_c11_fukigen3.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp『彼は何と？』\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700107.ogg":^"<What did he say?>"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_oya1.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp『前にも話した通り、この六軒島基地は誰にも知られていない。@見ての通り、戦略価値は何もなく、上層部にもすでに忘れられてる。@……中尉は、この島に黄金を隠してはどうかと提案したいみたいだ。』\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600163.ogg":^"<As we told you earlier, no one knows about this base.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600164.ogg":^  And, as you can see, it's of no use strategically, so the higher-ups have already forgotten about it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600165.ogg":^  ...It sounds like Lieutenant Yamamoto's suggesting that you hide the gold on this island.>"^\

cl r,23
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　ベアトリーチェはすぐにそれを翻訳し、アンジェロ少尉に伝える。@
langjp　少尉は下士官たちと早口に議論を始める。\
langen^Beatrice quickly translated this and told Lieutenant Angelo.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^He began discussing something rapidly with his subordinates.^\

bg black,24
bg new_sub_r2a,2
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　表情は苦々しい。@
langen^They didn't look happy.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　同盟国とはいえ、祖国再建の大切な黄金を、東洋人の手に委ねたくはないのだろう。@
langen^Japan may have been their ally, but they probably didn't want to leave the gold for reconstructing their motherland in Asian hands.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　しかし、選択の余地が残されているとは思えない。\
langen^Still, it was hard to imagine any other option for them.^\

bg new_sub_r2a,0
bg new_sub_r2a,23
_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_c11_majime2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp『……激しく議論しているわ。@他に手はないと言う者もいるし、それでも祖国に忠誠を尽くすべきだと言う者もいる。@……少尉は板挟みになってるわ。』\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700108.ogg":^"<...It's a fierce debate.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700109.ogg":^  Some say that there's no other option, while others think we should remain loyal to our homeland no matter the cost.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700110.ogg":^  ...Lieutenant Angelo is stuck between a rock and a hard place.>"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　黄金隠匿は、滅んだ祖国の最後の命令だ。@
langjp　しかしその命令はもはや遂行不能だ。@
langen^The final order given to them by their fallen homeland was to hide the gold.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^However, by now, there was no way for that order to be carried out successfully.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　本土や祖国に知られれば、彼らの望まぬ人間たちに接収されることになる。\
langen^If the mainland or their own homeland found out, the gold would probably be confiscated by the wrong people, from their point of view.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

