langjp『………考える時間がほしいと言ってるわ。@私はあなたと話せたから、気が紛れて良かったけれど、他の人たちはそうじゃないの。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700131.ogg":^"<...They're saying they want some time to think.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700132.ogg":^  I had you to talk to, so I was able to distract myself from our current situation, but that wasn't true for the rest of them.^\/
advsetwindow "27"


langjp……とても長い航海の果てに、大勢の仲間を失って、極限状態でここにいるわ。@唯一の心の拠り所だった任務ももはや喪失してる。@どうすればいいのか、彼らもわかってないの…。』\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700133.ogg":^  ...They lost a lot of comrades at the end of a very long journey, and now they're here, and in a tight spot.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700134.ogg":^  They've even lost their mission, the one thing they could depend on to guide them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700135.ogg":^  They don't know what to do...>"^\

bg new_sub_R2a,23
_ld l,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_nayamu1.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「中尉。@……彼らは時間が欲しいと言っています。」\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600182.ogg":^"Sir,^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600183.ogg":^ ...they say they'd like some time."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「くっくっく、いいとも、大いに議論したらいい。@しかし時間はないぞ。@隠すとなったら、時間と手間がかかる。@……明日の正午までに結論しろ。@以上だ、イタリア人ども！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700062.ogg":^"Heheh, sure, let 'em talk it over all they want.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700063.ogg":^  But they'd better not take too long.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700064.ogg":^  If we're gonna hide the gold, that'll take time and effort.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700065.ogg":^  ...Make your decision before noon tomorrow.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75700066.ogg":^  That's all, Italians!"^\

