advsetwindow "53"


langjp「……イタリア人たちの胸中は、複雑でしょうね。」@
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300234.ogg":^"...I imagine the Italians had some complicated feelings about all this."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_niramu1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「彼らにとって、降伏後のイタリアは敵国同然だろう。@黄金をそのイタリアに返還するのは、彼らの長い旅路を全て否定するのと同じだ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400491.ogg":^"In their eyes, the Italy that surrendered was probably little better than an enemy country.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400492.ogg":^  Letting the gold go back there would make their entire voyage meaningless."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「しかし、@黄金を着服して山分けすることも、彼らの旅路の否定になります…。」@
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300235.ogg":^"However, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300236.ogg":^embezzling and divvying up the gold would also make their whole voyage meaningless..."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「彼らが義理立てすべき祖国はすでに滅んでる。@その時点で、彼らの旅路の意味など、もう失われてる。@気の毒な話だ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400493.ogg":^"The country they felt obligated to serve had already fallen.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400494.ogg":^  That alone destroyed the significance of their journey.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400495.ogg":^  Not a happy story for them."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_komaru1a.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「……どうせ意味のないことなら、@インゴットの１本でもありつけた方が、まだマシだと？」@
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300237.ogg":^"...If it's bound to be meaningless anyway,^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300238.ogg":^ wouldn't keeping hold of even just a few ingots be better than nothing?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「損得勘定で言えばそうなる。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400496.ogg":^"Sure, if you want to calculate straight-up profit and loss.^@/
advsetwindow "54"

;ld r,WIL_FumanA1,80

langjp…………そうならねぇのが、男ってもんだがな。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400497.ogg":^  ......But men aren't like that."^\

