;■どこかの狭い部屋
langjp　狭い部屋にイタリア人たちが集まり、激論を交わしていた。\
langen^The Italians were gathered in a cramped room, arguing fiercely.^\

me2v 11,90

bg new_sub_R3b,24
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp“反対です！@　死んだ戦友たちのためにも、断固、軍人魂を貫くべきです！”@
langjp“貫くとはどういうことか。@この島に黄金を隠せということか。@東洋人たちの申し出を受けろということか！”@
langjp“東洋人たちは信用できません！@　特にあのヤマモトという男！@　断じて油断できません！”\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITHEA7001.ogg":^`I don't like it!^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITHEA7002.ogg":^  We must remain true to our soldier spirit until the end, for the sake of our fallen comrades!'^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\75800003.ogg":^`And how do you define `remaining true'?^\:dwave 0, "voice\99\75800004.ogg":^  By hiding the gold on this island?^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75800005.ogg":^  By accepting the proposal of those Asians?!'^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITHEA7003.ogg":^`We can't trust them!^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITHEA7004.ogg":^  Especially that Yamamoto person!^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITHEA7005.ogg":^  We mustn't let our guards down!'^\

bg new_sub_r3b,23
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp“黄金を荷揚げして日本人たちに見られたのはやはり失敗でした！@　艦と共に沈めるべきでした！”@
langjp“日本人の基地で沈めてどうする？！@　やがていつかは引き上げられる。@隠したことにはならない！”@
langjp“いずれにせよ、この島から黄金を誰にも知られずに運び出す方法はない。”\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITHEB7001.ogg":^`Unloading the gold and letting the Japanese see it was a huge mistake!^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITHEB7002.ogg":^  We should've let it sink with the sub!'^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\75800006.ogg":^`Oh, wonderful idea, let's just sink it right inside a Japanese base!^\:dwave 0, "voice\99\75800007.ogg":^  It would've been pulled up eventually.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75800008.ogg":^  That wouldn't hide anything!'^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\75800009.ogg":^`It doesn't matter.  There's no way to get the gold off this island without anyone knowing.'^\

bg new_sub_r2d,25
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp“洋上で名誉ある自沈を選んでいたらこんなことには…！！”@
langjp“艦のダメージが致命的だったことが、あの時点でわかっていたら……。”@
langjp“どうしてあの時、少佐は日本軍に救援要請を？@　日本軍にこの黄金のことを知られたら、少佐はどう任務を遂行するつもりだったんだ？”\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITHEB7003.ogg":^`If we had just taken the honorable path and scuttled the sub, none of this would've happened...!!'^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITHEA7006.ogg":^`If we had known then that the sub would be broken beyond repair...'^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITHEA7007.ogg":^`Why did the lieutenant commander contact the Japanese military and ask for help?^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITHEA7008.ogg":^  How was he planning to carry out our mission if they found out about the gold?'^\

bg new_sub_r3b,24
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp“少佐が救援要請を出した時点で、我々の任務はもう、失敗していたんだ！”@
langjp“諸君にも、祖国で待つ家族がいるはずだ。@そして極東の島国まで、よく航海に耐えた。@それに対する、これは正当な報酬なのだという、考え方もあるっ。”\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\75800010.ogg":^`Our mission was a failure from the moment he asked them for help!'^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\75800011.ogg":^`All of us have families waiting for us back home.^\:dwave 0, "voice\99\75800012.ogg":^  And we've more than done our part, I'd say, voyaging all the way to this island country in the Far East.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75800013.ogg":^  You might call this fair and just payment for our services.'^\

;bg sub_R2d,25

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp“ざわざわざわ！@　ざわざわざわざわ！！”\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\00\awase7001.ogg":^`*chatter*chatter*!^@:dwave 0, "voice\00\awase7002.ogg":^  *chatter*chatter*chatter*!!'^\

