langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7003.ogg":^`Lieutenant Angelo,^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7004.ogg":^ ...if the Japanese prove to be less than amicable, we need to be prepared to take extreme measures.'^\

