me1v 5,50

bg new_sub_r3b,26
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp“日本人たちは弛みきっています。@実戦経験もない、腰抜けばかりです。”@
langjp“我々は精兵です。@すでに基地内の間取りのほぼ全てと、日本人の人数、配置状況は把握しています。@少尉の命令があれば、短時間で制圧できるでしょう。”\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7005.ogg":^`The Japanese here are pushovers.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7006.ogg":^  They're all cowards with no battle experience.'^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7007.ogg":^`And we're the elite.^\:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7008.ogg":^  We know the layout of almost the entire base, along with the number of Japanese troops and how they're arranged.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7009.ogg":^  If Lieutenant Angelo gives the order, we should be able to subdue them quickly.'^\
advsetwindow "-1"


langjp“戦闘員と思わしきはヤマモトを含めて数人程度。@残りは軍属の作業員風情です。@上辺の人数は日本人が上ですが、実質兵力ではこちらが優位です。”@
langjp“日本人を殺せば、迎えの船が来た時、それをどう説明する？@　誤魔化しようがないぞ？！”\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7010.ogg":^`Only a few of them, Yamamoto included, look like fighters.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7011.ogg":^  The rest are just laborers attached to the military.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7012.ogg":^  It may look like they have the advantage of numbers, but we have the greater military force.'^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\75800015.ogg":^`If we kill the Japanese, what exactly are we gonna say when the boat comes to pick us up?^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\75800016.ogg":^  You really think that'll work?!'^\

me2v 17,50

bg new_sub_R3b,24
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp“死体さえ見つからなければ、どうとでも誤魔化せます。”@
langjp“少尉。@……この基地を制圧するのは容易です。@ヤマモト以下、主要な兵士数人を殺して見せれば、あっさりと作業員たちは降伏するでしょう。”\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7013.ogg":^`There should be plenty of ways to work it, as long as the corpses aren't found.'^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7014.ogg":^`Lieutenant Angelo,^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7015.ogg":^ ...it'll be easy to subdue this base.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7016.ogg":^  If we kill Yamamoto and the few strong fighters, the laborers will probably surrender easily.'^\

me3v 19,70
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp“彼らに黄金を運ばせ、地中に埋めましょう。@……もちろん、彼らの口は永遠に塞ぎますが。”@
langjp“日本人たちを、皆殺しにするということか……。”@
langjp“殺しましょう。@全員殺せば、黄金のことは誰にも知られずに済むのです。”\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7017.ogg":^`Let's have them carry the gold and bury it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7018.ogg":^  ...Of course, we'll have to silence them afterwards.'^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\75800017.ogg":^`Are you suggesting we massacre all of them...?'^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7019.ogg":^`Let's do it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\ITAG7020.ogg":^  If we kill them all, no one will know about the gold.'^\

