advsetwindow "01"

langjp『ない。@隣の島へ船で運ぶ。@……君は病院へ。@私は、この島での出来事をうまく片付けないと、……とばっちりで軍法会議ものだ。』\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600217.ogg":^"<There isn't.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600218.ogg":^  A boat should get us to the next island over.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600219.ogg":^  ...We'll get you to a hospital.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600220.ogg":^  As for me, ...unless I cleverly cover up what happened on this island, ...I might end up getting court-martialed just for being here.>"^\

