langjp『病院へ行って、大使館に連絡が行けば、私はやがて本国へ送還されるわ。@……そしてきっと、あれこれと尋問を受けるんだわ。@私は、ママを見殺しにしたヤツらを、自分の祖国とは認めないの。』\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700182.ogg":^"<If we go to a hospital and the embassy is contacted, I'll eventually be sent back to Italy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700183.ogg":^  ...If that happens, I'll be interrogated about all kinds of things.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700184.ogg":^  I won't acknowledge the bastards who let Mama die.>"^\
advsetwindow "01"

langjp『……………………。』\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600222.ogg":^"<............>"^\
advsetwindow "27"

langjp『もう、私の帰るべき祖国はないの。@ここが私の終点。@だからもう、私はどこへも行きたくないの。@……私にやさしくしてくれたアンジェロ少尉も、/
langjp!d700ルーベンスも、/
langjp!d700みんなみんな、/
langjp!d800……死んでしまった。』\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700185.ogg":^"<There's no homeland for me to return to now.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700186.ogg":^  This is the end for me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700187.ogg":^  So, there's nowhere I want to go anymore.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700188.ogg":^  ...Lieutenant Angelo, ^@/
advsetwindow "27"
langen:delay 3500:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700189.ogg":^Rubens, ^@/
advsetwindow "27"
langen:delay 1200:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700190.ogg":^everyone who was so kind to me...^@/
advsetwindow "27"
langen:delay 1400:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700191.ogg":^  ...They're all dead.>"^\

