langjp『だから、君までここで死ぬと？@　イタリア女はヤワじゃないんだろう？@　生きるんだ。』@
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600223.ogg":^"<And because of that, you want to die here too?^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600224.ogg":^  I thought you said Italian women weren't weak.^@:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600225.ogg":^  Live.>"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_c11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp『ねぇ、金蔵。@生きるってどういう意味？@　あなたが教えてくれたはずよ。@生きるってのは、ただ息をすることじゃないわ。@………私は、イタリアへ帰りたくないの。』\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700192.ogg":^"<Hey, Kinzo?^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700193.ogg":^  What does it mean...to live?^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700194.ogg":^  You're the one who taught me, aren't you?^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700195.ogg":^  Living is more than just breathing.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700196.ogg":^  ...I don't want to go back to Italy.>"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ki2\1\ki2_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp『……ビーチェ。』\
;＜若金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\58\75600226.ogg":^"<...Bice.>"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_c11_fuman3.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp『あなたは私と出会うまで、死んでいたと言ってくれたわ。@でも、それは私も同じなの。@……潜水艦の中で、私は死んでいた。@祖国も滅び、ママも死んだ。@パパもね。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700197.ogg":^"<You said that you were dead until you met me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700198.ogg":^  But it's the same for me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700199.ogg":^  ...I died in that submarine.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700200.ogg":^  My homeland fell, Mama died.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700201.ogg":^  Even Papa died.^@/
advsetwindow "27"


langjp……私は、こんな船、沈んでしまえと願ったわ。@だから、ここに辿り着いた時、実は死に損ねたとがっかりした。@………その矢先よ。@少尉が、英語がわかる者はいるかと騒ぎ出したのは。』\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700202.ogg":^  ...I prayed that our sub would just sink to the bottom of the ocean.^\:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700203.ogg":^  So, when we reached this place, I was actually disappointed that we'd survived.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700204.ogg":^  ...Then, right after that, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700205.ogg":^Lieutenant Angelo started asking whether anyone could speak English.>"^\
