langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700206.ogg":^"<Now that I've lost my homeland, my family, and my friends,^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700207.ogg":^ ...my only wish...^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700208.ogg":^is for you to kidnap me and take me away with you.>"^\

