langjp『でも、……それは叶えられない望みだともわかってる。@……ならばせめて。@……迎えの船が来るまでの数日間を、あなたと一緒にいたいの。@胸の痛みなんて、気にしない。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700209.ogg":^"<But...I know that's a wish that couldn't possibly come true.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700210.ogg":^  ...So, at the very least,^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700211.ogg":^ I want to be with you until the boat comes for us.^@:dwave 0, "voice\59\70700212.ogg":^  I don't care about the pain in my chest.^@/
