langjp「これは、手厳しいですな……。@突然、異人の女性患者を連れ込み、軍機だから秘密にせよと言い、@治療代は必ず持って来るから担保にと言って、黄金のインゴットを差し出す相手ですぞ。@厄介事はごめんでした。@渋々とですとも。」\
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900008.ogg":^"That's a bit harsh...^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900009.ogg":^  He suddenly brought in a foreign woman patient, explained to me that this was a military secret,^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900010.ogg":^ promised that he'd pay the medical fees later, and handed me a gold ingot as collateral.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900011.ogg":^  I didn't want to get involved with any funny business.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900012.ogg":^  I was reluctant to say the least."^\

cl c,24
_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_fuman1.png",23
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「確かに、それもそうですね。@……でも、南條先生はベアトリーチェを匿ってくれたんですね。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300242.ogg":^"I see your point.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300243.ogg":^  ...But in the end, you did conceal Beatrice, didn't you?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a1_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「金蔵さんほどではありませんが、私にも英語の心得がありました。@二人の会話を漏れ聞き、二人が決して厄介な何者かでないと確信したからです。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900013.ogg":^"I may not be as skilled as Kinzo, but I do have some familiarity with English.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900014.ogg":^  I managed to overhear part of their conversation, and that was enough to convince me that they were not troublesome people."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a2_fumu1.png",80
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「コホン。@……もちろん、インゴットに目が眩まなかったと言えば、嘘が過ぎますがな。@私も、今よりは若かったものですから。」\
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900015.ogg":^"*cough*^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900016.ogg":^  ...Of course, if I were to say that the ingot didn't tempt me, that would be a lie.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900017.ogg":^  I was much younger then, you see."^\

bg new_cha_r1a,24

_ld c,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",24
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「その後、彼女は？」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400501.ogg":^"What happened to her next?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a1_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「しばらくの療養の後、右代宮家の使いの方が来て、小田原に移すと仰いましてな。@引き取られていきました。」\
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900018.ogg":^"I treated her for some time before a messenger from the Ushiromiya family came and said that she would be moved to Odawara.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900019.ogg":^  They took her away."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_majime1.png",24
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「お祖父さまが自分で迎えに行ったわけではないのですか。」@
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300244.ogg":^"So Grandfather didn't come to get her himself?"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime2.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「金蔵がどう六軒島の事件を言い訳したにせよ。@しばらくの間は自由には動けなかっただろうよ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400502.ogg":^"Regardless of how Kinzo explained away the incident on Rokkenjima,^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400503.ogg":^ he probably wouldn't be able to move about freely for some time afterwards."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a1_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「ですな。@軍を誤魔化すのが、金蔵さんの人生で、一番の大勝負だったと言っておりましたな。」\
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900020.ogg":^"Precisely.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900021.ogg":^  Kinzo-san has said that deceiving the military was the greatest challenge of his life."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_fuman1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「ベアトリーチェは小田原に行って、それから…？」@
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300245.ogg":^"So, Beatrice went to Odawara, and then what...?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a1_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「使われていない別荘の一つに匿ったと聞いています。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900022.ogg":^"I have heard that she hid in one of their unused villas.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a1_fumu1.png",80
advsetwindow "19"

langjp……当時の金蔵さんにはもう、家族がおられましたからな。@そこは、うまくやられたのでしょうなぁ。」\
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900023.ogg":^  ...After all, Kinzo already had a family at that time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900024.ogg":^  It must have been tricky to manage."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「九羽鳥庵以前から、二重生活はお手の物だったというわけだ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400504.ogg":^"So, leading a double life was business as usual for Kinzo, even before Kuwadorian.^@/

cl c,0-

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_fuman1.png",24
advsetwindow "54"

langjp………サッ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400505.ogg":^  ...Whoosh."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「何してるんですか…？@　おしりにおできでも？」@
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300246.ogg":^"What are you doing...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300247.ogg":^  Is your butt itching?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_ikari1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「……ちっ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400506.ogg":^"...Tch."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「それから？@　ベアトリーチェとお祖父さまは、別荘でいつまでも仲良く…？」@
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300248.ogg":^"And later on?^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300249.ogg":^  Beatrice and Grandfather continued their happy relationship in the villa from then on...?"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a1_def1.png",24
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「平穏に、慎ましやかに暮らしたと聞きます。@……それから数年の後に、子供を儲けられましてな。」\
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900025B.ogg":^"I have heard that it was a modest, peaceful life.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900026B.ogg":^  ...Several years later, they had a child."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「……九羽鳥庵のベアトリーチェの誕生、か。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400507B.ogg":^"...So, Kuwadorian's Beatrice was born."^\

bg black,25

me1v 12,50

bg new_cha_r1d,22
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「出産が、うまく行かなかったそうで……。@お気の毒なことです。」@
;＜南條
langjp「まさか、……亡くなったんですか？！」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900027B.ogg":^"The birth...didn't go well...^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900028.ogg":^  It was truly a sad tale."^\
advsetwindow "53"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300250.ogg":^"You don't mean...she died?!"^\

bg new_cha_r1b,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_odoroki1.png",0
