_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「驚くな。@金蔵は娘を、生まれ変わりと信じたんだぞ。@……心を、蔑ろにするんじゃねェ。推理は可能だ。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400508.ogg":^"Don't be surprised.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400509.ogg":^  Kinzo believed his daughter was Beatrice reborn.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400510.ogg":^  ...You can't neglect the heart.  It's possible to reason it out."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「そ、……そうですね。@……失礼。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300251.ogg":^"...Y-You're right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300252.ogg":^  ...My apologies."^\

cl l,24
_ld l,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a1_komaru3.png",23
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「私は、金蔵さんが彼女と過ごされた小田原の数年間を知りません。@………しかし、その後の、今日までの金蔵さんを見れば、@ほんの数年間であっても、彼が如何に彼女を深く愛したか、うかがい知ることが出来るでしょう。」\
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900029.ogg":^"I don't know how many years Kinzo-san spent with her in Odawara.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900030.ogg":^  ......However, judging by the Kinzo-san we grew to know afterwards,^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900031.ogg":^ one can tell how deeply he loved her, even if they only had a few years together."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「………………………。@……そうですね。」@
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300253.ogg":^"......^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300254.ogg":^...I see."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_def1.png",24
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「そして、娘のために九羽鳥庵を作ったというわけか……。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400511.ogg":^"And then, he made Kuwadorian for his daughter..."^\

bg black,22

fede 10,1000
E_MA

bg new_gold2,2
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「金蔵さんは、潜水艦の黄金を元手に巧みに立ち回り、たちまちのうちに財産を築き上げていきました。@また、持ち前の英語力を生かし、ＧＨＱに強いコネクションを作って、見る見るうちに大富豪となられたのです。@この辺は、理御さんに説明する必要はありますまい。」\
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900032.ogg":^"Kinzo-san cleverly made use of the submarine's gold to build up a fortune in a flash.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900033.ogg":^  Then, he made use of his considerable skills in English to make connections with the GHQ, becoming immensely wealthy in a short span of time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900034.ogg":^  There's no need to explain this part to you, Lion-san."^\

bg black,22
bg new_sea_1cf,22
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「……えぇ。@その莫大な財産で、……六軒島を買い取り、屋敷を建てます。@小田原の親族たちは、無人島を丸ごと買い取ったお祖父さまを、酔狂だと笑ったそうです。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300255.ogg":^"...Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300256.ogg":^  He used that vast wealth, ...bought Rokkenjima, and built the mansion.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300257.ogg":^  The remaining relatives in Odawara scoffed at Grandfather, thinking he was crazy to buy an entire deserted island."^\
advsetwindow "54"



langjp「１０ｔの黄金がポケットに収まる大きさだったなら、金蔵も島を買わなかったろうよ。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400512.ogg":^"If you could carry 10 tons of gold around in your pocket, Kinzo probably wouldn't have bought Rokkenjima."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

;bg sea_3a,22
;br
langjp　六軒島の何処かに黄金を隠し、@持ち出したインゴットで財を築いて、……宝島を丸ごと買い取ったわけだ…。\
langen^He hid the gold somewhere in Rokkenjima,^@^ built up a fortune with the ingots he'd taken out of it, ...and then bought up the whole treasure island...^\

bg black,22

me1v 12,50
advsetwindow "19"

;bg cha_R1a,0
;ld c,NAN_fumuA1,6
;ld c,NAN_DefA1,80

langjp「ですな。@………そして、右代宮家の黄金伝説が始まるのです。」\
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900035.ogg":^"Exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900036.ogg":^  ......And that started the legend of the Ushiromiya gold."^\

;bg black,23
;bg cha_R1a,0
;ld l,WIL_NayamuA1,23
bg new_gold1,22
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「……インゴットには、片翼の鷲が刻印されていたと聞くが？」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400513.ogg":^"...What about the mark of the One-Winged Eagle that was supposedly pressed into the ingots?"^\
advsetwindow "19"

;ld r,NAN_KomaruA1,24

langjp「片翼の鷲、……というよりは、片翼に見えてしまう鷲、というべきでしょうな。」@
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900037.ogg":^"The One-Winged Eagle...  Or, more precisely, an eagle of which only one wing is visible."^\
advsetwindow "53"

;ld c,RIO_MajimeA1,23

langjp「それはどういう意味ですか？」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300258.ogg":^"What do you mean?"^\
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「ヨーロッパに多いでしょう。@翼を広げた鷲を紋章にしたものは。@……サロ共和国の国旗にも、鷲が、……いやいや、鷹でしたかな？、@が刻まれています。」@
;＜南條
langjp「刻印が薄かった、……あるいは粗雑だったということか。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900038.ogg":^"You see it often in Europe, do you not?^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900039.ogg":^  A crest or coat of arms with an eagle spreading its wings on it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900040.ogg":^  ...The flag of the Salo Republic also had an eagle, ...or was it a hawk?^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900041.ogg":^  ...At any rate, it had some bird of that type emblazoned on it."^\
advsetwindow "54"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400514.ogg":^"So, the imprint was made too lightly, ...or else it was poorly done."^\

bg new_gold3,22
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「そうです。@………戦時下の粗雑な刻印でした。@本来は翼を広げた鷲の紋章が刻印されるべきだったのでしょう。@それが、ちょうど斜めに断ち切ったように半分、薄れて消えていたのです。」@
;＜南條
langjp「翼を広げた鷲が半分消えて、……それが、片翼の鷲に見えた？」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900042.ogg":^"Correct.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900043.ogg":^  ......They used a rough, wartime press.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900044.ogg":^  It was probably supposed to look like the crest of an eagle spreading its wings.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900045.ogg":^  It was pressed in at a slight slant, so half of it was too light to see."^\
advsetwindow "53"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300259.ogg":^"So half of the eagle spreading its wings disappeared, ...making it look like a One-Winged Eagle?"^\

bg black,22
bg new_cha_r1b,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime2.png",22
_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「金蔵は、自分の運命を大きく変えたベアトリーチェの黄金に片翼の鷲を見て。@それを自分の紋章とすることを決めたに違いあるまい。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400515.ogg":^"Kinzo thought the seal on the gold of Beatrice, the woman who had changed his fate, looked like a One-Winged Eagle.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400516.ogg":^  That must be why he decided to make that his own crest."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a1_komaru3.png",23
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「……果たして正しく刻印されていたなら、それは共和国旗の鷹だったのか、@……それともまさか、双頭の……。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900046.ogg":^"...If the imprint had been made correctly, it would have been the eagle of the Salo Republic's flag,^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900047.ogg":^ ...or could it have been the two-headed..."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a1_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「……いやいや、そんなまさか。@あの莫大な黄金の山の前で、金蔵さんと杯を傾け合いながら、黄金ロマンで夜を明かすのは、なかなかに楽しいことでした。」\
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900048.ogg":^"...No, no, of course not.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900049.ogg":^  Passing the night away with Kinzo-san in front of that massive pile of gold, drinking and wondering, was truly an enjoyable experience."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a1_fumu1.png",80
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「もっとも、金蔵さんはその刻印から、黄金の出所を探られることを嫌いましてな。@外部に持ち出す黄金には、わざわざ自分の片翼の鷲をデザインした、別の刻印を打ち直していたようですが。」\
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900050.ogg":^"However, Kinzo-san didn't want people using that seal to figure out where the gold had come from.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900051.ogg":^  The gold he took outside was all re-pressed with the One-Winged Eagle design he had created."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_ikari1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"
langjp「お前には見せるだけだったのか？@　金蔵もケチだな。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400517.ogg":^"And all he did was show you the gold?^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400518.ogg":^  What a cheapskate."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a1_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「無論、大富豪になった後、金蔵さんは再び私の元へ訪れ、未払いだった治療費をしっかり払ってくれましたとも。@治療費には、ちと多過ぎましたのでな。@ちゃんとお釣りを払いましたが。」\
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900052.ogg":^"Of course, after he became immensely rich, Kinzo-san came to me once more, saying that he'd pay me in full for the overdue medical expenses.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900053.ogg":^  The amount he came with was a bit much for medical fees.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900054.ogg":^  Though I did make sure to give him his change."^\

bg new_cha_r1a,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_majime1.png",23
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「それ以来、お祖父さまと交流を……？」@
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300260.ogg":^"And you've been friends ever since...?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a1_def1.png",24
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「そうです。@金蔵さんは、私が秘密を守ってベアトリーチェを匿ったことを、事のほか深く感謝してくれましてな。」\
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900055.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900056.ogg":^  Kinzo-san was extremely grateful to me for keeping his secret and concealing Beatrice."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「……お祖父さまは、かつての小田原の親族たちは欲深の嘘吐きばかりだと仰っていました。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300261.ogg":^"...Grandfather always says that the old relatives in Odawara were a bunch of greedy liars.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp……南條先生の義理堅さが、嬉しかったに違いありません。@お祖父さまのような方が、どうしてあなたにだけは心を開いたのか、わかる気がします。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300262.ogg":^  ...I'm sure he appreciated your strong sense of duty, Doctor Nanjo.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300263.ogg":^  I think I understand why a person like Grandfather came to trust you."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a1_fumu1.png",80
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「私にも多少の異国趣味と、チェスの趣味がありましてな。@金蔵さんとは以来、意気を投合しまして。@こうして細々と、しかし気付けばずいぶんと。@長くお付き合いをさせてもらっています……。」\
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900057.ogg":^"I also had some interest in foreign countries, as well as a hobby of playing chess.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900058.ogg":^  Kinzo-san and I have gotten along well ever since.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900059.ogg":^  It was a friendship that built up gradually, but grew strong before we knew it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900060.ogg":^  Yes, we have been friends a very long time..."^\

