advsetwindow "54"

langjp「マタイ伝１章２０節。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400562.ogg":^"Book of Matthew, chapter 1, verse 20."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「違うよ、２３節。@２０節は“かくて、これらを思い巡らす時、御使いが夢に現れて言った。@ダビデの子、ヨセフよ。@妻マリアを迎えることを恐れるな。@その胎に宿る者は聖霊によるものなり”。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400022.ogg":^"No, verse 23.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400023.ogg":^  Verse 20 is `But while he thought on these things, behold, the angel of the Lord appeared unto him in a dream, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400024.ogg":^saying, Joseph, thou son of David, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400025.ogg":^fear not to take unto thee Mary thy wife: ^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400026.ogg":^for that which is conceived in her is of the Holy Ghost'."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「……お前の父親は聖霊だというわけだ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400563.ogg":^"...So your father is the Holy Ghost."^\

bg new_different_spiral_1a,28

me1v 5,50
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「パパがいるのが当り前だとみんなに言われた。@パパがいないなんて、おかしい、変な子だ、可哀想な子だと言われた。@でも、ママに聞いても、パパなんかいない、知らない、存在しないと言われた。@聞くだけで怒られて叩かれた。@だから真里亞は、……自分が誰から生まれたか、よくわからなくなった。@……真里亞はニンゲンとして正しくない、未熟で不正な存在。@みんなとは違う、おかしな、可哀想な子だと気が付いた。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400027.ogg":^"Everyone said that everyone has a Papa.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400028.ogg":^  They said it was strange to not have a Papa, that I was a weird, pitiful child.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400029.ogg":^  But when I asked Mama, she said I didn't have a Papa, that he didn't exist.^\:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400030.ogg":^  She got mad and hit me even though all I did was ask.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400031.ogg":^  So...I didn't really understand who gave birth to me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400032.ogg":^  ...I was...an immature and misplaced creature, not a proper Human.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400033.ogg":^  I realized I was a strange, pitiful girl, different from everyone else."^\

bg black,22
bg new_different_space_2d,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",22
_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「親も他人も関係ねェ。@お前はお前だ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400564.ogg":^"It doesn't matter who your parents are or what other people say.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400565.ogg":^  You are who you are."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_fukigen2.png",23
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「それを、未熟な幼児に教えるのは、きっと難しかったろうね。@ひょっとしたら、幼稚園の先生は、いじめられて泣く私にそう諭してくれたのかもしれない。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400034.ogg":^"It must've been hard to teach that to a young, immature kid.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400035.ogg":^  My kindergarten teacher might've said that to me when I cried after being bullied.^@/
advsetwindow "13"

;ld l,MAR_OdorokiA1,80

langjp……でも、そんな慰めでは、私の心の空白、/
langjp!d900……うぅん、疑問。@どんな言葉も、私の疑問に答えてはくれなかった。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400036.ogg":^  ...But even those words of encouragement couldn't fill the blank space...^@/
advsetwindow "13"
langen:delay 4900:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400037.ogg":^no, the questions.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400038.ogg":^  Those words couldn't answer the questions in my mind."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime2.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「その疑問に答えたのが、ザ・ブックだというのか。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400566.ogg":^"And the Book is what gave you the answers?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b22_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「神父様がね、来たの。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400039.ogg":^"A priest came to see me."^\

