bgm1 170
advsetwindow "-1"


langjp　子供にありがたいお話を聞かせて、心を豊かにする授業の一環だったと思う。\
langjp　多くの子供たちにとって、それは先生が聞かせてくれるおとぎ話と違いはない。@……うぅん、小難しい分だけ、私たちは退屈していたと思う。\
langjp　最後に、神父様が言ったの。\
langen^It was probably part of some lesson, to enrich the minds of children through an edifying tale.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^To most of the children, it was just an ordinary fairy tale they might've heard from one of their teachers.^@^  ...Actually, I think we were just bored because it was too hard to grasp.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Then, at the end, the priest said something important.^\



bg new_different_space_2a,22
_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「神は、何でも知っている、か。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400567.ogg":^"That God knows everything?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_def1.png",24
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「うん。@だから真里亞は聞いた。@……真里亞にはママしかいない。@パパは、ない。@パパがなくても、真里亞はママから生まれてきた。@それは、おかしくて悲しいことなの？、って。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400040.ogg":^"Yep.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400041.ogg":^  So I asked him.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400042.ogg":^  ...I only have a Mama.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400043.ogg":^  I...don't have a Papa.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400044.ogg":^  Mama gave birth to me without a Papa.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400045.ogg":^  Was that a strange, sad thing?  ...I asked."^\

