langjp「神父は何と答えた。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400568.ogg":^"And how'd he answer that?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_niyari1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「聖母マリアが赤ちゃんを身篭れたのは、聖霊のおかげだからって。@マタイ伝１節２０章、後段。@“その胎に宿る者は聖霊によるものなり”。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400049.ogg":^"He said the Virgin Maria was with child because of the Holy Ghost.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400050.ogg":^  The second part of the Book of Matthew, chapter 1, verse 20.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400051.ogg":^  `For that which is conceived in her is of the Holy Ghost'.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b22_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp……またまた、真里亞はびっくりした！@　これはどういうことだと思う？！」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400052.ogg":^  ...That surprised me again!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400053.ogg":^  What do you think that means?!"^\

;ld r,WIL_FutekiA1,80
_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「……お前はこう解釈した。@右代宮真里亞にはニンゲンの父はいない。@……本当の父は、聖霊だと。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400569.ogg":^"...You interpreted this to mean that ^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400570.ogg":^Ushiromiya Maria had no Human father.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400571.ogg":^  ...That your real father was the Holy Ghost."^\

mbg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　本来の聖書の意味はともかく。@……父親がいないことでアイデンティティを保てない、幼き悲しい少女は、@そこに初めて、自己の理解を見出したのだ。\
langen^Regardless of the Bible's original meaning,^@^ ...this young, sad girl, whose lack of a father had caused her to lose her sense of identity,^@^ had finally created a way to understand herself.^\

mcbg 22

cl a,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_warai1.png",23
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「それを知った時、私はなぜ、他の子たちと自分だけが違うのかを理解したの！@　私を馬鹿にするみんなはヨセフの子。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400054.ogg":^"Once I realized that, I knew why I was different from all the other kids!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400055.ogg":^  The ones who made fun of me were all children of Joseph.^@/
advsetwindow "13"


langjpでも私だけは違った！@　私はみんなより劣ってなんかいない…！@　私は神の子、聖霊の子だった！！@　帰ってママに話したよ。@真里亞にはパパなんていない。@ママはママで、真里亞は神様の力で生まれてきたんだよって。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400056.ogg":^  But I alone was different!^\:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400057.ogg":^  I wasn't worse than everyone else...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400058.ogg":^  I was a child of God, a child of the Holy Ghost!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400059.ogg":^  When I got back, I told Mama.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400060.ogg":^  I had no Papa.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400061.ogg":^  Mama gave birth to me thanks to the power of God."^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"
;bg Different_spiral_1b,28

langjp　楼座にとって、真里亞に父親を尋ねられることは、辛いことだったろう。@
langen^It was probably painful for Rosa when Maria asked about her father.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　みんなにはパパとママがいるのに、どうして真里亞にはいないの？@
langen^Why did Maria have no Papa, when everyone else had a Papa and a Mama?^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　それを聞かれる度に、楼座は感情的な怒りでそれを誤魔化してきた。\
langen^Every time she was asked this, Rosa flew into a rage and changed the subject.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　……それが、どういうわけか、真里亞が勝手に納得してくれたのだ。@
langen^...Then, for some reason and all on her own, Maria had found an answer that satisfied her.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　自分にはパパなどいない。@ママと神様の子だと。@
langen^She had no Papa.^@^  She was the child of Mama and God.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

;br
langjp　幼い少女が、聖書より見出した自己の解釈を、楼座が抱擁して受け入れたことは、想像に難くない……。\
langen^It isn't too difficult to imagine that Rosa, after hearing this young girl's explanation, ^@^might go along with it as though it were true...^\

bg new_different_space_2b,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_def1.png",22
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「ベアトは宇宙を生み出す最小の人数を、２人だと言った。@私はこれを、両親がいないと子は成せないという意味だと感じた。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400062.ogg":^"Beato said that the minimum number of people needed to create a world is two.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400063.ogg":^  I thought she meant that you need two parents to create a child.^@/

_ld c,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_fukigen2.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp……その時、私は思ったの。@ベアトは魔女だけれど、ニンゲンから生まれた魔女なんだ、って。@ベアトは聖霊の子じゃない。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400064.ogg":^  ...That's when I thought of it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400065.ogg":^  Beato may be a witch, but she's a witch born of a Human.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400066.ogg":^  Beato isn't a child of the Holy Ghost."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「でも、私は違う。@ママだけから生まれた。@聖霊から生まれた！@　………ベアトは、私と一緒じゃなきゃ宇宙を作れない。@でも私は、
langjp“^~ib~^神は我らと共にある^~ib~^”。@私１人でも、聖霊とともに宇宙が作れる！」\

langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400067.ogg":^"But I'm different.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400068.ogg":^  I was born from Mama alone.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400069.ogg":^  I was born of the Holy Ghost!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400070.ogg":^  ...Beato can't create a universe without me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400071.ogg":^  But ^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400072.ogg":^`God is always by your side'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400073.ogg":^  I can make a universe all by myself, along with the Holy Ghost!"^\
;br

_ld c,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b22_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「ベアトは私を原始の魔女と呼んだ。@そしてやがては、１人で全てを生み出せる造物主になれるよと言ってくれた。@私が１人で、無から有を創造する！@　それをベアトが無限に膨らませる！@　縁寿はそれを受け継ぎ、語り広げる魔女の使徒だった！」\
;＜真里亞
;＜点処理：神は我らと共にある
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400074_b.ogg":^"Beato called me the Witch of Origins.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400075.ogg":^  And she also said that eventually, I might become a Creator, who could create anything alone.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400076.ogg":^  All by myself, I can create something out of nothing!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400077.ogg":^  Beato can take that and extend it into infinity!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400078.ogg":^  Ange was the witches' apostle, who would spread the word far and wide!"^\


bg new_different_space_2c,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",24
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「マリアージュ・ソルシエールか。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400572.ogg":^"And that was Mariage Sorcière."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_niyari1.png",23
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「一と無限は大きく違う。@だからベアトは偉い。@でも、無と有の前には、一も無限も同じ有でしかない。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400079.ogg":^"There's a huge difference between one and infinity.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400080.ogg":^  That's why Beato is so great.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400081.ogg":^  However, compared to the difference between existence and non-existence, one and infinity are nearly the same thing.^@/
advsetwindow "13"

;ld l,MAR_AkuwaraiA1,80

langjp私は世界で一番の魔女、うぅん！@　世界で一番偉い、造物主になることを約束されていた子…！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400082.ogg":^  I am the child destined to become the best witch, ...no...^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400083.ogg":^  The greatest Creator in the world...!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b22_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「マリアージュ・ソルシエールは、そんな私を温める卵の巣！@　私は、右代宮真里亞！！@　神と共にある真里亞！！」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400084.ogg":^"Mariage Sorcière was the nest to prepare me for that!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400085.ogg":^  I am Ushiromiya Maria!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400086.ogg":^  Maria, who stands by God's side!!"^\

