;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400573.ogg":^"......^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400574.ogg":^...We're jumping about a bit too fast.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400575.ogg":^  Let's take things one at a time."^\

