advsetwindow "54"

langjp「自分は聖霊の子だと解釈したお前が、そこから次第にオカルトに傾倒していくことは容易に理解できる。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400576.ogg":^"After you decided that you were the child of the Holy Ghost, it's easy to imagine that you gradually became more and more interested in the occult.^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp………そこからだ。@そんなお前が、ベアトリーチェとどこで出会い、どのように交流していったか。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400577.ogg":^  ......And then what?^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400578.ogg":^  Once you reached that state, where did you meet Beatrice, and how did the two of you interact?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「それは本当にある日、突然の、唐突なこと。@………六軒島に住まう、ベアトリーチェという魔女に、私は会ってみたかったの。@同じ魔女として。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400089.ogg":^"It really did happen all of a sudden, one day.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400090.ogg":^  ...I wanted to meet the witch called Beatrice, who lived on Rokkenjima.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400091.ogg":^  I wanted to meet her as a fellow witch."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime2.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「その頃にはもう、自分が魔女という自覚があったのか。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400579.ogg":^"At that time, you already knew you were a witch?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「あった。@その頃には、聖書とオカルトでは、大人にも負けないくらいの知識があったから。@だから私は、魔法は使えずとも、自分を魔女だと信じてた。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400092.ogg":^"I did.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400093.ogg":^  Even then, when it came to the Bible and the occult, I already knew as much as an adult.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400094.ogg":^  So, even though I couldn't use magic, I believed that I was a witch.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp……きひひひ、ちょっと滑稽だね。@だから、私は魔女見習いなの。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400095.ogg":^  ...Kihihi, it's a bit funny, isn't it?^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400096.ogg":^  That's why I was only a witch apprentice."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「いつ、ベアトリーチェと出会った。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400580.ogg":^"When did you meet Beatrice?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_fukigen2.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「よくは覚えてない。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400097.ogg":^"I don't really remember when.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjpでも、その出会いはよく覚えてる。@それは、とてもとても唐突だった。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400098.ogg":^  But I do remember what it was like.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400099.ogg":^  It was really, really sudden."^\

