langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700232.ogg":^"You're the one who wanted us to meet.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700233.ogg":^  Here I am, welcoming the witch who came to visit my island, and yet you ask my name?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700234.ogg":^  *cackle*cackle*."^\

