langjp　真里亞は欲した。@
langjp　自分がオカルト的存在であることを信じるために、自分以外のオカルトを欲したのだ。@
langen^There was a thing Maria desired.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^To strengthen her belief that there was an occult side to her, she wanted to see the occult outside herself as well.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　だから、ベアトリーチェの魔法に、協力した。@
langjp　自分の毒素で、魔法の奇跡を知ることの出来る機会を、失わないために。\
langen^That's why she agreed to help Beatrice with her magic.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^She didn't want her own toxin to ruin her chance of learning the miracles of magic.^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「良いぞ。@……さぁ、そのカップを開けてみるがいい。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700265.ogg":^"Good.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700266.ogg":^  ...Then try looking inside that cup."^\

