wait 500
_ld r,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_a11_odoroki1.png",26
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「…………あ。@……キャンディーだっ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400141.ogg":^"......Ah.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400142.ogg":^  ...There's candy.^@/
advsetwindow "13"

;ld r,MAR_WaraiA2,80

langjp……キャンディーだ…！！」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400143.ogg":^  ...There's candy...!!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「妾からそなたへの挨拶代わりと、新しき魔女との出会いと友情に、それを贈ろう。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700267.ogg":^"As a gift to mark my meeting with a new witch, and as a sign of our friendship, I offer this to you."^\

;bg Different_spiral_1a,22

mono 1
print 2
advsetwindow "-1"


langjp　これが、本当の魔法の奇跡。@
langjp　私は初めて、自分の自惚れを悔いて、恥じた。@
langen^This...was a true miracle of magic.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^For the first time, I felt shame and embarrassment at my conceit.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　自分だけが聖霊の子で、世界でもっとも偉くて特別でといった、@自分だけの万能感が一気に晴れていくのを感じた。\
langen^I could feel that sense of omnipotence disappear, ^@^the idea that I was the child of the Holy Ghost and the most important and special person in the world.^\

;bg Different_spiral_1b,28

bg black,22
mono 0
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　……何も出来ない聖霊の子なんかより。@私は魔法が使える魔女の方がいい…！@
langjp　右代宮真里亞は、魔女になりたい…！！@
langjp　まずは魔女の見習いから始めたい！！@
langen^...Instead of a child of the Holy Ghost who can't actually do anything,^@^ I'd rather be a witch who can use magic...!^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Ushiromiya Maria wants to become a witch...!!^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Starting off as a witch apprentice!!^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　もう私はベアトに夢中だった。\
langen^I was already fascinated by Beato.^\

bg new_beach_2af,22
_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_a11_odoroki1.png",26
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「真里亞も本当の魔女になりたい！@　ベアトの弟子になりたい！！」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400144.ogg":^"I want to become a real witch too!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400145.ogg":^  I want to be your disciple!!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_1_warai1.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「謙遜を。@そなたには充分な才能と日々の精進があるぞ。@/
