;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700274.ogg":^"Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700275.ogg":^  From this point forth, we shall be friends.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700276.ogg":^  Let us continue to discuss the deep and profound world of witches."^\

