;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400148.ogg":^"Uu-!!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400149.ogg":^  Thank you, Beato!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400150.ogg":^  Can I eat this candy?!"^\

