;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400154.ogg":^"Uu-...^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400155.ogg":^  No.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400156.ogg":^  I don't want Beato's precious magic to disappear."^\

