langjp「守る！@　毎日、お家に帰ってきたら、手を洗う！@　うがいをする！@　そうしたら、また会ってくれる？！」@
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400159.ogg":^"I'll do it!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400160.ogg":^  Every day, when I come home, I'll wash my hands!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400161.ogg":^  I'll rinse out my mouth!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400162.ogg":^  If I do that, will I see you again?!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_futeki2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「約束しようぞ。@そなたが妾との約束をきっちり守れたなら、@そなたの体は清められ、妾もさらに魔力を取り戻す。@……さすれば、次に来る時は、より素晴らしい魔法を見せようぞ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700290.ogg":^"I promise it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700291.ogg":^  If you keep your end of the promise,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700292.ogg":^ your body will be cleansed, and I will regain even more of my magical power.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700293.ogg":^  ...If that happens, I will show you even more incredible magic the next time you come."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_a22_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「うー！@　約束守る！　絶対！！@　真里亞はなる！@　ベアトの友達になって、魔女見習いになる！」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400163.ogg":^"Uu-!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400164.ogg":^  I'll keep my promise!  No matter what!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400165.ogg":^  I'll do it!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400166.ogg":^  I'll become your friend and a witch apprentice!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_1_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「良き心掛けであるぞ、右代宮真里亞よ。@そなたが早く一人前の魔女になって、妾の良き友人に成長してくれることを、心より願っている。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700294.ogg":^"Your resolve is heartening, Ushiromiya Maria.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700295.ogg":^  I hope you will grow to become a full witch and my close friend soon."^\


