langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400178.ogg":^"Yep.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400179.ogg":^  I told everyone about it at dinner that day.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_akuwarai1.png",23
advsetwindow "13"

langjp蔵臼伯父さんに笑われた。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400180.ogg":^  Uncle Krauss laughed at me.^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\ros\1\ros_a32_komaru4.png",24
advsetwindow "13"

langjpそしたら隣の席のママに、その話は終わりにしなさいって怒られた。@…うー。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400181.ogg":^  Then, Mama, who was sitting next to me, got mad and told me to stop talking about it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400182.ogg":^  ...Uu-."^\


