advsetwindow "54"

langjp「隣の席…？@　序列上、お前の席は楼座と隣り合わないはずだ。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400595.ogg":^"Next to you...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400596.ogg":^  By your family's ranking system, your seat shouldn't be next to Rosa's."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_niyari1.png",24
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「親族会議じゃないもん。@ママと真里亞だけが訪ねた時の話。@だから、蔵臼伯父さん一家全員と、ママと真里亞しかいない。@席は詰めるから、親族会議の時とはお席がちょっと違うの。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400183.ogg":^"It wasn't a family conference.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400184.ogg":^  It was when just Mama and I came to visit.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400185.ogg":^  So, there was only Uncle Krauss's family, Mama, and me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400186.ogg":^  There were fewer people, so we didn't sit in the same spots as a family conference."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「………………………。@………お前の隣の席に、楼座だったんだな？」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400597.ogg":^"......^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400598.ogg":^...And Rosa was sitting in the seat next to you?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「うん。@……それが何？」@
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400187.ogg":^"Yeah.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400188.ogg":^  ...Why does that matter?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「………何でもない。@……ベアトリーチェと、六軒島以外で会ったことは？」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400599.ogg":^"......It doesn't.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400600.ogg":^  ...Have you ever met with Beatrice outside Rokkenjima?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「ないよ。@だってベアトは体が希薄で、自由には動けないんだもの。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400189.ogg":^"No.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400190.ogg":^  After all, Beato's body is fragile, so she can't go wherever she wants.^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp真里亞の体に乗り移ってもいいよって言ったけど、@島からは離れられないから出来ないって言ってた。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400191.ogg":^  I said I wouldn't mind letting her possess me,^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400192.ogg":^ but she said she couldn't, because she couldn't leave the island."^\

;ld l,WIL_FutekiA1,80
_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime2.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「その後は、六軒島へ行く度に会っていたということか。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400601.ogg":^"And after that, you met her every time you came to Rokkenjima."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「うん。@私たちは大の仲良しになった。@ベアトと話せば話すほどに、彼女は本当にすごい魔女だと思い知ったよ。@彼女は会う度にいつも素敵な魔法を見せてくれた。@そして、私とは異なる魔法大系を聞かせてくれて、二人で魔法の深遠を語り合ったよ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400193.ogg":^"Yeah.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400194.ogg":^  We became really good friends.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400195.ogg":^  The more I talked to Beato, the more I realized what an amazing witch she was.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400196.ogg":^  She showed me wonderful magic every time I saw her.^\:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400197.ogg":^  Then, she told me about a magical compendium that was different from mine, and we both talked together about the mysteries of magic.^@/
advsetwindow "13"

;ld r,MAR_WaraiA2,80

langjp私は、早く彼女の高みに上りたいと思った。@ベアトのような魔女の域に達したいと願った。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400198.ogg":^  I wanted to reach her level as soon as I could.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400199.ogg":^  I wanted to become the kind of witch Beato was."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「ベアトリーチェを、母親に紹介したことは？」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400602.ogg":^"Did you ever introduce Beatrice to your mother?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_akuwarai2.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「ないよ。@ママは毒素が強過ぎるからまだ会えないって言ってた。@……大人はほとんどダメだって。@みんな汚れてるから。@きひひひひ。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400200.ogg":^"Nope.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400201.ogg":^  She said Mama's toxin was too strong, so they couldn't meet each other yet.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400202.ogg":^  ...Almost all adults are no good when it comes to the toxin.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400203.ogg":^  Because they're all tainted.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400204.ogg":^  Kihihihihi."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_ikari1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「お前以外に、ベアトリーチェの姿を見ることが出来た者はいるのか。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400603.ogg":^"Was anyone other than you able to see Beatrice?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「最初は無理だった。@魔力が弱いからね、毒素に少しでも近づくと体が壊れてしまう、って。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400205.ogg":^"They couldn't at first.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400206.ogg":^  She said her magical power was weak, so her body would crumble if even a little bit of the toxin reached her.^\/

_ld r,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp……でも、次第に魔力を蓄えて、真里亞以外の毒素の少ない人の前にも現れられるようになったよ。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400207.ogg":^  ...But she gathered magical power bit by bit, and she could eventually appear in front of other people who had small amounts of toxin."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「それは誰だ。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400604.ogg":^"And who was that?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_b11_fukigen2.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「うーーー……ん。@……あんまり多くない。@使用人の一部の人だけだった。」@
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400208.ogg":^"Hmmmmmmm...^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400209.ogg":^  ...There weren't many of them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400210.ogg":^  Just a few of the servants."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

