;ld l,JES_DefA1,80

langjp「あれこそが、真里亞のなりたい真里亞なんじゃないかなって。@そう思うことがあるよ。」@
;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200100.ogg":^"Sometimes, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200101.ogg":^I think that's the person Maria really wants to be."^\
advsetwindow "54"

;ld c,WIL_DefA1,80

langjp「……親族で一番の年少で、可愛がられてはいるが、尊敬されているわけではない。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400671.ogg":^"...As the youngest member of the family, she's adored, but not respected."^\
advsetwindow "04"

;ld c,JES_DefA1,80

langjp「何を知っても覚えても、そんなのは親族の誰かが知ってる。@真里亞に威張れることは何もない。@……私たちは真里亞が何かを覚える度に、微笑ましく褒めてたつもりだけど、@……ひょっとしたらそれが、彼女を傷つけていたのかもしれない。」@
;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200102.ogg":^"Every time she learns something, there's always someone in the family who already knows it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200103.ogg":^  She doesn't get to show off her knowledge about anything.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200104.ogg":^  ...Whenever she does learn something new, we try to smile and praise her,^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200105.ogg":^ ...but that might actually have hurt her."^\
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「真里亞は、何かの権威になりたかったということか。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400672.ogg":^"So, Maria wanted to become an authority on something?"^\

bg black,22
mono off
bg new_different_spiral_1a,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　それは、幼少から脱皮したいと願う少年少女なら、誰もが思うことだ。@
langen^It's something that all young boys and girls think, when they want to shake off their childhood.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　何かを覚えて、親に褒められるのは悪い気はしない。@……しかし、そのことについて、親がすでに知っていることがわかると、馬鹿にされたような気持ちにもなる。\
langen^It's not a bad feeling when you learn something new and your parents praise you.^\^  ...But when you realize that your parents already knew that thing, it sometimes feels like they're talking down to you.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　初めて九九が出来た時、親はきっと褒めてくれただろう。@
langen^When a kid learns their one-digit times table, their parents will probably praise them.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　しかし、心無い親は、じゃあ１１×１１は知ってる？@　とか、１６×１６は知ってる？@　などと意地悪な問題を返してくる。@
langen^However, inconsiderate parents will sometimes ask mean questions, like `then what is 11 times 11?' or `what is 16 times 16?' or something similar.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そんな時、子供は九九を覚えた達成感は失われ、何をしても親を超えられないことに、深い落胆を覚えるのだ…。\
langen^If that happens, the kid will lose his feeling of accomplishment...and will start to feel as though he could never surpass his parents...^\

bg black,22

;bg cha_R1f,0
bg new_different_space_2d,22
_ld l,":b;sprites\jes\1\jes_a11_nayamu1.png",23
advsetwindow "04"

langjp「だから真里亞が、誰も知らないオカルトに関心を持ち、@その知識を深めていったのは容易に想像できる。@……多分、真里亞にとっての理想の自分というのは、@みんなに尊敬されるオカルトの権威の自分なんだ。」\
;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200106.ogg":^"So, it's easy to guess why Maria got interested in the occult, something no one else knew about,^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200107.ogg":^ and started learning more and more about it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200108.ogg":^  ...I think the person Maria wants to be ^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200109.ogg":^is an authority on the occult who everyone respects."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime2.png",24
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「普段の生活でオカルトの話ばかりしていたら、楼座にぶたれるからな。@……お前がそうであるように、普段はもう一人の自分を隠している、というわけだ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400673.ogg":^"And if she talked about the occult during her everyday life, Rosa would hit her.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400674.ogg":^  ...So, like you, she's been hiding this other `self' most of the time."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\jes\1\jes_a11_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "04"

langjp「私は、こんな時の真里亞を、そうだと思ってる。@……いや、本当の自分が、普段の自分を塗り潰してしまったと言うべきかな。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200110.ogg":^"That's what I think she's doing at times like this.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200111.ogg":^  ...Maybe I should say that this is her real self slipping through the cracks to cover up her normal self.^\/

_ld l,":b;sprites\jes\1\jes_a11_tohoho3.png",80
advsetwindow "04"

langjp私も、そういうのちょっと覚えが。@……深窓の令嬢に憧れて、病弱な自分になれたらいいなと思って…、咳する真似ばっかしてたら、悪いクセになって。」\
;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200112.ogg":^  Actually, I've had some experience with that myself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200113.ogg":^  ...I've thought at times that it'd be nice to become a frail, secluded lady, ...so I'd pretend to cough a lot, and it sort of became a bad habit."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「咳き込めば、周りがやさしくしてくれるからか。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400675.ogg":^"Because everyone would be nice to you if you started having coughing fits?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\jes\1\jes_a11_atya3.png",80
advsetwindow "04"

langjp「いや、はは、……嫌な話の流れになった時とか、空気悪い時とかに、流れを断ち切れるし。」@
;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200114.ogg":^"Haha, no...  Whenever the conversation turned to something I didn't like, or something that made me feel uncomfortable, I could do that to change the subject."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「なるほど。@それもまた、お前の、なりたいもう一人の自分、なんだな。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400676.ogg":^"I see.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400677.ogg":^  And that's another `self' you wanted to become."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\jes\1\jes_a11_aisowarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "04"

langjp「はは、この話は内緒で頼むぜ…。」\
