langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200124.ogg":^"At the end of the family conference, I was the only one still upset.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200125.ogg":^  ...Maria acted as though nothing had happened.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200126.ogg":^  Instead, she went off somewhere on her own...and came back talking happily about how she'd played with Beatrice again."^\

