;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400793.ogg":^"Both Maria and Jessica told me stories about the witch Beatrice.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400794.ogg":^  However, when they talked about the ranking system at the dining table, you weren't there."^\

