langjp「朱志香の話も同じだ。@お前が序列に加わっているなら、金蔵の席を正面に、左列に理御、右列に朱志香。@そして左列に譲治、右列に縁寿となる。@……朱志香と縁寿は、理御がいてもいなくても隣り合う。@しかし、理御がいるかいないかで、その席が、右になるか左になるかが異なる。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400799.ogg":^"It was the same in Jessica's story.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400800.ogg":^  If you were added to the ranking system, then when looking down the table towards Kinzo's seat, you should be on the left side and Jessica should be on the right.^\:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400801.ogg":^  After that comes George on the left side and Ange on the right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400802.ogg":^  ...Jessica and Ange will be sitting next to each other whether you're there or not.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400803.ogg":^  However, which side of the table they're sitting on changes."^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　理御がいる世界ならば、朱志香の左が、縁寿の席となる。@
langjp　しかし、理御がいない序列だと、縁寿の席は、朱志香の右になる。\
langen^In the world where Lion exists, Ange's seat is on Jessica's left.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^However, if Lion doesn't exist, then Ange's seat is on Jessica's right.^\
