;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400805.ogg":^  And, in your world, there are no ghost stories about a witch.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400806.ogg":^  To you, Beatrice is either Kinzo's mistress or his benefactor, not a wandering ghost."^\

