langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400807.ogg":^"Exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400808.ogg":^  If you exist, the witch Beatrice doesn't.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400809.ogg":^  Your existence ^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400810.ogg":^`kills Beatrice'."^\
