langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400813.ogg":^"That's a good way to put it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400814.ogg":^  That's it exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400815.ogg":^  You're a coin, and Beatrice is on the other side."^\

