advsetwindow "54"

langjp「なら、なぜ金蔵は蔵臼が成人した際に当主を譲らなかった？」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400823.ogg":^"Then why didn't Kinzo give the Headship to Krauss when he came of age?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a12_akire1a.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「………当主様の話を聞かれたでしょう。@当主様は右代宮家の老獪な親族たちに振り回され、辛い思いをされました。@だから、これからの当主は若者が受け継ぐべきだと思い、」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300387.ogg":^"......You heard what our Head said.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300388.ogg":^  He was used by the cunning elders of the Ushiromiya family and suffered much.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300389.ogg":^  That's why he decided that only young people should inherit the Headship from now-"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_niramu1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「お前のいない世界では、次期当主を証明する銀の指輪さえ存在しない。@……お前が指にしているその銀の指輪は、金蔵がお前に当主を継承したいという、@他の世界にはない強い意思の証明だ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400824.ogg":^"In the world without you in it, there is no silver ring for the Successor.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400825.ogg":^  ...That silver ring proves that Kinzo had a strong desire, which he didn't show in any other world,^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400826.ogg":^ to see that you became the next Head."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_fuman1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「……確かに、その点は否定できません。@当主様は、私を特に可愛がられておいでで、@私が幼い頃から、成人したらすぐに当主を継承させる。その日に備え学業を怠るなと厳しく言われてきました。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300390.ogg":^"...I can't deny that you may have a point there.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300391.ogg":^  The Head always seemed to adore me particularly,^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300392.ogg":^ and I was very young when he first promised to make me the Head when I came of age.^@^  He was very strict when he told me to keep up in my studies in preparation for that day."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「……しかし、お父様にその資質がないとは思いません。@なぜ、お父様を早々に飛び越して私が次期当主なのか。@………不思議に思ったことはありますが、ずっとそうだったので、その疑問を口に出したことはありませんでした。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300393.ogg":^"...But I don't think my father was any less talented.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300394.ogg":^  Why did Grandfather skip over him and make me the Successor?^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300395.ogg":^  ......I've thought it strange from time to time, but since it's always been that way, I never said so aloud."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「なぜ金蔵は、蔵臼よりお前に、強く当主を引き継がせたかったか、わかるか。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400827.ogg":^"Do you know why Kinzo wanted you and not Krauss to become the next Head?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_akire1a.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「わかるわけもありません。@………また、心を蔑ろにするんじゃないと仰るので？@　当主様のお心から、何が推理できると仰るんですか？」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300396.ogg":^"How could I know?^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300397.ogg":^  ...Are you trying to tell me to stop neglecting the heart again?^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300398.ogg":^  Do you think you understand how the Head's heart works?"^\



