langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100093.ogg":^  That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100094.ogg":^  Ushiromiya Lion is not Natsuhi's child.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100095.ogg":^  This is the grown-up version of the baby Kinzo got from somewhere 19 years ago."^\

