_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_niramu1.png",24
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「何処か、じゃねェ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400834.ogg":^"Not `somewhere'.^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp……明白に、ベアトリーチェの血を引いている。@その証拠が、数多の世界で理御にしか与えられない、銀の指輪だ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400835.ogg":^  ...Lion clearly shares Beatrice's blood.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400836.ogg":^  The proof is the silver ring, which is only ever given to Lion across all of the many worlds."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a12_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"
;bg black,26
langjp「この指輪があると、どうして私がベアトリーチェの血を引くと？」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300402.ogg":^"Why does the ring prove that I share Beatrice's blood?"^\


;ld c,WIL_DefA1,80
bg new_cha_i1ep,22
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「数多の世界で、お前にしか与えられない。@それは、全ての世界の中で、金蔵にとってお前は、ベアトリーチェの次に最も重要な人間であることを示している。@そしてそれは、実の息子の蔵臼や、孫の朱志香を遥かに超えている。@そしてさらに、お前の年齢である１９。@……即ち、１９年前に何があったかを遡れば、導き出される一つの推理がある。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400837.ogg":^"In all of the many worlds, you are the only one who receives it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400838.ogg":^  That means that, in all worlds, you are the most important person to Kinzo, second only to Beatrice.^\:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400839.ogg":^  And his love for you is clearly greater than it is for his son, Krauss, or his granddaughter, Jessica.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400840.ogg":^  And you are 19 years old.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400841.ogg":^  ...In other words, if we look back to see what happened 19 years ago, it can lead to a certain theory."^\

bg new_cha_i1ap,26
_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_fuman1.png",23
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「１９年前？@　私が生まれた時に、何があったというんですか。」@
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300403.ogg":^"19 years ago?^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300404.ogg":^  What's supposed to have happened at the time I was born?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai1.png",24
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「………あなたも聞いたはずよ？@　それも今日。@ウィルと一緒にね？」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100096.ogg":^"...You heard it too, didn't you?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100097.ogg":^  You even heard it today.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100098.ogg":^  And Will was with you, right?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「……………………。@……まさか、楼座叔母さんの話だというのですか？！」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300405.ogg":^"......^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300406.ogg":^...You don't mean...Aunt Rosa's story?!"^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime1.png",24
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「そうだ。@第３のゲームで楼座の話が出て、第５のゲームでの赤ん坊の年齢が時間軸で一致した時、一つの推理が生まれた。@あの金蔵が、どこからともなく赤ん坊を連れてきて、自分の血族に加えろというのは、@その赤ん坊が特別な存在であることの証拠だ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400842.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400843.ogg":^  Rosa's story came out in the 3rd game, and when the age of the baby in the 5th game matched that date, a certain theory became possible.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400844.ogg":^  The fact that Kinzo brought a baby from somewhere and tried to add it to his family...^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400845.ogg":^proves that the baby was somehow important to him."^\

textoff
