langjp「九羽鳥庵のベアトリーチェは、潜水艦で来たベアトリーチェの娘だ。@……しかし金蔵は娘と思わなかった。@生き写しの、生まれ変わりと信じた。@……その生まれ変わりが、かつての年齢にまで成長し、まさに生き写しとなった時。@金蔵は過ちを犯したんだ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400846.ogg":^"The Kuwadorian Beatrice was the daughter of the Beatrice who arrived in that submarine.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400847.ogg":^  ...But Kinzo didn't think of her as a daughter.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400848.ogg":^  He believed she was the same person, Beatrice reborn.^\:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400849.ogg":^  ...When that `reborn Beatrice' reached the same age as the first Beatrice, and truly looked like Beatrice's double...^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400850.ogg":^  Kinzo made a terrible mistake."^\
