;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100099.ogg":^"That's how it is.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100100.ogg":^  Kinzo got Beatrice pregnant with Beatrice, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100101.ogg":^and then he got that Beatrice pregnant with you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100102.ogg":^  ...So, you're both Kinzo's child and Beatrice's grandchild."^\

