;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100106.ogg":^  ...After all, it took a dizzying span of time just to find a Fragment with you in it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100107.ogg":^  Mathematically speaking, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100108.ogg":^there's actually a 2,578,916/2,578,917 chance of her refusing to raise you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100109.ogg":^  You should probably be thanking me for creating this miracle, not Natsuhi.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100110.ogg":^  ...*giggle*giggle*."^\

