langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500002.ogg":^"......Listen.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500003.ogg":^  I am one yet many.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500004.ogg":^  What I speak is our tale.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500005.ogg":^  However, this is a small world, sealed by glass and cork, with no one to hear.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500006.ogg":^  None shall lay eyes upon it, and my entire tale shall be sealed away,^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500007.ogg":^ set adrift in the sea of my heart until it disappears amongst the seaweed..."^\

