langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500018.ogg":^"And yet, we cannot go against fate.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500019.ogg":^  Oh, I am one yet many.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500020.ogg":^  I pray that the new fate brings us blessings.^@/
advsetwindow "55"


langjp時は西暦１９７６年４月。@春を語るにはあまりに寒き頃のこと。@新しき異郷は何ら変わることなく、朽ちた空気と隙間風で我等を苛むのである……。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500021.ogg":^  The time is 1976 AD, in April.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500022.ogg":^  At a time still too cool to be called spring.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500023.ogg":^  In a strange new land, we were tormented by the same stale air and drafts..."^\

