advsetwindow "03"

langjp「以上が、当家のルールです。@厳しいですが、当家で躾けられたことが、皆さんの将来にきっと役立つものと信じています。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900015.ogg":^"Those are the family rules.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900016.ogg":^  They may be strict, but I believe that the discipline you learn in this house will serve you well in the future."^\

;bg Mhal_2co,24

bg new_mhal_1a,25
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「「「はい、奥様。」」」\
;＜立ち絵なし
langen:dwave 0, "voice\00\awase7005_o.ogg":^"""Yes, Madam."""^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　この４月より、新しく迎えられた使用人たちが、声を揃える。@
langen^The servants who would start working this April all called out in unison.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　規則が窮屈なのは、福音の家も右代宮家も変わらない。\
langen^The rules of the Ushiromiya family are no more or less strict than those of the Fukuin House.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　しかしここでは、とても大きな給金がもらえる。@
langjp　そして、再就職に当たっては強力なバックアップをしてくれた。\
langen^However, we get paid a lot of money here.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^They also give us a lot of help in finding our next job.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　右代宮家で働き、お金を貯めて、良い会社に就職を斡旋してもらい、新しい幸せな人生を切り拓く。@
langen^We work for the Ushiromiya family, store up money, use their influence to get a job at a good company, and start on a new, happy life.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……それが福音の家のみんなが描く、もっとも現実的な夢だった。\
langen^...That was the dream, and it was a very realistic one, held by all of us at the Fukuin House.^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　しかし、誰もが右代宮家の使用人になれるわけではない。@
langjp　品行方正で成績優秀な子しか、推薦はされない。@
langen^However, not everyone can become an Ushiromiya family servant.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Only kids with a record of exemplary conduct and good grades are recommended.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　なので、絶対に福音の家を出て行って幸せになってやると願う子たちは、皆、熱心に勉強を励んでいた……。\
langen^So, all of the kids who want to be sure of leaving the Fukuin House to live a happy life are feverishly devoted to their studies...^\

bg new_mhal_2co,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",2
_ld c,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_zutuu1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「では、これで今日はおしまいです。@明日からは早いですよ。@消灯時間を守るように。@解散。」@
;＜夏妃
langjp「「「はい、奥様。@ありがとうございます。」」」\
;＜立ち絵なし
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900017.ogg":^"That's enough for today.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900018.ogg":^  Tomorrow, you start early.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900019.ogg":^  Make sure the lights are all out at the appropriate time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900020.ogg":^  That is all."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\00\awase7006.ogg":^"""Yes, Madam.^@:dwave 0, "voice\00\awase7007.ogg":^  Thank you very much."""^\

cl c,4
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　夏妃の姿が見えなくなるまで頭を下げ続けていた新しい使用人たちは、@先輩使用人が頭を上げたのに倣い、頭を上げる。\
langen^After bowing until Natsuhi was no longer in sight,^@^ the new servants all followed the lead of one of the more experienced servants and raised their heads.^\

bg new_mhal_1co,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\rg1\1\rg1_e21_fuman2.png",23
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「じゃあ、今日はこれでおしまいよ。@明日からはシフト通り。@奥様は時間に厳しい方よ。@あんたらが寝坊したら私の責任にされるわ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300004.ogg":^"Okay, we're done for the day.^@:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300005.ogg":^  Starting tomorrow, you'll be following your shift schedule.^@:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300006.ogg":^  The Madam is very strict about time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300007.ogg":^  If any of you sleep in, it'll be my responsibility.^@/
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp寝坊したら蹴り起こしてやる。@いいわね！」\
;＜ルシファー
langen:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300008.ogg":^  So if you do, I'll kick you awake.^@:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300009.ogg":^  Got it?!"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　先輩使用人ももちろん、福音の家出身の先輩だ。@
langjp　彼女は２年前にここへ来たらしい。@
langen^Of course, this experienced servant was one of the older girls from the Fukuin House.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^She's been here for two years, apparently.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　だから、私以外の年上の新入りたちは、彼女と面識があるようだった。@
langen^That's probably why all the other new servants, who are older than me, seem to know her well.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　奥様厳しそうっすねー、マジ疲れましたー、きゃっきゃと騒いでいる。\
langen^`That Madam looks so strict.'  `Dang, I'm tired.`  `*giggle*giggle*.'^\

;se1 47
cl l,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\rg1\1\rg1_e11_fuman1.png",23
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「……ところでこの子、何者？@　どうして使用人に選ばれたわけ？」@
;＜ルシファ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300010.ogg":^"...By the way, who exactly is this kid?^@:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300011.ogg":^  Why were you chosen to be a servant?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　先輩が私を指差し、怪訝そうな目で周りに訪ねる。\
langen^The older servant pointed at me and asked the room at large, a dubious look on her face.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　確かに怪訝にも思うだろう。@
langjp　普通、使用人たちは中卒か高卒を機に、使用人になる。@
langen^It's no surprise, really.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Most of us become servants when we graduate middle school or high school.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　でも私は、これから小学校だった。\
langen^But I'm just starting elementary school.^\

;bg Different_spiral_1a,28
bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　他の使用人たちはこれから毎日、通常のシフトに従い、使用人をすることになる。@
langen^The others will be working as servants every day of the week, according to their standard shift schedule.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　しかし私は、平日はお嬢様と一緒に新島の小学校に通い、@空いた時間と、土日だけお勤めをするのだ。\
langen^However, on weekdays, I was going to go to the elementary school on Niijima with Milady,^@^ only working on weekends and when I had free time.^\

bg new_mhal_2a,6
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　それは、これまでに例のない、異例中の異例だった。@
langen^It was an exception among exceptions, something that had never happened before.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……厳しい選抜を潜り抜けて推薦を得た彼らにとって、@私が納得行かない存在であるのは、一目瞭然だった。\
langen^...It was clear at a glance that the others, who had obtained their positions after a rigorous selection process,^@^ didn't like the fact that I was here too.^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rg1\1\rg1_e11_def1.png",24
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「……あんたについては、学業最優先でと奥様からも源次さまからも言われてるわ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300012.ogg":^"...Both Madam and Genji-sama have told me that you are to put your studies first.^@/
advsetwindow "-1"

langjpでもお給金は出るんですってよ。@意味わかんない。」\
;＜ルシファ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300013.ogg":^  But you're still getting paid.^@:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300014.ogg":^  Doesn't make any sense."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　陰口なら、陰で言ってくれればいいのに。@……先輩ははばかることなく、堂々と言う。\
langen^If you're going to talk behind someone's back, at least do it behind them.^@^  She didn't even try to hide her discontent.^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rg1\1\rg1_e21_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「こいつ、そんなに勉強できるの？@　天才児？」@
;＜ルシファ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300015.ogg":^"Is this kid really that smart?^@:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300016.ogg":^  A child prodigy, or something?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\rg2\1\rg2_e11_fuman1.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"
langjp「全然知んないです。」@
langjp「なんか病弱とかって、隔離されてたらしくて、家でも全然知りませんでしたし。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\39\72400004.ogg":^"I never heard anything about that."^\
_ld c,":b;sprites\rg3\1\rg3_e11_fuman1.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\40\72500004.ogg":^"Well, that kid supposedly gets sick easily and is kept isolated most of the time.  A total outsider to the rest of us, even back at the House."^\

bg new_Mhal_2co,24
_ld l,":b;sprites\rg1\1\rg1_e11_fuman1.png",23
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「……ここに来た以上、連帯責任なんだからね。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300017.ogg":^"...Now that you're here, you're part of the collective responsibility system.^@/
advsetwindow "-1"

langjpあんたがドジれば、福音の家の全員のドジだと思われるのよ。@せいぜい気合入れなさいよね。」\
;＜ルシファ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300018.ogg":^  If you screw up, it's the same as everyone from the Fukuin House screwing up.^@:dwave 0, "voice\38\72300019.ogg":^  Make sure you don't, okay?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　私は弱々しく頷く。@……こんなにも年上の人に凄まれることなんて、経験がなかったので、とても怖かった。\
langen^I nodded weakly.^@^  ...I'd never been threatened by someone this much older than me, and I was very frightened.^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「大丈夫よ。@私も一緒だから。@二人でがんばろ。@ね。」@
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500092.ogg":^"Don't worry.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500093.ogg":^  I'll be there with you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500094.ogg":^  Let's give it our all together,^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500095.ogg":^ okay?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　紗音はそう言って、そっと微笑んでくれた…。\
langen^Shannon smiled at me as she spoke...^\

