;＜ゼパル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\51\75100011.ogg":^"Then if I thought it was fun, would it get fun?!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\fur\1\fur_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "52"

langjp「うん、楽しくなるよ。@だからここでも、笑顔でがんばろう。」\
;＜フルフル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\52\75200014.ogg":^"Yeah, it would.^@:dwave 0, "voice\52\75200015.ogg":^  So here too, let's give it our all with a smile."^\

bg new_the_2b,24
_ld c,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_nayamu1.png",22
advsetwindow "55"

langjp「……紗音は、福音の家からの唯一の友人だった。@彼女はしっかり者で人気者。@我とは大違い。@我は呆れるくらいにのろまで要領が悪くて、誰も友人になどなってはくれなかった。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500026.ogg":^"...Shannon was my only friend in the Fukuin House.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500027.ogg":^  She was confident and popular.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500028.ogg":^  The complete opposite of me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500029.ogg":^  I was embarrassingly dull-witted, and no one wanted to be my friend."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_houshin1star.png",80
advsetwindow "55"

langjp「そんな我が、福音の家でがんばってこれたのは、彼女がいつも励ましてくれたからだ。@……なら、ここでも彼女と一緒に頑張れるだろう。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500032.ogg":^"I would never have made it through those days in the Fukuin House had it not been for her encouragement.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500033.ogg":^  ...So, I would probably make it through here too, with her by my side."^\

bg black,23
bg new_the_2b,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\zep\1\zep_a11_majime2.png",23
advsetwindow "51"

langjp「さぁ、早く寝支度をして休もう？@　私は明日からすぐにお仕事だけれど、あなたは別のお仕事があるわ。」@
;＜ゼパル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\51\75100012.ogg":^"Well, isn't it about time we got ready for bed?^@:dwave 0, "voice\51\75100013.ogg":^  I've got work early tomorrow morning, but you have a different job."^\

;se1 48
_ld r,":b;sprites\fur\1\fur_a11_warai2.png",66
advsetwindow "52"

langjp「そう、私はみんなと違って、学校に通わなければならない。@六軒島で泊まる時は、学校の支度をして、船着場でお嬢様をお迎えしなくちゃいけない。」\
;＜フルフル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\52\75200016.ogg":^"That's right.  Unlike everyone else, I have to go to school.^@:dwave 0, "voice\52\75200017.ogg":^  When I spend the night on Rokkenjima, I have to get ready for school and wait for Milady at the dock."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\zep\1\zep_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "51"

langjp「お嬢様、元気そうな人だったね。@仲良くなれるといいね！」@
;＜ゼパル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\51\75100014.ogg":^"Milady looks like an energetic person.^@:dwave 0, "voice\51\75100015.ogg":^  I hope you get along well!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\fur\1\fur_a11_majime2.png",80
advsetwindow "52"

langjp「な、仲良くなれるかな…。@私、学校は怖いよ、緊張するよ…！」\
;＜フルフル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\52\75200018.ogg":^"D-Do you think I will...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\52\75200019.ogg":^  I'm so scared of school, so nervous...!"^\

bg new_the_2b,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_nayamu1.png",24
_ld c,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "55"

langjp「……福音の家での生活に慣れていた我にとっては、規則緩き学校など気楽なもの。@しかし、慣れるまでは、全てが新しく、そして不安なのだった。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500034.ogg":^"...I had grown used to life in the Fukuin House, so the more relaxed rules at school made life easy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500035.ogg":^  But until I grew used to it, everything was new, and everything made me nervous."^\

