;■六軒島の風景など...

langjp　六軒島の新しい生活について、説明が要るだろう。@
langen^My new life on Rokkenjima probably deserves an explanation.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br

langjp　ここでの日々は、福音の家での、温かいながらも澱んで滞った日々とはまったく違う。\
langen^It was completely different from the comfortable yet stagnant life I'd lived at the Fukuin House.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　私には六軒島の右代宮家に仕える使用人としての日々と、新島の小学校に通う日々が同時に与えられた。@
langen^In addition to the time I spent as a servant to the Ushiromiya family on Rokkenjima,^@^ I also traveled to the elementary school on Niijima on school days.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　慌しくて忙しくて、気の緩む間もない新しき日々の幕開けである。\
langen^It was the start of a time that was both rushed and busy, with hardly a moment to relax.^\

bg new_m1f_p1df,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　福音の家と違い、ここでは毎日を同じベッドでは寝られない。@
langjp　週の半分は六軒島のお屋敷の、使用人控え室のベッドで休む。@
langen^Unlike the time I spent at the Fukuin House, I didn't get to sleep in the same bed every day.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Half of the week, I slept in the servant waiting room in the Rokkenjima mansion.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　放課後にお嬢様と一緒に下校してお屋敷へ行き、そこで使用人としてのお勤めをして、@そのまま泊まって翌朝、またお嬢様と一緒に登校するのだ。\
langen^I would return from school with Milady, go to the mansion, and work there as a servant.^@^  I would then stay the night and go to school with Milady again the next day.^\

