langjp「えぇ。@福音の家から毎年、何人かの使用人が入れ替わりでやって来ていました。」@
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900021.ogg":^"Correct.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900022.ogg":^  Every year, new servants came from the Fukuin House, replacing some of the old ones."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_nayamu1.png",23
advsetwindow "02"

langjp「あれに関しては、親父殿が先方と決めて勝手にやっていたことだからね。@私たちには、何も口出し出来なかったよ。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800017.ogg":^"It was something Father worked out with the House all on his own.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800018.ogg":^  The rest of us weren't allowed to meddle."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime2.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「身寄りのない子供たちを当家が厳しく躾け、そして社会へ羽ばたいて行くのを応援するのが、@富める右代宮家の社会への義務と思っていましたから。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900023.ogg":^"And after all, our family would strictly discipline these children without families and support them on their path to adulthood,^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900024.ogg":^ which I always viewed as the rich Ushiromiya family fulfilling its obligations to society."^\

bg new_the_2b,24
;se1 48
_ld l,":b;sprites\fur\1\fur_a11_warai2.png",66
advsetwindow "52"

langjp「どんな子たちが右代宮家へ来ていたのかしら？」@
;＜フルフル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\52\75200020.ogg":^"What sort of kids came to serve the Ushiromiya family?"^\

;se2 47
_ld r,":b;sprites\zep\1\zep_a11_warai1.png",66
advsetwindow "51"

langjp「きっと品行方正！@　真面目で良い子で可愛い子たちさ！」\
;＜ゼパル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\51\75100016.ogg":^"I'm sure they were serious, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\51\75100017.ogg":^cute kids of irreproachable conduct!"^\

bg new_the_2a,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_zutuu1.png",23
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「ぎらぎらとした、ハイエナみたいな子が多かった印象です。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900025.ogg":^"It seemed to me that there were a lot of glaring hyenas among them."^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a14_komaru1.png",24
advsetwindow "02"

langjp「上昇志向が強かった、と言いたまえ。@身寄りのない気の毒な子たちだ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800019.ogg":^"Let us say they had high ambitions.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800020.ogg":^  They were pitiable children without families.^@/

_ld c,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a14_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "02"

langjp貴重な機会を踏み台に、自分の人生を必ず掴み取ってやろうという気概に溢れていたよ。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800021.ogg":^  All were determined to use this rare opportunity to launch their careers, so that they could take control of their lives."^\

bg new_the_1d,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\fur\1\fur_a11_def1.png",24
advsetwindow "52"

langjp「みんな、学校生活と使用人生活を両立してたの？」@
;＜フルフル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\52\75200021.ogg":^"Did all of them have to balance school and servant work?"^\

;se1 48
_ld c,":b;sprites\zep\1\zep_a11_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "51"

langjp「それは大変だね！@　ほとんど働けやしない！」\
;＜ゼパル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\51\75100018.ogg":^"That must be tough!^@:dwave 0, "voice\51\75100019.ogg":^  You wouldn't be able to get much work done!"^\

bg new_the_2b,23
_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_zutuu1.png",23
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「学校に通いながら働く子など、あの子以前には前例もありませんでした。」@
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900026.ogg":^"Before that child, there were no cases of a servant going to school while they worked."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_nayamu2.png",24
advsetwindow "02"

langjp「正直、最初の挨拶の時に驚いたよ。@明らかに幼かった。@他の子たちは１６歳から１８歳くらいなのだが、その子だけはさらに１０歳は幼く見えた。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800022.ogg":^"To be honest, I was fairly surprised when that kid first came to greet me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800023.ogg":^  So obviously young.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800024.ogg":^  The others were all around 16 or 18 years old, but that kid alone looked 10 years younger."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「福音の家から来る若過ぎる使用人は、あくまでも社会勉強として当家に訪れているのであって、@そもそも、使用人としての腕前はあまり期待していません。」@
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900027.ogg":^"That one extraordinarily young servant came to the family mainly for experience,^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900028.ogg":^ so not much was expected of that child's ability as a servant."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_akuwarai2.png",80
advsetwindow "02"

langjp「そうだな。@やはり大人の、年季の入った使用人たちに比べると、どうしても頼りないものだ。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800025.ogg":^"Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800026.ogg":^  You certainly couldn't rely on that kid as much as you could an adult, seasoned servant."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_zutuu1.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「それが、未就学の子を受け入れるなんて。@家事はおろか、社会勉強どころか義務教育もまだではありませんか。@お父様にどんなお考えがあったのか存じませんが、明らかにおかしいと思いました。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900029.ogg":^"To think that we would accept a child who hadn't even started school...^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900030.ogg":^  No knowledge of housework, no practical experience, and not even finished with mandatory education.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900031.ogg":^  I don't know what Father was thinking, but I always thought there was something clearly odd about it."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "02"

langjp「親父殿には申し上げたさ。@せめて中学を出るまでは福音の家で学ばせるべきではないかとね。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800027.ogg":^"I spoke to Father about it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800028.ogg":^  I asked if it might be better to wait for this servant to graduate middle school before starting here."^\

bg black,23
bg new_the_2b,23
