;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800029.ogg":^"Hahaha...^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800030.ogg":^  By that time, he was already a complete shut-in inside his study, obsessed with the occult.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800031.ogg":^  If you tried to talk to him when he didn't want you to, he'd yell and tell you to stop interrupting `the journey of his mind'."^\

