;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900032.ogg":^"And Father's decisions are absolute.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900033.ogg":^  ...However, the case of this particular child just didn't make sense."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "02"

langjp「福音の家にも問い合わせたさ。@そしたら源次さんに聞いてくれという。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800032.ogg":^"I even asked the Fukuin House about it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800033.ogg":^  They said to ask Genji-san.^@/
