langjp「源次の配慮、と見るべきだろうな。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400946.ogg":^"We should probably view this as an arrangement planned by Genji."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_akire1a.png",24
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「………でしょうね。@……源次さんは、その世界の私がお祖父さまの血を引くと知っていて、@特別な配慮をして、六軒島に呼び寄せたのでしょう。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300450.ogg":^"...Probably.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300451.ogg":^  ...Genji-san knew that the `me' in this world carried Grandfather's blood,^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300452.ogg":^ so he probably arranged for that `me' to be summoned to Rokkenjima."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「体調は、もう大丈夫なのか。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400947.ogg":^"Are you feeling okay now?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_fuman1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「……色々とショックが大き過ぎただけです。@……もう、眩暈くらいしか。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300453.ogg":^"...It was a really big shock, that's all.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300454.ogg":^  ...I just feel a bit dizzy now."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「この世界では次期当主。@しかし、世界が違えば、使用人、……いや、魔女だったかもしれない。@……お前も、難儀な運命だ。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400948.ogg":^"In this world, you're the Successor.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400949.ogg":^  But if we move to a different world, you're a servant...or maybe a witch.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400950.ogg":^  ...You do have a troubled fate."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_akire1a.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「まったくです……。@知ったことを後悔はしませんが、今からでも忘れられるなら、それを選びたいです。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300455.ogg":^"No kidding...^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300456.ogg":^  I don't regret learning about it, but if I could forget it now, I would."^\

bg new_cha_i1np,24
;se1 52
_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai1.png",22
advsetwindow "28"
;print 99,2000,"breakup.dll/llb"

langjp「くすくす、面白いじゃない。@使用人なのに、実は当主の血を引く隠し子なんて……。@まるで、童話のようにロマンティックな話よ？」@
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100153.ogg":^"*giggle*  Isn't it interesting?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100154.ogg":^  Even though you're a servant, you're actually an illegitimate child of the Head...^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100155.ogg":^  Isn't that romantic, like some fairy tale?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_akire1.png",23
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「……ロマンティック？@　……母さんの気持ちを考えると、複雑です。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300457.ogg":^"...Romantic?^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300458.ogg":^  ...Considering how Mom must have felt, I'm not sure what to think."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「うふふ、そうね。@夏妃にとってこの世界の理御は、育てろと押し付けられた気に入らない赤ん坊に過ぎない。@そしてそれを拒絶した世界でもある。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100156.ogg":^"Heheheh, true.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100157.ogg":^  In Natsuhi's eyes, the Lion of this world is nothing more than the baby she hated and was forced to raise.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100158.ogg":^  And in this world, she rejected that child.^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai3.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp……夏妃にとっては自分の腹を痛めた朱志香の方が何百倍も可愛いわ。@自分の血の入らぬ赤ん坊なんて、汚らわしくて生暖かい汚物の皮袋と同じよ。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100159.ogg":^  ...Natsuhi must adore her natural child Jessica a bunch more.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100160.ogg":^  A baby that doesn't share your blood is nothing more than a dirty, lukewarm sack of filth."^\

bg new_cha_i1dp,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_ikari1.png",24
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「言葉を選べ。@俺でもケツを抓るぞ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400951.ogg":^"Have some decency.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400952.ogg":^  Next time, I'll be the one pinching your butt."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_majime1.png",24
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「……ありがとう、ウィル。@……大体、話は見えます。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300459.ogg":^"...Thank you, Will.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300460.ogg":^  ...I think I understand, more or less.^@/
advsetwindow "53"

;ld r,RIO_MajimeA1,80

langjpだからこそ、私は母さんに一層感謝しなくてはならない。@この歳になるまで、こんなにも公平に育ててくれたことを。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300461.ogg":^  And that's exactly why I need to be grateful to my mother.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300462.ogg":^  She's raised me fairly all these years."^\

cl l,24
_ld l,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai4.png",23
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「奇跡的な確率でだけれどね。@……動物というのはね、自分の血が入らない子供にはいつも残酷なのよ。@ライオンとかもそうでしょう？　……くすくすくす。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100161.ogg":^"Though at a probability so low it'd take a miracle to happen.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100162.ogg":^  ...Animals are always brutal towards children that don't carry their blood.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100163.ogg":^  Lions do that too, don't they?  ...*giggle*giggle*."^\

bg new_cha_i1ip,23
_ld c,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",24
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「源次は恐らくこう考えた。@……この世界の理御は、正しい血統を持つ右代宮家の人間だ。@何とか六軒島で生活させてやりたかった。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400953.ogg":^"We can probably sketch out Genji's line of thinking.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400954.ogg":^  ...The Lion of this world is a true, blood-related member of the Ushiromiya Family.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400955.ogg":^  He must have wanted to let that child live on Rokkenjima somehow.^@/
advsetwindow "54"

;ld c,WIL_NiramuA1,80

langjpしかし、いきなり連れてきて、この子がそうですというわけにはいかなかったわけだ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400956.ogg":^  However, it wasn't as though he could just suddenly show up with Lion and tell everyone who this was."^\

