;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300463.ogg":^"...Yeah.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300464.ogg":^  Maybe he wanted me to live on the island until I was used to it, and then reveal everything when the chance presented itself."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime2.png",24
advsetwindow "54"

