langjp「それは知れば知るほどに容易ならざる物語。@我の生まれを、祝福する者もいれば、祝福せざる者もいる。@……源次はそれを明かす日を静かに待つしかないのである。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500039.ogg":^"The more one learns, the less simple this tale becomes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500040.ogg":^  There were some who celebrated my birth, and some who did not.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500041.ogg":^  ...Genji could only wait in silence for the proper day to reveal it all."^\

