;＜フルフル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\52\75200028.ogg":^"Lion and Kinzo and Natsuhi and Krauss and Jessica and everyone else!^@:dwave 0, "voice\52\75200029.ogg":^  None of them knew this tale!"^\

