;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500042.ogg":^"Thus, the curtains slowly rise on this curious tale in the year 1976.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500043.ogg":^  Oh, I am one yet many.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500044.ogg":^  Why must fate abandon us and continue on its merry way...?"^\
