advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　みんなは、私はお嬢様の遊び相手だけが仕事だと言って、ずるいと言ってる。@
langen^Everyone complains that I'm just there to play with Milady.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　でも、奥様からは、お嬢様のことを決して友人などと思って、気安く話し掛けないようにと念を押されてる。\
langen^And yet, Madam made it clear that I am not to think of Milady as a friend or speak to her in a casual manner.^\

bg new_dor_r1bn,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_def1.png",26
_ld r,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_tokui1.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「あなたはみんなより１０も幼いけれど。@ということは、みんなと同じ歳になるまでここで頑張ったなら、@新しく来る人たちより、ずっと仕事の出来る人になっているということだよ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500104.ogg":^"You may be ten years younger than everyone else,^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500105.ogg":^ but that means, if you keep it up until you're the same age as the others,^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500106.ogg":^ you'll be much more experienced than the new people who come later.^\
advsetwindow "15"

;ld r,SHA_WaraiA1,80

langjp源次さまにも認められて、あなたは新しく福音の家から来る人たちに仕事を教えてあげる、リーダーの役になるの。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500107.ogg":^  Even Genji-sama will acknowledge your talents, and you'll become a leader who can teach the new kids who come from the Fukuin House."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「そしてきっと、みんなに尊敬されるわ。@その頃にはきっと奥様にも認められて、お館様や旦那様にも認められるようになってるよ。@それが、あなたの未来。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500108.ogg":^"And then, I'm sure that everyone will respect you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500109.ogg":^  By that time, even Madam, the Master, and Krauss-sama will acknowledge your skills.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500110.ogg":^  That's your future."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

;textoff
;se1 13
;wait 600
langjp「……醜いアヒルの子みたいな、白鳥になれる未来？」\
langen^"...You mean like the ugly duckling becoming a swan?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_tokui1.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「そうかもしれないね。@だって、あなたが右代宮家の使用人に選ばれたのは、本当に不思議だもの。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500111.ogg":^"That might be it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500112.ogg":^  After all, it was very unusual for you to be chosen as an Ushiromiya family servant.^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "15"
langjp……ひょっとすると、本当にあなたは誰かが噂していたように、@右代宮家の血筋を引く、誰かの隠し子かもしれないね。@くす。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500113.ogg":^  ...In fact, that rumor might be true, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500114.ogg":^and you might be the secret child of someone in the Ushiromiya family.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500115.ogg":^  *giggle*."^\

bg new_dor_r1dn,25
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　だったらすごいね、大金持ちの仲間入りだねと、紗音は笑います。@
langjp　でも、私はほんの少しだけ、微妙な気持ち。@
langen^Shannon laughed, saying `Wouldn't that be cool' and `Then you'd be super-rich too'.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^But that didn't seem quite right to me.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　だって、……ならどうして私は、福音の家でひとりぼっちで暮らしていたの？\
langen^After all, ...if that was the case, why have I had to live all alone, here in the Fukuin House?^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　遊んでくれるのは、園長先生たちと、紗音だけでした。@
langjp　他のお友達とは遊ばせてもらえなくて、……ずっと自分だけ、隔離されたお部屋で過ごしてた。@
langen^Shannon and people like the House Director are the only ones who will play with me.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^I don't have any other friends to play with, ...and I've spent all my time by myself, in my isolated room.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　私が病弱で、いつも寝てばかりいたからだろうけど、………寂しかったな。\
langen^Maybe it's because I'm frail and always sleep a lot, ...but it has been lonely.^\
textoff


