advsetwindow "54"

langjp「つまり理御とは。@……過ちを犯した金蔵が、その罪を悔い、@右代宮家に正しい形で迎え入れた存在、ということだ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400961.ogg":^"So, then we get Lion.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400962.ogg":^  ...Kinzo, trying to atone for his sin,^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400963.ogg":^ tried to make Lion a proper member of the Ushiromiya family."^\

bg new_cha_i1ep,24
_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai1.png",22
advsetwindow "28"
;print 99,2000,"breakup.dll/llb"

langjp「……そういうことよ。@他のカケラの話をするとおしりを抓られそうだけれど。@/
langjp!s0……理御が迎え入れられながら、/
langjp!d800……再び金蔵が過ちを犯すカケラ、/
langjp!d1000なんてのもあったりして。/
langjp!sd@……そのカケラも探してみる？@　くすくすくすくす………。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100164.ogg":^"...Exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100165.ogg":^  I get the feeling I'll get my butt pinched if I talk about other Fragments, ^@/
advsetwindow "28"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100166.ogg":!s1^...but what if there was a Fragment...^@/
advsetwindow "28"
langen:delay 2500:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100167.ogg":^...where Lion is accepted...^@/
advsetwindow "28"
langen:delay 2600:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100168.ogg":^and Kinzo commits the same sin again?^@/
advsetwindow "28"
langen!sd@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100169.ogg":^  Wanna see if we can find one of those?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100170.ogg":^  *giggle*giggle*..."^\

bg new_cha_i1ip,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_ikari1.png",23
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「見たくありません、そんなものっ。@………人の人生のあらゆる場所に、最悪の可能性や妄想を勝手に混ぜ込んで、その運命を嘲笑うのが、あなたの仕事なんですか？！」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300466.ogg":^"Who would want to see something like that?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300467.ogg":^  ...Is this your job, mixing up the worst possible delusions and possibilities for every part of a person's life and sneering at them?!"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",23
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「残念なことに、こいつはそういう悪魔だ。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400964.ogg":^"Unfortunately, that's the sort of demon she is."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai1.png",24
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「魔女よ、失礼ね。@くすくす……。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100171.ogg":^"How rude.  I'm a witch.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100172.ogg":^  *giggle*..."^\

bg new_cha_i1lp,25
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「……源次は、そういう最悪の未来を予見し、より良い未来になるよう、わざと赤ん坊は死んだと、虚偽を伝えたというわけだ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400965.ogg":^"......Genji foresaw that worst of all possible futures, and, trying to secure a better future, he intentionally lied about the baby being dead."^\
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「そうよ。@実の娘を慰み者にして、ほとぼりも冷めない男よ。@ベアトリーチェの気持ちを知り同情していた源次は、金蔵のことを容易く信じることが出来なかったの。」@
;＜ベルン
langjp「金蔵の忠実な僕である源次がか。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100173.ogg":^"Right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100174.ogg":^  Kinzo was a man so impulsive that he used his own daughter.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100175.ogg":^  Genji, who knew Beatrice's feelings and felt sympathy for her, couldn't trust Kinzo so easily."^\
advsetwindow "54"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400966.ogg":^"Even Genji, Kinzo's most devoted servant?"^\

bg new_cha_i1ap,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_def1.png",26
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「源次は公私をしっかりと使い分けられる男よ。@金蔵に忠誠を尽くす一方で、娘に対して犯した過ちは、容易に許されるべきではないと思っていたわ。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100176.ogg":^"Genji draws a clear line between the professional and the personal.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100177.ogg":^  While he served Kinzo faithfully, he also felt that the mistake Kinzo had made with his daughter was not one to be forgiven easily."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「……かもな。@源次は、理御の存在が容易に知れることがないよう、３つも年齢を詐称させてる。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400967.ogg":^"...Could be.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400968.ogg":^  And to make sure that Lion wouldn't be found out easily, Genji lied about the kid's age, lowering it by three years."^\

cl r,23
_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_komaru1.png",24
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「確かに。@この世界の私は、１９７６年に小学校入学になってる。@その年には、自分はもう４年生になってるはずです。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300468.ogg":^"That's a good point.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300469.ogg":^  In this world, I'm just entering elementary school in 1976.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300470.ogg":^  I was actually supposed to become a 4th year then."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「病弱だったことが理由にならないなら、………源次は恐らく入念に、生まれ年も誤魔化そうとしたんだろう。@１９年前の赤ん坊のことを、金蔵だけでなく、夏妃だって簡単には忘れないはず。@そこに、その年に生まれた不審な幼い使用人が入ってきたら、夏妃の女の勘は、ピンと来たはずだ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400969.ogg":^"If your frailness wasn't the reason, ...then Genji must have been careful to disguise the year of your birth.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400970.ogg":^  Not only Kinzo, but also Natsuhi, ...wouldn't easily forget the baby from 19 years ago.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400971.ogg":^  If a suspiciously young servant of that age came to the island, Natsuhi's woman's intuition would definitely have picked up on it."^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　病弱だったから、３年も学校へ行けなかった？@
langjp　あるいは夏妃に気取られることを恐れ、３年、歳をずらした？\
langen^Had the child been too sick to go to school for three years?^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Or had the age been faked, so that Natsuhi wouldn't figure everything out?^\

bg new_cha_i1ip,26
_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",24
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「何れにせよ、この世界のお前は、歳を３つ、少なく教えられているはずだ。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400972.ogg":^"Either way, we know that your age has been lowered by three in this world."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai2.png",23
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「………ご名答。@この世界の理御は生まれつき、歳を３つ、誤魔化されてる。@……虚弱で小柄。@発育不良だったしね。@案外誤魔化せたみたいだわ。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100178.ogg":^"...Correct.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100179.ogg":^  The age of this world's Lion has been altered by three.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100180.ogg":^  ...This is a small, feeble kid we're talking about.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100181.ogg":^  An underdeveloped kid.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100182.ogg":^  It would've been more possible to pull off than you'd think."^\

;■メタ劇場
