bg new_the_2a,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_houshin2star.png",2
_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_houshin1star.png",80
advsetwindow "55"

langjp「源次は見届けねばと思った。@金蔵が果たして、ベアトリーチェの子を、子として受け容れられるや、否や。@適齢になるまでを福音の家で過ごさせ、幼き使用人として呼び寄せる。@父も子も、互いに互いを知らない。@源次は思った。@もしも、真に親子の愛情があるならば。@金蔵はこの子に亡き母と娘の面影を見るだろう。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500076.ogg":^"Genji decided to wait and see.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500077.ogg":^  In the end, would Kinzo be able to accept Beatrice's child as an actual child, or not?^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500078.ogg":^  He had the child live in the Fukuin House until a suitable age, and then summoned the child to the island as a servant.^\:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500079.ogg":^  Both father and child had no clue who the other was.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500080.ogg":^  Genji had an idea:^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500081.ogg":^ if Kinzo truly felt affection as a parent,^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500082.ogg":^ he would notice traces of that deceased mother and daughter in this child."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "55"

langjp「そして誰に明かされずとも、親子の絆を取り戻せるに違いない。@そう思った。@……あるいは、その時はやがて自然に訪れるだろう。@その時に、父と子に、真実を話せば良い。@その日がやがて訪れることを信じて、源次は何も知らせず、教えず。@……運命の日を待ちながら、ベアトリーチェの子を見守るのである…。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500083.ogg":^"That way, they would surely regain their parent-child relationship, without anyone having to expose the truth to them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500084.ogg":^  That's what he thought.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500085.ogg":^  ...Or, perhaps, the time might come naturally.^\:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500086.ogg":^  When that happened, he could tell the truth to both father and child.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500087.ogg":^  Believing that this day would eventually come, Genji told nothing of this to anyone.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500088.ogg":^  ...He watched over Beatrice's child, waiting for the fated day..."^\


bg new_the_1e,5
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　そして月日は重ねていく。@
langen^And time continued to pass.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　ベアトリーチェの子を静かに見守りながら、月日は静かに重ねていく……。\
langen^Days slid by as he quietly watched over Beatrice's child...^\

