langjp「どしたー？」@
;＜ベルフェ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\41\72600001.ogg":^"What's up?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\rg3\1\rg3_e11_fuman1.png",23
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「ヤスがチビ箒、またどこかで無くして来たのよ。@こいつ、物をなくす天才？！」\
;＜サタン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\40\72500016.ogg":^"Yasu lost the small broom again.^@:dwave 0, "voice\40\72500017.ogg":^  The kid must be some sort of genius at losing things!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rg4\1\rg4_e11_fuman1.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「だからヤスに物を持たすなといつも言っている。@そいつはそそっかしいから、いつも物をなくす。」@
;＜ベルフェ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\41\72600002.ogg":^"That's why I'm always telling you, never give things to Yasu.^@:dwave 0, "voice\41\72600003.ogg":^  Yasu's always careless and losing things."^\

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_fuman1.png",23
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「一生懸命やってるんだから、そんなこと言っちゃいけません…。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500119.ogg":^"Don't say that.  Can't you see that this kid's working hard...?^@/

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjpほら、急いで探してらっしゃい。@待ってるから。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500120.ogg":^  Go on, hurry and find it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500121.ogg":^  I'll wait for you."^\

mcl c,0

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　う、うん……。@
langen^O-Okay...^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　私は使用人仲間の陰口をそれ以上聞きたくなくて、慌てて踵を返す。\
langen^Not wanting to hear my fellow servants complain even more, I spun around and headed off.^\

bg new_cha_o2af,23
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　道具を無くせば怒られる。@誰のせいかわからなければ、連帯責任で怒られるから、@彼女らは私がなくしたと奥様に言いつけるだろう。\
langen^If you lose a tool, you get in trouble.^@^  If no one knows who did it, we all get yelled at,^@^ so one of them will probably tell Madam that it was my fault.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　でも、なくしたのは私のせいだから私が悪い。@
langen^Still, it really is my fault that I lost it in the first place.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　いつの間になくしてしまったんだろう。@
langjp　いつの間に、いつの間に……。\
langen^I wonder when I lost it.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^When, when...^\

bg black,23
bg new_cha_o1af,23
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　今日は礼拝堂の大掃除だった。@
langen^We cleaned out the entire chapel today.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　礼拝堂は、屋敷の裏手にある大きな建物だ。@しかし、普段は誰も近付かない。\
langen^The chapel is a large building behind the mansion.^@^  However, no one ever goes near it normally.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　そんな礼拝堂も、年に何度か大掃除を命じられる。@
langjp　金蔵にとって神聖な建物であるらしく、夏妃は厳しく清掃を命じていた…。\
langen^Even so, we are ordered to clean it a few times each year.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Kinzo calls it a sacred building, so Natsuhi is very strict about it...^\

bg black,24
bg new_cha_i1dd,24
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　細かいところを、上から下まで、奥から隅まで、全て清掃した。@
langjp　今日一日掛りだった。\
langen^We'd cleaned every little nook and cranny, from top to bottom.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^It had taken all day.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　私は窓枠の清掃も担当だったが、他にも小さな担当をいくつもしていた。@
langen^I had been in charge of cleaning the window frames, but I had also been given many smaller tasks.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　他の小さな仕事にかまけているうちに、すっかり忘れ、@どこかに置きっ放しにしてしまったのだろうか。\
langen^While those small jobs were keeping me busy, I completely forgot about the small broom,^@^ and I must've left it lying around somewhere.^\

bg new_cha_i1ed,25

me1v 5,50
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　……私は、自分で自分が悔しくなる。@
langjp　こういうことは、何もこれが初めてじゃない。\
langen^...I began to hate myself for it.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^This isn't the first time this has happened.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　いつも、いつもなのだ。@
langen^It happens all the time.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　私が何かを置くと、いつも物が消える。@
langjp　どこかに行ってしまう。なくなってしまう。\
langen^Every time I set something down, it always disappears.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^It goes somewhere else.  Vanishes.^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　私は、多分これは、魔女ベアトリーチェの悪戯だと思っていた。@
langjp　魔女ベアトリーチェは、その亡霊が、六軒島の悪霊の力を得て生まれ変わったもの。@
langen^I thought it was probably the witch, Beatrice, pranking me.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^The ghost of the witch gained power from Rokkenjima's evil spirits and was reborn.^@
advsetwindow "-1"

;br
langjp　熊沢さんが教えてくれるまで、海岸の岩にある社の意味なんて知らなかった……。\
langen^Until Kumasawa-san told me, I never knew the meaning of the shrine on the rocks by the sea......^\

;■メタ劇場

