;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500091.ogg":^"Kumasawa told an old, old tale, passed down among the local fishermen.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500092.ogg":^  Rokkenjima used to be known as Akujikishima,^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500093.ogg":^ and terrible evil spirits who ate human souls lived there..."^\

