langjp「ほっほっほ、いいですともいいですとも。@六軒島はかつては、小豆島という名でした。@でももっと大昔の呼び名は、悪食島でした。@島に近寄る船乗りを海の底に引き摺り込んで魂を喰らうと噂されておりまして。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\71800055.ogg":^"Hohoho, very well, very well.^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\71800056.ogg":^  Rokkenjima was once called Azukishima.^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\71800057.ogg":^  However, even deeper in the distant past, it was known as Akujikishima.^\:dwave 0, "voice\18\71800058.ogg":^  It was rumored that sailors who went too near the island were dragged down to the bottom of the sea and had their souls eaten.^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\kum\1\kum_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "18"

langjp……そんな恐ろしい悪霊が、この島にいるんでございますよぅ？@　ほっほっほっほ。」\
;＜熊沢
langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\71800059.ogg":^  ...Yes, frightening spirits such as those do exist on this island.^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\71800060.ogg":^  Hohohoho."^\

bg black,23
bg new_the_1e,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_nayamu1.png",23
advsetwindow "55"

langjp「それは熊沢の好む定番の怪談。@新しい使用人がやって来る度に聞かせる、お約束の怪談。@………普段ならば下らないと笑い捨てられるそれも、右代宮家の屋敷以外に何も存在せず、@嵐の夜には不気味な唸りを聞かせる、この寂しい六軒島では、誰もが神妙に耳を傾けるのだった。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500094.ogg":^"It was Kumasawa's favorite ghost story.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500095.ogg":^  Every new servant who came to the island heard about it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500096.ogg":^  ......Such stories are usually laughed off,^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500097.ogg":^ but when stormy nights visited Rokkenjima, bringing an eerie howling to that lonely island where nothing exists except the Ushiromiya mansion, everyone would listen meekly."^\

