;＜フルフル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\52\75200053.ogg":^"So, not only the timid-looking Shannon,^@:dwave 0, "voice\52\75200054.ogg":^ but a boy, Kanon, and a big adult, Gohda, believed in the ghost story?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kan\1\kan_a11_komaru1.png",23
