langjp「ですね。@怪談もジンクスも、その職場のローカルルールです。@それに新参者が背けば、打ち解けることは出来ませんからね。」\
;＜郷田
langen:dwave 0, "voice\17\71700027.ogg":^"That's it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\17\71700028.ogg":^  Ghost stories and jinxes are the local rules of your workplace.^@:dwave 0, "voice\17\71700029.ogg":^  If a newcomer breaks those rules, they can't expect to be welcomed in."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kan\1\kan_a11_fuman1.png",80
advsetwindow "16"

langjp「そういうこと。@……魔女なんているものか、馬鹿馬鹿しい、なんて言うと、姉さんと喧嘩になるからね。@上辺だけでも合わせた方が楽だったし。」\
;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\70600013.ogg":^"Exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\70600014.ogg":^  ...If I said witches couldn't possibly exist, that the whole idea was ridiculous, then I'd get into a fight with Nee-san.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\70600015.ogg":^  It was easier if I just appeared to go along with it."^\

