;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500125.ogg":^"Come on.  If you think that way, you'll be cursed...^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500126.ogg":^  There was one servant who got seriously injured..."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\goh\1\goh_a11_warai1.png",24
