langjp「この島に来て、初めて出来た友人は、どうやらニンゲンではないようだった。@しかし、思い返せばそれは当然。@魔女の島で出来る友人が、どうして魔女でなかろうか。@これが、我とベアトリーチェの初めての出会いである。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500142.ogg":^"The first friend I made after coming to the island was apparently not a Human at all.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500143.ogg":^  However, when I think back on it, it was only natural.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500144.ogg":^  What other sort of friend would you expect to make on a witch's island?^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500145.ogg":^  This was the first meeting between me and Beatrice."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "55"

langjp「……しかしながら、勘のいい諸賢はお気付きのように、これは本当のベアトリーチェとの出会いではない。@我が、ベアトリーチェと呼ぶその魔女は、後に他の名で呼ばれることとなる。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500146.ogg":^"...However, as some of you listeners may have noticed, this was not a meeting with the real Beatrice.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500147.ogg":^  The witch I then called Beatrice would later be known by another name."^\

