;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500148.ogg":^"...However, she was clearly not human.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500149.ogg":^  And being bonded with one who is not human means being bonded with their world.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500150.ogg":^  I still had no way of knowing the varied fates that waited for me on Rokkenjima..."^\

