langen:dwave 0, "voice\41\72600006.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\41\72600007.ogg":^  ...If Yasu is supposed to learn cleverness by growing up, then that should've been done before coming to work for the Ushiromiyas."^\


