langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500129.ogg":^"Come on...^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500130.ogg":^  That kid worked really hard to balance school and work...^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500131.ogg":^  I think you're all being too harsh..."^\

