langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500154.ogg":^"...Of course, Yasu was working very hard for a child of that age.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500155.ogg":^  However, before long, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500156.ogg":^the unsatisfied older servants started being mean to Yasu whenever they got the chance.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500157.ogg":^  Even after getting used to life on Rokkenjima, Yasu didn't manage to make a single friend.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500158.ogg":^  At least, not any Human friends..."^\

