langjp「ほっほほほほ。@そういう時もありますねぇ、忙しい時に限って。@妖精さんが、悪戯でもしてるんじゃないかしら。」\
;＜熊沢
langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\71800074.ogg":^"Hohohohoho.^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\71800075.ogg":^  Yes, that can sometimes happen, and always when you're busy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\71800076.ogg":^  Perhaps a fairy is pulling pranks on you."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「……魔女が悪戯をしてるんです。@だって、そこに確かに置いたのに、ちょっと余所見をしただけでなくなってしまうし…。」\
langen^"...It's a witch pulling pranks on me.^@^  I mean, I knew I'd put it right there, and when I looked away for just a second, ...it had disappeared..."^\

