langjp「ほっほっほ、ベアトリーチェさまの悪戯では困りましたねぇ。@でも、魔女が相手なら、おまじないで何とか出来るかもしれませんよ？」@
;＜熊沢
langjp「おまじない…？」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\71800077.ogg":^"Hohoho, Beatrice-sama's pranks can be quite troublesome.^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\71800078.ogg":^  But if you're dealing with a witch, shouldn't a ritual of some sort do the trick?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^"A ritual...?"^\

