;＜熊沢
langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\71800086.ogg":^"Hohoho, for times like that, there's a different ritual.^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\71800087.ogg":^  All you have to do is make a house for Mr. Pencil and Mr. Eraser."^\
