langjp　ただそれだけのことなのに、大冒険をして迷子になった包丁が、やっと家に帰りついたような小さな感動を覚えた。\
langen^Even though she had done something so ordinary, I felt slightly moved, ^@^as though the lost little knife had finished his adventure and finally returned home.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　彼の納まるべきスペースに、ストンとしまわれると、@……包丁一家は無事に勢揃いして一家団欒が始まった…。@
langen^Once he slid into the spot he was supposed to be in,^@^ all the knives would be together and could have a party...^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　あとは家族仲良く水入らず。@熊沢さんは、そっと戸を閉める…。\
langen^Then, Kumasawa-san said we should give them their privacy, and shut the door...^\

