langjp「妾が腹立たしかったからこそ、まじないを覚えたのであろう？@　そのまじないで、そなたは鍵をまたしても置き忘れるというウッカリを、こうして防げたではないか。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700094.ogg":^"Because I annoyed you, you learned of that ritual, correct?^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700095.ogg":^  Thanks to that, you've managed to avoid the screw-up of forgetting where you'd left your key once again.^@/
advsetwindow "27"

;ld c,GAP_WaraiA3,80

langjpつまり、妾のお陰も同然ということよ。@わっはははは、感謝されるのも道理であろう？」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700096.ogg":^  In other words, it is all thanks to me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700097.ogg":^  Wahahahaha, don't I deserve some gratitude?"^\

bg black,24
bg new_m1f_r1af,24
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「ん、……んん……。」@
langen^"Nng, ...nnnnn..."^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　すごく腑に落ちないが、魔女の言い分は一理ある。@
langjp　ベアトリーチェに酷い目に遭わされたから、私は熊沢さんに打ち明け、おまじないを習ったのだ。\
langen^I really don't like it, but she does have a point.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Because of all the trouble Beatrice caused me, I talked to Kumasawa-san and learned the ritual from her.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　仮に魔女の悪戯がなくとも、@……おまじないがなかったら、私はマスターキーをここに忘れたまま仕事に行ってしまっただろう。@
langen^Even without the witch's pranking,^@^ ...if I didn't have that ritual, I would've gone to my next job and left the master key here.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そしたら、……また鍵が見つからなくって、きっと大騒ぎをするのだ。\
langen^If that happened, ...then surely, I wouldn't have been able to find the key, and it would've been a big mess.^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_warai2.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「こういうのを一罰百戒という。@妾は友人として、そなたのミスを過剰に悪戯して思い知らせることで！@　こうしてそなたを立派に教育したというわけなのだ。」@
;＜ガァプ
langjp「……ん、んん……。@感謝すべきは熊沢さんにであって、あなたにではない気がします。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700098.ogg":^"We call this `punishment to make an example'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700099.ogg":^  By magnifying your mistakes, I've shown you what they are, as a friend!^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700100.ogg":^  Don't you see how much you've grown?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^"...Nng, nnnn...^@^  I get the feeling that Kumasawa-san is the one I should be thanking, not you."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_warai3.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「やれやれ。@魔女とはつくづく、感謝されぬ稼業よ。@くっくっく。」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700101.ogg":^"My, my.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700102.ogg":^  What a thankless job we witches have.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700103.ogg":^  *cackle*."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「とにかく。@今回は私の勝ちですね。@さ、もう仕事に行かなくちゃ。」@
langen^"Anyway,^@^ I win this time.^@^  Okay, I need to get back to work now."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「良かろうとも、我が友よ。@今回は勝ちを許そうぞ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700104.ogg":^"Very well, my friend.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700105.ogg":^  We'll call this your victory."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_warai3.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「されど妾は諦めが悪い。@この負けを取り返すべく、以後さらにますますにッ、そなたのミスを探そうと窺い続けるであろうぞ。@心せよ。@そそっかしいそなたが置き忘れる小道具など、いくらでもある。@それら全てに凧糸を縛るわけにも行くまい。@くっくくくく…！」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700106.ogg":^"However, I'm bad at giving up.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700107.ogg":^  I'll keep watching you, even more closely now, until I can even the score.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700108.ogg":^  Prepare yourself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700109.ogg":^  There are still several small items that a person like you is likely to forget.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700110.ogg":^  You can't attach strings to all of them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700111.ogg":^  *cackle*cackle*...!"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「蜘蛛の糸のおまじないだけではありません。@……お家へ帰してあげるというおまじないも習いました。@もう二度と、あなたの思い通りにはさせませんので。」\
langen^"The spiderweb ritual isn't the only one I have.^@^  ...I also learned the `take them home' ritual.^@^  I won't let you have your way anymore."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「ふっ。@どの程度、そなたがやれるものか、拝見させてもらおうぞ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700112.ogg":^"Hmph.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700113.ogg":^  Let's see how well you actually do.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjpそれにしても。@何とも晴れやかな笑顔を見せおって。@魔女が来るのは笑う門でなく、泣きっ面が相応しい。@もう休み時間は終わっているぞ。@せいぜい今日も、先輩たちの足を引かぬように仕事に精を出すが良かろう。」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700114.ogg":^  Even so,^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700115.ogg":^ that's quite the bright smile you've got there.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700116.ogg":^  When a witch appears, it should be time to cry, not laugh.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700117.ogg":^  Your break time is over.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700118.ogg":^  See if you can manage to do your job today without slowing down the older servants."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「えぇ、今日は素敵な天気の日曜日。@お仕事、がんばらなくっちゃ。」\
langen^"Sure.  Today is Sunday, and the weather is wonderful.^@^  I'd better do my best."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"
;gggg
langjp「せいぜい励め。@そうそう、玲音の機嫌が朝から悪い。@目を合わせぬ方が良かろう。@それから水難の相が出ておるぞ。@水の入ったバケツの近くでは、常に注意するが良かろうぞ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700119.ogg":^"Indeed, go to it with all you can manage.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700120.ogg":^  Oh, that's right.  Sanon's been in a bad mood all morning.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700121.ogg":^  You'd better try and avoid eye contact with her.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700122.ogg":^  Also, your fortune for the day is `water hazard'.^\:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700123.ogg":^  Make sure you take care when standing near buckets of water.^@/
advsetwindow "27"

;ld l,GAP_WaraiA2,80

langjp……そなたのこと。@きっと我が期待を裏切らず、バケツを引っ繰り返して叱られてくれることを、心待ちにしている。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700124.ogg":^  ...This is you we're talking about.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700125.ogg":^  I'll be waiting for you to knock over a bucket and get scolded just like usual."^\

