advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　かつて、姿をまだ視られなかった頃。@
langjp　我はこの悪戯好きの魔女が憎くて憎くて仕方なかった。@
langen^Back when I still couldn't `see' her...^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^I simply hated this prank-loving witch.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　しかしこうして会話が出来るようになると、……ただの嫌なヤツではない気もする。\
langen^But now that I could talk with her, ...it felt as though she wasn't all bad.^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　無論、感謝する謂れなどない。@
langen^Of course, there was no need for me to be grateful to her.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　ベアトリーチェという魔女は、退屈を愛さず、人の不幸を嘲笑うことで糧とする。@
langjp　ニンゲンと魔女は違う。@相容れぬ存在。@
langen^To the witch called Beatrice, who despises boredom, mocking the misfortune of others is like what eating food is to us.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Humans and witches are different.^@^  Incompatible beings.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　ではあっても、……友人になれそうな、そんな気がした。\
langen^And yet, ...it felt as though we could become friends.^\

