_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_nayamu1.png",3
_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_houshin1star.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　もちろん、相手は魔女。@油断してはいけない。@
langen^Of course, she's still a witch.^@^  I mustn't get careless.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　でも、油断しないことはとてもよいこと。\
langen^And yet, not being careless is a good thing.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　彼女にもう何の悪戯も許さないように、おまじないや工夫で注意をすることは、まったく悪いことじゃない。@
langen^Thanks to the tricks and rituals I use to keep her at bay, I'm able to concentrate.^@^  That could hardly be a bad thing.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そしてそれは、魔女の悪戯がなくても、我の仕事上、生活上、とても役立つものだ。\
langen^Those things will be useful for my job and my life, even when I don't have to worry about the witch's pranks.^\
advsetwindow "-1"


langjp　なるほど、ベアトリーチェという魔女は確かに天邪鬼。@
langjp　憎まれ口を叩きながら育める友情というのも、どうやらあるらしかった…。\
langen^I see, so this witch called Beatrice really is like a demon.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Apparently, it's possible to build up a friendship even while speaking hostilely to each other...^\

