langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500133.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500134.ogg":^  That kid would sometimes say it out loud.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500135.ogg":^  It was really cute, like watching someone play house with a bunch of tools."^\

