langjp「我にも学校にて友人はいたが、仕事の都合もあり、友情を深め合うには至ってなかった。@気取らぬ朱志香も親しくしてはくれたが、夏妃の厳命もあり、一緒に遊ぶことも出来なかった。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500205.ogg":^"Even I had friends at school, but because of my work, there was no chance to deepen our friendship.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500206.ogg":^  Jessica was always kind and modest, but there was Natsuhi's stern order to think of, so we couldn't play together very much."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_houshin3star.png",80
advsetwindow "55"

langjp「……そんな我にとって、いつも母のように優しくしてくれる熊沢は、もっとも親しい存在であった。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500207.ogg":^"...So, at that time, Kumasawa, the one who was always as kind as a mother to me, was the person I felt closest to."^\

cl c,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_def2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「孫ほども離れた二人のこと。@駆け回って遊ぶわけではない。@熊沢の趣味に、興味を持ったのだ。」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700153.ogg":^"Kumasawa was old enough to have grandchildren.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700154.ogg":^  They couldn't exactly run around and play together.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700155.ogg":^  You developed an interest in Kumasawa's hobby."^\

