;se1 47
_ld l,":b;sprites\fur\1\fur_a11_majime1.png",23
advsetwindow "52"

langjp「熊沢の趣味って何かしら！」@
;＜フルフル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\52\75200068.ogg":^"And what's Kumasawa's hobby?!"^\

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_def2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「本だ。@意外かも知れぬが、あの熊沢、なかなかに推理小説を好んでおった。」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700156.ogg":^"Books.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700157.ogg":^  It might be hard to believe, but Kumasawa was a huge mystery novel fan."^\

;se1 48
_ld r,":b;sprites\zep\1\zep_a11_warai1.png",23
advsetwindow "51"

langjp「どんな本か、関心を持つ内に、自分も読んでみることに？」\
;＜ゼパル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\51\75100064.ogg":^"So, the kid wanted to find out what sorts of books they were and started reading them?"^\

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_warai3.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「その通りよ。@推理小説は、読みながらに語らうのもなかなかに楽しい。@すでに答えを知る熊沢にしても、若き知性がどのような推理を見せるのか、@聞くのはさぞや楽しかったに違いあるまい。」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700158.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700159.ogg":^  The nice thing about mystery novels is that you can talk about them while you read them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700160.ogg":^  Even Kumasawa, who already knew the answer,^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700161.ogg":^ must have enjoyed listening in and hearing what sorts of theories a young intellect could create."^\

mcl c,0
bg new_the_1e,24
_ld c,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_houshin3star.png",22
advsetwindow "55"

langjp「無論、いきなり熊沢の読む難解なものから入りはしなかった。@まずはお奨めを聞き、学校の図書室から探してきて読んだ。@使用人室にも持ち込み、休憩の合間などに、少しずつ読み進めた。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500208.ogg":^"Of course, I didn't start right away with the complicated books Kumasawa read.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500209.ogg":^  First, I asked for her recommendations and got books from the school library.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500210.ogg":^  I would even bring them into the servant room and read a bit during every break."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "55"

langjp「そして新しい推理が浮かぶ度にそれを熊沢に話し、@すでに答えを知っている熊沢はにやにやと笑いながら、我の推理に相槌を打つ。@……それが、我にとっての楽しい時間だった。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500211.ogg":^"Every time a new theory popped into my head, I told Kumasawa about it,^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500212.ogg":^ and she, who already knew the answer, would nod at my theory and grin.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500213.ogg":^  ...That was a lot of fun for me."^\

