langjp「くっくっく。@………妾の生まれた太古の時代には推理小説なる娯楽はなかった。@そなたの肩越しに読ませてもらっているが、なかなか面白い読み物であるな。」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700164.ogg":^"*cackle*^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700165.ogg":^  ......In the ancient times I was born in, pleasures such as mystery novels didn't exist.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700166.ogg":^  I've been reading over your shoulder, and this truly is a captivating read."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「ベアトはこの事件、誰が犯人だと思う？」@
langen^"Beato, who do you think is the culprit?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

