;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700191.ogg":^"Perhaps, but it's also a fight between humans and witches.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700192.ogg":^  Will you allow for or deny the magic of my closed room murders?^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700193.ogg":^  Call it a chess match of mystery!"^\
