langen@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700195.ogg":^  As Shannon said a short while ago,^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700196.ogg":^ this story apparently has the truth revealed by a message bottle at the end.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700197.ogg":^  So, if you can't expose the truth of the tale before that point, you lose."^\

