langjp「くっくっく！@　これより妾は、そなたがそれを読み終えるまで！@　４９５年の魔女、オーエン卿であるぞ！@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700201.ogg":^"*cackle*!^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700202.ogg":^  Starting now, and until you finish reading,^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700203.ogg":^ I am Lady Owen, the 495-year-old witch!^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_akuwarai5.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp　そなたに我が孤島殺人のトリックが見破れるかなァ？@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700204.ogg":^  Can you see through my deserted island murder tricks?^@/
se2 37
advsetwindow "27"
langjp　くっひっひゃっはっはっは！」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700205.ogg":^  Ahihhyahahahaha!"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「……ひとつ、推理が出来た。@つまり、あんたは私と遊びたいってこと？@　私がずっと本ばっか読んでて、あんたに構わないものだから。」\
langen^"...I do have one theory:^@^ you want to play with me, don't you?^@^  I've been reading books so much, you've gotten lonely."^\

se1 2

mbg white,1
_ld r,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_akuwarai4.png",0
mcbg 22
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「そうとも言う！」@
;＜ガァプ
langjp「ぷ、」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700206.ogg":^"That too!"^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^"Pft-"^\

bg new_dor_r1dr,2
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「「はっはっはっはははははははははは……。」」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700207.ogg":^""Hahahahahahahahahahaha...""^\

bg black,2
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　……ちなみに。@
langen^...Incidentally.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　この『そして誰もいなくなった』を巡る、私とベアトのゲームは、私の敗北で終わった。\
langen^The game Beato and I played around `And Then There Were None' ended with my defeat.^\

bg new_chess2,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　結局、私は満足な推理を出せず、メッセージボトルにて真相を知ることになる。@
langen^In the end, I wasn't able to build a satisfying theory, and I had to learn the truth from the message bottle.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　たまたま漂着したからいい。@もしベアトの言うとおり、海の底に沈んでいたら、私は真相を知れない。@
langen^Luckily, it did manage to drift into human hands.^\^  If it had sunk to the bottom of the ocean, as Beato had suggested, I would've had no way of knowing the truth.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　即ち、私はＵ・Ｎ・オーエンを、魔女と認めなくてはならないのだ。\
langen^In other words, I was forced to acknowledge U. N. Owen as a witch.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　小説の中の、単なるジャンルに過ぎないと思っていた、ミステリー。@
langen^Mystery.^@^  I once thought it was just a genre for novels.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　それが、紙一重で、魔女と人間が、幻想と真実を争うゲームに様変わりするなんて。@
langen^To think that it can so easily become a fight between witches and humans, truth and fantasy.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　私は、この新しい“ゲーム”に、瞬く間に虜になっていく。\
langen^I was instantly enraptured by this new `game'.^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　月日を重ねぬうちに、私は学校の図書室の推理小説を全て読み尽くし、@大人向けの推理小説にも手を出し始める。\
langen^As the months passed by, I read through all of the mystery novels in the school library...^@^and started to read mystery novels for adults.^\

bg new_the_1f,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_nayamu1.png",2
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　熊沢と議論し、@紗音と議論し。@
langjp　魔女と真相を巡って、推理のチェスをする。@
langen^I discussed them with Kumasawa.^@^  I discussed them with Shannon.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^I played my game of theory chess, the fight between witches and the truth.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　その日々の、何と愉しきこと……。\
langen^Those days...were so much fun...^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_houshin1star.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　あぁ、我こそは我にして我らなり。@
langen^Oh, I am one yet many.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　我を虜にする、楽しき知的ゲームに、乾杯……。\
langen^Here's to the fun game of the mind that enraptured me...^\

