;＜レヴィア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\39\72400023.ogg":^"...You know, it's still a mystery.^@:dwave 0, "voice\39\72400024.ogg":^  Why was Yasu recommended for this job?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rg3\1\rg3_e21_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「それを言ったら、未だに奥様がヤスの勤務を認めてる方が意外だわ。」\
;＜サタン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\40\72500027.ogg":^"It's even more surprising that Madam let Yasu stay this long."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\rg4\1\rg4_e21_fuman2.png",24
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「逃げ出さない分だけ、根性があるってもんだ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\41\72600008.ogg":^"It must've taken some guts to not give up and run away.^@/


_ld c,":b;sprites\rg4\1\rg4_e11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjpしっかりな、ヤ・ス。」@
;＜ベルフェ
langjp「わ、私、……ヤスって呼ばれるの、嫌いです…。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\41\72600009.ogg":^  Keep it up, Yasu."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^"I-I...hate being called Yasu..."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　最後の最後に、……彼女らに言い返したかった一言を、ようやく口に出来る。@
langen^At the very end, ...I finally said the one thing I'd always wanted to say to them.^@
