langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500161.ogg":^"Yeah.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500162.ogg":^  I'm sure they feel the same way, so you're even.^@/

_ld c,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjpあの人たちのことは、もう忘れちゃおう。@もう、お互い、何の関わりもない。@だから、心に留める必要もない。」@
;＜紗音
langjp「…………うん。@……そうだね。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500163.ogg":^  Let's just forget about those people.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500164.ogg":^  They no longer have anything to do with us.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500165.ogg":^  So, there's no reason to think about them."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^"...Yeah.^@^  ...You're right."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　ちょっとだけ、悔しかった。@
langen^I felt just a bit disappointed.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　最後まで彼女らに、私がしっかり一人前になったことを、認めてもらえなかった。\
langen^I never got a chance to prove to them that I could take care of myself.^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_tokui1.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「人は、最初の印象をいつまでも引き摺る生き物だからね。@……だから仕方がない。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500166.ogg":^"It's hard for people to throw off their first impressions.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500167.ogg":^  ...That's just how it is.^@/

_ld c,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjpあなたがどんなに素晴らしい人間に成長しても、@彼女らはきっと、いつまでもヤスと呼び続けて、あなたを馬鹿にしたと思うもの。@そんな人たちに認めさせようと思うなんて、全然意味のないことなんだよ。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500168.ogg":^  No matter how wonderfully you grow,^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500169.ogg":^ those people would've probably always called you Yasu and made fun of you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500170.ogg":^  There's no reason for you to want their admiration."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「……そうだね。@うん、紗音の言う通り。@もう、あの人たちのことは綺麗さっぱり忘れるよ。」\
langen^"...Yes.^@^  Yeah, you're right, Shannon.^@^  I'll completely forget about those people."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「それがいいよ。@あなたには私や熊沢さんなどの、素敵な友達がいるじゃない。@そして、新しい使用人の人たちの前では、今度は一人前の姿を見せてあげればいい。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500171.ogg":^"Good.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500172.ogg":^  You have two great friends, Kumasawa-san and me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500173.ogg":^  And if you want to prove that you can take care of yourself, prove it to the new servants who are coming."^\

