langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800021.ogg":^"I thought so at first.^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800022.ogg":^  It was only natural to think that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800023.ogg":^  But I started getting this feeling that something wasn't right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800024.ogg":^  I kept thinking...could such a timid kid really get away with something so obnoxious?"^\

