;＜アスモ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900016.ogg":^"Well, you can be pretty absent-minded, Belne...^@:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900017.ogg":^  Are you sure you didn't just take that key off and put it in your locker...?"^\

