langjp「鍵束から、何でわざわざその鍵だけを外すわけ？！@　明日音、鍵束の鍵、外したり、あるいは戻したりしたことある？！@　私も試してみた。@あれ、すごく硬い！@　わざわざやらない！@　やる意味ないしッ！@　私、夢遊病？！@　自分でやったことの記憶さえないっての？！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800042.ogg":^"Why would I take that key off the ring?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800043.ogg":^  Have you ever taken a key off or put a key on your key ring, Asne?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800044.ogg":^  I tried doing it myself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800045.ogg":^  It's really stiff!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800046.ogg":^  I'd never go to all that trouble.^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800047.ogg":^  There'd be no point!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800048.ogg":^  Am I a sleepwalker or something?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800049.ogg":^  How could I not remember something I've done?!"^\

cl r,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\rg6\1\rg6_e11_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「私、馬鹿だけど、そこまで馬鹿じゃない！@　私、そこまで自分のこと、忘れてたりしない！！@　それに私の鍵さ、確実に部屋に入った時はあったよ？！@　じゃなきゃ、あの部屋の鍵、私、どうやって開けたわけよ？！」\
;＜ベルゼ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800050.ogg":^"I may be stupid, but I'm not that stupid!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800051.ogg":^  I don't forget about things I do that easily!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800052.ogg":^  And anyway, I know I had my key with me when I entered the room!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800053.ogg":^  Otherwise, how could I have unlocked the door?!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\rg7\1\rg7_e21_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「……だからさ…。@音をさせないようにさ。@/
langjp!s1スルリとその、/
langjp!d800……ヤスがうまく鍵を抜いて、/
langjp!d900鐘音のロッカーに隠したんだよ、きっと…。」/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900018.ogg":^"...Okay then...^@:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900019.ogg":^  Yasu, careful not to make any sound, ^@/
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900020.ogg":!s1^slipped the key off...^@/
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:delay 1500:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900021.ogg":^and hid it in your locker.^@:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900022.ogg":^  That has to be it..."^@/
