_ld c,":b;sprites\rg6\1\rg6_e11_ikari1.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「私も最初はそう思った！@　ヤスに、舐めたことすんじゃねって食って掛かった！@　でも、言いながら思ってた。@これ、絶対ヘンじゃね？って！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800054.ogg":^"That's what I thought at first!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800055.ogg":^  I jumped at Yasu, telling that kid not to mess with me!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800056.ogg":^  But even as I said it, I realized.^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800057.ogg":^  Isn't there something completely wrong here?!"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\rg6\1\rg6_e11_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「だってさ、あの日、私たち、ずっとヤスと一緒に部屋回ってたわけでしょ？！@　鍵をカチャカチャ外すほどの隙は絶対ないよ？！@　ヤスには無理！@　っていうか、誰にも不可能だよ、音をさせずに、それもわずかの隙に鍵を一本だけ抜き取るなんて！！」\
;＜ベルゼ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800058.ogg":^"After all, on that day, we were cleaning that room with Yasu the whole time, right?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800059.ogg":^  There wouldn't have been time for Yasu to noisily remove a key!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800060.ogg":^  It was impossible for Yasu!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800061.ogg":^  In fact, it should've been impossible for anyone!!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\rg7\1\rg7_e11_odoroki3.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「う、受け取った時から、もうマスターキーが１本足りなかったとか…。」\
;＜アスモ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900023.ogg":^"M-Maybe the ring was missing a master key when you got it..."^\


