langjp　ちゃんと鍵は最初あった！@　あの部屋の鍵を開けたのは私！@　だから絶対、鍵はあった！@　……んで、部屋に入って！@　私、馬鹿だから、鍵のジャラジャラが嫌いで、ひょいっとベッドの上に置いといた…！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800063.ogg":^  The key really was there in the beginning!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800064.ogg":^  I was the one who unlocked that room!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800065.ogg":^  So it must have been there!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800066.ogg":^  ...And then, I went into the room!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800067.ogg":^  I'm stupid, and since I hate having the keys clattering around, I placed the ring on the bed...!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rg6\1\rg6_e31_komaru2.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「それで掃除終わって、鍵束取って、施錠しようとしたらもうなかった！@　背中を向けてはいたけれど、鍵のすぐ傍にいた！@　だから、誰かが鍵を１本だけ抜くなんて悪戯をして、悠長にガチャガチャ言わせたらすぐわかる！@　なのに、その部屋の鍵１本だけがすぅっと蒸発して、私のロッカーの中に！！」\
;＜ベルゼ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800068.ogg":^"Then, when we finished cleaning, I picked up the ring, tried to lock the door, and it was gone!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800069.ogg":^  I may have turned my back on the ring, but it was right next to me!^\:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800070.ogg":^  So, if someone tried to pull a prank by removing just one key, I'd have heard the clinking!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800071.ogg":^  And yet, just the key for that room vanished and appeared again in my locker!!"^\

bg new_the_1e,25
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「……いいよ、ヤスがこっそりやったって仮定してもいい。@そう考えると気楽になれるもん。@……でもね？！@　じゃあ、どうやってロッカーに入れたわけ？！@　ヤス、私たちとずっと一緒じゃん？！@　私がないないって大騒ぎして、あちこち探し回ってロッカーの中で見つけるまで、ずっと一緒だったじゃん？！」\
;＜ベルゼ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800072.ogg":^"...So okay, let's say that Yasu managed to sneak it away.^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800073.ogg":^  It's easier to think of that way.^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800074.ogg":^  ...But still!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800075.ogg":^  How could Yasu have put it in my locker?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800076.ogg":^  Yasu and I were together the whole time, right?!^\:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800077.ogg":^  When I started yelling about it being gone and ran all over the place looking for it, Yasu was with me until the moment I found it in my locker, get it?!"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\rg6\1\rg6_e11_ikari2.png",26
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp!s0「ありえないってッ！！/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800078.ogg":!s0^"I'm telling you it's impossible!!^@/

