langjp　私、ヤスに当り散らしながら感じ始めてた。@というか、ヤスの瞳がさ、無言で言ってるわけ。@/
langjp……あの子の言うさ、いつの間にか物がなくなってるって、@……みんなが言うようにあの子がぼんやりしてるんじゃなくて……、……本当に実は、@……私と同じで、突然、ありえないことが起こって、@……その、………そのッ…！」\
;＜ベルゼ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800079.ogg":^  Even as I jumped at Yasu, I began to feel it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800080.ogg":^  I mean, Yasu's eyes seemed to be saying it silently.^\/
advsetwindow "-1"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800081.ogg":^  ...According to Yasu, the reason things used to go missing all the time wasn't because Yasu was forgetful, as everyone said, ...but actually...^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800082.ogg":^it was because...^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800083.ogg":^impossible things would suddenly happen, just like they had to me,^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800084.ogg":^ ...and...and...!"^\


