langjp「うん、そう。@物がなくなるとか、単純にそれだけじゃないことが、その後も、他にも、何度も何度も。@……さすがに薄気味悪くなって、物とかその辺に置かないように気を付けたけど、……それでも駄目だった。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800085.ogg":^"Yeah, they did.^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800086.ogg":^  Afterwards, other things happened...and not just things disappearing...  Over and over...^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800087.ogg":^  ...Of course, I started getting nervous and made sure not to put things down in places like that, ...but that didn't help."^\

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\rg6\1\rg6_e31_komaru2.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「……最初こそヤス舐めんなって思ってたけど、@……途中からマジで、これは違うって理解し始めた。@私がポケットに入れっ放しにしてたはずの鍵束から鍵が消えたことだってある！@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800088.ogg":^"...At first, I was angry at Yasu,^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800089.ogg":^ ...but at some point, I began to realize that I was mistaken.^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800090.ogg":^  One time, a key even disappeared from a ring that I'd left in my pocket!^@/
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　私は気付いた。@……ヤスが悪戯してんじゃない。@ヤスも私も、同じ何かに、やられてるんじゃないかッ、って…！」\
;＜ベルゼ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800091.ogg":^  Then, I realized.^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800092.ogg":^  ...These weren't Yasu's pranks.^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800093.ogg":^  The same thing that happened to Yasu was now happening to me...!"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\rg7\1\rg7_e21_komaru2.png",24
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「お、落ち着きなよー……。@私は、一部はヤスの悪戯。@…それ以外のほとんどは、鐘音のウッカリか勘違いだと思ってるよ。@……確かに屋敷はいつも薄暗くて、どこか薄気味悪かったし……、@何か祟りとか呪いとか、そんなのがあってもおかしくなさそうな雰囲気はあった。@そのせいできっと、鐘音はおかしな方向に怯えちゃったんじゃないかなって…。」\
;＜アスモ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900024.ogg":^"C-Calm down a bit...^@:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900025.ogg":^  I think some of those were Yasu's fault, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900026.ogg":^and the others were just you being clumsy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900027.ogg":^  ...It's true that the mansion's always dark and eerie,^@:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900028.ogg":^ ...and it does feel like the sort of place you'd find a curse.^@:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900029.ogg":^  I'm sure that's what made you scared like that..."^\


