langjp　そんな服を着てるの、奥様もお嬢様も見たことないよ？！@　というか、あの貴賓室、いつも施錠されてるし！@　奥様とかは鍵持ってないし！@　あれは絶対、幽霊とか亡霊とか、@……うぅん、絶対に魔女の影だった！」\
;＜ベルゼ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800097.ogg":^  Have you ever seen either of them wearing something like that?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800098.ogg":^  And besides, that VIP room is always locked!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800099.ogg":^  They don't have keys to it!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800100.ogg":^  That had to have been some kind of ghost...^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800101.ogg":^...no, the silhouette of the witch!"^\

