langjp「自分も同じようなことが何度もあったけど、誰に相談しても信じてくれなかったって…！@　第一、先輩とかはヤスのこと馬鹿にしてたけど、ヤスは言われるほどドジでも馬鹿でもなかった。@年下に仕切られるのはムカつくから、いつも反抗してたけど、仕事は割りとそつなくこなしてた。@そんなヤスが、そこまで馬鹿にされるほど、物をなくすなんてことあるのかなぁって不思議に思ってた…！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800107.ogg":^"Yasu said that the same thing had happened many times already, but no one else believed any of it...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800108.ogg":^  In the first place, the older servants always made fun of Yasu, but that kid clearly wasn't as clumsy or stupid as they said.^\:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800109.ogg":^  I hated having a younger person tell me what to do, so I always resisted, but Yasu always got our work done flawlessly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800110.ogg":^  I've always thought it strange that people made fun of Yasu for losing things...!"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\rg6\1\rg6_e11_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「だから確信したの。@“い”る！@　このお屋敷には、人間とは異なる、何かおかしなものが“い”るって！」\
;＜ベルゼ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800111.ogg":^"I was sure then.^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800112.ogg":^  It `existed'!^@:dwave 0, "voice\43\72800113.ogg":^  Some strange, inhuman thing `existed' in this mansion!"^\

;se1 47
_ld l,":b;sprites\fur\1\fur_a11_majime3.png",66
advsetwindow "52"

langjp「それが、魔女ベアトリーチェだと…？」\
;＜フルフル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\52\75200076.ogg":^"And that thing was the witch, Beatrice...?"^\

