;＜アスモ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900043.ogg":^"...St-Still,^@:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900044.ogg":^ ...it did freak you out for a while, but then you got a lot better...^@:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900045.ogg":^  After that, all that fuss about you losing things went away, right...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\44\72900046.ogg":^  So it must've been your imagination all the time..."^\

