;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700217.ogg":^"Let's show her my magic!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700218.ogg":^  Foolish Belne!^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700219.ogg":^  I'll make you regret not listening to my friend's advice!^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700220.ogg":^  This flimsy body is not enough!  I'm borrowing yours!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700221.ogg":^  It's been too long since I've shown you real magic!^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700222.ogg":^  Let my body return to the land of the living for just a moment!"^\

