langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500389.ogg":^"Hiding objects and transporting them instantaneously is your theme.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500390.ogg":^  So, I must think of my own particular theme of magic.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500391.ogg":^  ...When I use magic, gold butterflies will flit about.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500392.ogg":^  I'm not backing down on that part...!"^\


