langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500393.ogg":^"Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500394.ogg":^  Even an all-powerful witch needs a few small weaknesses to keep things interesting.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500395.ogg":^  Then let us do it like so.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500396.ogg":^  If I touch a spiderweb, it will burn me."^\

