langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500410.ogg":^"Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500411.ogg":^  That room is too crude for entertaining friends and serving tea.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500412.ogg":^  We shall change rooms.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500413.ogg":^  Let us go, my friend...!"^\


