;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500414.ogg":^"So long, Shannon.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500415.ogg":^  ...The days I spent as a Human, with you as a goal and a constant comfort, were truly fun.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500416.ogg":^  ...If I had never learned the joys of magic and awakened as a witch,^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500417.ogg":^ everything would doubtless have remained as it was."^\

