langjp　神秘的な美しさの、黄金の薔薇庭園。@
langen^It was a golden rose garden of mysterious beauty.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　その東屋の椅子に、紗音はいつの間にか座っていたのだ。@
langjp　まるでそこで居眠りをしていて、夢から覚めたかのように。\
langen^Somehow, Shannon was sitting in a chair under the arbor.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^It was as though she'd taken a nap there and woken up from a dream.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　……しかし、それは不思議な感覚。@
langen^...But it felt strange.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　この黄金の薔薇庭園が、夢なのか。@
langjp　今までの使用人としての生活が夢で、今、ここでこうして目覚めたのか、@……その程度のことにさえ混乱してしまう、不思議な感覚…。\
langen^Is this golden rose garden a dream?^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^For some strange reason, it felt as though my entire life up to this point had been a dream, and that I had finally awakened here...^\
;cbfly 0
