langjp「久しぶりであるな、紗音。@元気であったか…？@　まぁ、元気であったろうなぁ。@妾は毎日、そなたたちを観察しているのだから。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500424.ogg":^"It has been quite some time, Shannon.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500425.ogg":^  Have you been well...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500426.ogg":^  Of course, I know you have been.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500427.ogg":^  After all, I have been watching all of you, every day."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　まるで、紗音の古い馴染みであるかのように、その女性は、笑う。@
langen^This woman laughed as though she was an old friend of Shannon's.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　しかし紗音には、この神秘的な黄金の薔薇庭園はもちろんのこと、彼女の面影にさえ、記憶はなかった…。\
langen^However, Shannon obviously didn't remember this strange gold rose garden, and she didn't remember this person's face either...^\

