advsetwindow "27"

langjp「別れの時、そなたの記憶を奪った。@しかし、妾はそなたとルームメイトだったことを忘れぬ。@……そして、そなたとの友情を、妾の方から一方的に破棄し、立ち去ったことも忘れはせぬ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500441.ogg":^"When we last parted, I stole away your memory.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500442.ogg":^  However, I have not forgotten that we were once roommates.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500443.ogg":^  ...I also remember that I was the one who destroyed our friendship and left."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「だからこそ、一人残すそなたに悲しみを与えぬために、@妾との日々の記憶も世界も、全てを消し去ったのだ。」@
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500444.ogg":^"So as to not leave you alone in sadness,^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500445.ogg":^ I erased all of your memories and the very world of our days together."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「………………………………。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500245.ogg":^"............"^\

