;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500446.ogg":^"You do not need to understand...^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500447.ogg":^  But believe this.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500448.ogg":^  I have not called you here to do you harm."^\
