langjp「夢の中と思って良い。@厳密には、眠ったそなたの魂を、我が庭園に招いたのだ。@そなたを、この世界の住人に招くために。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500449.ogg":^"You may think of it that way.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500450.ogg":^  Strictly speaking, I beckoned your soul to my garden while you were sleeping.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500451.ogg":^  To invite you to be a resident of this world."^\

