langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500466.ogg":^"I am glad you enjoy it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500467.ogg":^  I bred this rose simply for the purpose of using the petals with black tea.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500468.ogg":^  If you crush them, they're also splendid for making jam!^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500469.ogg":^  That goes better with scones than anything else imaginable.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500470.ogg":^  Do you want to try?"^\

