langjp「短い間だ。@覚えておらぬだろうが、そなたとともに働いていたのだぞ。@妾はドジで物をよくなくす愚か者。@そなたは妾の憧れる、理想の使用人であった。」@
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500474.ogg":^"For a short time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500475.ogg":^  You probably don't remember, but I worked alongside you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500476.ogg":^  I was a clumsy fool who always lost things.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500477.ogg":^  You were my idea of a perfect servant, and the person I looked up to."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「……なのに、私が覚えていなくて、本当にごめんなさい。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500257.ogg":^"...That makes me even more sorry that I can't remember."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「それを詫びる必要はない。@ここではそなたは使用人ではなく、妾の友人であり客人だ。@ここでは何の不自由もない、何の苦労も退屈もない。@そなたが望む全てのものを与えることが出来るのだ。@今や妾にはそれだけの力がある。@……それに至ったことを、そなたには知らせたかったのだ。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500478.ogg":^"There is no need for apologies.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500479.ogg":^  Here, you are not a servant, but my friend and guest.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500480.ogg":^  There are no inconveniences here, no trials nor boredom.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500481.ogg":^  I can give you anything you desire.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500482.ogg":^  That is how much power I currently possess.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500483.ogg":^  ...I wanted to let you know that I have now reached that level."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_tokui1.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「………何の取り得もない私を、こんなに素敵なお持て成しで歓待して下さって…。@本当にありがとうございます。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500258.ogg":^"...I'm truly grateful to you ^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500259.ogg":^for welcoming one with so few redeeming features in such an extravagant way."^\



_ld l,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「くっくっく！@　辛き日々を今日まで耐え忍んだそなたへの褒美であると、そう思えば良い。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500484.ogg":^"*cackle*!^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500485.ogg":^  Think of it as a reward for all of the painful days you have withstood.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjpさぁ、黄金の蝶たちよ！@　妾の友人を退屈させるでないぞ、軽やかな舞を見せるがいい！@　それに飽きたなら、楽団を呼び出しそなたの好きな曲を何でも演奏させよう。@それにも飽きたなら、瀟洒なる使い魔たちにタネなし手品を披露させてやろうぞ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500486.ogg":^  Come, gold butterflies!^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500487.ogg":^  Don't let my friend get bored!  Show her a little dance!^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500488.ogg":^  When you have tired of that, allow me to call the band to perform any song you would like.^\:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500489.ogg":^  When you have tired of that, my refined familiars will show you some conjuring tricks.^@/
advsetwindow "27"

;ld l,CUR_DefA2,80

langjp安心せよ、ここでの時間は無限。@そしてそなたの願いもまた、妾が無限に叶える。@妾の茶会に終わりはないのだ…！」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500490.ogg":^  Fear not, for time is endless here.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500491.ogg":^  And I can grant your wishes endlessly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500492.ogg":^  My tea party has no end...!"^\

cbfly 0
bg black,22

;bfly2 0
bg new_rose_1ep,2
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　魔女は本当に上機嫌に色々な不思議な話を、いくつも聞かせてくれた。@
langen^In a truly good mood, the witch told Shannon several strange stories.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　それはどれもこれも、初めて聞く話。@興味深い話。@そして奇天烈で奇想天外な、おかしな話ばかり。\
langen^They were all stories Shannon had never heard before.^@^  Very interesting stories.^@^  And, they were all odd, bizarre fairy tales.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　まるで自分が、不思議の国のアリスにでもなってしまったかのような。@そんな不思議な不思議な、愉快な愉快な、ゆっくりとしたお茶会の時間。\
langen^Shannon felt as though she had become Alice in Wonderland.^@^  The time she spent at this tea party was strange, pleasant, and relaxed.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　いや。@このお茶会には、時計の針などない。@
langen^No,^@^ the clocks have no hands at this tea party.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　だから、そのお茶会の時間は、好きなだけ毛布の中でまどろめる、まるで日曜日の朝のようだった……。\
langen^So, the time passed like a Sunday morning, when you can wrap yourself in your blanket for as long as you want...^\

