langjp「……本当に、こんな素敵な時間を与えて下さり、感謝します。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500260.ogg":^"...I can't express how grateful I am to you for this."^\

bg new_rose_2bp,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_warai4.png",24
_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「礼はいらぬ。@なぜなら、人の世で礼は、別れの言葉を兼ねるのであろう？@　この茶会に終わりはない。@だから礼も必要がない。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500493.ogg":^"There is no need for thanks.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500494.ogg":^  In the human world, words of thanks go along with words of farewell, do they not?^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500495.ogg":^  There will be no end to this tea party.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500496.ogg":^  So, there is no need for thanks either."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_warai1.png",23
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「くす。@でも感謝します。@ベアトリーチェさま、こんな素敵なお茶会を、本当にありがとうございます。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500261.ogg":^"*giggle*^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500262.ogg":^  I'll still thank you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500263.ogg":^  Thank you so much, Beatrice-sama, for this wonderful tea party.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_tokui1.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp………でも、終わらない夢はないように、この夢も、終わらないといけません。」@
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500264.ogg":^  ...But all dreams must end, and so must this one."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「ほう。@なぜに終わらねばならぬのか。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500497.ogg":^"Hoh.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500498.ogg":^  And why must they end?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「その……、明日も早いので。@いつまでもここでお喋りをしていたら、私はお寝坊をして、@奥様に大目玉をもらってしまいます…。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500265.ogg":^"Because, ...I start early tomorrow.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500266.ogg":^  If I stay here talking too long, I'll sleep in, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500267.ogg":^and Madam will give me a good scolding..."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_futeki2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「ふ、はっはっはっははははははははは！@　なぜにわざわざ、短気な夏妃のいる世界へ帰りたがるというのか。@いやいや。@労多くして何のねぎらいもないニンゲンの世界へ、なぜにわざわざ帰ろうというのか。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500499.ogg":^"Pft, hahhahhahahahhaahahahahaha!^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500500.ogg":^  Why are you so anxious to return to the world of that short-tempered Natsuhi?^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500501.ogg":^  Really, now.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500502.ogg":^  Are you truly saying you want to return to the Human world, where it's all work and no rewards?"^\

cl r,23

_ld l,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_odoroki2.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「私、ニンゲンですし。@いつまでも、ここでお世話にはなれません。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500268.ogg":^"But I am Human.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500269.ogg":^  I can't impose myself on you forever."^\

bg black,23
bg new_rose_3ap,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_def1.png",23
_ld c,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_warai8.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「紗音。@そなたは勘違いをしているようだ。@妾はそなたを招いたが、追い返すような真似はしない。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500503.ogg":^"Shannon,^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500504.ogg":^ it seems that you do not understand.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500505.ogg":^  I invited you here, but I have no desire to chase you away again."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「ここでの時間は永遠だ。@そなたが別れを切り出さねばならぬ義理などない。@妾はそなたとどれだけ茶会を共にしようとも飽きぬぞ。@むしろ、そなたという話し相手が実に心地良い。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500506.ogg":^"Here, time is eternal.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500507.ogg":^  You are not obligated to say farewell, not ever.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500508.ogg":^  I will never tire of enjoying tea with you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500509.ogg":^  On the contrary, it is quite agreeable to have you here to talk to."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_tokui1.png",24
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「お言葉は嬉しいですけど、私はニンゲン。@自分の世界に、帰らなくちゃいけません。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500270.ogg":^"I'm grateful for your words, but I am Human.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500271.ogg":^  I must return to my own world."^\

cl c,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_warai8.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「家人に扱き使われ、日々を学校と仕事だけに費やす何の彩りもない世界に、@なぜわざわざ帰るというのか？」@
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500510.ogg":^"Why do you want to return to that colorless world, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500511.ogg":^where you waste all your time with school and your job and the family works you to the bone?"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「それでも、……そこが私の世界ですし。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500272.ogg":^"Despite all that, ...it's still my world."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_warai4.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「紗音。@そのような世界が、そなたの世界である必要が、あるというのか？@　率直に言おう。@……紗音。@妾はそなたを招いたのではない。@迎えに来たのだ。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500512.ogg":^"Shannon,^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500513.ogg":^ does that sort of world really need to be yours?^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500514.ogg":^  Let me be honest with you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500515.ogg":^  ...Shannon,^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500516.ogg":^ I didn't just invite you here.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500517.ogg":^  I came to take you home."^\

cl l,24

_ld r,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_odoroki2.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「迎え、………？」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500273.ogg":^"Take me home...?"^\

;ld r,CUR_MajimeA1,80

bg black,22
bg new_rose_1ep,22
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「かつて、そなたのような良き使用人を目指し。@……そして、魔女の世界に憧れ、@使用人から魔女となった妾は、もはや魔法の悦楽を知り尽くす境地に至った。@……だから、そなたを迎えに来たのだ。」@
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500518.ogg":^"Once, I tried to become a good servant like you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500519.ogg":^  ...Then, I became fascinated by witches ^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500520.ogg":^and became one myself, learning all the pleasures of magic.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500521.ogg":^  ...And now, I have come to take you home."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br

