;ld c,CUR_NayamuA1,4

langjp　ベアトリーチェは静かにそう言い、ゆっくりと席を立つ。\
langen^Beatrice spoke quietly and slowly rose from her seat.^\

bg black,22
bg new_rose_3ap,24

_ld c,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_nayamu1.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「紗音。@……やはり、使用人よりも、魔女の世界の方がずっと楽しいぞ。@この茶会など、旧友とのほんの挨拶代わりでしかない。@妾とそなたが望めば望んだ数だけ、いくらでも楽しき催しは繰り広げられる。@それこそ、無限に永遠に。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500522.ogg":^"Shannon,^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500523.ogg":^ ...the world of witches truly is more fun than being a servant.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500524.ogg":^  This tea party is nothing more than a mere welcoming party for an old friend.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500525.ogg":^  We can hold as many fun festivities as we desire.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500526.ogg":^  That is the endless, the eternal."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_warai6.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「……この黄金の薔薇庭園を完成させた今、妾は至ったのだ。@此処こそが、理想郷。@そう、ここを黄金の理想郷と名付けよう。@その完成に至ったからこそ、そなたを迎えに来たのだ。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500527.ogg":^"...Now that this golden rose garden has been completed, I have reached my goal.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500528.ogg":^  This place is paradise.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500529.ogg":^  Yes, let us call it the Golden Paradise.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500530.ogg":^  Now that it has been completed, I have come to welcome you in.^\/
advsetwindow "27"


langjpもう、何の不自由も、忍耐も努力も必要ない。@ここでそなたと妾は永遠に、いつまでも楽しく過ごすのだ。@まるで、終わりのないおとぎ話のようにな……。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500531.ogg":^  There's no need for any inconveniences, any perseverance or hard work.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500532.ogg":^  Here, you and I can enjoy ourselves for all eternity.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500533.ogg":^  It will be like a never-ending fairy tale..."^\

