;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500543.ogg":^"Why?^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500544.ogg":^  ...What responsibility forces you to return ^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500545.ogg":^to the world of Humans?"^\

