langen^Madam is strict, high-strung, and has a short temper.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　日々の仕事も面倒臭くないといえば嘘になるし、学業との両立だって、それはとても大変なこと。\
langen^It'd be a lie if I said the everyday chores weren't a pain, and having to balance work with school makes it even harder.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

