langjp「それは私もだぜ。@母さんなんかは、粗相があってはダメとかうるさかったけど。@私にとっても、いとこみんなで遊べる楽しい日だった。@何しろ、普段の六軒島には、何もねぇんだから。」\
;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200270.ogg":^"Same here.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200271.ogg":^  Mom was always yelling about how there must be no mistakes,^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200272.ogg":^ but to me, it was just the day I got to play with all my cousins.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200273.ogg":^  After all, there's usually nothing at all to do on Rokkenjima."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_futeki1.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「すげぇお屋敷に住んでたり、プライベートビーチがあったり。@ガキの頃は羨ましいと思ってたけど。@朱志香の身になって考えると、さぞや窮屈だったと思うぜ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100023.ogg":^"Back when I was still a little brat, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100024.ogg":^I was always jealous of Jessica, getting to live in this huge mansion with a private beach.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100025.ogg":^  But now that I try putting myself in her shoes, it must've been a pretty constricting place to live."^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\geo\1\geo_a11_majime2.png",80
advsetwindow "07"

langjp「だろうね……。@六軒島には、本当に何もない。@友達の家も、お隣もご近所もない。@朱志香ちゃんの気持ちを考えると、少し気の毒に思うよ。」\
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300042.ogg":^"Probably...^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300043.ogg":^  There's hardly anything on Rokkenjima.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300044.ogg":^  No friends' houses, no next door neighbors, no neighborhood.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300045.ogg":^  If you think of how Jessica must have felt, you have to feel a little sad for her."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\jes\1\jes_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "04"

langjp「だから私にとっては、親族会議の日は、本当に特別な日。@はしゃいでふざけて！@　まるでお祭りの日みたいな気持ちだった。@徹底的に悪ふざけの限りを尽くしたぜ。」\
;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200274.ogg":^"That's why the family conference was so special to me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200275.ogg":^  Jumping around, messing around!^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200276.ogg":^  It felt like I was at a festival.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200277.ogg":^  We played tricks on each other all the time."^\

