langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400977.ogg":^"Yeah, I see where you're coming from.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400978.ogg":^  ...I doubt anyone could understand.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400979.ogg":^  ...This person here thought that no one would ever understand.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400980.ogg":^  That's why you're here.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400981.ogg":^  ...That's why Bernkastel brought you two, two people who never should have met, together like this."^\

bg black,22
