;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400986.ogg":^"...Yes."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_akire1a.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「それは、……私が家族を、親族を！@　みんなを殺すに足る、納得できる動機なんですか…！」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300489.ogg":^"Is that motive...^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300490.ogg":^a satisfying explanation for why I'd kill my entire family...?!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「さぁな。@それを考えるのは自分だ。@俺が納得しても、お前が納得するわけじゃねぇ。@……お前の納得は、お前がするんだ。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400987.ogg":^"Who knows.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400988.ogg":^  That's for you to decide.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400989.ogg":^  Even if I say it's satisfying, that doesn't mean it'll satisfy you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400990.ogg":^  ...You have to decide that for yourself."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「私には、何が何だか、本当にわからないんです…！@　ベアトリーチェが起こしたといういくつものゲーム盤という名の事件を見ましたっ。@そして今、もう一人の私が語る、異なる人生についても聞いていますっ。@でも、全然、それと事件が繋がらない！@　理解が出来ない！！」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300491.ogg":^"I really don't have a clue what's going on...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300492.ogg":^  I've seen several crimes called game boards that Beatrice supposedly carried out.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300493.ogg":^  And now, I'm hearing another me talk about a different life from mine.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300494.ogg":^  But there's no connection between that and the crime!^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300495.ogg":^  I don't understand!!"^\

