advsetwindow "54"
langen:delay 900:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400997.ogg":^ ...which involves inviting all to the Golden Land...^@/
advsetwindow "54"
langen:delay 2200:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400998_b.ogg":^...and making all loves bear fruit."^@/
