;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75400999.ogg":^"That's the answer to the final riddle from the 4th game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401000.ogg":^  ...Your greatest misfortune was solving the epitaph,^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401001.ogg":^ ...reviving as the Golden Witch in the truest sense, and gaining magical power."^\

