;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500603.ogg":^"...Looking back, ...was that really misfortune after all?^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500604.ogg":^  ...I do not know.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500605.ogg":^  However, as long as the fact that Battler-san returns in 1986 remains unchanged,^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500606.ogg":^ ...some sort of tragedy would certainly have occurred."^\



