;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401002.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401003.ogg":^  ...If Battler had returned a year earlier or later,^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401004.ogg":^ ...that incident might not have occurred."^\

