langjp……運命とは、本当に皮肉なものですね。@………私に魔女の人生を歩ませ、……碑文を解くことで、本当の魔女となり。@……そして、６年を経て、彼の帰りを知る。@………それら全てが運命ならば。@……これは私にとって、必然であり、逃れられなかった事件、なのです。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500608.ogg":^...Fate can be so filled with irony.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500609.ogg":^  ...It made me walk the path of a witch, ...and when I solved the epitaph, I became a true witch.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500610.ogg":^  ...Then, six years passed, and I learned of his return.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500611.ogg":^  ...If all of that was fate,^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500612.ogg":^ ...then this crime must have been inevitable and inescapable for me."^\


