langjp「戦人は１９８０年。@母、明日夢の死と、父、留弗夫の早過ぎる再婚に憤慨して、右代宮家を飛び出した。@そして６年間、右代宮家を離れた。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401005.ogg":^"In 1980,^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401006.ogg":^ Battler was resentful because of the death of his mother, Asumu, and his father's remarriage that came too soon, so he left the Ushiromiya family.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401007.ogg":^  For six whole years, he had no direct contact with them."^\

