langjp「お前の人生にも、そして家庭にも。@私は何も文句を言うつもりはない。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800040.ogg":^"I have no intention of criticizing your way of life or your family situation.^@/


_ld c,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "02"

langjpしかし、親父殿はカンカンだよ。@勘当ならまだしも、子の方から愛想を尽かして籍を出て行くなど、聞いたこともない。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800041.ogg":^  However, Father is in a towering rage.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800042.ogg":^  Disinheriting a son is one thing, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800043.ogg":^but I've never even heard of a child becoming fed up and leaving the family on his own."^\

bg new_m1f_s1af,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\rud\1\rud_a11_nayamu1.png",23
advsetwindow "08"

langjp「……誰に似たんだか。@戦人のやつめ、妙に頑固でなぁ。」@
;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200019.ogg":^"...That Battler can be surprisingly stubborn.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200020.ogg":^  Sort of like someone else I know."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_majime1.png",24
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「戦人くんの気持ちがわからないのであれば、父親としての資格を疑われるかと思いますよ。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900053.ogg":^"If you are unable to understand Battler-kun's feelings, one might question your right to be a father."^\

bg new_m1f_s1c,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_majime1.png",24
advsetwindow "02"

langjp「よしたまえ。@霧江さんの子供を、しっかり育てたいという責任を、留弗夫なりに示したということだろう。」@
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800044.ogg":^"Enough, Natsuhi.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800045.ogg":^  I'm sure Rudolf was just trying to show how dedicated he was to raising Kyrie-san's child, in his own way."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_odoroki2.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「それが来年だったなら、何も言うことはありません。@……しかし、どうして今年なのですか。@喪も明けない内から。@……懐妊の時期を考えると、留弗夫さんを見下さざるを得ません。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900054.ogg":^"I would have nothing to say if this were happening next year.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900055.ogg":^  ...But why this year?^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900056.ogg":^  He's still in his period of mourning.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900057.ogg":^  ...If you consider the timing of this pregnancy, one must acknowledge that Rudolf-san has acted disgracefully."^\

bg new_m1f_s1a,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\rud\1\rud_a13_komaru1.png",24
advsetwindow "08"

langjp「…………まぁ、そう虐めないでくれ。@……これが、俺なりのケジメの取り方なんだ…。」\
;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200021.ogg":^"...Come on, don't be so harsh.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200022.ogg":^  ...This is my way of atoning for what I've done..."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_zutuu1.png",23
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「戦人くんが、亡くなられた明日夢さんに代わって、あなたに抗議されている気持ち。@……本当によくわかります。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900058.ogg":^"Battler-kun's trying to protest against you on the behalf of his departed mother, Asumu-san.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900059.ogg":^  ...I deeply understand how he feels.^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_odoroki2.png",80
advsetwindow "03"

langjpもしここにいたなら、一緒に肩を抱いて泣いてあげたい気持ちですよ。」@
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900060.ogg":^  If he were here, I would want to hold him and cry along with him."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　夏妃の言葉は鋭い。@容赦なく留弗夫をえぐる。\
langen^Natsuhi's words were sharp.^@^  They pierced Rudolf mercilessly.^\

bg new_m1f_s1d,25
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　留弗夫には何も言い返せない。@
langjp　霧江との仲は、完全に不倫だった。@
langen^Rudolf had no retort.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^His relationship with Kyrie had been adulterous, plain and simple.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……留弗夫の言い分によるなら、霧江との付き合いは明日夢より長い。@
langjp　そして、明日夢との結婚後も、その縁が切れていなかった……。\
langen^...According to Rudolf, he had been close to Kyrie longer than Asumu.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^And, even after his marriage to Asumu, that relationship had not disappeared...^\

