langjp　そりゃ、俺だって霧江さんは知ってるさ。@あんたのビジネスパートナーで、いつも事業の相談に乗ってくれる頼れる友人だって、聞かされてたさ！@
langjp　それが男女の仲だったなんて、今さら言われたって知ったことかよ！！\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100117.ogg":^So, you've just been betraying Mom from the start!!^\
;advsetwindow "10"
;locate 0,4;utmeta-break
locate 0, 5 ;<CENTER_TEXT>
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100118.ogg":^Sure, I know Kyrie-san.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100119.ogg":^  You've told me that she was your business partner and a friend whose advice you could always rely on!^@
;advsetwindow "10"
;locate 0,4;utmeta-break
langjp　母さんが死んだ後なら勝手さ！@　俺だってあんたの人生だ、好きにしろと言ってるさ！@
langjp　でもな、霧江さんの懐妊はいつだよ？！@　まだ母さんは生きてるじゃないか？！\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100120.ogg":^If you're trying to say after all this time that she was more than that, then why should I give a damn?!!^\
;advsetwindow "10"
;locate 0,4;utmeta-break
locate 0, 5 ;<CENTER_TEXT>
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100121.ogg":^After Mom's death, you could've done whatever you wanted!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100122.ogg":^  I'm right there with you, saying that you should live life as you please!^@
;advsetwindow "10"
;locate 0,4;utmeta-break
langjp　あぁ、やっとわかったぜッ！@　何で俺はあんたにこんなにも吐き気を感じるのかってな！@
langjp　あんた、母さんがここで死んでくれて嬉しかったろ？　そうなんだろ？！\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100123.ogg":^But just when did Kyrie-san get pregnant?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100124.ogg":^  Back when Mom was still alive, right?!^\
;advsetwindow "10"
;locate 0,4;utmeta-break
locate 0, 5 ;<CENTER_TEXT>
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100125.ogg":^Yeah, now I finally see!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100126.ogg":^  So this is why you always make me want to vomit!^@
;advsetwindow "10"
;locate 0,4;utmeta-break
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100127.ogg":^Are you glad that Mom's finally dead now?  You are, aren't you?!^\
;advsetwindow "10"
;locate 0,4;utmeta-break
langjp　もし母さんが生きてたら、不倫のことや、子供のことで、どう隠すかで苦労が耐えなかったろうからな！！@
locate 0, 4 ;<CENTER_TEXT>
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100128.ogg":^I'm sure it would've been so hard on you, keeping your infidelity and even a kid secret while Mom was still alive!!^@
;locate 0,4;utmeta-break
br
;advsetwindow "10"
langjp　都合よく母さんが死んでくれたから、霧江さんと結婚して、新しい子を俺の弟か妹になんて、よく言えたもんだぜッ！！\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100129.ogg":^But now that Mom conveniently kicked it, you get to marry Kyrie-san, and I get a new little brother or sister?!!^\
;advsetwindow "10"
