;advsetwindow "10"
;locate 0,4;utmeta-break
langjp　生まれてくる子に罪はねぇさ。@両親が揃ってなきゃ可哀想だ。@せいぜい、新しい家族を育んで、幸せに育ててやれよ！！@
locate 0, 4 ;<CENTER_TEXT>
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100134.ogg":^The kid is completely guiltless.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100135.ogg":^  It'd be too sad if he or she doesn't have both parents together.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100136.ogg":^  Go ahead, build a new family and raise that kid to have a happy life!!^@
br
