langjp　だって母さんはもう、憎むことも出来ねぇ！！@　だから俺が母さんに代わって、あんたを憎む！！@　全身全霊をかけてなッ！！@
locate 0, 5 ;<CENTER_TEXT>
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100138.ogg":^Mom isn't here to hate you anymore!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100139.ogg":^  So I'll hate you in her place!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100140.ogg":^  With all of my body and soul!!^@
br
