langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700334.ogg":^"Ah, I see!^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700335.ogg":^  He realizes that there'll be all kinds of trouble if he decides to marry a servant girl, so he's abandoned the Ushiromiya name beforehand...!"^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「どうだ、紗音！@　これならば全てに筋は通るというもの！@　戦人が右代宮の名を捨てたのは、そなたを考えてのことよ！@　留弗夫との唐突な親子喧嘩は、それをもっともらしくする口実に違いあるまい。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500685.ogg":^"What do you think, Shannon?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500686.ogg":^  That way, everything makes sense!^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500687.ogg":^  Battler has abandoned the Ushiromiya name for your sake!^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500688.ogg":^  This sudden argument with Rudolf was just an excuse."^\

cl r,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_akuwarai1.png",24
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「素敵な推理だわ！@　さすが、リーチェ！」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700336.ogg":^"What splendid reasoning!^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700337.ogg":^  Nice going, Riiche!"^\

cl l,0
ut_mld l,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_warai4.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「わっはっはっはっはっはっは…！@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500689.ogg":^"Wahahahahahahahahaha...!^@/

ut_mld l,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp　どうだ、紗音。@落ち込むには値しないではないか！@　それどころか、そなたと結ばれるために、戦人が先に決意を見せたようなものではないか！」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500690.ogg":^  What do you say, Shannon?^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500691.ogg":^  There's no reason to feel down!^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500692.ogg":^  On the contrary, it's as though Battler has shown his determination first!"^\

