langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500700.ogg":^"Very good.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500701.ogg":^  Wait until the next conference while improving yourself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500702.ogg":^  If you think of it as training to become a wife, all of your everyday chores will grow more meaningful!"^\

