langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300020.ogg":^"Thank you, Krauss nii-san.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300021.ogg":^  ...This is an issue for our family alone.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300022.ogg":^  However, I intend to do all I can to see that Battler-kun and Rudolf-san can live together again someday.^@/
