langjp「そうなのですか……？」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500424.ogg":^"Do you think so...?"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\geo\1\geo_a21_majime4.png",80
advsetwindow "07"

langjp「そうさ。@男がいつまでも両親の元でぬくぬくしていたらカッコ悪いよ。@荒々しく巣を飛び出して、一旗上げなくちゃいけない。@……僕もやがてはと思ってたけど、彼に先を越されてしまったよ。」\
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300070.ogg":^"I do.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300071.ogg":^  It's not cool for a guy to hang around at his parents' for too long.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300072.ogg":^  You've got to leave the nest in a flurry and make your name in the world.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300073.ogg":^  ...I planned to do that eventually, but it looks like he's gone and done it first."^\


;ld l,SHA_fumanA1,80
bg new_sky_1c,25
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「ひ、一旗上げて立派になったら、……帰って来てくれるのでしょうか？」@
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500425.ogg":^"A-And when he makes his name in the world and becomes a great man, ...will he come back?"^\
advsetwindow "07"

;ld r,GEO_KomaruA1,80

langjp「ひょっとしたら、もう帰って来ないことも、……あるかもしれないね。@だって、これは彼にとって、巣立ちなのかもしれないのだから。」\
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300074.ogg":^"It may be...that he never comes back.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300075.ogg":^  After all, this might be leaving the nest to him."^\
advsetwindow "15"


;ld l,SHA_MajimeA3,80

langjp「……巣立ち…………………。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500426.ogg":^"...Leaving the nest......"^\

