langjp「戦人、来なかったわね……。」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700340.ogg":^"Battler didn't come, did he..."^\

;bg rose_3cp,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_aseru1.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「あぁ、何ということだ。@妾は紗音に、きっと来るからと何度も言ってしまったぞ。@………きっと紗音は、戦人が来なくて深く落ち込んでいるに違いない。@妾がいい加減なことを言って、希望を持たせてしまったから…！」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500710.ogg":^"Oh, how terrible.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500711.ogg":^  And I kept telling Shannon that he was sure to come.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500712.ogg":^  ...I'm sure she's very upset over Battler's absence.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500713.ogg":^  And it's all because I got her hopes up...!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_warai3a.png",23
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「親族会議の今日を張り合いに生きてきたようなもんだしね…。@彼女の気持ちを考えると、心が痛むわ。」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700341.ogg":^"She's been looking forward to this day...^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700342.ogg":^  It pains me to think of how she must feel."^\

bg new_rose_2bp,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_fuman1.png",2
_ld c,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「……………ありがとうございます。@……私は、大丈夫です。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500427.ogg":^"......Thanks, you two.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500428.ogg":^  ...I'm...okay."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　夢の世界で再び私は、魔女たちに再会する。@
langen^I had been reunited with the witches once again in that dream world.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　………日中はまったく覚えていないのに、夢の世界では、これが再会だと不思議に理解できた。\
langen^...Though I could never remember anything during the day, now that I was in the dream world, I somehow knew that this was a reunion.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　魔女たちは気の毒そうな顔をしていた。@
langen^The witches both looked apologetic.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　きっと今日、戦人が来てくれると励ましたのに、@彼が来なくて、結果として嘘を吐くことになってしまったのを、悔やんでいるように見えた。\
langen^Though they had tried to cheer me up by saying that Battler would come today,^@^ now that he hadn't come, it was like they'd been lying, and they seemed to regret it heavily.^\

bg new_rose_3ap,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_odoroki2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp!s1「紗音、/
langjp!d800……その、/
langjp!d800……まぁ……。」/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500714.ogg":!s1^"Shannon, ^@/
advsetwindow "27"
langen:delay 1000:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500715.ogg":^...umm...^@/
advsetwindow "27"
langen:delay 1700:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500716.ogg":^...well..."^@/
langjp!sd@
langen!sd\

;＜クレル

_ld l,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_warai2.png",23
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「……お気遣いを、ありがとうございます。@悲しくなんかないと言えば、もちろん嘘になりますけれど。@………私は、大丈夫ですから。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500429.ogg":^"...Thanks for your concern.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500430.ogg":^  I'd be lying if I said I wasn't sad,^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500431.ogg":^ ...but I'll be okay."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_odoroki4.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「そ、そうか？@　そうなのか？@　……ならば良いのだが……。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500717.ogg":^"A-Are you sure?^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500718.ogg":^  Really sure?^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500719.ogg":^  ...That would be splendid, but..."^\

bg new_rose_3ap,23
_ld l,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_warai2a.png",23
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「戦人のヤツ、派手にケンカしたもんだからきっと、引っ込みが付かなくなっちゃっただけに決まってるわ。@男は意地っ張りだもの。」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700343.ogg":^"Clearly, Battler's fight was so over-the-top that he couldn't bring himself to back down so soon.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700344.ogg":^  Men are so stubborn."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_odoroki3.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「そ、そうであるとも…！@　威勢のいいことを言って飛び出したものだから、今さら引っ込みが付かなくなって、意地になってしまっただけに違いあるまい！@　きっと、来ればよかったと後悔しているはずだ。@そうとも、そうであるとも…！」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500720.ogg":^"Y-Yes, that is true...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500721.ogg":^  He tried to act tough before running away, so his stubbornness is preventing him from taking back what he said so easily!^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500722.ogg":^  He'll probably regret not coming today.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500723.ogg":^  Yes, that must be it...!"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　何と言うか、……とにかく私を励まそうと、必死になってくれる。@
langjp　その必死さが、何だか少しだけおかしくて。@……私は思わず、くすりと笑ってしまう。\
langen^For some reason, ...they seemed nearly desperate in their attempts to encourage me.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^It was almost funny to watch.^@^  ...I couldn't help but giggle.^\

bg black,22

bg new_rose_2bp,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_warai1.png",22
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「本当にありがとうございます。@だって、………言ったのは皆さんじゃないですか。@これは、試練だ、って。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500432.ogg":^"Thanks a lot, both of you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500433.ogg":^  After all, ...you're the ones who told me in the first place.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500434.ogg":^  That this is a test, ...a trial to be overcome."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　本当は、そこまで自分を騙せてるわけじゃない。@
langen^The truth was, I couldn't really fool myself so easily.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　彼はいつ帰ってきてくれるのか。@
langjp　いつ、私を迎えに来てくれるのか。@
langjp　いつ、じゃなくて。@……本当に彼は迎えに来てくれるのか。\
langen^When will he come back?^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^When will he come for me?^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^When...isn't the question.^@^  ...Will he come for me, ever?^\

bg black,22
bg new_rose_1cp,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　今だって、自分ひとりで塞ぎ込めば、不安と悲しみで胸が張り裂けてしまいそうになる。\
langen^If I start moping right now, the uncertainty and sadness will probably tear me apart.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　でも、彼女らが教えてくれた。@
langen^But they've taught me.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　これは、………彼のことを本当に信じていることを試される、試練なのだ。@
langen^This is...a trial to see whether I really believe in him or not.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　不安に思うことそのものが、……私の決意に対して、迎えに来ると約束してくれた彼への、裏切りなのだ。\
langen^The very fact that I feel uncertain and anxious is a betrayal of my resolve...^@^and of his promise to come for me someday.^\

