;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500435.ogg":^"George-sama said something about it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500436.ogg":^  ...He said this might be the same as leaving the nest for Battler-san."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_def2.png",24
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「そうよ。@これは、右代宮の姓を抜け出てひとりの男として羽ばたくという、巣立ちなんだわ。」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700345.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\73700346.ogg":^  This is his chance to leave behind the Ushiromiya name and spread his wings as his own man."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「よくよく考えれば、……私たちはまだ若いんですし。@本当に結ばれようと思ったら、まだまだ社会的経験も信用も、何より年齢が足りません。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500437.ogg":^"If you really think about it, ...we're still very young.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500438.ogg":^  Even if we want to be tied together, we're still lacking many years of social experience and trust.^@/
advsetwindow "15"

;ld l,SHA_MajimeA1,80

langjp戦人さんが本当に真剣に考えて下さったならばこそ、……まだ迎えに来られるわけがないんです。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500439.ogg":^  If Battler-san is really and truly taking this seriously, ...then it's too soon for him to come for me now."^\

