;br
langjp　その心配ばかりで、仕事を辞める覚悟はおろか、辞表の準備も何も出来てはいなかった。@
langen^Thanks to that, not only did I not have the resolve to quit my job, I hadn't even started on the paperwork to do so.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……つまり、私にはまだ、彼にあの日、約束した“決意”が、まだなかったのだ。\
langen^...In short, I still don't have the `determination' that I promised him that day.^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　神様は、それをちゃんとわかっていたのだ。@
langjp　彼は、私の決意の日に、迎えに来る。@
langen^I'm sure that God knew that.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Battler will come for me when I've found my determination.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　私に決意がないのだから、彼が今日、やって来なかったのは当然のことなのだ……。\
langen^I wasn't determined, so it's only natural that he didn't come today...^\
