langen^If someone actually could solve it, ...they themselves would be a miracle.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Perhaps that miracle...would guide the person Kinzo most wanted to solve it...^\
advsetwindow "53"

;ld l,RIO_DefA1,80

langjp「つまりこの碑文は、やはり誰もが想像するように、魔女ベアトリーチェを復活させる、儀式を記したものなのですか…？」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300520.ogg":^"In short, this epitaph really does depict a ceremony to revive the witch, Beatrice, just as everyone thought...?"^\

mcbg 0

bg new_cha_i1dp,22
_ld c,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_fuman3.png",24
advsetwindow "55"

langjp「………普通に考えれば、これはそう読み取れるでしょう。@１３人の生贄を捧げれば、魔女が蘇ると読み取れる、謎の儀式。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500794.ogg":^"...That does seem to be the obvious interpretation.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500795.ogg":^  A mysterious ceremony, sacrificing 13 people to revive the witch.^@/
advsetwindow "55"

;ld c,CUR_FumanA2,80

langjp……しかし、本当の儀式はそれではない。@……奇跡的に解ける誰かを待つ。@そちらこそが、本当の儀式。@しかし、運命とは皮肉なもの。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500796.ogg":^  ...However, the true ceremony wasn't that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500797.ogg":^  ...It lies in wait for someone to miraculously solve it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500798.ogg":^  That is the true ceremony.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500799.ogg":^  However, fate does have its irony."^\

bg new_cha_i1ip,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_majime2.png",24
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「源次は知っていた。@……金蔵は始めから、源次が全てを知っていると思い、仕掛けたのかもしれねぇな。」\
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401037.ogg":^"Genji already knew.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401038.ogg":^  ...Maybe Kinzo set this up in the first place because he guessed that Genji knew everything."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_nayamu1.png",24
advsetwindow "55"

langjp「……その運命が偶然だったのか、仕組まれたものなのか。@私にはわかりません。@……しかし、その碑文により、魔女ベアトリーチェは、本当の意味での復活を遂げるのです。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500800.ogg":^"...Was that fate a coincidence, or something planned?^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500801.ogg":^  I do not know.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500802.ogg":^  ...However, with this epitaph, the witch Beatrice will revive in the truest sense."^\

