;＜ベアト

bg new_portrait2,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　妾は、その巨大な肖像画に描かれた貴婦人に魂を奪われる。@
langjp　それは、まさにその通りだったかもしれない。@
langen^My soul was captured by the woman shown in that massive portrait.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^That might have been literally true.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　魂を奪われるというより、……魂が、より相応しい、在るべき場所へ戻るというべきか。\
langen^Or, rather than captured, perhaps it would be better to say that my soul had returned to a more fitting place, the place it belonged.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　美しいブロンドの髪は妾と同じだったが、結い上げられていた。@
langjp　纏うドレスは漆黒で、その黄金の髪をより引き立てている。\
langen^The beautiful blonde hair was the same as mine, but tied up.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^The dress she wore was a deep black, making that golden hair stand out all the more.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　………これが、魔女ベアトリーチェ。@
langjp　これが本当の、……妾の姿なのだ……。\
langen^...This is the witch, ...Beatrice.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^My...true form...^\


bg new_mhal_2cnz,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\be2\1\be2_b11_majime4.png",26
_ld r,":b;sprites\be2\1\be2_b11_fukigen3.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「？@　…………これは何か。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700298.ogg":^"?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700299.ogg":^  ......What is this?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　肖像画のタイトルを記したにしては、文字量の多過ぎるプレート。@
langen^There was a plate with too many words for it to be the title of the picture.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　懐かしき、故郷を貫く鮎の川……。@
langjp　黄金郷を目指す者よ、これを下りて鍵を探せ。\
langen^Behold the sweetfish river running through my beloved hometown...^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^You who seek the Golden Land, follow its path downstream in search of the key.^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\be2\1\be2_b11_1_majime6.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「……黄金郷…。@/
langjp!s1……そうか、/
langjp!d500………妾の世界は、/
langjp!d300……黄金郷なのか…。」/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700300.ogg":^"...The Golden Land...^@/
advsetwindow "27"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700301.ogg":!s1^  ...I see,^@/
advsetwindow "27"
langen:delay 1600:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700302.ogg":^ ...so my world...^@/
advsetwindow "27"
langen:delay 1500:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700303.ogg":^...is the Golden Land..."^@/
langjp!sd@
langen!sd\
advsetwindow "-1"

;＜ベアト
;br
langjp　妾はずっと、自分だけの世界を、理想郷と呼んできた。@
langjp　しかし今宵、それは改められる。@
langen^I have always called my own, personal world a Paradise.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^But tonight, I shall change that.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　これより、妾の世界は、黄金郷。@
langjp　我こそは、黄金郷の主、ベアトリーチェ……。\
langen^From now on, my world shall be the Golden Land.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^I am the master of the Golden Land, Beatrice...^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　……そして、第一の晩から続く、残酷な生贄の儀式。@
langjp　第九の晩に、魔女は蘇り、誰も生き残れはしない……。\
langen^...And then, there is the brutal ceremony of sacrifices, starting on the first twilight.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^On the ninth twilight, the witch shall revive, and none shall be left alive...^\

;bg black,25
bg new_portrait2,22
advsetwindow "27"

;ld c,BEA_DefA1,80

langjp「妾はこの儀式を執り行えば、……真の復活を得るというのか……。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700304.ogg":^"If I carry out this ceremony, ...will I revive in the truest sense...?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そして第十の晩に旅は終わり、黄金の郷に至る……。@
langjp　魔女は賢者を讃え、四つの宝を授けるだろう。@
langjp　一つは、黄金郷の全ての黄金。\
langen^Then, on the tenth twilight, at journey's end, you shall attain to the power of the Golden Land's treasures, once and for the last time...^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^The witch shall praise the wise and bestow four treasures.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^One shall be all the gold from the Golden Land.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　……金蔵は、ベアトリーチェより莫大な黄金を授けられ、今尚、それをどこかに隠していると噂される。@
langen^...Kinzo received a massive amount of gold from Beatrice, and rumor has it that it still lies hidden somewhere.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　これはやはり、家人や使用人たちが噂しているように、金蔵が隠した黄金の在り処を示す暗号なのだろうか。\
langen^Is this, as the family members and servants are all whispering, a code showing the location of Kinzo's hidden gold?^\

bg black,2
bg new_mhal_2cnz,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\be2\1\be2_b11_nayamu1.png",26
_ld r,":b;sprites\be2\1\be2_b11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「………ニンゲンが至れば、莫大な黄金を手に入れるであろう。@………しかし妾が至れば、自らの復活を得る…。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700305.ogg":^"......If a Human solves it, they will obtain a great quantity of gold.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700306.ogg":^  ......However, if I do, it will mean my own resurrection..."^\
;br

_ld r,":b;sprites\be2\1\be2_b11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　……………………………。@
langen^............^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……金蔵め、老いぼれ魔術師め。@
langjp　老い先短いと馬鹿にしていたら、こんな戯れを始めるとは。\
langen^...Kinzo, you aging magician.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Just when I was mocking the shortness of the time left to you, you start a game like this.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　面白いではないか。@……きっと妾が解いてやろうぞ。@
langjp　そして、妾は本当のベアトリーチェとして復活するのだ。@
langen^How interesting.^@^  ...I'll definitely solve it.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Then, I will revive as the real Beatrice.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　さすれば、妾は絶大な魔力によって、人も物も、昼も夜も、六軒島の全てを支配するであろうぞ……。\
langen^When that happens, I will use my great magical power to rule over object and man, day and night, and all of Rokkenjima...^\

