;＜源次
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\71600101.ogg":^"......Is that truly how you feel?"^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_naku2.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「そうだ、我が友よ。@……悔いている。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500172.ogg":^"Yes, my friend.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500173.ogg":^  ...I regret it.^@/
advsetwindow "01"

;ld l,KIN_fukigenA1,80

langjp若き日の過ちを深く悔いているッ。@……お前も老いたならわかるであろう。@……若き日の過ちは、若き日には何の咎も感じはせぬ。@しかしそれは深いトゲのように、次第に膿み、………私を苛むのだ。@……この右代宮金蔵、今さら死に様などこだわりはせぬ！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500174.ogg":^  How deeply I regret those mistakes made in youth!^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500175.ogg":^  ...You have aged as well, so you must know.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500176.ogg":^  ...One cannot feel guilt for the sins of their youth when one is still young.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500177.ogg":^  However, like deep thorns, they began to fester, ...torturing me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500178.ogg":^  ...I, Ushiromiya Kinzo, no longer care how I die!"^\

cl l,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_naku2.png",23
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「しかし、……このトゲだけは、………この後悔だけは、………清算したいのだ……。@ベアトリーチェに全てを返す。@そして罪の許しを請う…！@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500179.ogg":^"However, ...this thorn...this regret...is the one account I must settle...^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500180.ogg":^  I will return everything to Beatrice.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500181.ogg":^  And, I will ask her to forgive me for my sins...!^@/
advsetwindow "01"

;ld l,KIN_NakuA1,80

langjp　それだけが、………それだけが、私の最後の願いなのだ……。@……ぅ、/
langjp!d500……ぅうぅぅぅ………。@ぅああぁああぁああぁぁぁ……！！」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500182.ogg":^  For that is...  That is my only and final wish...^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500183.ogg":^  ...Ooh, ^@/
advsetwindow "01"
langen:delay 900:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500184.ogg":^oooooohhhh...^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500185.ogg":^  Uwaaaaaaaaaahhhhhhhh...!!"^\

