;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500816.ogg":^"And so, ...since the time of my birth, I have been trapped by the crossroads of fate,^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500817.ogg":^ ...never given the right to make any decisions of my own will."^\

