langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400316.ogg":^"Yep.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400317.ogg":^  They're his little brothers, waiting for him at home!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400318.ogg":^  Sakusuke's a lot more reliable than Sakutaro, and Sakukichi is so skillful, he can do anything.^@/

