;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400321.ogg":^"Yep.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400322.ogg":^  So I call my bed Lion Land!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400323.ogg":^  But there's lots of other animals too!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400324.ogg":^  Uu-!"^\

