;＜ワルギリア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\73200035.ogg":^"I guess that means we should work on deepening our relationships as well.^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\73200036.ogg":^  By strengthening our bonds, our existence and magical power will grow stronger and stronger..."^\

