;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700337.ogg":^  From what I've heard, Maria's world has far more than just Sakutarou and the bunnies!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700338.ogg":^  We can't let her beat us!"^\

