;＜ワルギリア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\73200037.ogg":^"Here in Mariage Sorcière, we have learned how to expand our worlds and create new minions.^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\73200038.ogg":^  By now, you may create new minions as often as your imagination allows..."^\

