;＜ロノウェ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\73100015.ogg":^"Milady, what about those?^@:dwave 0, "voice\31\73100016.ogg":^  Could you make vessels of those dark tools you found when cleaning out Goldsmith's storage room?"^\

