;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400325.ogg":^"Uu-!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400326.ogg":^  We'll get more and more new friends...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400327.ogg":^  That's my magic!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400328.ogg":^  And Beato can take my friends and give them a form.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\70400329.ogg":^  You can make them grow...!"^\

