;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500538.ogg":^"W-We don't know that for sure, right...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500539.ogg":^  I don't know where the Master lived in Taiwan, ...but there might have been only one river there.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500540.ogg":^  If so, that must be the place."^\

