;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700414.ogg":^"How foolish.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700415.ogg":^  All rivers have freshwater in them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700416.ogg":^  What's stopping sweetfish from living in any river?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700417.ogg":^  ......Come to think of it, what a foolish name this Danshui River has.^\:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700418.ogg":^  Freshwater River?  What sort of river isn't a freshwater river?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700419.ogg":^  It would only make sense to name a river after what's in it if it were literally anything else."^\

