;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300547.ogg":^"If the station was once known by a different name, ...then could some local spot also have had its name changed?"^\

cl r,23
_ld r,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_ikari1.png",24
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「そうだ。@元々、キリガン駅は、地名から名付けられたものだ。@そして、地名のキリガンは、駅名と違い、こう書く。」\
;＜ウィル
;■書き文字
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401066.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401067.ogg":^  Kirigan Station was named after a nearby location, after all.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401068.ogg":^  And though the name of that area was also Kirigan, it's written differently."^\

