langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500843.ogg":^"That would be the obvious answer.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500844.ogg":^  However, I couldn't make the long trip to Taiwan to check.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500845.ogg":^  And, of course, the place known as Kirigan is quite large itself.^@/
advsetwindow "55"

