;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500848.ogg":^"I was certain that I had found the answer, at least to the first five lines of the epitaph.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500849.ogg":^  ...In my eyes, it truly was an entertaining game...no, a mystery."^\

