;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401070.ogg":^"We can tell by this line that the key refers to six things.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401071.ogg":^  ...Reasoning makes it possible to see that this couldn't refer to a physical key."^\

