advsetwindow "55"

langjp「はい。@６つの何か。@……私も頭が硬い人間でしたから。@……とにかく、６に関わる何かがないかと、本を読み漁りました。@６。@６、６、６。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500850.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500851.ogg":^  Six things.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500852.ogg":^  ...I was merely a thick-headed human.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500853.ogg":^  ...I decided to look through books for anything related to the number six.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500854.ogg":^  Six.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500855.ogg":^  Six, six, six.^\/

_ld c,":b;sprites\cur\1\cur_a11_majime4.png",80
advsetwindow "55"

langjpキリガンという鍵の在り処は、言葉遊びによって隠されていました。@ならばきっと、この６もまた、言葉遊びに関わるに違いない。@６。@６、６、６。@……探しました。６を。」\
;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500856.ogg":^  The location of the key called Kirigan was hidden by a word game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500857.ogg":^  That meant the six things were surely connected to some sort of word game too.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500858.ogg":^  Six.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500859.ogg":^  Six, six, six.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500860.ogg":^  I kept searching for six."^\

