;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401076.ogg":^"On the second twilight, we start hearing about `those who remain'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401077.ogg":^  ...Reasoning opens up the possibility that the six letters of the key...are being removed from an even larger set of letters."^\


