;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500863.ogg":^"However, what could the six letters be removed from?^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500864.ogg":^  That puzzle worried me for a long time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500865.ogg":^  It's like the start of an entirely new riddle.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500866.ogg":^  This time, I would have to solve it all by myself, without any assistance."^\

