;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401078.ogg":^"Right, that theory about a ten-day journey ending at the tenth twilight.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\75401079.ogg":^  `On the tenth twilight, at journey's end, you shall attain to the power of the Golden Land's treasures, once and for the last time.'  She took that section to be a literal trip that ends when you `attain to', or reach, the treasures of the Golden Land."^\

