;＜クレル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500867.ogg":^"What meaning was there in those words?^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500868.ogg":^  Realizing that there was something to be found...and then realizing what that something actually was...took another long stretch of time."^\

