langen:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500869.ogg":^"...You reach...^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500870.ogg":^or rather, raise yourself to the power of the `four' treasures.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500871.ogg":^  Starting at twilight number `ten'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\55\75500872.ogg":^  And this is done `once and for the last time'."^\

