langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500216.ogg":^"......Lion, my child...^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500217.ogg":^  ...All the ways your fate has been toyed with until today were caused by my sins.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500218.ogg":^  ...Please forgive me...^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\71500219.ogg":^  ...You will now inherit my ring.^@^  You are the new Ushiromiya Family Head."^\

