advsetwindow "19"

langjp「２００億円の価値があるそうです。@………もうあんたには、この世で、カネで叶えられぬ夢はありませんな。」@
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900096.ogg":^"I hear it's worth 20 billion yen.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\71900097.ogg":^  ...From here on, any of your dreams in this world can by granted with money."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kum\1\kum_a11_warai1.png",24
advsetwindow "18"

langjp「ほっほっほっほ……。@急にこんな大金が手に入っても、使い道に困ってしまいますねぇ。」\
;＜熊沢
langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\71800155.ogg":^"Hohohoho...^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\71800156.ogg":^  It must be tough to think of what to do with this much money when it suddenly comes your way."^\

bg new_sub_r1b,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a15_nayamu1.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「…………お金で手に入れられるものの中に、私の欲しいものはありません。@……ですから、これは当分は、そのままにしておこうと思います。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700529.ogg":^"...There is nothing I desire among the things money can buy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700530.ogg":^  ...So, for the present, I would like to leave this here."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　……もちろん、お金がたくさんあるのは嬉しいことだけれど。@
langen^...Of course, I'm glad I have a lot of money.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　私の胸の痛みは、お金では癒せない。@
langjp　ただ、………彼が帰って来て欲しいだけ。\
langen^However, money can't heal the pain in my heart.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^I just...want him to come back.^\

