langjp「この地下貴賓室へ至る鍵です。@これを使えば、もう仕掛けを使う必要はありません。」@
;＜源次
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\71600155.ogg":^"It is a key to the underground VIP room.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\71600156.ogg":^  If you use this, you won't need to use that entrance contraption."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　碑文の謎は、彼女以外、誰も答えを知らず、そして唯一の鍵も、彼女の手に委ねられる。@
langjp　……今や、彼女は本当に、この黄金の貴賓室の主だった。\
langen^She was the only one who knew the answer to the epitaph's riddle, and the only key to this place was now hers.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^...At this point, she truly was the master of this golden VIP room.^\


