;＜源次
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\71600170.ogg":^  ...Then, we must tell them that Lion-sama is the official Successor to the Headship.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\71600171.ogg":^  After all, from this point forth, you are the Ushiromiya Family Head."^\

