advsetwindow "27"

langjp「わ、私が当主なんてそんな……。@それに、次期当主は蔵臼さまでは……。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700542.ogg":^"M-Me as the Head?  That's...^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700543.ogg":^  And isn't Krauss-sama the Successor...?"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\gen\1\gen_a11_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "14"

langjp「碑文の謎を解いた者が次期当主である。@………これはお預かりしている遺言状にも明記してございます。@………お館様の最後の命令が、あなたに全てを引き継ぐことなのです。」\
;＜源次
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\71600172.ogg":^"The one who solves the epitaph's riddle is the Successor.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\71600173.ogg":^  ......There exists a will specifying this much.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\71600174.ogg":^  ......The Master's final order was that you were to inherit everything."^\

cl l,0
ut_mld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a15_odoroki2.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「ま、待って下さい…！@　お気持ちは嬉しいですが、……私には次期当主なんて、務まりませんし、@……そんな大任、とてもお引き受け出来ません。@その役目は、やはり蔵臼さまが引き継がれる方が、いいと思います……。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700544.ogg":^"P-Please wait...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700545.ogg":^  I appreciate the sentiment, ...but I can't do the job of being the Successor,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700546.ogg":^ ...and I can't accept such a big responsibility.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700547.ogg":^  I think it would be better for Krauss-sama to inherit that role..."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\gen\1\gen_a11_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "14"

