langen^I don't want to become the Head if it means making them feel like that.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　私が何者か、今日、私は得ることが出来た。@
langen^Today, I learned who I am.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　誰から、いつ、どのようにして生まれてきたのか。@
langjp　……それを、時間をかけてゆっくりと、彼らから聞いていこう。@
langen^Who gave birth to me, how, and when?^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^...These are things I want to learn from them as time goes by.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　それだけで、もう、充分なのだ。\
langen^That alone is enough.^\

