;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100219.ogg":^  ...And, though I lost, I enjoyed playing.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100220.ogg":^  ...That kid died without folding up her game board.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100221.ogg":^  ...I just took charge of cleaning up...as thanks to her for letting me play and because it's the loser's duty."^\


