langjp「この、絡まった恋の物語を、絶対の意思で、終わらせる。@……その絶対の意思に、絶対の魔女が微笑んで、あの子を二日間だけの魔女にした。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100227.ogg":^"This tale of intertwined loves ends thanks to an absolute and certain willpower.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100228.ogg":^  ...Out of respect for that certain willpower, the Witch of Certainty made that kid a witch for just two days."^\

