langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100253.ogg":^"I'm mean, so I won't go any further than this.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100254.ogg":^  There are no witches who don't think.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100255.ogg":^  After all, witches who don't think either die or turn to seaweed."^\

