langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100256.ogg":^"...Yes, now you can look back and have a drink, ...while seeing how much of your theory was right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100257.ogg":^  I'm tired of playing the part of the bad guy...and of being a miko.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100258.ogg":^  You're done with me now.^@/
