;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400031.ogg":^"Then let's go!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400032.ogg":^  I'll show you!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400033.ogg":^  Let's go, let's go!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400034.ogg":^  But the first to see them gets to keep them!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400035.ogg":^  I'm gonna get them all!"^\
