_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_def3.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「そうだな。@でも、６年ぶりに帰って来て、@……祖父さまは６年経っても、まったく変わってなかったって知ったぜ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100155.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100156.ogg":^  But, when I finally came back after six years,^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100157.ogg":^ ...I saw that Grandfather hadn't changed in the slightest."^\

cl c,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a11_def4b.png",23
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「金蔵は、……気紛れで何を考えてるかわからなくて、@……不気味なオカルト趣味の奇人で……。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000110.ogg":^"Kinzo was...fickle, so you could never understand what he was thinking,^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000111.ogg":^ ...and he was an eccentric with a creepy love for the occult, and..."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「オカルト趣味なのは間違いない。@余生の趣味にしちゃ、ちょいと珍しいものだったのは事実だ。@……その不気味な収集品で孫を怖がらせてからかう、悪い趣味があったことは、俺も認める。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100158.ogg":^"It's true that he had a love for the occult.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100159.ogg":^  Yeah, it was a bit of a strange hobby for him to get into in his final years.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100160.ogg":^  ...I'll admit that his hobby of collecting strange objects to scare his grandchildren and laugh at them wasn't exactly praiseworthy."^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　戦人もかつて金蔵に、からかわれたことがある。@
langen^Even Battler had been pranked by Kinzo in the past.^@
;br

bg new_magicsquare_sun7,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　おかしな杭が７本も詰まったアタッシュケースを見せられ、@……これは中世の昔に、魔女が生贄の儀式で、心臓を抉るのに使った杭だ、みたいなことを。\
langen^He'd do things like showing off an attache case with seven strange stakes in it...^@^...and say something about how they were once used in the Middle Ages to gouge the hearts of victims in a witch's ceremony.^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"
langjp　脅された当時はそこそこに怖かったが、今にして思うと、文字通りの子供騙しだ。@
langen^When Kinzo did things like that, it was pretty scary, but looking back on it now, they really were childish pranks.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　祖父さまは孫とじゃれ合いたくて、……怖がらせてからかっていただけなんだ。\
langen^Grandfather only scared his grandchildren because he wanted to joke around with them.^\

