advsetwindow "10"

langjp「祖父さまはきっと、……お前にも同じことをしてからかったと思う。@幼いお前が、それに怯えて、祖父さまを不気味で恐ろしい人だと思い込んだとしても、無理もない話だと思う。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100161.ogg":^"I'd be willing to bet...that Grandfather pulled a prank like that on you too.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100162.ogg":^  It's no surprise that, young as you were, you let that scare you and convince you that Grandfather was a strange, terrifying person."^\

