;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000115.ogg":^"Are you saying I got presents once too?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000116.ogg":^  I don't remember anything like that!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000117.ogg":^  That could never happen!"^\

