advsetwindow "10"

langjp「……オカルト好きで西洋かぶれの祖父さまが、ハロウィンをやらないと思うか？@　……祖父さまのハッピーハロウィンは、もう親族会議の挨拶みたいなもんだったぜ。@……縁寿だってもらってるはずだ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100165.ogg":^"...Do you really think that Grandfather, a man who loved the occult and Western traditions, wouldn't celebrate Halloween?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100166.ogg":^  ...Grandfather's `Happy Halloween' was pretty much the standard greeting at our family conferences.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100167.ogg":^  ...He must've said it to you too."^\

