;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100168.ogg":^"...Youth can be so cruel.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100169.ogg":^  Even though Grandfather put all his heart into choosing those presents, ...it looks like your heart didn't remember anything."^\
