;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000143.ogg":^"First it was Beato and Bern!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000144.ogg":^  One witch after another has sneered at my fate, trying to make me surrender in their games.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000145.ogg":^  But I want the truth!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000146.ogg":^  Witch illusions won't work on me!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000147.ogg":^  ...Now I get it, you damn witches.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000148.ogg":^  So, you've sent Onii-chan as a final assassin to finish me off."^\

