langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000161.ogg":^"No.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000162.ogg":^  This is a game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000163.ogg":^  ...I made a wish, hoping to learn the truth of October 4th, 1986.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000164.ogg":^  And so, you invited me to this game, saying that you'd show me the truth.^\:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000165.ogg":^  And now, you're showing me this strange illusion, trying to make me believe that it's the truth!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000166.ogg":^  ...Well, too bad.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000167.ogg":^  I'm already used to dealing with witches.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000168.ogg":^  I can totally tell that you're trying to use that kind face of yours to trick me...!!"^\

