langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000236.ogg":^"......Wha?  ...What?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000237.ogg":^  ...How?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000238.ogg":^  How, Onii-chan?!"^\

