;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500098.ogg":^"Golden Witch Beatrice,^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500099.ogg":^ each and every day, I remember the debt the Ushiromiya family owes from when it was saved from the brink of destruction."^\

