advsetwindow "27"

langjp「くっくっく！@　感謝せい、感謝せい。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700084.ogg":^"*cackle*cackle*!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700085.ogg":^  Yeah, you'd better thank me."^\

