langjp「いいや、同じことです。@莫大な黄金を、三代にもわたり、右代宮家に貸し付けてくれました。@それも無償で。」@
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800024.ogg":^"No, it comes to the same thing.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800025.ogg":^  All of that gold has been lent to the Ushiromiya family for three generations.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800026.ogg":^  And without cost."^\

