;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700087.ogg":^"Gold bars are the same as bricks to me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700088.ogg":^  I had nowhere else to put them, so it was a relief to have Kinzo hold onto them."^\

