;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100265.ogg":^"Hmm?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100266.ogg":^  Well, yeah.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100267.ogg":^  After all, she just went and lent Grandfather 10 tons of gold."^\

