langjp「そうだ。@必ず返すと約束し、もう数十年も借りている。@その恩は、もはや返しきれないほどだ。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500100.ogg":^"Precisely.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500101.ogg":^  I've been borrowing it for several decades, always promising to return it someday.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500102.ogg":^  It is a debt I will never be able to fully repay."^\

