langjp「当家が感謝の気持ちを忘れたことはありません。@ねぇ、あなた。」@
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\80900017.ogg":^"The Head Family has never forgotten its gratitude.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\80900018.ogg":^  Isn't that right, dear?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_komaru1.png",23
advsetwindow "02"

langjp「無論だとも。@三代にわたりベアトリーチェさんたちが気前よく貸してくれなかったら。@右代宮家はとうに滅んでいましたとも。@辣腕のお父さんとて、軍資金がなければ何も出来なかったのですから。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800027.ogg":^"Of course.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800028.ogg":^  If the Beatrices hadn't kindly lent it to us for three generations,^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800029.ogg":^ the Ushiromiya family would have fallen long ago.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800030.ogg":^  Even someone as shrewd as Father couldn't have done anything without funds to start with."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「もはや、カネがカネを呼び、黄金の軍資金は静かに眠るのみだ。@………蔵臼。@私が何を話そうとしているか、わかるか。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500103.ogg":^"By now, my money is making money, and the gold that made up my original funds can sleep in peace.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500104.ogg":^  ......Krauss,^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500105.ogg":^ do you know what I am about to say?"^\

