;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500110.ogg":^"Of course, I do not intend to die as soon as next year.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500111.ogg":^  However, I don't believe I can make any certain promises about meeting you again.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500112.ogg":^  I never make promises I cannot keep."^\

