langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500113.ogg":^"Beatrice,^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500114.ogg":^ I want to make amends.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500115.ogg":^  And I must do it while I am still in high spirits.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500116.ogg":^  For that reason, I made a decision today."^\

