;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500117.ogg":^"I will return all of the gold ^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500118.ogg":^that your grandmother lent me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500119.ogg":^  ...Krauss, you have no objections, correct?^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500120.ogg":^  That gold did not belong to the Ushiromiya family in the first place."^\

