langjp「無論です。@何の異論もありませんとも。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800033.ogg":^"Of course.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800034.ogg":^  I have no objections whatsoever."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_b11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「良いのか、蔵臼。@そなたは投資家であろう？@　カネはいくらあっても足りぬであろうが。@金蔵から黄金を譲り受けたいと思っていたのではないのかぁ？」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700093.ogg":^"Are you sure, Krauss?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700094.ogg":^  You're an investor, aren't you?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700095.ogg":^  You could always do with more money, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700096.ogg":^  Didn't you want Kinzo to hand the gold over to you?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_akuwarai2.png",80
advsetwindow "02"

langjp「はははは…。@それを言われれば、確かに否定は難しい。@しかし、元より父とあなたの契約であり、そして元々あなたの黄金です。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800035.ogg":^"Hahahaha...^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800036.ogg":^  Yes, now that you mention it, it's hard to deny what you say.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800037.ogg":^  However, the contract was always between you and Father, and the gold was yours to begin with."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_warai1.png",24
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「主人は仮にも次期当主。@お父様が一代にて当家を復興させたように。@主人も一代で当家を繁栄させるでしょう。@そしてそれは、主人と私で成し遂げることです。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\80900019.ogg":^"My husband is the Successor, after all.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\80900020.ogg":^  Just as Father rebuilt the family in one generation,^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\80900021.ogg":^ I am sure my husband will make the family thrive in his.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\80900022.ogg":^  And this is something the two of us will do together."^\

cl l,24
_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_def1.png",23
