;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700097.ogg":^"...So, letting go of 10 tons of gold leaves you with no regrets?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700098.ogg":^  I must say, that is quite impressive.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700099.ogg":^  What can a witch do against an opponent who cannot be swayed by the golden magic?"^\

