langjp「私が死ねば、葬式で大忙しな上に、遺産はどうするのかと絵羽たちががっついてくるであろうが。@今から分けておけば、葬式が気楽になるというものよ。@……蔵臼、メモを取れ。@源次も書記を頼む。@これより、財産の分け方を説明する。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500127.ogg":^"When I die, you will not only be busy with the funeral, but I imagine that you will have Eva and the others at your throats over the inheritance issue.^\:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500128.ogg":^  If all is divided now, the funeral will be less trying for you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500129.ogg":^  ...Krauss, write this down.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500130.ogg":^  And Genji, please be our secretary.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500131.ogg":^  I will now lay out the distribution of my assets."^\

