langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000250.ogg":^"Just how long have I suffered, wishing that I could return to the Rokkenjima of 1986...^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000251.ogg":^  And now, I've finally made it here!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000252.ogg":^  So why are you chasing me out...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000253.ogg":^  You said I could decide for myself!"^\
