langjp「うるさいわね、あんたには聞いてないわよ…！@　それにあんたこそ何よ、そのザマは…！@　黄金の魔女は、復活の儀式のためにやって来たんじゃないの？！@　雷鳴と共に島に現れ、これから１３人もの人々を生贄に捧げようとしてるんでしょう？！@　そのあんたが、何でこんなにものんびり団欒してるのよ！@　わけがわかんないッ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000257.ogg":^"Shut up.  I didn't ask you...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000258.ogg":^  And what the hell do you think you're doing here...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000259.ogg":^  Didn't the Golden Witch come here to perform her resurrection ceremony?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000260.ogg":^  Didn't you appear on the island with a crash of thunder and try to offer up 13 people as sacrifices?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000261.ogg":^  Why are you acting so happy and casual?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000262.ogg":^  It doesn't make sense!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_b11_majime2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「わけがわからぬのは、そなたの方であるぞ。@何だ、そなたは。@妾に、そんなにも人殺しがしてほしいのか。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700125.ogg":^"You're the one that doesn't make sense.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700126.ogg":^  What are you thinking?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700127.ogg":^  Do you want me to be a murderer?"^\

