langjp「あんたは、それを物語に記してメッセージボトルに封じて海に投じたわ！@　後の世界にはその内の２本が伝わってる…！@　どちらも酷い連続殺人の物語じゃない！」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000263.ogg":^"You wrote it down in a tale, sealed it in a message bottle, and threw it into the sea!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000264.ogg":^  Two of those were discovered later on...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000265.ogg":^  Both of them were stories of cruel serial murders!"^\

