;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700128.ogg":^"What a shame that only two of them made it to shore...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700129.ogg":^  How sad that `Land', my greatest masterpiece, was never seen by human eyes."^\

