;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700132.ogg":^"Precisely!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700133.ogg":^  They were so good, I just couldn't bear to wait for your return...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700134.ogg":^  Inspired by Agatha Christie, I tried sealing them in bottles and throwing them into the ocean.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700135.ogg":^  Mysterious, don't you think?!"^\

