langjp「はぁ？！@　何を開き直ってんのよ…！！@　私を拍子抜けさせようと目論んでるの？！@　私は騙されないわよ、ベアトリーチェ！　お兄ちゃん！！@　私に魔女はいると屈服させたいんでしょう？！@　その手には乗るもんですか…！@　私はお兄ちゃんの手なんか借りなくたって、ひとりで真実に辿り着いてみせる！」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000270.ogg":^"Huh?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000271.ogg":^  What's with the sudden change of character...?!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000272.ogg":^  Is this some scheme to make me let my guard down?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000273.ogg":^  I'm not gonna be fooled so easily, Beatrice!  Onii-chan!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000274.ogg":^  You want to make me surrender and say that witches exist, don't you?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000275.ogg":^  You think I'll fall for that...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000276.ogg":^  I'll find the truth without your help!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_b11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「ここが、その真実であるというのにか？@　そなたはかつて、グレーテルと名乗ったが、どうやら、ミチルと名乗った方が相応しいようだぞ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700139.ogg":^"Even though that truth is all around you right now?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700140.ogg":^  You once called yourself Gretel, but it seems the name Mytyl would be more fitting."^\

;ld c,EN2_DefA1,80
