;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700143.ogg":^"Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700144.ogg":^  This tale is a farce.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700145.ogg":^  Of course it isn't the truth.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700146.ogg":^  ...However, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700147.ogg":^there is something that he feels he must tell you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700148.ogg":^  ...Something he's so determined to convey that he went to such lengths."^\


