langjp「自分が死んだ後のことなんて、人は普通、考えないぜ…。@……はー。@やっぱ祖父さまはスケールがひとつ違うぜ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100309.ogg":^"Most people don't think much about what happens after they die...^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100310.ogg":^  ...Haah.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100311.ogg":^  Guess Grandfather just lives on a whole different scale."^\

