langjp「親父たちには、まだそれは秘密なんすか？」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100314.ogg":^"Are we still keeping this secret from Dad and the others?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\gen\1\gen_a11_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "14"

langjp「一応は秘密にしております。@……ただ、お館様のお考えは、唐突に今日、思いついたものではありません。@もう何年も前から、今日という日について考えを重ねられ、時にご兄弟の皆様に相談もされておりました。@恐らく、今宵の発表に驚かれる方はいないでしょう。」\
;＜源次
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\81600026.ogg":^"Technically, it is a secret.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\81600027.ogg":^  ...However, the Master did not suddenly begin thinking in this way today.^\:dwave 0, "voice\14\81600028.ogg":^  He has considered this day many times over many years, and has even discussed certain matters with his children.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\81600029.ogg":^  I doubt that any will be surprised to hear this night's announcement."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「うちのクソ親父。@どうやら会社のことで、カネの工面が大変そうだし。@祖父さまからのちょいと早い遺産のプレゼントに、舞い上がっちまうかなぁ？」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100315.ogg":^"Apparently, my old bastard's been running all over the place trying to get money for his company.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100316.ogg":^  I guess he'll be dancing around when he hears that Grandfather's giving him his part of the inheritance early.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100317.ogg":^  A nice present for him."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\gen\1\gen_a21_kashikomari1.png",80
advsetwindow "14"

langjp「むしろ、大きな責任に奮い立たれるでしょう。@……留弗夫さまは島を出られ、大成し見事な成功を収められました。@しかしそれは、お館様の財産によって支えられたものです。」\
;＜源次
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\81600030.ogg":^"I rather think the great responsibility is what will spur him on.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\81600031.ogg":^  ...Ever since Rudolf-sama left the island, he has succeeded splendidly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\81600032.ogg":^  However, his success so far has been supported by the Master's wealth."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_warai3.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「……それが、唐突に遺産をドンと出され、これからはお前の力だけで頑張るのだぞとなるわけか。@………へへ、かえってプレッシャーがあるかもなぁ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100318.ogg":^"...And now that he's suddenly getting his inheritance money, he'll have to keep going by his own strength alone in the future.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100319.ogg":^  ...Heheh, that's some nice pressure for him."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\gen\1\gen_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "14"

langjp「ご兄弟の皆様は、お館様というあまりに偉大すぎる父親に、もう何十年も苦しんできました。@……偉大すぎる親は、ただ存在するだけで、子には重石になるものなのです。」\
;＜源次
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\81600033.ogg":^"The siblings must have suffered for decades because of their father's excess of success and ability.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\81600034.ogg":^  ...Simply having a parent who is too successful can be a great burden to a child."^\

bg new_rose_1c,22
advsetwindow "10"
;ld c,BUT_DefA1,80

langjp「それが今夜。@……本当の意味で、一人前になって巣立つってわけだ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100320.ogg":^"And tonight,^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100321.ogg":^ ...they'll be leaving the nest, truly becoming adults for the first time."^\
advsetwindow "14"

;ld c,GEN_DefA1,80

langjp「お館様は今宵を、黄金の返還式とお呼びになるようです。@……ですが最初は、生前葬と呼ぼうと考えておいででした。」\
;＜源次
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\81600035.ogg":^"It seems the Master plans to call this night a gold-returning ceremony.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\81600036.ogg":^  ...However, he originally intended to call it a living funeral."^\
advsetwindow "10"

;ld c,BUT_DefA1,80

