langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100322.ogg":^"Sounds pretty depressing, having a funeral while you're still alive.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100323.ogg":^  I'll admit that calling it a day to start a new journey and leave the nest fits the Ushiromiya family much better."^\

