langjp「そうです。@親を亡くした身寄りのない子供たちが、武装勢力に拾われて兵士になるんです。@……パンと銃を与えられ、復讐の方法を教えられる。@……所詮は子供、使い捨てですがね。@引き金さえ引けりゃ、戦場じゃ誰だって兵士になれる。」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000015.ogg":^"That's it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000016.ogg":^  Kids who've lost their parents and have nowhere to go sometimes get picked up by groups of armed insurgents and become soldiers.^\:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000017.ogg":^  ...They get a gun thrust in their hands, and they're taught how to take revenge.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000018.ogg":^  ...But in the end, children are expendable.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000019.ogg":^  Anyone can be a soldier in a battlefield if they can pull a trigger."^\


