;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000020.ogg":^"Revenge can be a reason for living.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000021.ogg":^  It can also give you the strength to become a soldier.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000022.ogg":^  ...Like a miracle, it can turn a girl who could do nothing but sob over her parents' corpses into a soldier, almost overnight.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000023.ogg":^  ...Nothing gives you more power than revenge."^\

