advsetwindow "-1"
;bg gun_2a,22

langjp　……復讐のために銃を撃つのと、生きるために銃を撃つのに、何か違いが？@
langen^...Is there any difference between shooting for revenge and shooting to live?^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　引き金を引けば、誰かが死ぬのは同じだ。\
langen^When you pull the trigger, someone dies either way.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　私の場合は？@
langjp　真実を暴いて絵羽を憎むのと、それを諦めて絵羽を憎むのに、何か違いが？@
langen^And what about my case?^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Is there any difference between hating Eva as I expose the truth...and hating Eva after I've given up?^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　何も変わらない。@
langen^There's no difference.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　結局、真実に至ろうと至らなかろうと、私は死ぬまで、絵羽を呪って呪って呪い抜くのだ。\
langen^In the end, whether I find the truth or not, I'll just keep on cursing Eva, over and over, until I die.^\

