langjp「お前たちがそれぞれ、カネに苦労しているのは知っておる。@それらの問題は全て、これで解決できるであろう。@……ただし心せよ。@これは、死を待たずして与える遺産である。@私はお前たちを厳しくも、常に見守ってきた。@しかし今宵をもって、お前たちの父はそれをやめるのだ。@………私は雲上から見守るかの如く、お前たちが飛翔するのを眺めているだろう。@もはや、何の口出しもせぬ。@……そなたたちの生きたいように生きるが良い。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500145.ogg":^"I am aware that each of you is in trouble with money.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500146.ogg":^  This should be enough to resolve all of those problems.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500147.ogg":^  ...But do not grow complacent.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500148.ogg":^  This is my inheritance, given to you before my death.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500149.ogg":^  In the past, though I have been strict, I have always watched over you."^\
advsetwindow "01"

langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500150.ogg":^"However, beginning tonight, your father will cease to provide support of that kind.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500151.ogg":^  ...I shall watch on as you take flight, as though watching down upon you from the heavens.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500152.ogg":^  No longer will I interfere.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500153.ogg":^  ...You may live however you please."^\


