langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100370.ogg":^"We have to take responsibility for our game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100371.ogg":^  We'll make up for our sins together.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100372.ogg":^  ...That's why we're showing Ange this final game."^\

;bg black,23
