langjp「縁寿は、あの鍵を正しく使えると思うか…？」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700205.ogg":^"Do you think...that Ange will be able to use that key the right way...?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_futeki1.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「……俺たちが正しいと思う方へ、無理やり引っ張ることも、もちろん考えたさ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100373.ogg":^"...Of course, I've thought about forcibly dragging her in the direction we think is right."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_futeki2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「それは意味なきことかも知れぬな。@……強制された選択は、正しくとも生涯受け容れ難い。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700206.ogg":^"Such an attempt would probably have been meaningless.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700207.ogg":^  ...When you're forced to make a decision, it's hard to accept that it was truly a correct one, no matter how much time passes."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_futeki5.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「そういうことだ。@………縁寿は、自ら考え、自ら選ばなければならない。@それが、俺たちから見て正しくない選択であったとしても、……俺はそれを祝福しようと思う。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100374.ogg":^"Exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100375.ogg":^  ...Ange has to think and choose for herself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100376.ogg":^  Even if she doesn't make the decision we view as the correct one, ...I think we should respect it."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「……ふむ。@………ゲームマスターはそなただ。@妾はもはや、何も口を挟まぬ。@今宵をただ楽しむだけだ。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700208.ogg":^"...Hmmm.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700209.ogg":^  ...You are the Game Master.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700210.ogg":^  I cannot argue with you anymore.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700211.ogg":^  I will simply watch on and enjoy this night."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_futeki1.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「縁寿にとっては意味あるゲームだ。@だが、俺たちにとっては、お疲れ様パーティーみたいなもんさ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100377.ogg":^"This game is really significant for Ange.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100378.ogg":^  But for us, it's kind of like a party after the show."^\


