advsetwindow "10"

langjp「大丈夫さ。@それに、むしろ必要なんだ。@……お前が、そういう姿を見せたように。@みんなもな。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100379.ogg":^"It'll be fine.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100380.ogg":^  In fact, this is necessary.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100381.ogg":^  ...Just like how you appeared in the way you did.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100382.ogg":^  And everyone else too."^\


