;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700215.ogg":^"......Hmmm.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700216.ogg":^  Then let us enjoy this final celebration with the others.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700217.ogg":^  After all, all of them have acted their parts so well in this long game."^\
