;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500185.ogg":^"On Christmas Day,^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500186.ogg":^ a woman looked up at the night sky and spoke:^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500187.ogg":^ 『Eventually, the night will end, and morning will come.^\:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500188.ogg":^  Wouldn't it be wonderful if, after the sun sinks and it becomes night once more, it could be Christmas again?』^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500189.ogg":^  And then, the man spoke.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500190.ogg":^  『Okay,^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500191.ogg":^ I'll make your dream come true for you.』^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500192.ogg":^  Is such a thing possible...?"^\

