;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000425.ogg":^"Right!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000426.ogg":^  December 25th starts at 12:00 midnight.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000427.ogg":^  Midnight is during the night, so that's the first night.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000428.ogg":^  Then, morning comes, and when night falls again, it's still the same day until midnight!"^\

