;熊沢の問題;
;コックは困ってしまった。@
;ディナーはデザートを残すのみなのだが、材料がサバしかないのだ。@
;その時、コックはあることを閃いた。@
;ひらがなを一文字足せば、サバがデザートになるのだ。@
; The cook was in trouble.
; Dinner had been fully prepared except for the dessert, but he had no ingredients except sabara (mackerel and leftovers).
; Then, the cook had a flash of inspiration.
; By changing just a single letter, he could make a grand desert out of those leftovers.
;
;その文字とは一体何だろう？@
; Which letter was it?
; A. "m" B. "r" C. "b" D. "a"

;選択肢４つ。@「あ」「か」「く」「ろ」
; "あ" "か" "く" "ろ"
;■選択後、以下に進む


;■ヒント
*eva_hinto_2
bg new_mhal_h1a,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a11_def2.png",22
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「伯母さん、わかった？」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000494.ogg":^"Aunt Eva, do you get it?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_a11_hohoemi1.png",23
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「一文字を足せばって言うんだから、ダジャレみたいな答えに違いないわ。@サバに一文字を加えて、デザートにならないか考えて……。@……あ、わーかった！」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000177.ogg":^"She says you have to change one letter, so the answer's probably some sort of word game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000178.ogg":^  Her choice of words is suspicious to say the least.  Try and think of some kind of dessert that you can make by changing a letter in...^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000179.ogg":^  Ah, I've got it!"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a11_def1b.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「え？！@　何？　何？！」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000495.ogg":^"Huh?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000496.ogg":^  What is it?  What is it?!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「とにかく、語尾に一文字を足してみて？@　それがまさに、答えそのものだから。」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000180.ogg":^"Forget changing a whole letter...  You only need to change one line.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000181.ogg":^  In fact, that pretty much gives you the answer."^\

bg black,2

return



