;＜郷田
langen:dwave 0, "voice\17\81700058.ogg":^"...With each passing family conference, one can feel the growth of those youngsters.^@:dwave 0, "voice\17\81700059.ogg":^  After just a few years more, Ange-sama will surely learn of love, of makeup, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\17\81700060.ogg":^and will eventually grow to become a true lady."^\

