;＜郷田
langen:dwave 0, "voice\17\81700064.ogg":^"Perhaps we should have sent her a clearer message.^@:dwave 0, "voice\17\81700065.ogg":^  ...If the egg cannot be warmed, could we not at least strike it from the outside to make it easier to crack?"^\

