;＜熊沢
langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\81800051.ogg":^"If a chick without the power to break its own shell is forced outside of the egg,^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\81800052.ogg":^ it won't be able to withstand the cold winds.^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\81800053.ogg":^  Ange-sama will have to find that power and resilience herself."^\
