langjp「縁寿さまが、諦めと悲しみを紛らわせるためだけの怒りに身を任せず。@……本当に縁寿さまが求めておられる、たった一つの願いに純粋であってさえくれれば。@彼女は絶対に、自分の一番の願いを叶えることが出来るでしょう。」\
;＜熊沢
langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\81800059.ogg":^"If Ange-sama does not abandon herself to anger for the sole purpose of distracting herself from her resignation and sadness...^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\81800060.ogg":^  If she can just be honest about that one, single wish that she truly desires more than anything else...^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\81800061.ogg":^  Then you can be certain that she will make her greatest wish come true."^\
