langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000221.ogg":^"This has nothing to do with division.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000222.ogg":^  Read through the puzzle again carefully."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　……えっと、@……何だったっけ……。\
langen^...Umm, ^@^...what was it, again...?^\

