;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500257.ogg":^"He even fools me, from time to time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500258.ogg":^  He'll trick me right to my face, with that stern, serious expression of his.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500259.ogg":^  He has always been like that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500260.ogg":^  And yet, despite the numerous occasions on which he has fooled me in the past, I keep on getting tricked.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500261.ogg":^  Wahhahhahahahahahaha."^\

