;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500262.ogg":^"Wahaha, `knew me', he says...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500263.ogg":^  We were partners in crime, you might say!^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500264.ogg":^  The two of us were both prodigal sons of rich families.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500265.ogg":^  A pair of ruffians who caused their parents nothing but trouble."^\

