;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100406.ogg":^"Genji-san, a prodigal son...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100407.ogg":^  That's a surprise...^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100408.ogg":^  So, Genji-san also moved to Taiwan, where he met Grandfather?"^\

