langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\81900042.ogg":^"Genji-san was born in Taiwan.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\81900042B.ogg":^  ...Well, since Taiwan was under Japanese rule before the war, he is still Japanese, of course."^\

