;＜源次
langen:dwave 0, "voice\14\81600076.ogg":^"...There was a lot of disorder and conflict after the war.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\81600077.ogg":^  The Master is the one who saved me during that chaotic period.^@:dwave 0, "voice\14\81600078.ogg":^  ...If I spent the rest of my life trying to repay that debt, it would not be enough to pay it back in full."^\
