;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500269.ogg":^"......Don't say that, my friend.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500270.ogg":^  ...If only I had been a little more persuasive, I might have been able to bring your family back with us as well...^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500271.ogg":^  Because I was so inadequate, I was unable to save anyone but you..."^\

