langen^I don't know much about the details of Taiwan's history,^@^ but apparently, there was still a lot of chaos there even after the war ended and Japan pulled out.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　金蔵はその混乱をいち早く察し、@源次とその一族が脱出できるよう手配した。\
langen^Kinzo, predicting this chaos before it happened,^@^ worked out a way for Genji and his family to escape.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　しかし、源次の一族は台湾において大きな財産を保有していた。@それを捨てることが出来ず、台湾に残ることを選んだのだ。\
