langjp　そんな彼らが、戦後の新しい体制下で歓迎されたとは、思い難い。\
langen^This wealth had been built up thanks to their close relationship with the Japanese-run government of Taiwan.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^The new regime after the war wasn't likely to welcome them with open arms.^\

bg black,22
