; Once upon a time, there was a seven story skyscraper.
; The following companies were located on the following floors:
; Okamura Securities Co., Ltd. was located on the 7th floor.
; Iwamura Realty Co., Ltd. was located on the 6th floor.
; Tamura Transport Co., Ltd. was located on the 5th floor.

; Murakoshi Publishing Co., Ltd. was located on the _th floor.
; So, which floor is it on?
