;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000263.ogg":^"I-I won't give up, kiii!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000264.ogg":^  So, you're saying that Murakoshi Publishing Co., Ltd. is on this floor X?!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_akuwarai3.png",80
advsetwindow "02"
langjp「何階かじゃない。@何がいか、だ。」@
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800067.ogg":^"Not floor X.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800068.ogg":^  The ＿th floor."^\

