;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000274.ogg":^"Well done, you got it...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000275.ogg":^  From floor one to floor four, there's only one floor that ends in `th', ...the 4th floor."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a13_def1f.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「うん！@　３階だけは３ガイとも読めるけど、それ以外で１１階までは、どれもカイとしか読まない。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000590.ogg":^"Yeah!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000591.ogg":^  The 4th floor fits, but the other ones are the 1st, 2nd, and 3rd floors."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_nayamu2.png",80
advsetwindow "02"

langjp「や、……やるじゃないかね…。@私には、答えを教えられるまでサッパリだったというのに……。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800077.ogg":^"...N-Nicely done...^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800078.ogg":^  Even I didn't figure that out until I had the answer given to me..."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　どうやら、蔵臼伯父さんもかつてこの問題を出され、答えがわからなかったらしい。@
langjp　それを私に解かれて、ちょっぴりだけ悔しいようだ。\
langen^Apparently, Uncle Krauss once had this puzzle shown to him, and he wasn't able to answer it right.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^He looked a bit downcast to see a kid like me solve it.^\

