;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700239.ogg":^"...A future parent and child, unrelated by blood.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700240.ogg":^  Watching them like this, they look just like a normal parent and child."^\
advsetwindow "03"

;ld c,NAT_DefA1,80

langjp「えぇ。@………絆は、心で育むものです。@血の繋がりなど、それに劣るものです。」@
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\80900052.ogg":^"Yes, they do.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\80900053.ogg":^  ...Bonds between people are nurtured by the heart.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\80900054.ogg":^  Ties of blood do not bond as strongly."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　夏妃はそれを言ってから、@……自らの言葉を噛み締め、ひとり俯く。\
langen^After saying this,^@^ ...Natsuhi bit back her own words and stared at the floor.^\
