goto *quiz
;■嘉音の出題
;　学問の好きな王様が、よく勉強した人に賞金を与えることにした。@
;　銅賞の人には金貨２９枚。@
;　銀賞の人には金貨４７枚。@
;　金賞の人には金貨７９枚。@
; A scholarly king once decided to give out prizes to the learned people of his land.
; The one who won the copper prize got 29 gold coins.
; The one who won the silver prize got 47 gold coins.
; The one who won the gold prize got 79 gold coins.

;　では、プラチナ賞の人は、金貨何枚がもらえるのだろう？@
; So, how many gold coins were given to the one who won the platinum prize?

;選択肢は５つ。@「３０枚」「５７枚」「７８枚」「９１枚」「１１２枚」
; A. "30 coins" B. "57 coins" C. "78 coins" D. "91 coins" E. "112 coins"
;■選択後、以下に進む。



;■ヒント
*eva_hinto_7
