;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\80600021.ogg":^"...Understood.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\80600022.ogg":^  Now then, Eva-sama and Ange-sama,^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\80600023.ogg":^ I'll give you a hint.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\80600024.ogg":^  ......Copper is 29, silver is 47, and gold is 79.^@:dwave 0, "voice\16\80600025.ogg":^  That's the hint."^\

