;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000604.ogg":^"Huh?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000605.ogg":^  You got it?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000606.ogg":^  I get it too!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000607.ogg":^  Platinum is better than gold, so the prize must be more than 79 gold coins!"^\

