langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000293.ogg":^"That's wrong.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000294.ogg":^  With these rules, the platinum prize is probably worth less than the gold prize.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000295.ogg":^  Isn't that right?"^\

