langjp「この金貨の枚数はね、原子番号なのよ。@銅は２９番、銀は４７番、金は７９番。@プラチナが何番だったか思い出せないわー…！！」@
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000302.ogg":^"The number of gold coins is the atomic number for each element.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000303.ogg":^  Copper is 29, silver is 47, and gold is 79.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000304.ogg":^  I can't remember what number platinum was...!!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a15_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「縁寿、ちんぷんかんぷん。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000612.ogg":^"I don't have a clue what you're talking about."^\

bg new_mhal_h1a,23
_ld c,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_odoroki1.png",23
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「あんたねぇ？！@　縁寿ちゃん相手になんて問題を出してるのよ！@　もう少し問題を選びなさいよねぇ？！」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000305.ogg":^"You!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000306.ogg":^  What kind of problem do you think you're giving Ange-chan?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000307.ogg":^  Can't you put a little more thought into your puzzles?!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kan\1\kan_a11_def2.png",24
advsetwindow "16"

langjp「絵羽さまより、思い切り難しい問題を出すようにとのご許可を、賜っておりましたので。」@
;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\80600031.ogg":^"You did give me permission to show her the hardest one I've got."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a11_def2b.png",24
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「……そうだね。@絵羽伯母さん、自分でそう言った。@だから縁寿のわかんない問題になったー。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000613.ogg":^"...That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000614.ogg":^  You said it yourself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000615.ogg":^  That's why we got a puzzle that was too hard for me."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_komaru4.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「う、うぐぐぐぐぐぐぐ……！！@　ご、……ごめんね、縁寿ちゃん…。」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000308.ogg":^"Nnggggggggggghhhh...!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000309.ogg":^  ...S-Sorry, Ange-chan..."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

;bg black,22

langjp　絵羽伯母さんは苦笑いしながら両手を合わせる。@
langen^Aunt Eva clenched her hands together, grimacing.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　難し過ぎてさっぱりだった……。\
langen^It was just too hard, and I didn't have a clue...^\

