;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\80600030.ogg":^"......Correct."^\

bg new_mhal_h1c,23
_ld c,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a11_def1b.png",23
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「すごい、絵羽伯母さんッ。@どうして？！@　どうして７８枚なの？！@　金賞より上なのに、どうして賞金は金賞より少ないの？！」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000616.ogg":^"Awesome, Aunt Eva!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000617.ogg":^  Why?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000618.ogg":^  Why is it 78 coins?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000619.ogg":^  If platinum is better than gold, then why does gold get more coins?!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「この賞金の枚数はね、それぞれの賞の原子番号なのよ。@銅は２９番、銀は４７番、金は７９番。@ちなみにプラチナは７８番ね。@だから、プラチナ賞の賞金は金貨７８枚っ。」@
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000310.ogg":^"The number of coins you get is always the same as the atomic number of the prize.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000311.ogg":^  Copper is 29, silver is 47, and gold is 79.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000312.ogg":^  And, by the way, platinum is 78.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000313.ogg":^  So, the platinum prize gets you 78 gold coins."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a11_def1f.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「え、……絵羽伯母さん、すごぉい！！」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000620.ogg":^"...A-Aunt Eva, you're incredible!!"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　絵羽伯母さんは勉強熱心で、学生時代もすごく頭が良かったとお父さんから聞いたことがある。@
langen^Dad once told me that Aunt Eva was an enthusiastic studier, and really, really smart even back when she was in school.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　息子の譲治お兄ちゃんも頭いいし、絵羽伯母さんは本当にすごい。\
langen^Even George onii-chan, her son, is smart, so Aunt Eva must really be incredible.^\

bg new_mhal_h1a,24
_ld r,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_akire1go.png",24
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「それにしてもひどい問題ねぇ。@せめて縁寿ちゃんにわかる問題にしなさいよ。」@
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000314.ogg":^"Still, that was a pretty nasty riddle to choose.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000315.ogg":^  You should have at least given one that Ange could understand."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kan\1\kan_a11_warai3.png",23
advsetwindow "16"

langjp「絵羽さまより、思い切り難しい問題を出すようにとのご許可を、賜っておりましたので。」\
;＜嘉音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\16\80600029.ogg":^"You did give me permission to show her the hardest one I've got."^\

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a11_def1c.png",24
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「……そうだね。@絵羽伯母さん、自分でそう言った。@だから縁寿のわかんない問題になったー。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000621.ogg":^"...That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000622.ogg":^  You said it yourself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000623.ogg":^  That's why we got a puzzle that was too hard for me."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「う、うぐぐぐぐぐぐ……。@わ、私のせいかしら。@ごめんね、縁寿ちゃん…。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000316.ogg":^"Nnggggggggggghhhh...!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000317.ogg":^  I-Is it my fault?^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000318.ogg":^  Sorry, Ange-chan...^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjpでもほら、メダルをもらえたから許して。」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000319.ogg":^  But look, we got a medal, so please forgive me."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　またメダルがもらえた。@これで何枚集まっただろう？@
langjp　でもまだまだ集める。@今度は紗音からだ。\
langen^We got another medal.^@^  Just how many have we gotten so far?^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^But we still have a lot left to get.^@^  Next up is Shannon.^\

mcl c,0
bg black,22

