;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000645.ogg":^"Anchovies are salty.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000646.ogg":^  Lemonade is sour.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000647.ogg":^  ...So what is it?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000648.ogg":^  Do the letters match the tastes?"^\

