;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000350.ogg":^"That's right!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000351.ogg":^  The second letter of sweet is `W'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000352.ogg":^  The second letter of spicy is `P', salty is `A', and sour is `O'!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000353.ogg":^  So, what does black coffee taste like?"^\

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a11_def1b.png",80
