;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000354.ogg":^"Exactly!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000355.ogg":^  And the second letter of bitter is...^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000356.ogg":^  Wait, when did you drink coffee?"^\

