;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\80500062.ogg":^"Why don't you try saying `Sorry for making fun of you'?^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\80500063.ogg":^  If you don't, I'll make all your meals `O' and `I'."^\

