;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000362.ogg":^"Good point.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000363.ogg":^  Everyone left looks like they'll be a challenge."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a11_def1b.png",24
