;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\81400035.ogg":^"That's all for my puzzle.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\81400036.ogg":^  Now, for the one you've been waiting for.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\81400037.ogg":^  Good luck with Maria's puzzle!"^\

;★合流地点へ
