langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400127.ogg":^ouch!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ros\1\ros_a12_nayamu1.png",23
advsetwindow "12"

langjp「こら、真里亞。@ちょっと調子に乗りすぎっ。」@
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\81400052.ogg":^"Maria!^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\81400053.ogg":^  Show some manners!"^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　私が悩みぬいて選んだ答えに、真里亞お姉ちゃんは堰を切ったように笑い出す。@
langjp　楼座叔母さんに叩かれてそれは一瞬収まるが、また再びニヤニヤと笑い出す。\
langen^I thought so hard before getting that answer, but Maria onee-chan just burst out laughing.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^The laughter broke off when Aunt Rosa hit her, but then she was grinning again.^\

bg new_mhal_h1c,23
_ld l,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b21_odoroki1.png",23
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「全然わかんないわよ、これ、難易度どのくらいなの…？」@
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000389.ogg":^"I don't get it at all.  What was the difficulty level for this one...?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_a11_akuwarai1.png",24
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「せいぜい２０ピカラットってところかなぁ？@　本当に難しい問題が、まだまだこの本には載ってるんだから！」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400128.ogg":^"Just about 20 picarats, I guess?^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400130.ogg":^  Lots of the puzzles in this book are much, much harder!"^\


bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　２０ピカ何とかが何を意味するかわからないが、@どうやらこの問題をもってしても、真里亞お姉ちゃんには難しい部類には入らないらしい…。\
langen^I don't know what a pica-thing is,^@^ but apparently, even this puzzle doesn't count as a hard one for Maria onee-chan...^\

bg new_mhal_2d,22
advsetwindow "-1"
langjp　私はがっくりとうな垂れる。@
langen^I hung my head dejectedly.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　真里亞お姉ちゃんは、きっひひひひひひと、楼座叔母さんに叩かれるまで笑い続けるのだった。\
langen^Maria onee-chan kept on laughing until Aunt Rosa smacked her again.^\

