langjp「これで、私たちの問題はおしまいよ。@またぜひ一緒に遊びましょうね。」@
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\81400066.ogg":^"That's the end of our riddles.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\81400067.ogg":^  Let's play again sometime, okay?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_a22_warai2.png",23
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「その時は、もっともっと難しい、本当に酷い問題を用意しておくからね…！@　真里亞にも解けないくらいの！」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400137.ogg":^"Next time, I'll have a really nasty puzzle that's even harder...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400138.ogg":^  One so hard that even I couldn't solve it!"^\

bg black,23
bg new_mhal_h1a,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a11_def2b.png",23
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「やだ！@　もう真里亞お姉ちゃんとは遊ばない…！！」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000685.ogg":^"No way!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000686.ogg":^  I'm not playing with Maria onee-chan anymore...!!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_def1.png",24
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「くすくす。@ほら、縁寿ちゃん。@お父さんたちが手招きしてるわよ、行きましょ。@じゃあね、あとでね、楼座。」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000404.ogg":^"*giggle*^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000405.ogg":^  Look, Ange-chan.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000406.ogg":^  Your parents are waving at you, so let's go.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000407.ogg":^  See you later, Rosa."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ros\1\ros_a11_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "12"

langjp「うん。@じゃあね、縁寿ちゃん。@問題を出してくれる人も、あとちょっとね。@最後までがんばってね。@姉さんも、いっぱい応援してあげてね。」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\81400068.ogg":^"Sure.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\81400069.ogg":^  Later, Ange-chan.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\81400070.ogg":^  There aren't too many people left with puzzles for you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\81400071.ogg":^  Keep it up until the end.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\81400072.ogg":^  And make sure you keep cheering her on, Nee-san."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「もちろん。@私たちで協力して、いっぱいメダルを集めてきたもんねー？」@
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000408.ogg":^"Of course.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000409.ogg":^  We got all these medals by working together, right?"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a11_def1b.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「うんっ！」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000687.ogg":^"Yeah!"^\

bg black,26
bg new_mhal_2d,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　私たちは駆け出す。@
langen^We dashed away.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　向こうでお父さんたちが手招きしている。@
langjp　きっと意地悪な問題が思いついたに違いない。@
langjp　でもきっと、真里亞お姉ちゃんの問題よりは簡単に決まってる…！@
langen^Dad and Mom are waving at me from over there.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^I'm sure they've thought up some mean problems.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Still, they have to be easier than Maria onee-chan's...!^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　真里亞お姉ちゃんは意地悪だから大っ嫌ーい！\
langen^I hate Maria onee-chan!  She's such a meanie!^\

bg black,2

