langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200041.ogg":^"Is that so, huh?^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200042.ogg":^  All right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200043.ogg":^  Time to take a shot at Mom and Dad's puzzles!^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200044.ogg":^  I'll warn you, they're gonna be hard!"^\

