langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000420.ogg":^"That's right!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000421.ogg":^  Nice job, Ange-chan!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000422.ogg":^  Hard to imagine such a smart girl being related to that dolt of a father!"^\

