langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200050.ogg":^"Yeah, sorry for being a dolt.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200051.ogg":^  Nice going, Ange!^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200052.ogg":^  Did you think of all the combinations?"^\

