langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000701.ogg":^"Yeah.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000702.ogg":^  If Miyoko is the oldest, then what Satoko says is true.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000703.ogg":^  Only the oldest person is supposed to tell the truth, so that doesn't make sense."^\

