langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200060.ogg":^"That's all for our puzzles."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\kir\1\kir_a11_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "09"

langjp「いい、縁寿。@人生には、これからもたくさんの問題が訪れるわ。@……今は絵羽伯母さんが助けてくれるから、頼ってもいい。@でもね、人生の問題のほとんどは、あなた一人で解かなくちゃならないの。@その時に、それまで助けてくれた人の助言や恩を、必ず思い出すようにしてね。」\
;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300060.ogg":^"Listen up, Ange.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300061.ogg":^  Life will lead you through countless puzzles.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300062.ogg":^  ...Aunt Eva is here to help you now, so it's okay to rely on her.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300063.ogg":^  However, you'll have to solve most problems in life by yourself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300064.ogg":^  When that happens, you must remember the advice you've gotten from those who have helped you in the past."^\

