;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000727.ogg":^"I wonder what Grandpa will give us for getting all these medals...!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_hohoemi1.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「何かしらね。@でも、そんなものよりももっと素敵で楽しいものを、私たちはもういっぱい受け取っているわ。」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000443.ogg":^"Me too.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000444.ogg":^  Still, we've already gotten many things that are far more wonderful than that prize."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「何の話…？」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000728.ogg":^"What do you mean...?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「みんな、縁寿ちゃんとこうしてお話が出来て、とても楽しかったということよ。」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000445.ogg":^"We've all had a lot of fun talking to you like this, Ange-chan."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「…………？@　何のことかわかんない。@変な伯母さん。」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000729.ogg":^"......?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000730.ogg":^  I don't get it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000731.ogg":^  You're weird."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「ごめんなさい。@さ、行きましょう。@あとはいとこのみんなとベアトリーチェでおしまいかしら。」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000446.ogg":^"I'm sorry.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000447.ogg":^  Let's go then.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000448.ogg":^  Now, all that's left are the cousins and Beatrice, I guess."^\

