;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200063.ogg":^"I...wanted to take this to my grave.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200064.ogg":^  ...No, to hide it away in a cat box.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200065.ogg":^  If I just kept my mouth shut until tomorrow night, I'd be able to do that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200066.ogg":^  It'd be easy."^\

