;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200067.ogg":^"I...might be killed tonight.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200068.ogg":^  ...That's what I wanted to talk about."^\
advsetwindow "09"

;ld c,KIR_DefA1,80

langjp「……知ってたわ。@あなたが何か隠し事をしてるってことは。」\
;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300071.ogg":^"...I knew it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300072.ogg":^  I knew you were hiding something."^\
