langjp「……同じような話よ。@私は戦人くんには大人の対応をしてきたつもりよ？@　明日夢さんの子であっても、私は縁寿と分け隔てなく接してきたつもり。@ちゃんと我が家の子供だと思ってるから安心して。」\
;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300075.ogg":^"...It comes to the same thing.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300076.ogg":^  I've tried to behave as an adult towards Battler-kun, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300077.ogg":^  Even though he's Asumu's son, I've tried to treat him the same as Ange.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300078.ogg":^  I do think of him as a child in our family, so don't worry."^\


