langjp「死産したのはお前じゃない。@明日夢だ。@………あの時、お前と明日夢との二股を清算できず、俺はどうかしてたんだ…。」@
;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200076.ogg":^"You didn't have a stillbirth.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200077.ogg":^  Asumu did.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200078.ogg":^  ...Back then, when I was double-timing the two of you, I got myself stuck and couldn't find a way out..."^\
