langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000472.ogg":^"...It was you George, wasn't it?^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000473.ogg":^  You thought this puzzle up.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000474.ogg":^  Did the Monty Hall problem even exist in 1986?"^\


