;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300073.ogg":^"Nope, not until 1990.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300074.ogg":^  It's a puzzle that already exists in Ange-chan's world, so I thought it'd be okay to use it."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\jes\1\jes_a11_tohoho2.png",23
advsetwindow "04"

langjp「譲治兄さんに教えてもらったけど。@チンプンカンプンで。@……とにかくよくわからないけど、今のケースだと、青い箱は、赤い箱の約２倍、メダルの確率が高いって言うんだ。」\
;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\80200066.ogg":^"George nii-san ran me through the answer, but I was totally lost.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\80200067.ogg":^  ...Anyway, I don't get the details, but in this case, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\80200068.ogg":^the odds of the blue box having the medal are about twice the odds of the red box having it."^\

