;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000750.ogg":^"Oh.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000751.ogg":^  ...The odds are better for the blue box!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\geo\1\geo_a11_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "07"

langjp「へぇ。@それはどうしてかな。」\
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300075.ogg":^"Hmmm.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300076.ogg":^  And why is that?"^\

