;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000475.ogg":^"Think back to the 15 slice cake that you found the almond in.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000476.ogg":^  If there was only one almond, the odds of winning were 1 in 15, right?"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a11_def2.png",80
