;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000477.ogg":^"Still, Ange-chan,^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000478.ogg":^ what if the servants were also having cake, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000479.ogg":^and it started with 20 slices?"^\

