advsetwindow "11"

;ld c,EN2_DefA1,80

langjp「…………え？@　……あれ…。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000755.ogg":^"......Huh?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000756.ogg":^  ...What...?"^\

bg new_mhal_2d,22
advsetwindow "05"

;ld c,EVA_DefA1,80

langjp「今日はお祭りだもの。@使用人の人だけケーキなしなんて意地悪でしょう？@　だから本当は２０切れのケーキがあったの。@それを使用人分５切れ抜いて、１５切れにして飾り直して、そこから縁寿ちゃんに選んでもらった、……としたら。@縁寿ちゃんが選んだケーキの当たる確率は本当はいくつだったと思う？」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000480.ogg":^"This is a party, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000481.ogg":^  It's not fair that the servants don't get any cake, don't you think?^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000482.ogg":^  So, let's say it was originally a 20 slice cake.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000483.ogg":^  The servants took out 5 slices, then redecorated it as a 15 slice cake and let you choose a slice.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000484.ogg":^  If so, what would your chances of choosing the right slice be?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　本当は２０切れだったなら、@………２０分の１ではないか。\
langen^If there really were 20 slices,^@^ ......then the chances would be 1 in 20.^\

bg black,22
bg new_mhal_h1a,22
_ld c,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_a11_hohoemi1.png",24
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「でも、使用人の人たちはアーモンドの入ってない場所を知ってたから、そこを避けてケーキを５切れもらったのよ。@つまり、彼らはハズレを５個、間引いてくれていたというわけ。@だから確率は２０分の１じゃなく、１５分の１になる。」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000485.ogg":^"However, the servants know where the almond is, so they chose 5 slices for themselves that had no almonds.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000486.ogg":^  In other words, they removed 5 losing slices.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000487.ogg":^  That would mean your chances of winning were 1 in 15, not 1 in 20."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\en2\1\en2_a11_def2.png",24
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「……ハズレを間引いたんだから、その分、当たる確率が上がるのは当然だよ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000757.ogg":^"...They took out losing slices, so the odds would obviously go up."^\

bg new_mhal_h1c,23
_ld l,":b;sprites\geo\1\geo_a11_hohoemi1.png",23
advsetwindow "07"

langjp「同じことが、今、朱志香ちゃんによって行なわれたんだよ。@朱志香ちゃんは、君が選ばなかった２箱の中から、ハズレを１つ間引いたんだ。@ということは、君が選ばなかった方の当たる確率も、その分、上がったということになるんじゃないかな…？」\
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300077.ogg":^"Just now, Jessica-san did the same thing.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300078.ogg":^  Jessica-chan removed one of the two boxes you didn't choose.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300079.ogg":^  In other words, the odds that the remaining box you didn't choose was the winner went up a bit, right...?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\jes\1\jes_a11_atya3.png",24
advsetwindow "04"

langjp「あははははははは……、わかったよなわからないような……。」\
;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\80200069.ogg":^"Ahahahahahahahah, ...I sort of get it, but not really..."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　ハズレを間引けば、当たる確率がアップするのは当然だ。@
langen^If you remove a losing box, it's only natural that your chances of getting the right one go up.^@
