langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300080.ogg":^"Actually, you really are incredible, Ange-chan.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300081.ogg":^  Even though you're only six, you're trying to understand posterior probability, a concept in probability theory.^\:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300082.ogg":^  Probability really is interesting.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300083.ogg":^  I'm sure you'll like it when you get into high school and college.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300084.ogg":^  Go and enjoy studying it all you can."^\

