langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300108.ogg":^"The truth that lies in your hands is not unchangeable.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300109.ogg":^  You'll be interfered with in many ways that'll make it change.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300110.ogg":^  ...So, if the truth in your hands is really important to you..."^\

