langjp「うむ。@縁寿よ。@妾の問題は、また今度にしよう。@そのような寝惚け眼で解けるほど、やさしくはないのでな。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700294.ogg":^"Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700295.ogg":^  Ange,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700296.ogg":^ let us leave my puzzle for later.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700297.ogg":^  It's too difficult to be solved by one with eyes as sleepy as that."^\
advsetwindow "11"

;bg black,22
;bg Mhal_1aN,0
;ld c,EN2_DefA1,22

langjp「…………やだ。@……せっかく、いっぱいがんばったのに…。@……お兄ちゃんたちのメダルも、……ほしい………。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000783.ogg":^"......No way.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000784.ogg":^  ...I've...come this far, and...^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000785.ogg":^  ...I also want...Onii-chan's medal......"^\

