langjp　縁寿はふらふらと、隅にある椅子に近付くと、そこにすとんと座る。@
langen^Ange drifted over to a chair in the corner of the room and plopped down onto it.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そして、椅子に飾られたお人形のように目を閉じてしまう。\
langen^Then, she closed her eyes and sat there like a doll.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　可愛らしい寝息が聞こえ出すのに、そう時間は掛からなかった…。@
langen^It didn't take long before the cute sound of her breathing in her sleep could be heard...^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そして縁寿が眠ってしまうのを見届けると、ベアトは静かに言った。\
langen^When she saw that Ange was finally asleep, Beato spoke softly.^\

