langjp「皆、静かに。@……縁寿が眠ったぞ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700298.ogg":^"Quiet please, everyone.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700299.ogg":^  ...Ange fell asleep."^\

