langjp　みんなが、じっと縁寿の寝顔を見ている。@
langen^When she spoke, the peaceful clatter that filled the room fell silent.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Everyone looked down into Ange's sleeping face.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　それは、ようやく寝付いた赤子を、慈しみの眼差しで見守るかのようだった。\
langen^Each of them wore an affectionate gaze, as if they'd just watched a baby finally drift to sleep.^\

