;br

langjp　いつの間にか一同は、すやすやと眠る縁寿を、遠巻きに囲んでいた。@
langen^By this point, everyone was standing in a wide circle around Ange as she slept.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　主賓である彼女が眠り、……このハロウィンパーティーは、ひとつの終わりを迎える…。\
langen^Now that the guest of honor was asleep, ...this Halloween party had reached its conclusion...^\

bg black,22
bg new_mhal_h1a,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai2.png",22
advsetwindow "01"

langjp「さらばだ、我が孫よ。@………お祖父ちゃんは、１２年ぶりに遊べて、嬉しかったぞ。@……私のことを何も覚えていなくてもよい。@傲慢なる暴君と記憶してくれてもよい。@……だがたまには、目に入れても痛くないほどに可愛がっていたことも、思い出しておくれ。」\
;＜金蔵
langen:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500272.ogg":^"So long, my granddaughter.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500273.ogg":^  ...I was so pleased to have this chance to play with you again after 12 years.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500274.ogg":^  ...It matters not if you forget everything about me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500275.ogg":^  Remember me as an arrogant despot.^@:dwave 0, "voice\01\81500276.ogg":^  ...But, every now and then, just try and remember how much I adored you."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\nan\1\nan_a1_fumu1.png",23
advsetwindow "19"

langjp「思い出しますとも。@………縁寿さん。@あんたの人生は長い。@１２年を経ても、まだまだ長い。@その人生が有意義なものになることを、祈っております。」\
;＜南條
langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\81900043.ogg":^"She will remember.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\81900044.ogg":^  ...Ange-san,^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\81900045.ogg":^ you have a long life ahead of you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\81900046.ogg":^  Even after 12 years, there is still much for you to experience.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\81900047.ogg":^  I pray that you find this life meaningful and worthwhile."^\

bg new_mhal_h2c,24
_ld c,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_def1.png",24
advsetwindow "02"

langjp「……君が、右代宮家全員の、最後の孫で娘だ。@私たち全員が、君の幸せを祈っているよ。」@
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800086.ogg":^"...You are the final grandchild and daughter of the Ushiromiya family.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800087.ogg":^  All of us pray for your happiness."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_tukare2.png",23
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「縁寿ちゃん。@お元気で。@……幸せは見つけるものでなく、作るものです。@思い出も、実は同じなんですよ。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\80900074.ogg":^"Ange-chan,^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\80900075.ogg":^ stay well.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\80900076.ogg":^  ...Happiness isn't something you find, it's something you make.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\80900077.ogg":^  And in fact, memories work the same way."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_akuwarai2.png",80
advsetwindow "02"

langjp「そうだな。@……歳を重ねて思い出し、初めて意味を知るということもあるものだ。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800088.ogg":^"True.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\80800089.ogg":^  ...There are some things that we only truly understand when we think back on them years later."^\

bg new_mhal_h1c,24
_ld r,":b;sprites\hid\1\hid_a11_odayaka1.png",24
advsetwindow "06"

langjp「わしのこの愛嬌ある顔、たまには思い出してや。@わしらにとって、あんたに思い出してもらうのが何よりの供養なんや。」@
;＜秀吉
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\81100068.ogg":^"Make sure you remember my pretty face every now and then.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\81100069.ogg":^  Just havin' you remember us is the greatest memorial service we could ever have."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_akire1go.png",23
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「嫌ぁね。@死ぬわけじゃないでしょ。@猫箱の向こうという、カーテンの向こうに行くだけじゃない。」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000491.ogg":^"Oh, come on.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000492.ogg":^  It's not like we're dying.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000493.ogg":^  We're just going to the inside of the cat box, ...the other side of the curtain."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\hid\1\hid_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "06"

langjp「せやな。@カーテンなんてもんやない。@今と同じや。@縁寿ちゃんはすやすや眠っとる。@わしらはこうしてすぐ近くにいて、それを見守っとる。@……わしらは、いつだって側におるんやで。」@
;＜秀吉
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\81100070.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\81100071.ogg":^  It's not even a curtain.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\81100072.ogg":^  It's just like we are now.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\81100073.ogg":^  Ange-chan's there sleepin' away.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\81100074.ogg":^  The rest of us are right by her side, watchin' over her.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\81100075.ogg":^  We'll always be with her."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　一同の表情は微笑みのままだったが、鼻を啜るような音が何人からか聞こえた…。\
langen^All of them still wore warm smiles, but the sound of sniffling came from several places throughout the room...^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　このパーティーは、今日、訪れることが出来なかった彼女のためだけのものではない。@
langen^This party wasn't only for the girl who wasn't able to be here this day.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　今日、彼女を迎えることが出来きず、@……彼女に別れの言葉を告げることも出来なかった、彼らのためのものでもあるのだ…。\
langen^It was also for all those people who weren't able to meet her here,^@^ ...who never had the chance to say goodbye...^\

