langjp「縁寿。@力強く生きろよ。@……俺たちの血が流れてるんだ。@絶対にその力はあるさ。」\
;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200097.ogg":^"Ange,^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200098.ogg":^ live life strongly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200099.ogg":^  ...Our blood flows through your veins.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200100.ogg":^  That'll definitely bring you strength."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kir\1\kir_a11_warai2.png",23
advsetwindow "09"

langjp「……絵羽姉さん。@うちの娘のことを、よろしくね。@……素直じゃない子だし、わがままで短気なところもある。@きっと迷惑ばかり掛けるだろうけれど……。」\
;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300084.ogg":^"...Eva nee-san,^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300085.ogg":^ take care of our daughter.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300086.ogg":^  ...She's not honest with herself, and she'll often be selfish and short-tempered.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300087.ogg":^  She might be a pain all the time, but..."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_naku1.png",24
