langjp「私が、きっと幸せにするわ。@縁寿ちゃんが望む限り、……必ずね。」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000494.ogg":^"I'll make sure...she finds happiness.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\81000495.ogg":^  As long as she wants it herself..."^\

bg black,23
bg new_mhal_h1c,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\goh\1\goh_a11_warai1.png",23
advsetwindow "17"

langjp「縁寿さまっ…、私の顔を覚えていなくても構いません。@でもせめて、私の料理の味だけは忘れないで下さいませ…！」\
;＜郷田
langen:dwave 0, "voice\17\81700076.ogg":^"Ange-sama, ...it's okay if you forget my face.^@:dwave 0, "voice\17\81700077.ogg":^  But please, at least remember the taste of my cooking...!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kum\1\kum_a12_warai1.png",23
advsetwindow "18"

langjp「ほっほほほほほほほ。@この熊沢のことも覚えていろとは申しません。@でもせめて、サバの絞り汁ジュースの味だけは忘れないで下さいませ。」@
;＜熊沢
langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\81800070.ogg":^"Hohhohohohohohohoho.^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\81800071.ogg":^  And I won't ask you to remember old Kumasawa.^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\81800072.ogg":^  But please, at least remember the taste of mackerel juice."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そんなのいつ飲ませたんだっ、誰かのツッコミに一同は苦笑する。\
langen^Someone said "When'd you feed her that?!" and everyone laughed wryly.^\

bg black,22
