advsetwindow "10"

langjp「縁寿。@………少しはみんなのこと、思い出してくれたか？」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100413.ogg":^"Ange,^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100414.ogg":^ ...were you able to remember everyone, at least a little bit?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　もちろん、すやすやと眠る縁寿が答えるはずもない。@
langjp　しかし戦人は、続ける。\
langen^Of course, Ange didn't answer in her sleep.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^But Battler continued.^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_nayamu4.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「確かに右代宮家は、ちょいと変わった一族だ。@大金持ちだし、それを巡っておかしな噂話も飛び交っただろう。@……しかしそんなのは全て、島の外の連中の勝手な憶測だ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100415.ogg":^"It's true that the Ushiromiyas are a strange family.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100416.ogg":^  We're super-rich, and that's given rise to all sorts of rumors and stories.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100417.ogg":^  ...However, that's all speculation made by people outside the island."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_majime2.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「……幼さゆえに、やさしき思い出を記憶に留められなかったそなたを、誰も責めはせぬ。@しかしそれでも、思い出してやれ。@……忘れることが罪ではない。@……思い出さぬことが、罪なのだ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700303.ogg":^"...No one will blame you for forgetting these kind memories, young as you were.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700304.ogg":^  But even so, you must remember.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700305.ogg":^  ...It is not a sin to forget.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700306.ogg":^  ...But to not remember again...is a sin."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「俺たち全員。@………縁寿をパーティーに呼べて、本当に楽しかったぜ。@……なぁ、みんな。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100418.ogg":^"All of us...^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100419.ogg":^...were really happy to have you at this party.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100420.ogg":^  Right, everyone?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　戦人の言葉に、一同は皆、頷く。\
langen^Everyone nodded at Battler's words.^\

bg black,22
bg new_cit_2a,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　皆、彼女の未来にあまりに無慈悲な孤独が待ち構えていることを知っている。@
langen^Everyone knew about the merciless and lonely life that awaited her.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　それを癒すことは、もう彼らには出来ない。@
langen^It was no longer possible for them to heal those wounds.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　ひとつだけ出来るとしたら。\
langen^If there was one thing they could do...^\

