langjp「そうだな。@……客間のソファーにお願いできるか。@もしも目が覚めて、戻ってきたくなったら、いつでもそう出来るように。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100443.ogg":^"You're right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100444.ogg":^  ...Could you carry her to a sofa in the parlor?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100445.ogg":^  That way, she'll be able to come back if she wakes up and feels like joining in again."^\

