;＜ドラノ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\47\84600009.ogg":^"The depths of oblivion are like an empty endless desert, or perhaps the bottom of the SEA.^@:dwave 0, "voice\47\84600010.ogg":^  ...No one besides Lady Bernkastel herself could find her LOCATION..."^\


