langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700329.ogg":^"...Lady Bernkastel is just like a cat.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700330.ogg":^  She'll show up whenever she feels like it, but when she isn't in the mood, she'll never come no matter how often you call her."^\
