langjp　でもまーイチオー、ベアトの後見人だしー。@あんたの後見人も私じゃなかったっけー？@　まーそんなわけで、義理よ義理。@ちょっと近くまで来たから寄っただけ！@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200004.ogg":^  Still, I am Beato's guardian.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200005.ogg":^  Wasn't I your guardian too?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200006.ogg":^  Well, anyway, I came because it's my `responsibility'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200007.ogg":^  I happened to be in the neighborhood, so I stopped by!^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_majime1.png",80
