advsetwindow "29"

langjp　これ、手土産に色々持ってきたの！@　適当に盛り付けて出しちゃってもらえるー？」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200009.ogg":^  I've brought some presents!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200010.ogg":^  Could you just put these wherever for me?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"


langjp　義理で、たまたま近くに来たから寄っただけと言うのに、立派に包装された一升瓶だの重箱だの、手土産をきっちり持参している。\
langen^For someone who just dropped by because she was in the neighborhood, she brought an awful lot of presents, which included colorfully wrapped bottles and food boxes.^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_futeki4.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「ベルンカステルはまだ来ていない。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100470.ogg":^"Bernkastel isn't here yet."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_futeki2.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「来ないんじゃなーい？@　負けたゲームにのこのこと顔を出す子じゃないわよ。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200011.ogg":^"You really think she'd come?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200012.ogg":^  She's not the kind of kid who'd just drop by to say `hi' at a game she's lost."^\

bg new_mhal_h2c,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def2.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「……で、あろうな。@何しろ、プライドの高い御仁だ。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700331.ogg":^"...Probably.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700332.ogg":^  After all, she is very proud."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_nayamu2.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「あいつにゃ、散々な目に遭わされたような気もするが、@それでもこのゲームにかかわったプレイヤーのひとりのはず。@最後のゲームの最後の夜を、のんびり祝ってもいいのにと思ったんだが。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100471.ogg":^"I seem to remember her putting us through hell,^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100472.ogg":^ but she's still one of the players in this game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100473.ogg":^  I thought it'd be good to have her over to celebrate the final night of the final game."^\


ut_mld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_majime3.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「そうね。@あの子がいなかったら、このゲームはこの結末を迎えなかったかもね。@敵も味方も、ゲームを成立させるための絶対要素よ。」@
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200013.ogg":^"You're right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200014.ogg":^  Without that kid, this game might not have reached its conclusion.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200015.ogg":^  Enemies and allies are the bare minimum you need for a game."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_futeki2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「そうであるな。@敵がいなければ、ゲームにさえならぬ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700333.ogg":^"True.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700334.ogg":^  Without a foe, there can be no game."^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「私は敗北さえもゲームの一部として楽しんでるけれどね。@あの子はそうじゃない。@……仕方ないわ、色々あったから。@だから、あの子を責めないであげて。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200016.ogg":^"At least I can enjoy defeat as just another part of the game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200017.ogg":^  That kid can't.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200018.ogg":^  ...It's too bad, but she's been through a lot.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200019.ogg":^  So please, don't blame her too harshly."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_komaru2.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「本当は、感謝するつもりだった。@……色々あったが、お前がいなかったら、今日を迎えられなかったと感謝しようと思ってた。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100474.ogg":^"Actually, I was planning to thank her.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100475.ogg":^  ...A lot of crazy stuff happened, but thanks to her, we were able to make it to where we are today."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「……ありがと。@今度あの子に会えるのがいつかはわからないけれど。@運が良ければ数百年後にはまた会えるわ。@その時、伝えてあげる。@そうそう、それはそうと。@招待状はないんだけれど、今日はお客を連れてきたわ。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200020.ogg":^"...Thanks.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200021.ogg":^  I don't know when I'll see her next,^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200022.ogg":^ but if I'm lucky, I'll get my chance in a few hundred years.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200023.ogg":^  I'll let her know what you said.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200024.ogg":^  Ah, that's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200025.ogg":^  They don't have invitations, but I've brought two guests with me."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_oya1.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

