langjp「えぇ。@私も驚いてるわ。@……胸が好くような楽しいゲームを始めようとゲーム盤を広げたら。@まったく同時に、戦人もおかしなゲームを始めていたというわけ。@……ゲームマスターが２人なんて、おかしなこともあるものね…？」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100018.ogg":^"Oh, yes,^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100019.ogg":^ I was surprised myself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100020.ogg":^  ...Just when I opened the game board to start a delightful game of my own,^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100021.ogg":^ I found that Battler had started up this bizarre game at the same time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100022.ogg":^  ...I never thought I'd be in a game with two Game Masters..."^\

