langjp「……こいつも、プレイヤーの１人だったんだ。@……ゲーム盤を片付ける最後の最後で、こいつはやっと、舞台に上がる勇気を持てた。@……俺は、その勇気ある決闘の申し出を、受けて立ちたい。@…………お前の駒だった、あの勇敢な女の名にかけてな。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100529.ogg":^"...She was also one of the players.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100530.ogg":^  ...Now, at the very end, as the game board is being put away, she's finally found the courage to step up onto the stage.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100531.ogg":^  ...I'd like to accept your brave challenge.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100532.ogg":^  ...In the name of that courageous girl who was once your piece."^\

