;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700374.ogg":^"I feel the same as Battler.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700375.ogg":^  She was a piece who stood in opposition to us, but she was only faithfully fulfilling her role.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700376.ogg":^  There can be no game without a rival.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700377.ogg":^  ...She remains our enemy, but she's also an important friend to us."^\

