langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200092.ogg":^"As the observer, I'll say this.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200093.ogg":^  ...This game `is made to be solvable'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200094.ogg":^  In other words, I guarantee that it's a suitable setting for your duel.^@/
