;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200095.ogg":^  ...Bern, I know I keep on saying this,^\:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200096.ogg":^ ...but are you really sure?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200097.ogg":^  ...Battler and Beato's relationship started because they both loved mystery.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200098.ogg":^  ...I agree it's a pretty tricky scenario, ...but I'm not sure it'll be enough to stop these two..."^\


