langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100558.ogg":^"You're right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100559.ogg":^  Will that be enough to stump us?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100560.ogg":^  That's all this simple game is about.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100561.ogg":^  ...Thanks, Lambda.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100562.ogg":^  Thanks to you, we know that this duel will be a fair fight."^\

