langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200099.ogg":^"You're welcome.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200100.ogg":^  I'm happy too.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200101.ogg":^  ...It'll be an honor to witness Bern fighting this precious fight."^\

