langjp「……私もよ。@……あんたを見下してた。@勝負の場に出もせずにね。@そんな、それまでの自分に虫唾が走る。@………だから決闘させて。」@
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100083.ogg":^"...Same here.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100084.ogg":^  ...I underestimated you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100085.ogg":^  And I did it without even stepping onto the battlefield with you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100086.ogg":^  Just thinking about it makes me want to vomit.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100087.ogg":^  ...So let me fight."^\

