langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100088.ogg":^"If I win, I'll be able to look down on you for real this time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100089.ogg":^  ...And if I lose, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100090.ogg":^...I'll surely be reminded of the emotion I know I've forgotten."^\

