langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\81800075.ogg":^"#cc99ffEva-sama, Hideyoshi-sama, Rudolf-sama, Kyrie-sama, Rosa-sama, and Genji-san,^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\81800076.ogg":^ six people in all, were lying there, covered in blood...#ffffff"^\

