langen^However, several closed room murders had already occurred.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　自らを密室へ閉ざす行為は、新しい惨劇を自ら招く行為に他ならないのか。\
langen^Could locking themselves in a closed room do anything more than invite another tragedy?^\

