langen:dwave 0, "voice\19\81900057.ogg":^"#cc99ffIn both Gohda-san's and Kumasawa-san's cases, such wounds would have resulted in instant deaths#ffffff, I believe.^@:dwave 0, "voice\19\81900058.ogg":^  Such a gruesome way to die..."^\

