;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\80200108.ogg":^"Like hell they could survive with wounds like this...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\80200109.ogg":^  #cc99ffGohda-san and Kumasawa-san are both dead!#ffffff"^\

