;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100613.ogg":^"Well, we have been busy, keeping a lookout and locking up and all that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100614.ogg":^  Once again, #cc99ffnone of us has an alibi.#ffffff"^\

