;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100616.ogg":^"That's impossible.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100617.ogg":^  #cc99ffNo master keys exist anymore except the two keys on the two people who lie dead here.#ffffff"^\

