;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100654.ogg":^"A roll with a needle in it...  I like that analogy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100655.ogg":^  This precious, vital information might all be wasted thanks to one tiny lie."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_iiwake1.png",80
