;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100657.ogg":^"It's simple.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100658.ogg":^  Forget which ones are lies.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100659.ogg":^  Let's concentrate on finding out which ones must be true."^\

