;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100660.ogg":^"That's what we're looking for.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100661.ogg":^  We'll look for people who couldn't possibly be the culprit.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100662.ogg":^  If we can do that, then all of their purple statements are the same as red truth."^\

