;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700449.ogg":^"I see.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700450.ogg":^  Instead of searching for the culprit, we'll start by searching for those who couldn't be the culprit!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700451.ogg":^  Yes, a simple and fundamental strategy!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_def1.png",80
