;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700452.ogg":^"How can we know for sure that someone isn't the culprit?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_komaru2.png",23
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「ルールに、犯人は死なないってのがある。@つまり、酷ぇ話だが、死んだヤツは信用できるってことになる。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100665.ogg":^"One of the rules is that the culprit can't die.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100666.ogg":^  In other words, though it might sound cruel, we can trust anyone who's dead."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「ほう、それはわかりやすい！@　ほとんどの人物は殺された。@それらの人物の紫は全て信用できるというわけか！」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700453.ogg":^"Hoh, that makes it easy!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700454.ogg":^  Almost all of the characters were killed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700455.ogg":^  So, we can trust the purple of all those people!"^\

bg black,24
bg new_different_space_1c,24
_ld c,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_majime6.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「ところが、そう簡単な話じゃない。@俺とお前のゲームでも度々問題になった、死んだフリ問題ってのがあるんだ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100667.ogg":^"But it isn't quite that simple.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100668.ogg":^  There's the issue of people playing dead, which popped up so often even in our games."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_futeki2.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「どの犠牲者も、皆、検死をしているではないか。@南條も紫で、誰も検死を誤らないと断言している。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700456.ogg":^"The bodies of all victims were examined, were they not?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700457.ogg":^  Nanjo even said with the purple that no one would make a mistake when examining bodies."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_nayamu4.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「南條先生が犯人だったら、それもアテにはならねぇぜ。@一見、どの犠牲者も検死されているように見えるが、どの死亡確認も紫発言だ。@１００％じゃない。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100669.ogg":^"If Doctor Nanjo is the culprit, then we can't even rely on that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100670.ogg":^  At a glance, it may look as though all the victims were examined, but all confirmations of their deaths are in purple statements.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100671.ogg":^  We can't be 100% sure."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_majime2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「……では、誰の死ならば信用できるというのか。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700458.ogg":^"...Then whose death can we be sure about?"^\

cl c,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_oya1.png",23
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「とにかく、犠牲者全員の検死を、もう一度見直すんだ。@紫発言なんてあやふやなものじゃなくて、絶対確実に死んだ人間を探すんだ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100672.ogg":^"At any rate, let's check all the examinations over again.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100673.ogg":^  Let's look for someone who we can be absolutely certain is dead, in some way more reliable than these purple statements."^\

bg black,2

fede 0,1000
E_A

