;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100681.ogg":^"Doctor Nanjo and Jessica...^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100682.ogg":^are definitely dead.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100683.ogg":^  And that means-"^\

