;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700481.ogg":^"The number of innocent people has skyrocketed!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700482.ogg":^  In addition to Nanjo and Jessica, we now know that Krauss, Natsuhi, Shannon, Gohda, and Kumasawa cannot be culprits...!"^\

