;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100694.ogg":^"That's not all.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100695.ogg":^  On the fourth twilight, Bernkastel announced Kanon-kun's death with the red truth.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100696.ogg":^  The culprit can't die, so Kanon-kun isn't the culprit either!"^\

