langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700483.ogg":^"Nanjo, Jessica, Krauss,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700484.ogg":^ Natsuhi, Shannon, Kanon,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700485.ogg":^ Gohda, and Kumasawa.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700486.ogg":^  All eight of them are not the culprit!"^\

