_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d24_futeki1.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「あぁ。@その結果、源次さんが犯人でないことも新たに証明された。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100699.ogg":^"Yeah.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100700.ogg":^  And as a result, we've proven that Genji-san isn't the culprit."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_1_majime6.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「嘉音が第一の晩に、紫発言で源次の死を確認したと宣言している。@これで源次もシロというわけだ…！」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700492.ogg":^"After the first twilight, Kanon announces in a purple statement that he confirmed Genji's death.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700493.ogg":^  That clears Genji of suspicion as well...!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「これで、合計９人の無実が証明されたな。@いい感じだぜ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100701.ogg":^"So now, a total of 9 people have been proven innocent.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100702.ogg":^  Things are going pretty well."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_futeki1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「そうそう、紗音と熊沢の紫発言で、第一の晩の６人の死亡も確認しているようだぞ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700494.ogg":^"Ah, right.  It looks like Shannon's and Kumasawa's purple statements confirm that the six people of the first twilight all died."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d22_nayamu1.png",80

bg black,23
bg new_different_space_1a,23
_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d22_niramu1.png",23
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「………それは、鵜呑みに出来ねぇな。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100703.ogg":^"......We shouldn't accept that so easily."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_fukigen2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「なぜか？@　紗音と熊沢の発言は信用できるのではないか？」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700495.ogg":^"Why not?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700496.ogg":^  We can trust Shannon's and Kumasawa's statements, can we not?"^\

se1 57
mbg white,1
ut_mld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai3.png",0
mcbg 22
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「そうよねぇ？@　紗音と熊沢が犯人でないことが確定したのに、どうしてその発言が信用できないの？」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200128.ogg":^"Yeah, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200129.ogg":^  If you're sure they aren't culprits, why can't you trust their purple statements?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d23_nayamu4.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「例えば熊沢さんだが、第一の晩の犠牲者の６人が食堂で、“血塗れになって倒れていた”としか言ってない。@つまり、生死は不明ってわけだ。@食堂の６人の犠牲者の検死は、絶対とは言えないわけだ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100704.ogg":^"Kumasawa-san, for example, only said they were `lying there, covered in blood'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100705.ogg":^  So, it's not clear whether they were alive or dead.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100706.ogg":^  We can't call this a perfect examination of the six victims."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_1_majime6.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「食堂の６人について、紗音は別の言い方もしているぞ。@“お子様方はそれぞれ、自分の親がまちがいなく死んでいることを確認”したとな。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700497.ogg":^"Shannon speaks of those six in a different way.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700498.ogg":^  She says `Each of the children confirmed the deaths of their own parents'."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d23_komaru2.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「食堂でそれぞれの親を検死したのは、俺と譲治の兄貴、そして真里亞の３人ってことだ。@しかし、この３人がシロであることはまだ証明されていない。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100707.ogg":^"In the dining hall, that means George-aniki, Maria, and I each examined our own parents.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100708.ogg":^  However, we haven't proven yet that any of those three are innocent."^\

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_futeki3.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「あぁ、なるほど、そういうことね。@………紗音は、食堂の６人の死亡を、それぞれの親の子供が確認したことは証明したけれど、@それぞれの子供が真実の検死をしたかまでは、証明していないわ。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200130.ogg":^"Oh, I get it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200131.ogg":^  ...Shannon's words prove that the children confirmed each of the six deaths in the dining hall,^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200132.ogg":^ but they don't prove that the examinations those kids performed were legitimate."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_nayamu2.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「そういうことだ。@子供が嘘をついている可能性が、否定できない以上、まだ食堂の連中全員を疑いから外すわけにはいかない。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100709.ogg":^"That's it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100710.ogg":^  Since we can't deny the possibility that the kids are lying, we still can't remove all six people in the dining hall from suspicion."^\

mcl c,0
bg black,24
bg new_different_space_1c,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_fukigen1.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「これは厄介であるな……。@その３人は最後まで生き残った生存者。@生きているということは即ち、犯人でないと証明不能というわけだ…。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700499.ogg":^"How troublesome...^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700500.ogg":^  Those three are the survivors who live until the end.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700501.ogg":^  Since they are alive, that makes it impossible to prove that they aren't culprits..."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_oya1.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「戦人、譲治、真里亞。@……生き残ったこの３人は犯人である可能性が高いと同時に、シロであることの証明がもっとも難しいと言えるだろう。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100711.ogg":^"Battler, George, and Maria.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100712.ogg":^  ...While these survivors are very likely to be culprits, it's probably also hardest to prove them innocent."^\

cl c,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_majime2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「とりあえず。@確実な死亡によってシロであると断言できるのは、この９人までのようであるな。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700502.ogg":^"At any rate,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700503.ogg":^ it looks like those nine are the only ones whose innocence we can be sure of thanks to their confirmed deaths."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d24_komaru2.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「ここからは、信頼できる９人の紫発言で、純粋に推理していくしかない。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100713.ogg":^"From here on out, it'll just be pure reasoning based off the purple statements of the nine we can trust."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「南條、朱志香、蔵臼、@夏妃、紗音、嘉音、@郷田、熊沢、源次。@この９人の紫発言を読み直すしかないな…。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700504.ogg":^"Nanjo, Jessica, Krauss,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700505.ogg":^ Natsuhi, Shannon, Kanon,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700506.ogg":^ Gohda, Kumasawa, and Genji.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700507.ogg":^  All we can do is read through their purple statements once more..."^\

cl r,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_futeki3.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「ここからは難度が上がるぞ。@覚悟して掛かろうぜ…！」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100714.ogg":^"Things are going to get hard starting now.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100715.ogg":^  Let's steel ourselves and take a shot at it...!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「うむ。@ようやくミステリーらしくなってきたというところよ…！」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700508.ogg":^"Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700509.ogg":^  It's finally starting to feel like a real mystery...!"^\

bg black,2

fede 0,1000
E_A


if %hinto_point = 5 : inc %hinto_point
goto *quest_mode


*hinto_7
mov %play_scene,80110 ;シーン変数の入力

mov %r_hyouji_side,0
mov %r_hyouji_cha,but
;■マスターキーが使えない？
mov %BUT_Isyou,2

bgm1 52

bg new_different_space_1a,22
_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_majime4.png",22
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「おい、ベアト。@興味深いことがわかったぞ。@この一連の事件、マスターキーは一切使えない。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100716.ogg":^"Hey, Beato.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100717.ogg":^  I've found something interesting.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100718.ogg":^  In this chain of crimes, master keys can never be used."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_nayamu1.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「そう言えば、シロである９人の中に、使用人５人が含まれるのであったな？」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700510.ogg":^"Come to think of it, the group of nine innocent people includes all five servants, doesn't it?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_komaru2.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「マスターキーは使用人にしか使えない。@渡せもしない。@そして犯人でない人物は犯人に協力しないのだから、犯行にマスターキーを用いることは出来ないんだ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100719.ogg":^"Only the servants can use master keys.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100720.ogg":^  They can't hand them over to someone else.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100721.ogg":^  And, since people who aren't culprits themselves can't assist culprits, the master keys can't be used for crimes."^\

bg black,22
bg new_key2,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　使用人５人全員がシロであることが保証されている以上、@マスターキーは、事件には絡まないということになる。\
langen^Since it's been guaranteed that all five servants are innocent, ^@^we know that the master keys have nothing to do with the crimes.^\

bg black,22
bg new_different_space_1a,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_1_odoroki3.png",22
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「確かに、そうなる…！@　となるとますますに厄介ではないか？@　何度も起こった密室殺人！@　それらをマスターキー抜きで構築せねばならんことになる…！」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700511.ogg":^"Yes, that's right...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700512.ogg":^  And that makes this even more troublesome, correct?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700513.ogg":^  All of these closed room murders!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700514.ogg":^  Every one of them must be constructed without any master keys...!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_futeki2.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「違うな。@チェス盤を引っ繰り返すぜ。@ってことはつまり、マスターキーがなくても、構築可能なトリックってワケさ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100722.ogg":^"No.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100723.ogg":^  Spin the chessboard around.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100724.ogg":^  This just means that they can all be constructed with tricks that don't involve master keys."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_1_majime3star.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「なるほど…！@　第一の晩、食堂の密室。@第二の晩、夏妃の部屋の密室。@第五の晩以降のゲストハウスの密室。@じっくり考え直す必要がありそうだな…。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700515.ogg":^"I see...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700516.ogg":^  So, we have the first twilight, the closed room of the dining hall,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700517.ogg":^ the second twilight, Natsuhi's closed room,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700518.ogg":^ and starting with the fifth twilight, the closed room of the guesthouse.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700519.ogg":^  It seems we must look closely through those again..."^\

cl r,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_majime4.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「もう一度、じっくりと読み直してみよう。@……使用人は全員シロなんだ。@マスターキーは使えない。@そこを念頭に、もう一度考えるんだ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100725.ogg":^"Let's read it through once more carefully.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100726.ogg":^  ...All of the servants are innocent.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100727.ogg":^  Master keys can't be used.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100728.ogg":^  Let's think through it again with that in mind."^\

bg black,2

fede 0,1000
E_A

if %hinto_point = 6 : inc %hinto_point
goto *quest_mode



*hinto_8
mov %play_scene,80110 ;シーン変数の入力

mov %r_hyouji_side,0
mov %r_hyouji_cha,but
;■赤き真実に違和感？
mov %BUT_Isyou,2

bgm1 6

bg new_different_space_1a,22
_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_majime1.png",22
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「第一の晩の、食堂の密室についてだが、このような推理はどうだろうか。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700520.ogg":^"I think I have a theory about the closed room of the first twilight."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_majime1.png",23
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「拝聴しよう。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100729.ogg":^"Let's hear it."^\

cl c,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_1_majime5star.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「第一の晩の犠牲者の検死は、未だ定かではない。@つまり、その中の誰かが実は犯人で！@　他の５人を殺した後に死んだフリをして、内側から食堂を施錠したのだ…！」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700521.ogg":^"The corpse examinations of the victims in the first twilight still aren't certain.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700522.ogg":^  In other words, what if one of them was really the culprit?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700523.ogg":^  They killed the other five, locked the dining hall from the inside, and played dead...!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_nayamu4.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「確かに、それならマスターキーを使わずに密室を生み出せるな。@とすると１つ疑問が出てくる。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100730.ogg":^"True, they could create a closed room without using master keys that way.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100731.ogg":^  That leaves us with a problem though."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_majime2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「疑問とは何か。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700524.ogg":^"What problem?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_oya1.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「覚えてるか？@　第二の晩のやり取りの時、ベルンカステルに赤き真実でこう宣言された。@“第一の晩の犯人は確実に６人を殺している”とな。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100732.ogg":^"Remember?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100733.ogg":^  When we were talking about the second twilight, Bernkastel said this with the red truth:^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100734.ogg":^ the culprit of the first twilight really did kill six people."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_fukigen2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「そういえばそうであったな…。@………むぅ……。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700525.ogg":^"Yes, now that you mention it...^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700526.ogg":^  ...Muu..."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_komaru2.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「この赤き真実がある以上、やはり食堂の６人は死んでいたってことになる。@なら、外部の人間がどうやって食堂に施錠を。@マスターキーを使わずに……。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100735.ogg":^"Because of that red, it seems all six people in the dining hall were dead after all.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100736.ogg":^  So, how did someone lock the dining hall from the outside?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100737.ogg":^  Without using a key..."^\

bg black,22
bg new_different_space_1a,22
_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_futeki2.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「なぁ、戦人。@その赤き真実は食堂の６人の死亡を確実なものにしているのではないか？」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700527.ogg":^"Hey, Battler.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700528.ogg":^  Does that red truth really confirm the deaths of all six people in the dining hall?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_niramu3.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「……うむ、……まぁ、……そういうことになるんだろうな…。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100738.ogg":^"...Hmm, ...well, ...doesn't it...?"^\

cl c,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_futeki1.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「となれば、食堂の６人もシロということで、すでにシロとわかっている源次を除き、新しく５人がシロと判明したことになるのではないか？@　つまり、９＋５で１４人の無実が証明できたというわけだ…！@　残るは３人！@　戦人、譲治、真里亞の３人の中に犯人がいるに違いないのだ…！」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700529.ogg":^"In that case, the six in the dining hall were all innocent, and excluding Genji, whose innocence has already been confirmed, we can remove five more people from the list of suspects, yes?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700530.ogg":^  In other words, 9+5=14 people have been proved innocent...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700531.ogg":^  There are only three left!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700532.ogg":^  Either Battler, George, or Maria is the culprit...!"^\

;cl r,24
_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_aseru4.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「ちょっと待ってくれ！@　……どうもそいつは引っ掛かるんだ。@赤き真実で、犯人は６人を殺したと宣言はされてる。@でも、それを第一の晩の時に言われたわけじゃない。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100739.ogg":^"Wait a second!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100740.ogg":^  ...There's something about this that's bugging me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100741.ogg":^  That red truth did say that the culprit killed six people.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100742.ogg":^  However, she didn't say that red right after the first twilight."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「確か、第二の晩のやり取りの時に、言われたのであったな…？」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700533.ogg":^"I believe she said it back when we were talking about the second twilight, yes...?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_odoroki3.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「もう一度その部分を読み直したい。@探してみよう。@不自然なタイミングで言われたような、そんな違和感を覚えるんだ…。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100743.ogg":^"I'd like to read through that bit again.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100744.ogg":^  Let's search.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100745.ogg":^  It feels like that was a strange time for her to say it..."^\


bg black,22
bg new_different_space_1c,22

