;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700647.ogg":^"And the only corpse inspections that a child culprit could lie about were the inspections of that child's own parents.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700648.ogg":^  So, the culprit group was a family of two adults and one child."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_nayamu3.png",80
