langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700653.ogg":^"If you're a culprit, that automatically makes your parents culprits too.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700654.ogg":^  There's no need to worry anymore.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700655.ogg":^  We've already won."^\

