;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000807.ogg":^"Where are they?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000808.ogg":^  Wheeeeeeeeere?!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000809.ogg":^  Answer meeeeeeeeeeeee!!"^\
