langjp　………やがて、茂みの向こうに、兄の声を聞いた気がした。@
langjp　いや、兄の声だけじゃない。@譲治お兄ちゃんの声も、真里亞お姉ちゃんの声も聞こえた。@
langen^......Eventually, I thought I heard my brother's voice from beyond a bush.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^No, it wasn't just his voice.^@^  I heard George onii-chan's and Maria onee-chan's voices too.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　私は大声で呼び掛けるのだが、彼らは応えてはくれなかった。\
langen^I called out at the top of my lungs, but they didn't answer.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　しかしもういい。@すぐそこにいる。@この垣根の向こうにいる。@
langen^But it's okay now.^@^  They're right there.^@^  Just on the other side of the fence.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　垣根越しに、彼らの姿がうっすらと見えてさえいるのだ。\
langen^I could even faintly see them through the fence.^\

