langjp　こんなにも大声で叫んでいるのに？@
langen^I cried out, but my voice didn't reach them.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Even though I yelled so loudly?^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　私はものすごい違和感を覚える。\
langen^Something felt very wrong about all this.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　……人の声は、たとえ聞こえないふりをしたって、何かの反応が体に出てしまう。@
langen^...When people hear a voice, even when they pretend not to have heard it, their bodies tend to show some sign that they've noticed.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　しかし、お兄ちゃんたちには、一切、それがないのだ。\
langen^However, there was no trace of that in the three of them.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　これだけ大声で叫んでいるのに、………本当の本当に、お兄ちゃんたちの耳には届いていないのだ。\
langen^Even though I was screaming so loud, ...it truly wasn't reaching their ears.^\

mbg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　それを理解した瞬間、……彼らに駆け寄る私の足は遅くなり、止まってしまう。@
langen^The instant I understood that, ...my dash towards them slowed and came to a halt.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　同じ世界にいるように見えて、………私と彼らは異なる世界にいるのだ。\
langen^Though we appeared to be in the same world, ...we were actually in different worlds entirely.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　例えるならテレビ。@いや、亡霊…？@
langen^It was like seeing someone on TV.^@^  Or was it more like seeing a ghost...?^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　私にはありありと見えているが、……彼らにとって私は、いないのだ。\
langen^I could see them clearly, ...but as far as they were concerned, I didn't exist.^\

mcbg 22
advsetwindow "-1"


langjp　……だから、ほら。@
langen^...After all, look.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
