advsetwindow "-1"
langen^...What if my hand just went right through...?^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　それが怖くて、……私はこんなにも目の前なのに、呆然と立ち尽くすことしか出来なかった…。\
langen^I was so scared at the thought...that I could do nothing but stand there in shock, even though I was so close to them...^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_aseru3.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「クソッタレ…！！@　もう、俺には、何が何だかわからねぇ…！@　やっぱり、島の外から何者かが入り込んでるんだ！！@　そしてそいつが、右代宮家を皆殺しにしてるんだ！」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100899.ogg":^"Dammit...!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100900.ogg":^  I don't have a clue anymore...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100901.ogg":^  Someone must've snuck in from outside the island after all!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100902.ogg":^  And they're massacring the Ushiromiya family!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_a22_warai2.png",80
