;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100903.ogg":^"That doesn't make sense...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100904.ogg":^  After all, we've just seen several murders that'd be impossible for any one of us!"^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\geo\1\geo_a11k_majime5k.png",80
advsetwindow "07"

langjp「……それはそうだけど……。@本当にそうだろうか？@　僕たちには見落としがあるんじゃないだろうか？」\
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300136.ogg":^"...Well, that's true...^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300137.ogg":^  But is it really?^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300138.ogg":^  Maybe we've just missed something."^\

