;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400198.ogg":^"Missed something?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\geo\1\geo_a11_ikari2.png",24
advsetwindow "07"

langjp「例えば……。@………そうさ、死んだフリとか！@　この島に右代宮家の人間しかいない以上、犯人だって右代宮家の人間しかいないんだ。@だとしたら僕たちが、死んだと思い込んでいる誰かが実は死んでなかったということになる…！」\
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300139.ogg":^"For example...^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300140.ogg":^  ......That's right, maybe someone was playing dead!^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300141.ogg":^  Since we're the only ones on this island, the culprit must be one of us.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300142.ogg":^  That means someone we thought was dead was actually faking...!"^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_aseru3.png",23
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「しかし兄貴ッ、それはありえねぇぜ？！@　全員の死体を必ず誰かが検死してる！@　死んだフリなんか絶対に出来ねぇはずだ！」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100905.ogg":^"But Aniki, that's impossible!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100906.ogg":^  Every one of the corpses was checked by someone!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100907.ogg":^  There's no way any of them were faking!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\geo\1\geo_a11k_majime5k.png",80
advsetwindow "07"

langjp「考えたくはない…。@でも、その検死さえも、……偽られているとしたら？」@
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300143.ogg":^"I don't want to think about it, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300144.ogg":^...but what if those corpse inspections...were also faked?"^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_a11_fukigen2.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

