_ld l,":b;sprites\geo\1\geo_a11_majime2.png",23
advsetwindow "07"

langjp「つまりこういうことさ。@犯人は初めから複数犯だったんだ。@そして、１人は殺されたフリをして、１人は間違いなく死んでいると嘘を吐く。@そして、死んだフリをした犯人は犯行を重ね、@あたかも右代宮家以外の人間が島に紛れ込んでいるかのような、幻想を生み出す…！」\
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300145.ogg":^"It could have gone like this:^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300146.ogg":^ there were multiple culprits from the start.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300147.ogg":^  Then, one plays dead, and the other lies and confirms that the first culprit died.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300148.ogg":^  Then, the culprit who played dead keeps on committing crimes, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300149.ogg":^creating the illusion that some stranger has snuck onto the island...!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b23_odoroki2.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「譲治の兄貴は、右代宮家の誰かが犯人だって、……まだ疑ってんのかよ？！」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100908.ogg":^"Do you...still suspect someone in the Ushiromiya family of being the culprit?!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\geo\1\geo_a11_majime3.png",80
advsetwindow "07"

langjp「………南條先生は殺された。@……殺された以上、犯人ではないと考えるのが妥当だろう。@そして、お医者である南條先生の検死が、一番信頼できたと考えられる。」@
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300150.ogg":^"...Doctor Nanjo was killed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300151.ogg":^  So, it's probably safe to say that he isn't a culprit.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300152.ogg":^  And, we can consider the examinations performed by a doctor like him to be the most reliable."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　となれば、南條が死亡を確認した人間は、ほぼ確実に死んでいると考えて問題ないだろう。\
langen^If so, then it's fair to say that the people whose death Nanjo checked were almost certainly dead.^\

