;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300153.ogg":^"Think back to the beginning and the bodies in the dining hall.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300154.ogg":^  Of those six victims, Doctor Nanjo only inspected Genji-san."^\


