langjp「何を言ってんだよ？！@　あの惨ぇ殺され方で、どう親父たちが生きてるってんだよ？！@　それに譲治の兄貴は何を言ってるんだ？！@　ってことは、俺たちの親の誰かが犯人だって言ってんのかよ？！@　そりゃあねぇだろ？！@　真っ先に殺されて、これだけ大勢が殺されて…！@　どうやったら、さらにその上、俺たちの親が犯人だなんて言えるんだよ？！@　許せねぇ、あんな殺された方をした親父たちを、さらにこの上、疑って辱しめるなんて、たとえ譲治の兄貴でも許せねぇ…！！」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100909.ogg":^"What are you talking about?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100910.ogg":^  How the hell could our parents have survived after being killed like that?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100911.ogg":^  Anyway, what do you think you're saying, George-aniki?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100912.ogg":^  Wouldn't that mean one of our parents is the culprit?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100913.ogg":^  That's insane!!^\:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100914.ogg":^  They were killed right at the beginning, and so many of them...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100915.ogg":^  How can you accuse our parents of being killers after that?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100916.ogg":^  I won't let anyone, not even you, suspect and slander our parents after they've been killed like that...!!"^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\geo\1\geo_a11k_majime3k.png",23
advsetwindow "07"

langjp「………ご、………ごめん……。」@
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300156.ogg":^"......S-Sorry..."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_a22_warai1.png",23
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「……真里亞のママはちゃんと死んでたよ。@じゃあ、譲治お兄ちゃんの親か、戦人の親か、どっちかが犯人？」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400201.ogg":^"...I know my Mama was really dead.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400202.ogg":^  So, does that mean George onii-chan's parents or Battler's parents were the culprits?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\geo\1\geo_a11_majime3.png",80
advsetwindow "07"

langjp「もう、よそう、真里亞ちゃん……。@僕もちょっと混乱してたみたいだ…。」@
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300157.ogg":^"Let's stop this, Maria-chan...^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\80300158.ogg":^  I must have lost it a bit back there..."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_a22_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「譲治お兄ちゃんは、紗音を殺さないよ。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400203.ogg":^"George onii-chan wouldn't kill Shannon."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「もう止せよ…！@　俺たちの誰も、親族を殺したりするわけなんかねぇだろう！！」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100917.ogg":^"That's enough...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100918.ogg":^  None of us would kill members of our family, right?!!"^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_a22_niyari1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「だから、譲治お兄ちゃんが、お父さんとお母さんが本当は生きてるのに、死んでるなんて、嘘を吐かないと思う。@………譲治お兄ちゃんは、紗音が殺されるような事件の片棒を、担ぐわけがない。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400204.ogg":^"So, I don't think George onii-chan would lie and say his parents were dead, not if they were really alive.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400205.ogg":^  ...There's no way George onii-chan would help out in a crime if Shannon was going to be killed."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　真里亞は淡々と、……クイズかなぞなぞに答えるかのように、譲治に告げる。@
langen^Calmly, ...as though answering a quiz or a riddle, Maria spoke to George.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そして、きょとんとした顔のまま、戦人の方を向き、告げた。\
langen^Then, with a blank look on her face, she turned to Battler and spoke.^\

