;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400206.ogg":^"......Battler, you saw your Dad's and Mom's corpses, right?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_aseru3.png",23
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「あぁ、見たさ！！@　みんなも見ただろ？！@　あんな血塗れで、酷ぇ死に様で…！！」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100919.ogg":^"Yeah, I saw them!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100920.ogg":^  We all saw them right?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100921.ogg":^  Those pitiful, bloodstained...!!"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「戦人が、嘘を吐いてると思う。」@
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400207.ogg":^"I think you're lying."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b23_odoroki2.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「はぁ？！@　どうしてそうなるんだよ！！」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100922.ogg":^"Huh?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100923.ogg":^  Where the hell did that come from?!!"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_a11_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「そうすると、筋が通る。@……最初の食堂で、戦人の両親は死んでなかったの。@その片方が、夏妃伯母さんたちを殺し、内側から鍵を閉めて、部屋に留まる。@……もう片方が、それ以降の殺人を引き継いだ。@……ゲストハウスの密室を破るには、内側に協力者がいなくてはならない。@それが、戦人。@……全部全部、説明がつくよ。」\
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400208.ogg":^"Because that way, it all makes sense.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400209.ogg":^  ...Back in the dining hall, Battler's parents weren't dead.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400210.ogg":^  One of them killed Aunt Natsuhi and Uncle Krauss, locked the door from the inside, and waited in that room.^\:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400211.ogg":^  ...The other one took over the murders after that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400212.ogg":^  ...To break open the closed room of the guesthouse, they needed to have an accomplice inside.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400213.ogg":^  That was Battler.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400214.ogg":^  ...That explains everything."^\

