langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400215.ogg":^"Finally, all the pieces fit together in the Wolves and Sheep puzzle in my head.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400216.ogg":^  ...The culprits are Battler's family.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400217.ogg":^  Uu-.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400218.ogg":^  ...Am I right?"^\

