langjp「でもよ。@よくひねった、面白いゲームだったぜ。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100933.ogg":^"Seriously though,^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100934.ogg":^ that really was a fun game with a twist."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_def2.png",23
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「そう？@　………ありがと。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100226.ogg":^"You think so?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100227.ogg":^  ...Thank you."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_futeki1.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「解けないようにも作れるのに。@お前はちゃんと解けるように作ったもんな。@……それはゲームを楽しもうというフェア精神がなけりゃ出来ないことだ。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100935.ogg":^"You could've made it unsolvable,^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100936.ogg":^ but you still made it to be solved.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100937.ogg":^  ...You couldn't have done that unless you planned on playing fair and enjoying the game."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「……私は絶対に勝てるゲームが好きよ。@勝てないかもしれないゲームなんて、面倒臭い。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100228.ogg":^"...I like games where I win no matter what.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100229.ogg":^  Games that I might lose are just a pain."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_futeki5.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「今度は、攻守を逆にしてゲームをしたいな。@俺が出題して、それにあんたが挑戦する。@あんたが俺に勝つゲームだ。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100938.ogg":^"Later, I'd like to switch sides and try another one.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100939.ogg":^  I'll make a puzzle, and we'll see if you can solve it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100940.ogg":^  A game for you to win against me."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「…………………………。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100230.ogg":^"............"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「もちろん、これまでのベアトとの戦いで培ったノウハウの全てをつぎ込んだ、超難解なゲームにするぜ。@俺が２連勝しちまうくらいのつもりのな…！」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100941.ogg":^"Of course, I'll use all the know-how I've picked up in my fights with Beato to make it super-hard.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100942.ogg":^  I'm not giving up my winning streak that easily...!"^\

