langjp「………やっと。@……ベアトたちと私の考えの、何が違うのかはっきりと理解できたわ。」@
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100237.ogg":^"...Finally.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100238.ogg":^  ...Finally, I clearly understand the difference between how all of you think and how I think."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_oya2.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「違いって？」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100952.ogg":^"What do you mean?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「あんたたちにはコミュニケーション。@……私には、そうではないということよ。」@
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100239.ogg":^"For you, this is communication.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100240.ogg":^  ...It isn't for me."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_nayamu4.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「お前、ずいぶん殺伐とした世界に生きてるんだな。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100953.ogg":^"The world you live in must be pretty savage."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai4.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「……………あんただって。@……ベアトのゲームを理解するまではそうだったはずよ。@……永遠のゲームは永遠の拷問。@……その苦しみを、あんたはもう、綺麗さっぱり忘れてしまったというの…？」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100241.ogg":^"......And what about you?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100242.ogg":^  ...Wasn't it the same for you, until you understood Beato's game?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100243.ogg":^  ...An eternal game is eternal torture.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100244.ogg":^  ...Have you already completely forgotten about that pain you suffered...?"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_def3.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「…………………。@……確かにそう思った日もあった。@……しかし、もう決着はついた。@そうなれば、過去のことはグチグチ言わない。@ノーサイドってヤツだ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100954.ogg":^"......^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100955.ogg":^...There were days I did think that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100956.ogg":^  ...But now, it's all been resolved.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100957.ogg":^  I won't complain about stuff that's in the past.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100958.ogg":^  I'm impartial, you might say."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「そこに、………私とあんたの、致命的な違いがある気がするわ。@……あんたにとっての永遠の拷問は、笑って水に流せる程度のものだった。@……私にとってのそれは、そんな生易しいものではなかった。@……そういうことだわ。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100245.ogg":^"That...is the critical difference between you and me, I think.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100246.ogg":^  ...Your eternal torture was something you could laugh off and forget.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100247.ogg":^  ...Mine wasn't nearly so trivial.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100248.ogg":^  ...That's all there is to it."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai4.png",80
cl l,24

;cl r,24
_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_nayamu4.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「……あんたの生い立ちは知らねぇが。@……苦労があったみたいだな。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100959.ogg":^"...I don't know your history.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100960.ogg":^  ...It sounds like you had it rough."^\

;ld l,BER_nayamuA1,80

