langjp「ふん。@……成駒如きのあんたに同情されるとは、私も焼きが回ったもんね。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100249.ogg":^"Hmph.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100250.ogg":^  ...To think I'm getting sympathy from a mere former piece.  I must be getting old."^\


