langjp「………今のあんたは。@誰かの拷問に苛まれているのか。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100961.ogg":^"...Are you ^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100962.ogg":^being tortured by someone right now?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai4.png",24
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「まさか。@………私は自由人よ。@誰の束縛も受けない。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100251.ogg":^"Are you kidding?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100252.ogg":^  ...I'm as free as can be.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100253.ogg":^  I'm not bound by anyone's shackles."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「なら、良かったじゃねぇか。@少なくとも、昔とは違う。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100963.ogg":^"Then that's a good thing, isn't it?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100964.ogg":^  At least things are better for you now."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「…………そうね。@昔に比べたら、だいぶマシだわ。@……退屈から逃げ果せるための、長い長い終わりのない旅だけれど。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100254.ogg":^"......True.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100255.ogg":^  It's much better now than it once was.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100256.ogg":^  ...Though I am on a long, endless journey to escape from boredom."^\

cl l,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_def2.png",23
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「なら、この出会いは少なくとも、お前にとっては良いもののはずだ。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100965.ogg":^"Then at the very least, us meeting here should've been a good thing for you."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai3.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「そうね。@……敗北の味も、多少は退屈から私を遠ざけてくれるわ。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100257.ogg":^"Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100258.ogg":^  ...Even the taste of defeat can keep my boredom at bay somewhat."^\

