langjp「……俺たちは、フェアなゲームを戦って楽しんだ、友人同士だぜ。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100966.ogg":^"...We're friends who've enjoyed fighting in a fair game."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「だから………？」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100259.ogg":^"So......?"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_warai3.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「もし、お前の日々が退屈から逃げ回るためだけのものだというなら。@……たまには、俺たちのところに寄るといい。@俺たちは友人を歓迎する。@そして、友人を退屈から逃すために、色々な持て成しや労いをするだろう。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100967.ogg":^"If your days are filled with nothing but running away from boredom,^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100968.ogg":^ ...feel free to drop by our place every now and then.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100969.ogg":^  We'd love to welcome a friend.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100970.ogg":^  And we'll be able to set up everything needed to help a friend escape from boredom."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「この大ベルンカステルを、一夜とて退屈から逃す持て成しを、あんたらが出来ると…？」@
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100260.ogg":^"You think you can prepare a welcome interesting enough to help me, the great Bernkastel, escape boredom for even a single night...?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「あぁ。@それが、友人ってもんだ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100971.ogg":^"I do.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100972.ogg":^  That's what it means to be a friend."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「…………………………。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100261.ogg":^"............"^\

bfly2 0
bg new_mhal_h1c,24
_ld c,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d24_futeki1.png",23
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「今夜のゲームでは俺たちが勝った。@だから、次に来る時は攻守を逆にしよう。@今度は俺たちのゲームであんたを持て成す。@……もちろん、あっさりと勝ちを譲るつもりはないぜ？@　とことんひねった、極悪な推理ゲームで挑戦してやるぜ！@　一夜で解かせるつもりなんかねぇ。@それこそ、数ヶ月は頭を捻って滞在するはめになるくらいのを用意してやるぜ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100973.ogg":^"We won tonight's game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100974.ogg":^  So, the next time you come, we'll switch sides.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100975.ogg":^  This time, we'll entertain you with one of our games.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100976.ogg":^  ...Of course, we don't intend to let you win easily.^\:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100977.ogg":^  We'll challenge you to a devilishly twisted logic game!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100978.ogg":^  It won't be something you can solve in a night.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100979.ogg":^  It'll be good enough to make you stay for months, racking your brains over it."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_def1.png",24
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「………この大ベルンカステルを、友人として持て成すと……？」@
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100262.ogg":^"...You would entertain me, the great Bernkastel, as a friend...?"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「あぁ、そうだ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100980.ogg":^"Yeah, we would."^\

;背徳感
_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「……ふっ……。@………あんたたちに付き合ってると。@せっかくの梅干紅茶も、何だかベタベタに甘くなってくるわ。@やってらんない。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100263.ogg":^"...Hmph...^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100264.ogg":^  ...After talking with you,^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100265.ogg":^ even this dried plum tea is starting to taste sickly sweet.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100266.ogg":^  What a pain."^\

cl c,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「ベアトに聞いたぜ。@梅干紅茶とやらが好物なんだってな。@金箔まぶした最高級梅干を紅茶に放り込んでやるから、それを楽しみにしてまた来いってんだ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100981.ogg":^"I heard from Beato.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100982.ogg":^  Sounds like this dried plum tea stuff is one of your favorites.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100983.ogg":^  Next time, we'll throw in some high-class dried plums covered in gold leaf, so make sure you come again."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「………もし、本気でそう思ってるなら、もう少しはマシな紅茶を用意することね。@……こんなまずい紅茶じゃ、二度と来てやろうという気にはならないわ。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100267.ogg":^"...If you really plan to do that, try finding some better tea to start with.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100268.ogg":^  I'll never feel like coming again if you keep serving tea like this."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_d11_futeki1.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「やれやれ。@普段はよっぽどお上品な紅茶を飲んでやがるらしいぜ。@むしろ今度、その紅茶が飲めるところに招待しやがれ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100984.ogg":^"Ah, come on.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100985.ogg":^  I guess the tea you're used to drinking is pretty damn high-class.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100986.ogg":^  Next time, why don't you invite us somewhere we can drink some of that?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_def1.png",80

