langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100990.ogg":^"So, let's have the game be fair too.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100991.ogg":^  Let's switch sides and start a new game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100992.ogg":^  I'm looking forward to it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80100993.ogg":^  We won this time, but who knows about the next...?!"^\


