langen^This was the study of Featherine Augustus Aurora.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^The majestic Witch of Theatergoing, Drama, and Spectating.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……かつて私は彼女に呼び出され、巫女という名の朗読役を命じられたこともある。\
langen^...Once in the past, I was summoned by her and ordered to be her Reader, her miko.^\

