;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000004.ogg":^"I wasn't the one who called you here.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000005.ogg":^  ...My miko brought the two of us together."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a31_komaru3.png",80
