advsetwindow "28"

langjp「戦人の退屈な芝居を観劇するのと、@私の手による、運命の分岐を司る刺激的な芝居を観劇するのと、どっちを好むのかしら？@　……退屈に、一分一秒だって耐えられないくせに。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100285.ogg":^"So, would you rather watch Battler's boring play, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100286.ogg":^or my exciting one that manipulates the branching paths of fate?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100287.ogg":^  ...I know you can't stand even a minute of boredom."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def1.png",22
advsetwindow "50"

