advsetwindow "11"

langjp「私の決断を、……具現化したもの……。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000889.ogg":^"The physical manifestation...of my decision..."^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_def2.png",24
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「そういうこと。@最終的にあんたは恐らく戦人から、その鍵で開けられる２枚の扉の前に立たされ、@どちらの扉を開くか選択を迫られるでしょうね。@それくらいは聞かされてる？」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100292.ogg":^"Exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100293.ogg":^  Battler was probably planning to end it by putting you in front of two doors, both of which can be opened by the key.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100294.ogg":^  Then, he would ask you to choose which door to open.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100295.ogg":^  He must have told you that much, right?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a31_komaru3.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「………………何も教えてくれない。@……然るべき時がくれば、……みたいなことしか言わないの。@……お兄ちゃんも誰も、……何も教えてくれない。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000890.ogg":^"......He didn't tell me anything at all.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000891.ogg":^  He just kept saying things like `You'll know when the time comes'.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000892.ogg":^  ...No one will tell me anything.  Not Onii-chan, not anyone..."^\

