langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000959.ogg":^"It is.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000960.ogg":^  After all, this game is between me and you, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000961.ogg":^  I'm the player.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000962.ogg":^  You're the Game Master.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82000963.ogg":^  ...No matter how many pieces get between us, in the end, it's still a direct battle between you and me."^\


