langjp「もちろんでございます…！@　栄えある第１回丸々社ミステリー大賞賞金１０００万円はもちろん、先生にお支払いさせていただきます！@　他にもですね、他にも他にも！！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\HENSA8003.ogg":^"But of course...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\HENSA8004.ogg":^  The 10 million yen prize for Company X's first mystery novel contest will all go to you!^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\HENSA8005.ogg":^  And much more besides!!"^\

