langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900033.ogg":^"You people truly are amusing, fawning and cringing all the time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900034.ogg":^  But I've grown weary of this for today.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900035.ogg":^  Leave now.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900036.ogg":^  Meeting with children of men can be so tiring."^\
