langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900038.ogg":^"Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900039.ogg":^  They certainly can be entertaining.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900040.ogg":^  Inviting them over now and then may go a long way towards alleviating my boredom.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900041.ogg":^  ...At any rate, I think I will write that manuscript...when I feel like it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900042.ogg":^  It sounds like they'll even bring a gift for you."^\


