;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900052.ogg":^"In that case, why does a child of man draw up a tale in their mind, and then spit the whole thing out again on a keyboard?^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900053.ogg":^  ...How foolish of them to do the same thing twice."^\

