;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100377.ogg":^"...Don't make me laugh.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100378.ogg":^  Is this coming from the person who entertains herself by taking a tale and tearing out its guts?"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_a11_def1.png",24
advsetwindow "57"

