;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100385.ogg":^"...That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100386.ogg":^  If you eat a cat, then you only get to enjoy it for one night.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100387.ogg":^  But if you let it live, it might start calling you names and getting sarcastic."^\

