langjp「そうだな。@……勝手に菓子棚を漁ったり、ベッドに忍び込んできて暑苦しいのも、なかなか愉快なものだ。」@
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900083.ogg":^"Indeed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900084.ogg":^  ...Even the annoying way they break into your sweets cupboard or sneak into your bed can be part of their charm."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br

langjp　八城は、書斎を埋め尽くす書物の数々を見やり、その背をそっと撫でる。\
langen^Hachijo looked around at the books covering every square inch of the room, then softly petted the cat's back.^\

bg black,22
bg new_fea_r1g,22
advsetwindow "57"

;bg Different_spiral_1a,28
;ld c,FEA_DefA1,80

langjp「私は１つの物語を、もっともっと深く長く、楽しむことが出来たかもしれない。@……退屈から逃れるために、星の数の物語を食い尽くしてきた私は、そもそも初めから、物語を喰らってなどいなかったのだ。@……ただ、殺していただけ。@……結局は、それが私をも殺すのだ。」@
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900085.ogg":^"I might have been able to enjoy a single tale much longer and much more deeply.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900086.ogg":^  ...As I've eaten my way through countless tales to escape boredom, I haven't really been eating them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900087.ogg":^  ...I've just been killing them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900088.ogg":^  ...And, in the end, they'll kill me back."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　八城は自嘲気味に笑う。\
langen^Hachijo laughed with self-derision.^\
advsetwindow "28"

;bg black,22
;bg blood_1a,22
;ld c,BER_DefA1,80

langjp「………ベアトのゲームだって、ハラワタを引き摺り出そうとしたじゃない。」@
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100388.ogg":^"...Even in Beato's game, you tried to tear the guts out."^\
advsetwindow "57"

langjp「答え合わせを希望しただけだ。@物語の紡ぎ手であるベアトリーチェには、敬意を表する形としたつもりだがな。」\
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900089.ogg":^"I just wanted to check my answers.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900090.ogg":^  I did try to do it in a way that respected Beatrice, the weaver of this tale."^\

bg new_fea_r1f,23
_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai4.png",23
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「………そうね。@……わかんないヤツにはわかんない、うまい朗読だったと思うわ。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100389.ogg":^"...Yeah.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100390.ogg":^  ...I think it was pretty well Read, all done so that people who didn't understand wouldn't figure it out."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_a11_def3.png",23
advsetwindow "57"

langjp「縁寿が、真実を知ることと知らぬことと、どちらが良い物語となるのか、……正直なところ、もう私にはわからぬ。@だから、そなたに再び軽蔑されることを覚悟の上で、@……私はこの物語の続きを描くことを、止めようと思う。」\
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900091.ogg":^"Will it make for a better tale if Ange learns the truth, or if she doesn't?^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900092.ogg":^  ...To be honest, I don't know anymore.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900093.ogg":^  So, fully aware that you'll scorn me for it, ...I've decided to stop writing the rest of this tale."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「……止めてどうすんの。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100391.ogg":^"...What do you mean?"^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "57"

langjp「私は書かぬ。@記すだけだ。@……右代宮縁寿が自ら紡ぐ物語をな。」@
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900094.ogg":^"I won't write it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900095.ogg":^  I will merely record it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900096.ogg":^  ...The tale that Ushiromiya Ange weaves herself."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「また、……そういうことをするのね。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100392.ogg":^"So, ...you're going to do that sort of thing again?"^\


bg black,25
bg new_fea_r1g,22
advsetwindow "57"
;ld c,FEA_DefA1,80

langjp「私は、真実を知らぬことを敢えて選ぶ方が高潔であると、千年を生き飽きた末に思う。@……しかし、百年も生きぬ縁寿に、その価値観を押し付けるのも酷であると、今、理解した。」\
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900097.ogg":^"After growing tired of a thousand years of life, I've decided that choosing not to know the truth is the more noble path.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900098.ogg":^  ...However, I now see that it isn't fair to force my opinion on Ange, who hasn't lived even a hundred years."^\
advsetwindow "28"

;ld c,BER_DefA1,80

langjp「だから、……縁寿に委ねようと？」@
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100393.ogg":^"So, ...you're going to leave it in Ange's care?"^\
advsetwindow "57"

;ld c,FEA_DefA1,80

langjp「そうだ。@それを、私は淡々と記す。」\
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900099.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900100.ogg":^  I will silently record it as it plays out."^\
advsetwindow "28"

;ld c,BER_DefA1,80

langjp「……縁寿に委ねるということは、……もうこの物語の向かう先は、半ば決まったようなものだけど…？」@
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100394.ogg":^"...If you're leaving it to Ange, ...then the rest of this tale is pretty much set in stone, right...?"^\
advsetwindow "57"

;ld c,FEA_DefA1,80

langjp「そうなるだろうな。@………それで良い。@私が記すどのような物語よりも結局は、……人の子が自ら紡ぐ物語の方が、面白いのだから。」\
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900101.ogg":^"So it would seem.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900102.ogg":^  ...Let it be so.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900103.ogg":^  ...After all, in the end, a tale that a child of man weaves for herself will be more fun than any story I could create."^\
advsetwindow "28"

;ld c,BER_DefA1,80

langjp「なら、縁寿の物語に付き合ってあげたら？@　出番はもう、作ってあげたでしょ…？」@
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100395.ogg":^"In that case, why don't you lend a hand in Ange's tale?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100396.ogg":^  You've already given yourself a role in it, haven't you...?"^\
advsetwindow "57"

;ld c,FEA_DefA1,80

langjp「………ふむ。@……私は、この物語にピリオドを打つ役目か。」\
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900104.ogg":^"...Hmm.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900105.ogg":^  ...So, is it my role to bring this tale to its conclusion?"^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "28"
;ld c,BER_DefA1,80

langjp「ベアトのゲーム風に、もっとカッコよく言って欲しいわ。@……猫箱のハラワタを、引き摺り出す役目よ。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100397.ogg":^"Come on, that's no way for someone in Beato's game to talk.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\82100398.ogg":^  ...It's your job to tear the guts out of the cat box."^\

