langjp「一なる真実の書は、確かにこの島で何があったのかを縁寿に教えるだろう。@しかし、それを知って何の意味がある？！@　１２年前の悲しみが増すばかりじゃねぇか！@　一体、縁寿は、さらにあと何年を掛ければ１人の女の子としての幸せを享受できるってんだよ…！@　一体、何年を掛ければその傷口は癒されるんだよ…！！」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101162.ogg":^"The Book of the Single Truth probably can teach Ange what happened on this island.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101163.ogg":^  But what's the point of her knowing that?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101164.ogg":^  It'll just increase the sadness she's felt for 12 years!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101165.ogg":^  How many more years will it take for her to find happiness as an ordinary girl...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101166.ogg":^  How many years will it take for her wounds to be healed...?!!"^\

bg black,22
mono 1
_ld c,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_def1.png",22
