;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001044.ogg":^"I know what Onii-chan's trying to say...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001045.ogg":^  He's telling me to look to the future and live, instead of being stuck in the past, right?!"^\

bg new_chess2,22
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「そうだ。@それを戦人は、@この最後のゲームを以ってそなたに伝えるつもりだった。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700765.ogg":^"Correct.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700766.ogg":^  Battler wanted to use this final game ^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700767.ogg":^to show you that."^\

se1v 1100,100
se2 12
quakey 2,300
