langjp「本来は、そなたに与えた鍵にて、そなたに未来を選ばせるゲームだった。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700779.ogg":^"At first, this was supposed to be a game in which you were given a key.  A key that would let you decide your future."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_d11_ikari1.png",80
advsetwindow "70"

langjp「嘘だわ。@こうして礼拝堂に隠して、私にはあんたたちの望む、前向きな未来の扉とやらでも選ばせるつもりだったんでしょう。@……そんなのは選択じゃない！　押し付けだわ！！」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001061.ogg":^"Liar.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001062.ogg":^  You wanted to hide the truth in this chapel, then make me choose a door that leads to some optimistic future.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001063.ogg":^  ...That's not a choice!  You're trying to decide for me!!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_1_majime3star.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「親は子の選択肢から、不適当なものを間引く権利を有す。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700780.ogg":^"Parents have the right to prevent their children from making unsuitable choices."^\

se1v 2,100
_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_d21_komaru4.png",1
quakey 2,200
advsetwindow "70"

langjp「私は子供じゃないわ！！@　自分で考えて行動できる、１８歳の女よ…！！」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001064.ogg":^"I'm not a kid!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001065.ogg":^  I'm an eighteen-year-old woman, who can think and act for herself...!!"^\

se1v 2,100
_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_akuwarai4.png",1
quakey 2,200
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「たわけがッ！！@　過去のこと以外、何も考えることが出来ぬ６歳の小娘であろうが！！」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700781.ogg":^"Fool!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700782.ogg":^  You're just a six-year-old girl, who can't think of anything except the past!!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_d11_ikari2.png",80
advsetwindow "70"

langjp「誰のせいでよッ！！@　あんたのせいで、……私はいつまでも６歳のままなんじゃない！！@　真実を覆い隠すあんたの幻想を、今こそ打ち破るッ！！@　そうね、思えばあんたは、今こうして礼拝堂に私を閉じ込めてるんじゃない！@　１９８６年のあの日から、ずっとずっと……、私はあんたのせいで孤独で誰も真実を教えてくれない密室に閉じ込められているのよ！！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001066.ogg":^"And whose fault is that?!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001067.ogg":^  Because of you, ...I've been stuck as a six-year-old all this time!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001068.ogg":^  Now it's time for me to tear apart your illusion covering the truth!!^\:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001069.ogg":^  Yes, now that I think about it, it's not this chapel that you've locked me inside!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001070.ogg":^  Since that day in 1986, for all these years, you've had me locked away in a closed room where I'm all alone, and where no one will tell me the truth!!"^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "70"

langjp「あんたの密室を、……今こそ、私は自らの手でッ、打ち破る！！@　……あぁ、駄目ね、全然駄目だわ。@わかったわ、あんたの完全密室のトリック！！@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001071.ogg":^"And now, ...I'll tear your closed room apart with my own hands!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001072.ogg":^  ...Yeah, it's useless, it's all useless.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001073.ogg":^  I know the trick to your perfect closed room!!^@/
mbg white,1
se1v 2,100
bg black,0
mcbg 22
advsetwindow "70"
langjp　復唱要求ッ！！@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001074.ogg":^  Repeat it!!^@/
