advsetwindow "70"
langjp　“私を密室に閉じ込めてから、直ちにあんたは私を殺害している！”」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001075.ogg":^  `You murdered me immediately after shutting me into this closed room!'"^\
advsetwindow "27"


