langjp「…………！@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700783.ogg":^"......!^@/
se1 1100
advsetwindow "27"
langjp　拒否する。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700784.ogg":^  I refuse."^\

bg black,22
bg new_barrier1,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_d11_fuman2.png",22
advsetwindow "70"

langjp「そうよ。@……あんたは、私を１８年掛けて殺すのよ。@ありがとう、ベアトリーチェ。@……それを思い出させてくれたお陰で、あんたが私を殺す密室殺人のトリックがわかったわ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001076.ogg":^"Of course.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001077.ogg":^  ...You've been killing me for 18 years.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001078.ogg":^  Thanks, Beatrice.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001079.ogg":^  ...If you hadn't reminded me, I wouldn't have figured out the trick."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_aseru1.png",24
advsetwindow "27"
langjp「…………縁寿。@そなたは未来ある若者だ。@そして、未来に生きる黄金の魔女ではないか。@ならば未来にて生きよ。@過去の真実にどれほどの価値がある？@　そなたが自ら生み出すそなたの未来の真実の方が、よほど価値があるだろうに…！！」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700785.ogg":^"...Ange,^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700786.ogg":^ you are young, and you have a long future ahead of you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700787.ogg":^  In fact, you are the Golden Witch who lives in the future, are you not?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700788.ogg":^  Then live on in the future.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700789.ogg":^  Just how much are past truths really worth?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700790.ogg":^  Don't they pale in comparison to the truth of the future, the truth you'll create yourself...?!!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_d11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "70"

langjp「私の人生なんてクズよ。@家族は私を残してみんな死んだわ。@だから、一なる真実を手土産に、私はみんなのところに帰るの。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001080.ogg":^"My life is trash.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001081.ogg":^  My whole family died, leaving just me behind.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001082.ogg":^  That's why I'm going back to them once I've gotten my Single Truth."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_iiwake3.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「真実を知れば、家族の死を受け入れることになるだけだぞ…！@　ひょっとしたら、家族の誰かが生き延びていて、再会できるかもしれない奇跡に託して生き延びようとは思わぬのか…！」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700791.ogg":^"If you learn the truth, you'll just have to accept your family's deaths...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700792.ogg":^  Haven't you ever thought about living on, hoping that by some miracle, one of them might have survived?  And that someday, you might get a chance to see them again...?!"^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_d11_fuman2.png",80
advsetwindow "70"

langjp「安心して。@奇跡の魔女でさえ、そのカケラを見つけられなかったから。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001083.ogg":^"I'm not worried about that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001084.ogg":^  Even the Witch of Miracles couldn't find a Fragment like that."^\

bg new_sea_1cf,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　六軒島の大爆発で、親族の遺体はほとんど発見されなかった。@
langen^In the Great Rokkenjima Explosion, almost none of the family's remains were recovered.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br

langjp　それはひょっとしたら、……爆発を逃れて生き残ったことを示すのかもしれないと、それを生きる糧にした日もあった。@
langen^Some days, ...I hoped that this might be a sign that they had escaped the explosion and survived.^\^  That hope gave me the strength to live on.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　しかし、それだけを糧にするには、１２年は長過ぎる。\
langen^However, that hope wasn't strong enough to support me for 12 long years.^\

