langjp「……それを読めば、そなたはベルンカステルとの契約により、死ぬのであろうが…。@………死ぬために真実を知るのか？@　馬鹿げている…！！」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700797.ogg":^"...If you read that, then by your contract with Bernkastel, you will die...^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700798.ogg":^  ...Learning the truth just to die?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700799.ogg":^  Ridiculous...!!"^\

bg new_cha_i1n,23

_ld c,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_d31_komaru3.png",23
advsetwindow "70"

langjp「そうよ。@私は死ぬために真実を求めてるの。@……死に方くらい、私に選ばせて。@………私も馬鹿じゃない。@……本当の私はきっと、………あの、地上の星空の宙に、浮かんでいるのよ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001103.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001104.ogg":^  I'm looking for the truth so I can die.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001105.ogg":^  ...At least let me choose how I go.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001106.ogg":^  ...I'm not an idiot.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001107.ogg":^  ...I know the real me is still floating in that starry sky."^\

bg new_cit_2a,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　ベルンカステルは、私を最後のベアトリーチェだと認め、１９８６年の真実を知る旅に私を招いた。@
langen^Bernkastel acknowledged me as the final Beatrice and invited me on a journey to learn the truth of 1986.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　ここには二度と戻って来られない。@
langen^I won't be able to return here again.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そう告げて、ビルの屋上から漆黒の中空へ歩み出すベルンカステルの背中を追って、……私も中空へ足を踏み出した。\
langen^When Bernkastel told me that and walked off the roof into the black sky, ...I followed her into the empty air.^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　それが、契約。@
langjp　私はベルンカステルに２つを望んだ。@
langen^That was the contract.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^I wanted two things from Bernkastel.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　１つは家族が誰か帰ってきて欲しい。\
langjp　もう１つは、……復讐。@
langen^One was for someone from my family to come back.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^The other...was revenge.^@

bg new_different_spiral_1a,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　あの日に何があったのかを覆い隠す、魔女幻想を打ち破るということ。@即ち、真実に至るということ。\
langen^I wanted to destroy the Illusion of the Witch that hid the events of that day.^@^  I wanted to reach the truth.^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　しかし、最初の願いは叶えられない。@
langen^However, the first of my wishes couldn't come true.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　だって、奇跡の魔女でさえ、私の家族が帰ってくるというカケラを見つけられなかった。\
langen^After all, even the Witch of Miracles couldn't find a Fragment where my family came home.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　だから、彼女は無言で私に問い掛けたのだ。@
langen^So, she wordlessly questioned me.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　家族の誰かが帰ってくるかもしれないからと、いつまでも亡霊のように生き続ける、この無駄な生を終わらせる勇気を持たない限り、真実には至れないと。\
langen^She told me that I couldn't reach the truth unless I had the courage to end this worthless life, ^@^where I lived like a ghost, hoping someone might come back.^\

bg new_cit_2a,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　だから、彼女は中空に歩み出し、私にその後を追わせた。@
langen^So, she walked out into the open air, and I followed her.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そう、今だからこそ理解できる。@
langjp　私は自らの命と引き換えに、……ベルンカステルにあの日、１つのことを願い、１つのことを諦めたのだ。\
langen^Yes, now I can understand.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^When I offered to trade away my life, I made one wish and gave up on another.^\

bg black,22
bg new_different_space_2a,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　願ったのは、真実を覆い隠す幻想への、復讐。@
langen^I wished for revenge against the illusion hiding the truth.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そして今こそ私は幻想の主、黄金の魔女を打ち破って一なる真実の書を手に入れ、その復讐を成し遂げた。\
langen^And now, I've succeeded in that revenge, defeating the master of that illusion and obtaining the Book of the Single Truth.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

;bg different_space_2b,22

langjp　諦めたのは、家族が誰か帰ってくるかもしれないと信じ続ける、甘えた心。@
langen^What I gave up was my naivety, my continuing belief that someone from my family might come back.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　だからこそ私は、今こそこうして、家族が皆、死んでしまったことを受け入れることが出来る。\
langen^And now, I can accept that my entire family is dead.^\

bg black,22
bg new_cha_i1n,0

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_d11_nayamu1.png",22
advsetwindow "70"
langjp「……知らなきゃ生きてることに出来るの？@　あんたたちの言う猫箱というのは、死体を隠せば生きていることにしてもいいという、甘えた妄想だけがたった一つのトリック！@　でもね、隠したって、死んでいることは変わらないのよ…！！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001108.ogg":^"...Can you make someone alive just because no one knows any different?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001109.ogg":^  These cat boxes you talk about are just naive delusions.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001110.ogg":^  The idea that a corpse can live as long as you keep it hidden!  But even if you hide a corpse, it's still dead...!!"^\

cl r,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_d11_ikari1.png",24
advsetwindow "70"
langjp「遠いお空の国で、いつまでも見守っているなんて、そんなおとぎ話みたいなので私の傷が塞げると、本気で思っているの？！@　私は真実の魔女、エンジェ・ベアトリーチェ！！@　起こらぬ奇跡を待って亡霊のように生きる日々から、私は真実に至った高潔なる殉教者として生を終えるのよ…！！」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001111.ogg":^"Do you really think you can heal my wounds by saying they'll always be watching over me from the clouds, like some kind of fairy tale?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001112.ogg":^  I'm ANGE Beatrice, a Witch of Truth!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001113.ogg":^  I'll free myself from that life as a ghost, waiting for a miracle that'll never happen!  I'll end my life as a noble martyr who's reached the truth...!!"^\

bg black,22
bg new_cha_i1i,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a12_gaman7.png",22
_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a12_gaman6.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「……そなたは真里亞の魔導書より、魔法の力を理解したのではなかったのか……。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700800.ogg":^"...Didn't you once come to understand the power of magic through Maria's grimoire...?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_d11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "70"

langjp「えぇ。@理解したわ。@そして何て無力なものだろうと絶望したわ。@……そしてそれが、お兄ちゃんが私に押し付けようとしていることなのよね。@……私が信じれば、魔法があれば、……いつだって、家族は私の側にいる。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001114.ogg":^"Yeah,^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001115.ogg":^ I understood it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001116.ogg":^  And then I despaired when I realized how powerless it was.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001117.ogg":^  ...And that's what Onii-chan is trying to force me to use now, isn't it?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001118.ogg":^  ...If I believe, if I use magic, ...then my family will always be by my side."^\

