langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001119.ogg":^"...Don't take me for a fool!!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001120.ogg":^  You think that kind of magic, an illusion, a daydream...can heal those 12 years?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001121.ogg":^  And how am I supposed to go on for decades and decades into the future?!^\/
