;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001122.ogg":^  Someone, come back to me, someone!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001123.ogg":^  But no one's coming back!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001124.ogg":^  So, at least tell me what happened that day!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001125.ogg":^  Bernkastel said she'd tell me...!!"^\


