langjp「グッド！！@　しかし縁寿さんは探偵ではありません。@あの子にとって真実はゴール。@……幸薄き人生に終わりを告げる終止符です。@これであの子はようやく、生を終える最後の禊を終えた…！！@　死ぬために、たった一つの真実に拘る一夜限りのッ、@地上に叩きつけられて死ぬまでのほんのわずかな時間だけの、仮初の真実の魔女！！」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500107.ogg":^"<Good>!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500108.ogg":^  But Ange-san isn't a detective.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500109.ogg":^  To her, the truth itself is the finish line.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500110.ogg":^  ...A way to mark the end of her unhappy life.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500111.ogg":^  Now, she's finally finished the final purification ceremony...!!^\:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500112.ogg":^  She's a one-night Witch of Truth, focused on learning a certain Single Truth before she dies!^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500113.ogg":^  A temporary witch for the short time until she slams against the ground!!"^\

cl l,0
