langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101180.ogg":^"I won't let Ange die!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101181.ogg":^  No matter how tough it gets, she has to live!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101182.ogg":^  That's the only thing all of us want...!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101183.ogg":^  If she lives, all sorts of magic and miracles would be possible...!!"^\


