langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300024.ogg":^"As a single human, I want to ask.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300025.ogg":^  ...Is learning a sin?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300026.ogg":^  Is living in ignorance the only way we can have hopes and dreams...?!"^\


