;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\85400068.ogg":^"...Both living with knowledge and living in ignorance have their benefits, as well as their shortcomings.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\85400069.ogg":^  You're even free to choose which path you take.^@:dwave 0, "voice\54\85400070.ogg":^  ......That's what makes Humans powerless."^\

