;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300031.ogg":^"I'm the one hope held by Beatrices of a million worlds.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300032.ogg":^  ...So, even at times like this, I have to be everyone's hope.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300033.ogg":^  I'm not giving up on this game yet."^\

