langjp「そうですっ。@私たちの時だって、あの恐ろしい猫の群れの中で死を覚悟したではありませんか…！@　でもラムダデルタさんが助けてくれました…！@　もし、奇跡を信じずに諦めていたら、私たちは助けられる前に、虚無に消えていたに違いない。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300035.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300036.ogg":^  After all, last time, when we were surrounded by that pack of terrifying cats, we were prepared for death, weren't we...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300037.ogg":^  But Lambdadelta-san saved us...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300038.ogg":^  If we had given up, if we hadn't had the strength to believe in a miracle, then I'm sure we would've been erased before help could come."^\

