advsetwindow "53"

langjp「………戦人くんたちが言ってました。@……縁寿ちゃんは、自分の命と引き換えに、真実を得る契約をしたと。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300039.ogg":^"...Battler-kun told us.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300040.ogg":^  ...He said Ange-chan made a contract, by which she would learn the truth in exchange for her own life."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai3.png",24

/
advsetwindow "29"
langjp「さっきのあんたたちの話によるなら、それは契約じゃないわね。@……だって、人は死ぬために真実を求めて生きてるんでしょ？@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200180.ogg":^"Going by your conversation just now, that was no contract.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200181.ogg":^  ...After all, living and seeking the truth so they can die is what humans do anyway, right?^@/
bg new_blood_1ar,22
advsetwindow "29"
langjp　つまり縁寿は、自分の生の全てを真実を得るために費やした。@……それを一瞬の時間に、ベルンが凝縮しただけのことだわ。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200182.ogg":^  In other words, Ange has spent all of her life trying to learn the truth.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200183.ogg":^  ...All Bern did was shorten that time to a single instant."^\
advsetwindow "53"

;bg black,22
;bg mhal_2a,0
;ld l,RIO_DefA1,22

langjp「……縁寿ちゃんは、夢も希望もなくしたから、自らの命を軽んじてしまった。@………彼女に、どうやったら夢や希望を与えられるんですか。@……どうやったら、生きることに意味を見出させることが出来るんですか。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300041.ogg":^"...When Ange-chan lost her hopes and dreams, she stopped valuing her own life.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300042.ogg":^  ...How can she be given hopes and dreams again?^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300043.ogg":^  ...What can be done to help her find a reason for living?"^\

bg black,22
bg new_mhal_2br,22
;gggg
_ld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_futeki2.png",23
advsetwindow "29"
langjp「……それ、私に聞いてんのー？@　私、パーよ？@　それも二回転捻りの入ったクルクル超パー。@難しい話されてもわかんないわー。」@
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200184.ogg":^"...Are you asking me?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200185.ogg":^  I'm paper, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200186.ogg":^  Double-twisted, curly super-paper.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200187.ogg":^  I don't understand complicated stuff."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　ラムダデルタは、残りわずかのポップコーンを、ざらっと口に放り込むと、空っぽのカップを虚無の奈落に放る…。\
langen^After tossing the last bits of popcorn into her mouth, Lambdadelta threw the empty cup into the abyss of nothingness...^\

;bg black,22

;bg mhal_2aN,0
;ld c,LAM_AkuwaraiA1,80
bg black,22
bg new_cit_2a,22
advsetwindow "29"
;ld c,BER_DefA1,22

langjp「……ベルンがあの子を唆したわけじゃないわ。@ベルンは、縁寿にチャンスを与えた。@いえ、選択肢を与えたと言うべき？@　そして縁寿はその選択肢の中から自ら選んでゲーム盤に現れ、……そして今、戦人とのゲームで再び、自ら選択肢を選んでる。@/
langjp……あの子のゲームは、最初から最後までずっと、あの子のものよ。@私は今、それをのんびりと観劇しているわ。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200188.ogg":^"...Bern wasn't really pushing that kid to do something she didn't want.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200189.ogg":^  She was giving Ange a chance.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200190.ogg":^  Or should I call it a choice?^\:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200191.ogg":^  Then, Ange made the choice she wanted, appeared on the game board, ...and now, in her game against Battler, she's making her own choices again.^@/
advsetwindow "29"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200192.ogg":^  ...From start to finish, Ange's game has always belonged to Ange.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200193.ogg":^  Right now, I'm just a casual observer."^\

bg black,22
bg new_mhal_h2a,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\wil\1\wil_a11_nayamu1.png",22
advsetwindow "54"

langjp「………観劇に熱中している、というわけでもなさそうだな。」@
;＜ウィル
langen:dwave 0, "voice\54\85400076.ogg":^"...So, not a particularly enthusiastic observer."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_futeki3.png",26
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「まーね。@先の見えちゃったお芝居だし。@……だから、そろそろお暇しようかな〜って思ってたところよ。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200194.ogg":^"Maybe.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200195.ogg":^  It's a play with an obvious ending.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200196.ogg":^  ...So, I've decided I might as well take my leave."^\

cl l,24
_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_majime1.png",24
advsetwindow "53"
langjp「……先が見えたと感じたら、あなたはそのお芝居を見るのをやめるのですか。@ひょっとしたら、あなたが想像しないようなクライマックスを迎えるかもしれないのに？」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300044.ogg":^"...You mean you'll stop watching a play just because you think you know how it will end?^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300045.ogg":^  Even though it might reach a climax you didn't expect?"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai3.png",80
