langjp　ラムダデルタは塩のついた指をぺろりと舐める。@
langjp　そして挑発的に理御を睨んで、にやりと笑う。\
langen^Lambdadelta licked her salty fingers.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Then, she stared at Lion challengingly and grinned.^\

bg black,23
