langjp「縁寿ちゃんのゲームは、……絶対にこれで終わりません。@……必ず、戦人くんの気持ちが通じます。@……彼女に、より良い未来を生きて欲しいという気持ちが伝わり、……彼女が自らそれを選択する。@………必ず、絶対、そういう物語になります。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300046.ogg":^"I know...that Ange's game won't end this way.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300047.ogg":^  ...I know Battler-kun's feelings will reach her.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300048.ogg":^  ...She'll understand that he wants her to live in a better future, ...and she'll choose that future of her own accord.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300049.ogg":^  ...I'm certain that's how this tale will end."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_majime3.png",23
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「……へぇ…？@　この絶対の魔女ラムダデルタに、あんたが絶対を保証するの…？」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200198.ogg":^"...Huh...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200199.ogg":^  Are you talking to me, the Witch of Certainty, and saying that the outcome is certain...?"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a12_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「そうです。@私が、絶対に保証します。@……縁寿ちゃんのゲームは、このままでは終わりません。@だから、席を立たないで下さい。@そして、私たちも立ちません。@私たちに出来ることは、必ずあります。@そしてそれが必ず、………彼女をより良き未来へ誘う。@……この物語は必ずハッピーエンドになります。@だから、最後まで見届けて下さい。@お願いします。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300050.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300051.ogg":^  I guarantee it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300052.ogg":^  ...Ange-chan's game won't end like this.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300053.ogg":^  So please, don't leave your seat.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300054.ogg":^   We won't leave either.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300055.ogg":^  There must be something we can do.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300056.ogg":^  And...that will surely lead her to a better future.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300057.ogg":^  ...This tale will definitely have a happy ending.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300058.ogg":^  So keep watching until the end.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300059.ogg":^  I beg you."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「…………………………。@……私、絶対の魔女として、この物語にハッピーエンドはなーいって宣言しちゃってるんだけど〜…？」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200200.ogg":^"......^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200201.ogg":^...Even though I've already announced as the Witch of Certainty that this tale won't have a happy ending...?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「ハッピーエンドの定義なんて、観る人それぞれが決めることでしょう？」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\85300060.ogg":^"The definition of a happy ending is something everyone watching gets to decide for themselves, right?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

