langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200203.ogg":^"Well, I have nowhere better to be.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200204.ogg":^  ...Sure, I'll stick around a bit longer.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200205.ogg":^  If you get me some more popcorn, that is.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200206.ogg":^  I'm feeling like caramel flavor this time."^\

