langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200207.ogg":^"Okay.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200208.ogg":^  If you'll guarantee your own flavor of happy ending with certainty,^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200209.ogg":^ ...then I, the great Lambdadelta, will stick around for a while longer.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200210.ogg":^  See how big my heart is?!^@/
