;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001151.ogg":^"But we're the main characters.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001152.ogg":^  ...I am, and so are you."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_akuwarai1.png",22
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「そうです。@神々の物語に記されることがなくとも。@……私たちが記す自らの物語の主人公は、常に自分なんです。@………それを自覚できるか出来ないかが、魔女とニンゲンをわける最初の分かれ道。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500159.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500160.ogg":^  Even if the tale of the gods doesn't mention us,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500161.ogg":^ ...we're always the main characters in the stories we write for ourselves.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500162.ogg":^  ......Becoming aware of that fact is the first thing that separates witches from Humans."^\

