advsetwindow "70"

langjp「そうよ。@だから、死ぬの。@……もういいじゃない。@１２年も余計に生きたのよ。@そんな私に最期の瞬間くらい、願いを叶えてくれる魔女が現れてもいいとは思わない？」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001169.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001170.ogg":^  So, I'll die.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001171.ogg":^  ...Hasn't it been long enough?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001172.ogg":^  I've already lived 12 years too long.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001173.ogg":^  Don't I at least deserve to have a witch appear and grant my wish in my final moments?"^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_a11_akire1.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

