;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500189.ogg":^"...The Book of the Single Truth, huh?^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500190.ogg":^  Of course, I'm also dying to find out what's in it,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500191.ogg":^ but from what I hear, it doesn't sound like the truth inside is something spectacular enough to mark the end of your life with."^\

