langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001179.ogg":^"Yeah.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001180.ogg":^  ...At first, I hoped there would be something earth-shattering in it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001181.ogg":^  But now, ...I've calmed down, I guess you could say."^\


