;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500192.ogg":^"Any truth searched for by a worthless person is bound to be worthless.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500193.ogg":^  It'll probably make for a fitting end to your worthless life."^\

