langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500206.ogg":^"Great Witches from the Senate, Voyager witches who are trying to escape boredom in their endless travels,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500207.ogg":^ powerful witches who have woken from century-long sleeps, as well as witches who control the future world and noble witch hunters.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500208.ogg":^  It seems she's planning to hold a grand party tonight."^\
