;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001200.ogg":^"...Everyone in that huge crowd that looks like a packed freeway is going to one dinner party?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001201.ogg":^  ...I'm not sure what's stronger, my shock at how famous Beatrice is, or my revulsion at those sleazebags."^\
