langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500219.ogg":^"For you, the Book of the Single Truth is nothing more than an end.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500220.ogg":^  ......However, for all of those enjoying the mystery of Rokkenjima, this is an event that can't be missed."^\
