langjp「……ヤツらが攻撃を開始したら、戦う必要はない。@すぐに黄金郷に逃げ込め。@扉は閉めなくていい。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101216.ogg":^"...When they begin their attack, don't worry about fighting them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101217.ogg":^  Escape to the Golden Land as soon as they start.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101218.ogg":^  Don't worry about closing the door."^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_odoroki1.png",24
