langjp「久々よねっ、こんなスリル！@　まさか魔女にもなって、こんなハラハラした目に遭うなんて、夢にも思わなかったわ。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200223.ogg":^"I haven't had a thrill like this for years!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200224.ogg":^  Hard to believe I'd find myself in such a tense situation, even after becoming a witch."^\

bgm1 192

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_majime2.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「それで…！@　縁寿やベルンカステルたちは一体どこに…！」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101221.ogg":^"Let's get down to business...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101222.ogg":^  Where the heck are Ange and Bernkastel...?!"^\

cl c,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_futeki1.png",23
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「図書の都よ。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200225.ogg":^"They're in the City of Books."^\

mcl c,0
bg new_rose_2bp,24
_ld l,":b;sprites\wal\1\wal_a11_komaru1.png",24
advsetwindow "30"

langjp「……聞いたことがあります。@……海を渡る偉大なる魔女たちが集めた、様々なカケラを書物に記し保管した地があると。」@
;＜ワルギリア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\83200023.ogg":^"...I've heard of it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\83200024.ogg":^  ...They say it's a place where great witches--travelers of the sea--store countless Fragments in the form of books."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ron\1\ron_a11_def2.png",24
advsetwindow "31"

langjp「尊厳なる観劇と戯曲と傍観の魔女により厳選されし名誉ある図書の都、ですな。」\
;＜ロノウェ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\83100032.ogg":^"You mean the Great Witch of Theatergoing, Drama, and Spectating's Noble City of Carefully Selected Books, yes?"^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_1_majime6.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「大アウローラ卿は図書の都の主だ。@なるほど、妥当な場所であるな。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700816.ogg":^"The Great Lady Aurora is the ruler of the City of Books.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700817.ogg":^  Indeed, that would be a fitting place for those two to go."^\

mcl c,0
bg new_rose_3ap,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a12_warai2.png",23
advsetwindow "32"

langjp「しかし、さすがはラムダデルタ卿ね。@……無数に想定された隠れ家から、こんなにも早く居場所を突き止められるなんて。」\
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\83700027.ogg":^"Nice going, Lady Lambdadelta.^@:dwave 0, "voice\32\83700028.ogg":^  ...Hard to believe you could pick out that spot so quickly from all the other possible hiding places."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_futeki3.png",24
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「それがね。簡単にわかっちゃったわ。@……わかるも何も、向こうで大々的に宣伝をしているわ。@無限の魔女、大ベアトリーチェ卿の猫箱の秘密、大公開パーティーってね。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200226.ogg":^"Actually, it was pretty easy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200227.ogg":^  ...I didn't even have to search, since they're advertising it as loud as they can.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200228.ogg":^  They're planning a huge party to celebrate the announcement of a great secret.  The secret to the cat box of the Great Lady Beatrice, the Endless Witch."^\

;cl l,24
_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_futeki2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「………ふっ。@なるほどな、ヤツらがまだ攻めて来ぬ理由は、援軍待ちではなく、パーティーの式次第のせいらしいぞ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700818.ogg":^"......Hmph.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700819.ogg":^  I see, they haven't been delaying their attack because they await reinforcements, but because the party has not yet begun."^\

bg black,23
bg new_rose_2bp,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b22_komaru2.png",23
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「そのパーティーとやらで、縁寿の鍵を使って、一なる真実の書を公開する、ということなのか。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101223.ogg":^"So, in this party, they plan to use Ange's key and reveal the contents of the Book of the Single Truth?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai3.png",23
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「そういうことね。@アウローラは久しぶりのイベントなんで、各界から賓客を集めて大パーティーを催してるわ。@……一なる真実の書は、そのパーティーの最後の目玉になるでしょうね。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200229.ogg":^"You've got it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200230.ogg":^  Aurora hasn't held an event like this for ages, and she's gathering VIP guests from all over the place.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200231.ogg":^  ...The Book of the Single Truth will probably be the party's final showpiece."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_niramu1.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「……縁寿と鍵を取り戻すチャンスは、まだあるってことか。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101224.ogg":^"...That means we still have a shot at taking Ange and the key back."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「時間的猶予という意味ではね？@　ただ、とてもシンプルかつ当然な問題が。」@
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200232.ogg":^"Time-wise, that may be true.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200233.ogg":^  However, there's a really simple and obvious problem."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_majime2.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「何だっ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101225.ogg":^"What?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_majime3.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「図書の都は元老院の管理下にある聖域よ？@　神聖な結界が張られている。@元老院の魔女以外は踏み入ることさえ出来ない。」@
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200234.ogg":^"The City of Books is a sacred realm under the supervision of the Senate.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200235.ogg":^  It's protected by a holy barrier.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200236.ogg":^  Only a witch of the Senate can enter it."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_majime2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「……パーティーの招待客には、元老院に席を持たぬ者もいるのでは？」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700820.ogg":^"...Have they invited any non-Senators to the party?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「えぇ、いるわ。@そういう連中には、特別に聖域に踏み入ることを許可する“招待状”が与えられてるみたい。\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200237.ogg":^"They have.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200238.ogg":^  It looks like they're being given special `invitations', which allow them to enter the sacred realm for a limited time.^\

bg new_rose_3ap,24
_ld r,":b;sprites\gap\1\gap_a11_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "32"

langjp「……招待状。」@
;＜ガァプ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\32\83700029.ogg":^"...Invitations."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ron\1\ron_a11_akuwarai1.png",23
advsetwindow "31"

langjp「これはこれは、……面白くなってきましたな。」\
;＜ロノウェ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\31\83100033.ogg":^"My, my, ...now this could be interesting."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_futeki3.png",26
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「と、私も思ったわよ…！@　ところがこの招待状、遅刻厳禁で、パーティー開始時刻までに入場受付をしてないと自動的に効果を失う優れモノ！@　そしてお気の毒なことに、ついさっき、パーティーは始まっちゃったわ。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200239.ogg":^"That's what I thought...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200240.ogg":^  However, there's a strict policy on punctuality, so these invitations automatically become useless unless you present them before the party begins!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200241.ogg":^  And, I'm afraid to say...that the party started a short while ago."^\

cl l,24
_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_futeki2.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「つまり、遅刻した来客の誰かから招待状を奪うという手は、もう手遅れということか。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700821.ogg":^"In other words, it's too late to try stealing an invitation from a guest who's running late."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_majime2.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「そーいうこと。@……で、どーすんの？　これから！@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200242.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200243.ogg":^  ...So, what do we do now?!^@/

