;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\81200106.ogg":^"So, we're stuck defending the Alamo."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\kir\1\kir_a11_majime1.png",24
advsetwindow "09"

langjp「私たちに降伏はない。@……出来るのは、一分一秒でも持ち堪えて、奇跡が起こるのを待つことだけね。」\
;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300094.ogg":^"Surrender isn't an option.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\81300095.ogg":^  ...We can only hold out as long as we can, waiting for a miracle."^\


