;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400221.ogg":^"There is a chance, maybe one in a million,^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400222.ogg":^ ...that Ange will change her mind for some reason and come back."^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\kin\1\kin_a11_warai2.png",24
