;＜熊沢
langen:dwave 0, "voice\18\81800084.ogg":^"Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\81800085.ogg":^  ...This right here is the only place Ange-san can call home.^@:dwave 0, "voice\18\81800086.ogg":^  So, we must defend it to the last minute, waiting for her to come back."^\

