;＜郷田
langen:dwave 0, "voice\17\81700099.ogg":^"Awaiting the return of one's master is a servant's duty...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\17\81700100.ogg":^  N-N-N-Now that we are here, I, Gohda, am prepared for whatever may come...!"^\

