langjp「馬鹿言ってんじゃないわよッ、あんたたち正気ィ？@　……私がたった１人で！@　あそこへもう一度侵入してッ。@縁寿を連れ戻して来いっての？！」@
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200254.ogg":^"Enough kidding around!  Are you people crazy?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200255.ogg":^  ...You're telling me to go, all by myself,^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200256.ogg":^ and sneak into there one more time,^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200257.ogg":^ and then bring Ange back out here?!"^\
