advsetwindow "29"

langjp「勘違いしないでくれるゥ？！@　私は観客よ、観客！！/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200266.ogg":^"Please, stop getting the wrong idea!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200267.ogg":^  I'm a spectator, ...a spectator!!^@/

se2 12
quakey 2,200
advsetwindow "29"

langjp@　ベアトに招かれて、そのゲームを見物に来ただけの客人よ？！@　その私が、何であんたたちのために、命まで賭けなきゃなんないわけぇ？！@　縁寿が帰ってきたらハッピーエンド？！@　馬鹿じゃない？！@　怒り狂ったベルンとその軍勢が、一気に雪崩れ込んできて、ブチっと潰されて御仕舞いじゃない？！」\
langen@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200268.ogg":^  I'm just a guest who was invited by Beato to come and watch this game!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200269.ogg":^  So why should I risk my life for you people?!^\:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200270.ogg":^  You think you'll get a happy ending if Ange comes back?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200271.ogg":^  Are you really that stupid?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200272.ogg":^  Bern and her forces will come sweeping through here, mad with rage, and wipe us all out!"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_futeki1.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「私がここにいる理由はたった一つよ！@　それは面白い物語が見られると、そこの理御に啖呵を切られたから！！」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200273.ogg":^"There's only one reason I'm here, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200274.ogg":^and that's because Lion over there said I'd get to see an interesting show!!"^\

cl c,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai5.png",23
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「えぇ、そして、私はもうじき、最高に面白い物語が見られることを信じて疑わないわ…！@　それは背水の陣でベルンの軍勢と戦って、ひとりまたひとりと散っていく悲しい悲しい物語！@　全員に散り際の見せ場がありそうだもんね？！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200275.ogg":^"Yeah, and now I'm sure I'll get to see a sublimely interesting tale very soon...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200276.ogg":^  A sad, sad tragedy as you fight desperately against Bern's forces and get wiped out one by one!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200277.ogg":^  Oh, I'm sure you'll each get one last time to shine as you're torn apart!"^\

cl r,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai6.png",24
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「それを間近でもうじき観劇できるのよ？！@　あんたたちはもうじき、みんな死ぬのッ！！@　でも私は違う！@　私は観客よ、客人よ！！@　あんたも一緒に死んでくれなんてッ、言われる筋合いはこれっぽっちもないンだからッ！！！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200278.ogg":^"If I just wait a little, I'll get to see all that, won't I?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200279.ogg":^  Pretty soon, all of you will be dead!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200280.ogg":^  But not me!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200281.ogg":^  I'm a spectator, a guest!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200282.ogg":^  There's absolutely no reason for me to die with you!!!"^\

