langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001224.ogg":^"I'm happy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001225.ogg":^  ...Yeah, now I can understand how Erika feels.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001226.ogg":^  ...It's like I'm taking a shot back at you, exposing the secret that you kept until your death."^\

