langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\KISHAA8001.ogg":^"Madam Hachijo, we now know that in your previous book signings, you were so determined not to show yourself that you even used a body double,^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\KISHAA8002.ogg":^ so what has caused you to change your mind and appear before us this time...?!"^\

