;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900120.ogg":^"The legend of the Rokkenjima witch has given birth to endless tales.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900121.ogg":^  ...Considering the weight of such a legend's demise, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900122.ogg":^and being the mere writer that I am, I felt obligated to show myself as a sign of respect."^\

