langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\KISHAB8001.ogg":^"As a Forger, you announced on the web that you had reached the truth!^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\KISHAB8002.ogg":^  Does that mean you've already read the contents of that diary?!"^\
