langjp「まずは私の自己紹介から。@私は八城幾子。@親しげに幾子と呼んでくれても、他人行儀に八城さんと呼んでくれても構いません。」@
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900144.ogg":^"To start off, let me introduce myself.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900145.ogg":^  I'm Hachijo Ikuko.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900146.ogg":^  Feel free to casually call me Ikuko, or act more formal and call me Hachijo-san."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……八城、………幾子。\
langen^...Hachijo...Ikuko.^\

;ld c,FEA_DefA2,80
mbg new_fea_r1e,22
advsetwindow "56"

langjp「八城家はこの辺りではちょっと知られた大地主の名家。@……出来のいい兄たちと違い、私はどこかズレた変わり者。@色々と悪さが過ぎまして、とうとう親たちからも愛想を尽かされて追い出され。@今はここで蟄居をさせられています。@……趣味は推理小説を読むことと、そして書くこと。@歳は秘密の独身女。@心は女子でも、そろそろそれを語るにはおこがましいかなという年頃です。@ふっふふふふ。」\
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900147.ogg":^"The Hachijo family owns a large amount of land and is fairly famous in these parts.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900148.ogg":^  ...Unlike my accomplished brothers, I'm what you might call a little eccentric.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900149.ogg":^  I got into a bit too much mischief, and my parents finally ran out of patience and kicked me out.^\:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900150.ogg":^  I'm now confined to this house.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900151.ogg":^  ...As a hobby, I like to read detective novels...and also to write them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900152.ogg":^  My age...is a single woman's secret.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900153.ogg":^  My heart is that of a girl, but I'm approaching the point where calling myself one becomes increasingly absurd.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900154.ogg":^  Heheheheh."^\

