langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900183.ogg":^"Of course not!  Why are you apologizing...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900184.ogg":^  I'm just shocked, that's all.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900185.ogg":^  Your detailed opinions are worthy of praise, I believe...^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900186.ogg":^  It seems you have some talent as a critic or a detective novel writer too."^\
