;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900199.ogg":^"I like getting to hear your opinions.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900200.ogg":^  ......At any rate, I've finished writing the chapter.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900201.ogg":^  I'll go make some tea, so would you mind reading it again and sharing your thoughts with me?"^\
