langen^I turned on the light and looked out through a gap in the curtains.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^...As I'd thought, it was the sort of pouring rain that always reminded me of that day.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp「ひどい雨ですね。@風もひどい。@また雨どいが葉っぱで詰まらないといいのですが。」@
langjp「……先日掃除をさせましたから、当分は大丈夫でしょう。」\
;＜八城
langen^"It's raining pretty hard out there.^@^  The wind looks pretty strong too.^@^  I hope the rain gutters don't get clogged with leaves again."^\
