langjp「六軒島ミステリーの話は先日したでしょう。@これが今、ネットでブームになっているのです。@それを巡る議論や考察、中でも偽書が実に面白い。@……偽書というのは、付近の島に流れ着いた、右代宮真里亞の署名のあるボトルメッセージが、他にもあったと仮定して書いたもので……。」\
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900228.ogg":^"I told you about the Rokkenjima mystery a few days ago, remember?^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900229.ogg":^  It's been really huge on the net lately.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900230.ogg":^  The discussions, theories, and even the Forgeries have been quite entertaining.^\:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900231.ogg":^  ...Forgeries are stories, all based on the premise that yet another message bottle signed by Ushiromiya Maria existed and drifted to one of the nearby islands..."^\

