;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001289.ogg":^"No.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001290.ogg":^  I never really understood.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001291.ogg":^  ...Pitiful Maria onee-chan with her pitiful magic.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001292.ogg":^  ...That's all I thought of it...^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001293.ogg":^  ...So, ...I couldn't pick up a Fragment of happiness, couldn't even find one.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001294.ogg":^  ...You told me that yourself once, ...Onee-chan..."^\

