;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400225.ogg":^"...It can't be helped.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400226.ogg":^  It takes two to create a universe.^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400227.ogg":^  ...I had Beato, but you were all alone."^\

