;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001295.ogg":^"No.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001296.ogg":^  ...If I had called Aunt Eva `Mom', there would've been two of us.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001297.ogg":^  ...I'm sure I would've been able to create a new world with the same magic you used, Maria onee-chan."^\

