;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700839.ogg":^"...All of it is my fault.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700840.ogg":^  The message bottles I threw away half-jokingly distorted your future and wore you down.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700841.ogg":^  ...I bear responsibility for that."^\

