langjp「……そうね。@それもそうだわ、やっぱりあんたのせいだわ。」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001306.ogg":^"...True.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001307.ogg":^  That's right, it really is your fault after all."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_fukigen1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「むっ。@……素直にそう言われるとカチンと来るぞ。@……妾のせいだけでなく、やはりそなたも悪いのだっ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700845.ogg":^"Mu.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700846.ogg":^  ...Put that way, it's a little irritating.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700847.ogg":^  ...You do have your share of the blame as well."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_warai2.png",80
wait 500

bg black,22
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「……………………。@……えぇ、そうね。@あんたも悪いし、私も悪いわ。@……でも、お互い罵り合うのも馬鹿らしい。@……だって、私は未来の魔女。@あなたは過去の魔女。@……未来に生きる私は、その魔法で未来を築くべきなのよ。@……私たちはともに何らかの責任を負うけれど。@それを責める資格はどちらにもないわ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001308.ogg":^"......^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001309.ogg":^...Yeah, you're right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001310.ogg":^  You were at fault, and so was I.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001311.ogg":^  ...Still, it'd be stupid for us to attack each other.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001312.ogg":^  ...After all, I'm a witch of the future.^\:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001313.ogg":^  You're a witch of the past.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001314.ogg":^  ...I should be using that magic to build my future.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001315.ogg":^  ...We both bear responsibility in some way,^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001316.ogg":^ but neither of us has the right to blame the other."^\

bg new_rose_3ap,24
_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_a22_warai1.png",23
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「………縁寿なら。@マリアージュ・ソルシエールの教えを、きっと理解してくれると思ってたよ。」@
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400228.ogg":^"...I knew ^@:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400229.ogg":^you'd be able to understand Mariage Sorcière's teachings, Ange."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「そうね。@……私はマリアージュ・ソルシエールの最後の一人として、……お姉ちゃんの魔法を伝える義務があるわ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001317.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001318.ogg":^  ...As the final member of Mariage Sorcière, ...it's my responsibility to pass on Onee-chan's magic."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\mar\1\mar_a22_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "13"

langjp「真里亞の魔法は、みんなを幸せにする魔法なの。」@
;＜真里亞
langen:dwave 0, "voice\13\80400230.ogg":^"My magic can make everyone happy."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_warai2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「うむ…！@　清らかなる魔法も、邪悪なる魔法も思いのままよ…！」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700848.ogg":^"Indeed...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700849.ogg":^  You have both pure magic and wicked magic at your fingertips...!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_nayamu2.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「………本当ね。@魔法は、心の持ち方でまったく違う姿に変わる。@……正しい導きがなければ、正しい魔法は使えないわ。@……そして、正しい魔法は、人を幸福に導くわ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001319.ogg":^"...That's true.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001320.ogg":^  Magic can change completely depending on your heart.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001321.ogg":^  ...If you aren't properly guided, you can't use magic properly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001322.ogg":^  ...And proper magic can bring people happiness."^\

bg black,23
bg new_rose_2bp,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\wal\1\wal_a11_warai2.png",23
advsetwindow "30"

langjp「素晴らしいことです…。@………人を幸せにすることこそが、魔女が魔法を振るう唯一の理由なのです。@……その教えをようやく、我等が無限の魔女の系譜の、最後の魔女に伝えることが出来て、私は嬉しいですよ…。」\
;＜ワルギリア
langen:dwave 0, "voice\30\83200026.ogg":^"It is a wonderful thing...^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\83200027.ogg":^  ...Bringing people happiness is the sole reason that witches wield magic.^@:dwave 0, "voice\30\83200028.ogg":^  ...I am very pleased to know that those teachings have been passed down through the Endless Witches, all the way to the final witch..."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_fukigen2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「悪かったなー、全然、伝えてなくてよー。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700850.ogg":^"Sorry for failing to pass it down myself at all."^\

