;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101280.ogg":^"The City of Books, huh?^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101281.ogg":^  But there's no way for us to get in.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101282.ogg":^  There's a barrier around that place."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a13_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「……あいつがこれをくれたの。@これがあれば、自由に出入りできるって。@………馬鹿なヤツね。@私を捨てる時、回収を忘れたんだわ。」\
;＜縁寿
;鈴
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001368.ogg":^"...She gave me this.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001369.ogg":^  With it, I can come and go as I please.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001370.ogg":^  ...What an idiot.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001371.ogg":^  She forgot to collect it when she threw me away."^\
