langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200301.ogg":^"...That's it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200302.ogg":^  One of those temporary entry passes that you get when you turn in your invitation.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200303.ogg":^  As long as you have that, at least one of you will be able to get into the City of Books.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200304.ogg":^  Well, as long as someone takes you across the sea of Fragments first."^\

