langjp「どーしてかなんか知らないわ。@でも、とにかくあんたは、図書の都に入れる鈴を、２つ持っている。@よって、あんたたちの仲睦まじいやり取りを、これ以上見ている必要がなくなったわけ。」@
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200317.ogg":^"I don't know why.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200318.ogg":^  At any rate, you've got two bells that'll get you into the City of Books.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200319.ogg":^  Now I don't have to sit here and watch the two of you play around with each other anymore."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　二人はそれぞれ鈴を握り締め、見詰め合う。\
langen^The pair of them gripped their bells and looked at each other.^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「最初っから。@今回のゲームは、あんたたち二人のものだわ。@……ただ、対決するプレイヤーには若干の変更があったみたいね。@……あんたたち二人が競い合うゲームじゃない。@……猫箱を巡って、蓋を閉ざそうとする戦人と縁寿と、……それを開こうとするベルンとの戦いだわ。@縁寿は、ベルン側から戦人側にチームを変更した。@それだけの話。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200320.ogg":^"From the very beginning,^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200321.ogg":^ this game has belonged to the two of you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200322.ogg":^  ...There's just been a slight change in who the opponent is.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200323.ogg":^  ...This isn't a competition between you two.^\:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200324.ogg":^  It's a fight between Battler and Ange, who want to close the lid on the cat box, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200325.ogg":^and Bern, who wants it opened.  Ange has moved from Bern's team to Battler's team.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200326.ogg":^  That's all there is to it."^\

mcl c,0
bg new_rose_1ep,23
_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_majime4.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「ラムダデルタ。@俺たちを、図書の都へ連れて行ってくれ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101296.ogg":^"Lambdadelta,^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101297.ogg":^ take us to the City of Books."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_majime2.png",24
wait 1000
_ld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_majime3.png",22
wait 2000
wait 500

se1v 57,100
mbg white,1
mcbg 0
_ld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_odoroki1.png",22
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「………わかってるわよね、連れてくだけよ！@　後は、今度こそ観劇者に徹するからね！@　あんたたちが、図書の都で何をどう戦って、どうベルンにコテンパンにされるかを、じっくりたっぷり、間近で観劇してるだけだからね…！」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200327.ogg":^"...Okay, okay, I'm just taking you there, got it?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200328.ogg":^  After that, I'm done being anything but a spectator!^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200329.ogg":^  I just wanna have the best seats, to see exactly how you fight, what you do, and how Bern makes mincemeat out of you all...!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_ikari1.png",24
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「ラムダデルタ……、ありがとう！」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001386.ogg":^"Lambdadelta, ...thanks!"^\

