langen^At the head of that dinghy rowed by goats...stood Erika.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　どこから持ってきたやら。@この大船団の長を気取っているのだろうか。@……海賊帽のようなものを被り、こちらを睨みながら不敵に笑っている。\
langen^...Where the heck did she get that thing from?^@^  Maybe she's trying to act the part of the fleet's leader.^@^  ...Erika was glaring at them and smiling aggressively, with what appeared to be a pirate hat on her head.^\


ut_mld c,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_ak12_def2.png",80
