;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500259.ogg":^"I've come to deliver our terms.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500260.ogg":^  There will be room for negotiation.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500261.ogg":^  Please open the gate."^\

