;br
langjp　ヱリカの持ってくるものだ。@どうせろくな条件じゃない。\
langen^Erika was the one offering this deal.^@^  It wasn't likely to be anything agreeable.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　しかし、それを門前払いにすれば、ただちに攻撃を開始するだろう。@
langjp　絶対的劣勢であることを考えれば、今はどんな形であっても時間を稼ぎたい。@
langen^However, if they turned her away, the attack would probably begin at once.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Since they were in a firmly inferior position, they wanted to buy time by any means they could.^@
;br/

