langjp　ヱリカの行く手には、シエスタ姉妹兵を連れたベアトが待ち構えていた。@
langen^In the direction Erika was being led, Beato stood waiting, accompanied by the Chiester Sisters Corps.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　山羊の護衛を連れたヱリカもその姿を認め、見た目だけは美しくお辞儀をする。@
langjp　ベアトもそれに倣い、滅多にしない美しいお辞儀を見せる。\
langen^When Erika, accompanied by her goat guards, saw Beato, she gave a bow that only appeared graceful.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Beato followed suit and gave a graceful bow of the sort that was rarely seen from her.^\


ut_mld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "27"
langjp「……黄金郷の主、無限と黄金の魔女、ベアトリーチェである。@……名乗られよ。」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700854.ogg":^"...I am Beatrice, master of the Golden Land and the Golden and Endless Witch.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700855.ogg":^  ...Announce yourself."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そなたの茶番に付き合おうとでも言うように、ベアトは不敵に自己紹介し、ヱリカにもそれを求める。\
langen^As though implying that she was more than happy to go through with this farce, Beato introduced herself boldly and requested that Erika do the same.^\

mcl c,0
mcl r,0
bg black,23

bg new_rose_p1ap2,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\goa\1\goa_a11_def1.png",0
ut_mld c,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_ak11_def2.png",0
_ld r,":b;sprites\goa\1\goa_a11_def1.png",23

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_ak12_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「尊厳なる観劇と戯曲と傍観の魔女により厳選されし名誉ある図書の都より派遣されて参りました。@私は、図書に名誉と保護を与えし司書の艦隊司令官にして、真実の魔女、@古戸ヱリカと申します。@どうぞお見知りおきを。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500262.ogg":^"We have been dispatched from the Great Witch of Theatergoing, Drama, and Spectating's Noble City of Carefully Selected Books.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500263.ogg":^  I am the Witch of Truth, the commander of the Library Fleet, which is committed to bestowing honor and protection to books.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500264.ogg":^  My name is Furudo Erika.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500265.ogg":^  It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance."^\

mcl c,0
bg black,23
bg new_rose_p1ap2,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_1_warai1.png",23
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「用件を聞こうぞ。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700856.ogg":^"Shall we get down to business?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_ak11_warai3.png",24
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「お喜び下さい。@我ら、図書に名誉と保護を与えし司書の艦隊はあなた方に名誉ある朗報を持って参上しました。@一つ。@図書の都は、無限の魔女ベアトリーチェによって生み出されたゲーム盤を、名誉ある厳選されたる図書に認定されましたことを報告いたします。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500266.ogg":^"You ought to celebrate.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500267.ogg":^  We of the Library Fleet, dedicated to offering honor and protection to books, have come to bring good news to you all.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500268.ogg":^  First,^\:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500269.ogg":^ I would like to announce that, after careful selection, the City of Books has acknowledged and accepted the game board created by the Endless Witch Beatrice as a great and honorable book."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「ほう。@それは名誉なことである。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700857.ogg":^"Hoh.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700858.ogg":^  That is indeed a great honor."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_ak11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「このゲーム盤は、非常に興味深く、かつ独創的で研究価値の高いものです。@全ての臣民に公開される価値のあるものです。@よって、図書の都は我らに、このゲーム盤に永遠の名誉と保護を与えることを命ぜられました。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500270.ogg":^"That game board is a profoundly entertaining and original masterpiece, worthy of close study.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500271.ogg":^  It deserves to be released for all of our subjects to read.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500272.ogg":^  And so, the City of Books has ordered us to grant eternal honor and protection to this game board."^\

;cl l,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_1_majime3star.png",80
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「くどいし長い。@とっとと本題を言え。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700859.ogg":^"This is all quite long and boring.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700860.ogg":^  Get to the point."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_ak12_warai4.png",80
advsetwindow "46"
langjp「本ゲーム盤の全てを、名誉ある図書の都に譲渡することを要求します。@これは本ゲーム盤とその駒にとって、最高の名誉と保護です。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500273.ogg":^"We demand that you hand the entirety of this game board over to the honorable City of Books.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500274.ogg":^  Doing so will give this board and its pieces the greatest honor and protection imaginable."^\

se1v 27,50
bg new_rose_1ep,22
advsetwindow "27"

;ld c,BEA_futekiA2,80

langjp「嫌だと言ったら？」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700861.ogg":^"And if we refuse?"^\
advsetwindow "46"

;gggg
langjp「全ての臣民に共有されるべき名誉文化を私的独占する罪で告発されます。@我々はあなたに対し、全ての臣民の権利と利益を保護するため、攻撃を開始することを通告します。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500275.ogg":^"You will be prosecuted for the crime of monopolizing a great cultural artifact that ought to be shared among all of our subjects.^\:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500276.ogg":^  We are here to notify you of the impending assault, one which will be waged by us to protect the benefits that are the rightful property of all subjects, not yours alone."^\

;cl c,0
;bg black,0
bg new_rose_p1ap2,22
_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_futeki2.png",24
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「その攻撃で、臣民の共有財産が破壊されるのは構わぬのか。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700862.ogg":^"Are you not concerned that the shared property of all subjects might be destroyed in this assault of yours?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_ak11_akire1.png",23
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「名誉図書保護法の規定により、名誉文化私的独占を犯す犯罪者がこれを楯に篭城を試みる場合、@執行艦隊は大法院の許可を以って保護より逮捕を優先することが許されます。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500277.ogg":^"According to the Great Library Protective Regulations, when a criminal guilty of monopolization of a cultural artifact raises that objection as you have now done,^\:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500278.ogg":^ the executive fleet may prioritize arrest over its protective duties, as long as they obtain permission from the Great Court.^@
se1 1010
advsetwindow "46"
langjp……もちろん、すでに大法院の許可状はこちらにございます。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500279.ogg":^...Of course, we have already obtained the Great Court's written authorization."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a11_1_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "27"
langjp「ついでに、その逮捕は生死を問わぬと書いてありそうだな？」@
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700863.ogg":^"I imagine the word `arrest' is closely followed by `dead or alive'.  Am I right?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_ak14_komaru1.png",80
advsetwindow "46"

langjp「おや。@よくこんな小さい文字が読めますね？@　では、茶番は以上です。@……ぶっちゃけ、どうします？」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500280.ogg":^"My, my.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500281.ogg":^  I'm impressed that you can read those tiny letters.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500282.ogg":^  Now, enough fooling around.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500283.ogg":^  ...Let's hear your answer."^\

se3v 21,85

bg black,22

bg new_rose_p1ap2,22
_ld c,":b;sprites\bea\1\bea_a13_nayamu1.png",22
advsetwindow "27"

langjp「そなたの要求を飲むと、どのような利点があるというのか。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700864.ogg":^"What do we have to gain by accepting your conditions?"^\

