;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200335.ogg":^"In the first place,^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200336.ogg":^ you were only able to fight the Great Beatrice on an even footing because the game board protected you with rules that made it that way.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200337.ogg":^  If you leave the game board,^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200338.ogg":^ ...you're more like something that'll leave a small stain on her palm when she swats you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200339.ogg":^  Don't forget that, got it?"^\


