langjp「よした方がいいわ。@……余所の領地やゲーム盤ならともかく。@……ここはベルンのホームグラウンドよ？@　あの猫一匹で、猛獣の群に囲まれた位の危機感は持つことね。@……しかも猫よ。@勘も鋭いし仲間も呼ぶわ。@……気取られたら、その時は覚悟しなさい。@私は助けないからね。@……あんたたちをここへ連れ込んだだけで、かなり厄介。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200354.ogg":^"I'd advise against it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200355.ogg":^  ...Maybe if this were some other territory or game board,^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200356.ogg":^ ...but this is Bern's home base.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200357.ogg":^  That single cat should make you as scared as being surrounded by a crowd of vicious beasts.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200358.ogg":^  ...Plus, they're cats.^\:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200359.ogg":^  They've got good senses, and they'll call for their friends.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200360.ogg":^  ...If they spot you, you'd better be prepared for what happens next.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200361.ogg":^  I'm not going to save you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200362.ogg":^  ...Just getting you here has been troublesome enough."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\lam\1\lam_a11_futeki3.png",80
advsetwindow "29"

langjp「……私は降参すれば、@………裸にひん剥かれて、最悪のゲロカスカケラ巡り百年くらいで許してもらえるかも。@……素敵だわ、私にもベルンの気持ちが、ちょっとは理解できるようになるかもね。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200363.ogg":^"...If I surrender,^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200364.ogg":^ ...I might get off the hook with being stripped naked and thrown into the worst sort of crappy Fragment for just a century.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200365.ogg":^  ...How wonderful.  I think I can sympathize with Bern's feelings a bit now."^\
