langjp「“ちょっとお待ち下さい。@戦いを望まぬ者がいることもお忘れなく。@私は降参が良いかと思います”。@………私がここに訪れて、一番最初に聞いた、あなたの発言です。@ですが、今、あなたはこう仰いました。@“ここは戦うべきです。@戦わずして敗北を受け容れることなど、言語道断です。@私は最初から、ここは戦い抜くべきだと申し上げております”。@……そう言いました。」\
;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500336.ogg":^"`Hold on.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500337.ogg":^  Don't forget that some of us are opposed to fighting.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500338.ogg":^  I think we should surrender.'^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500339.ogg":^  ...Those were the first words I heard from you when I arrived here.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500340.ogg":^  However, you just said this:^\:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500341.ogg":^ `We must fight.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500342.ogg":^  It would be outrageous to accept defeat without fighting.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500343.ogg":^  As I've said from the beginning, fighting with all we have is the only option.'^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500344.ogg":^  ...That's what you said."^\


