;＜ヱリカ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500349.ogg":^"......This can lead us to two conclusions.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500350.ogg":^  First, ...it may be that Gohda-san has no opinion...and is just a loser who will say anything that goes with the flow.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500351.ogg":^  Second, ...it may be that none of you has an opinion, and that this entire argument exists only for its own sake."^\

