;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700936.ogg":^"Aren't you...overthinking this a bit...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700937.ogg":^  Here we are, in a desperate debate that will decide our fate.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\80700938.ogg":^  I hardly think it strange that some people would act abnormally under such pressure..."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\eri\1\eri_ak11_akire2.png",80
