langen:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500356.ogg":^"After all, for some time now,^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500357.ogg":^ I have heard all of you speak to Lady Lambdadelta and Battler occasionally, but not once have I heard them reply.^@:dwave 0, "voice\46\84500358.ogg":^  ...Taking all of this into account, we are left with only one conclusion."^\

