langjp「…………私、目がいいから教えてあげる。@あの黄金の鍵を取り囲んでる魔法陣、わかる？@　……あれは簡単だけど、なかなか堅牢な結界よ。@……触れば壊せる簡単な結界だけれど。@でもね、どんな大魔女でもニンゲン風情でも、解くのにかっきり１時間を掛けるという、タチの悪ゥい封印なのよ。@式典の進行上、まだ１時間前にはなってない。@……つまり、私たちは１時間稼がなきゃ、鍵に触れることさえ出来ないのよ！！」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200389.ogg":^"......I've got good eyesight, so let me enlighten you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200390.ogg":^  Can you see those magic circles around the golden key?^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200391.ogg":^  ...That's a simple barrier, but a pretty strong one.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200392.ogg":^  ...It'll break if you just touch it,^\:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200393.ogg":^ but it's the sort of annoying seal that'll take exactly one hour to fade, whether a great witch or a lowly Human does it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200394.ogg":^  It's still over an hour before the ceremony begins.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200395.ogg":^  ...In other words, we won't even be able to touch the key unless we can buy time for a whole hour!!"^\

