langjp「じゃ、行ってくるわ。@……私、目立ちたがり屋だから、やっぱ観劇者は無理だったわ。@ごめんね、出番を奪っちゃって。@……あんたたちのゲーム、最後まで観劇できないのは残念だけど。@……もう筋書きは教えてもらえたから見る必要もないわ。」\
;＜ラムダ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200431.ogg":^"Anyway, see you in a bit.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200432.ogg":^  ...I guess a show-off like me couldn't stick to being a spectator after all.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200433.ogg":^  Sorry for stealing your time to shine.^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200434.ogg":^  ...It's sad that I won't be able to watch your game until the end,^@:dwave 0, "voice\29\82200435.ogg":^ ...but I've already been shown the script, so I'm not missing anything."^\

