advsetwindow "10"

langjp「２つの内、片方はお前を未来へ導く。@……大丈夫。@今のお前なら絶対に間違えない。@そしてそれを潜ったら、扉が閉まるまで、後ろを振り返るな。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101368.ogg":^"Of the two, one will lead you to the future.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101369.ogg":^  ...Don't worry.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101370.ogg":^  I'm sure you won't choose the wrong one now.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101371.ogg":^  Also, once you go through it, don't turn back until the door closes."^\

