;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101383.ogg":^"Exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101384.ogg":^  So don't look back.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101385.ogg":^  You'll have the key soon.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101386.ogg":^  You've got to go back to the Golden Land like your life depends on it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101387.ogg":^  ...So, real quick, I have one message for the `you' of the future.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\80101388.ogg":^  Don't forget it, and engrave it into your heart!"^\


