langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000140.ogg":^"However, my miko is now a Game Master in your game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000141.ogg":^  ...It seems the two of you opened the game board at the same time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000142.ogg":^  It is rare to have two Masters for a single game, but this miracle pleases me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000143.ogg":^  ...After all, I can rest assured that this will make for a proper final game for you both."^\


