langen:dwave 0, "voice\21\84100003.ogg":^"...In her later years, the company president was very ill.^@:dwave 0, "voice\21\84100004.ogg":^  I imagine that she said some fairly harsh things to you,^@:dwave 0, "voice\21\84100005.ogg":^ ...but I don't believe she truly meant them."^\
