langjp「全部任せてくれ。@こっちには縁寿ちゃんの委任状って錦の御旗がある。@お陰で右代宮グループは一枚岩だ。@……縁寿ちゃんのお陰で、会長の作った会社が守られた。@会長も、縁寿ちゃんの決断を喜んでるはずだぜ。」\
;＜小此木
langen:dwave 0, "voice\21\84100014.ogg":^"Leave that to me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\21\84100015.ogg":^  We have your power of attorney as our rallying point.^@:dwave 0, "voice\21\84100016.ogg":^  Thanks to that, the Ushiromiya group is a united front.^@:dwave 0, "voice\21\84100017.ogg":^  ...Because of what you did, Ange-chan, the business built by the former president has been protected.^@:dwave 0, "voice\21\84100018.ogg":^  I truly believe she'd be joyful at your decision."^\


