advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……しかし、縁寿が心変わりし、絵羽のまとめ上げた右代宮グループが存続できる一番の形で協力を申し出たため、@最悪の事態は回避されたのだ。\
langen^...However, Ange had undergone a change of heart, deciding to do what was best for the Ushiromiya group that Eva had built up,^@^ and the worst-case scenario had been avoided.^\
