advsetwindow "24"

langjp「ん？@　あぁ、すまん、構わんよ。」@
;＜川畑
langen:dwave 0, "voice\24\83800003.ogg":^"Hmm?^@:dwave 0, "voice\24\83800004.ogg":^  Sure, whatever you say."^\
;br/

cl l,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　川畑船長は運転席へ顔を引っ込める。\
langen^Captain Kawabata went down into the driver's area.^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ama\1\ama_a11_def1.png",23
advsetwindow "20"

langjp「……何です、お嬢？@　気難しい顔して。」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000102.ogg":^"...What is it, Lady?^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000103.ogg":^  Why the troubled face?"^\

cl r,23
bg black,23
bg new_ship_s2af,23
advsetwindow "11"

;ld r,ENJ_DefA1,80

langjp「私、新しい人生を、これから踏み出そうと思うの。」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001665.ogg":^"I feel like taking a step into a new life."^\
advsetwindow "20"

;ld l,AMA_DefA2,80

langjp「すでに踏み出してますぜ。」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000104.ogg":^"You already have."^\
advsetwindow "11"


;ld r,ENJ_nayamuA1,80

langjp「そうね。@……右代宮家の面倒臭いのを全て売り払って、どこかに寄付でもしたら、綺麗サッパリ清々するわ。@それで私は、右代宮縁寿という殻を、全部脱ぎ去れる。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001666.ogg":^"True.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001667.ogg":^  ...If I could sell off all the Ushiromiya family wealth that's burdening me, maybe donating it to some charity, that would be a huge relief.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001668.ogg":^  Then, I'd finally be able to escape from the shell called Ushiromiya Ange."^\
advsetwindow "20"


;ld l,AMA_majimeA1,80

langjp「………………………。@……莫大なカネが思いのままってのに、勿体ねぇことです。」@
;＜天草
langen^"......^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000105.ogg":^...It seems a waste of all that money.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000106.ogg":^  You could do anything you wanted with it."^\
advsetwindow "11"

;ld r,ENJ_fumanA2,80

langjp「いいじゃない。@私がいらないって言ってるんだから。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001669.ogg":^"Who cares?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001670.ogg":^  My point is that I don't need it."^\
advsetwindow "20"

;ld l,AMA_akuwaraiA1,80

langjp「………そりゃそうですがね。@……ただ、お嬢が売っ払うのは、お嬢だけのものじゃないものもありますぜ。@……例えば、」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000107.ogg":^"......That may be true.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000108.ogg":^  ...Then again, not everything that you'd be selling off belongs to you exclusively.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000109.ogg":^  ...For example..."^\

;bg black,1

_ld c,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_def1.png",24
_ld c,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_fuman2.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「右代宮グループの株式とか？」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001671.ogg":^"Are you talking about the Ushiromiya group's stock?"^\

bg black,24
bg new_ship_s2bf,24
_ld r,":b;sprites\ama\1\ama_a11_akuwarai1.png",24
advsetwindow "20"

langjp「………そうです。@お嬢にとってはただの紙切れでしょうが。@でっかい会社の命運を揺さぶりかねない暴挙ですぜ…？@　んなことされたら、ウチのボスも堪らんでしょうぜ。」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000110.ogg":^"...That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000111.ogg":^  They may be little more than scraps of paper to you,^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000112.ogg":^ but doing something like that could shatter the whole company...^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000113.ogg":^  I don't think my boss could bear to have that happen."^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_nayamu1.png",24
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「えぇ、知ってるわ。@須磨寺家もそう、小此木社長たちもそう。@私に、自由気ままでいられちゃ困る連中が、大勢いるものね。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001672.ogg":^"Yeah, I know.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001673.ogg":^  It's like that for the Sumaderas and President Okonogi alike.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001674.ogg":^  There are plenty of people who're in a tough spot because I can do as I please."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\ama\1\ama_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "20"

langjp「…………縁寿さんは紛うことなきＶＩＰです。@派手なことは慎んで、ここは大人しく隠れてる方がいいかと思うんですがね…？」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000114.ogg":^"......There's no doubt that you're a VIP, Ange-san.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000115.ogg":^  Wouldn't it be better to chill out and hide away for now, and just hold off on doing anything flashy...?"^\

cl c,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_fuman2.png",24
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「そのＶＩＰ縁寿を、好き放題にさせない一番手っ取り早い方法って何かしら。」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001675.ogg":^"What would be the fastest and most convenient way to prevent this VIP from doing as she pleases, I wonder?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ama\1\ama_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "20"

langjp「……さぁて、どんな方法がありますやら…！@　まぁ、酒でも飲んで腹を割って…、」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000116.ogg":^"...Hey, that's a good question...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000117.ogg":^  Well, we could break out the drinks, tell each other our deepest secrets, and..."^\

bgm1 171

cl l,23
bg black,24
bg new_ship_s2af,24
_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_nayamu1.png",24
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「私の旅の最終目的地が六軒島であることは、誰にでも予測可能だわ。@そして六軒島は今や完全なる無人島。@……誰も存在しない。@誰にも見られず聞かれない。@今日は最高の密室日和。」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001676.ogg":^"Anyone could guess that the final destination of my journey is Rokkenjima.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001677.ogg":^  And, right now, Rokkenjima is completely uninhabited.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001678.ogg":^  ...There's no one there.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001679.ogg":^  No one to see or to hear.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001680.ogg":^  This is the perfect day for a closed room."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ama\1\ama_a14_def2.png",23
advsetwindow "20"

langjp「………そりゃまぁ、確かに。」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000118.ogg":^"......Well, yeah, that may be true."^\

bg black,22
mono 1
bg new_bui_o1a,22
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「須磨寺家が私を追っているわ。@小此木社長のところにも、タイミング良く押し掛けてきた。@……私があそこにいた情報は、売られているのよ。」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001681.ogg":^"The Sumadera family is chasing me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001682.ogg":^  They even managed to barge into President Okonogi's building with perfect timing.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001683.ogg":^  ...Someone leaked the fact that I was there."^\
advsetwindow "20"

;ld l,AMA_DefA1,80

langjp「ウチのボスが売ったと？@　……なのにボディーガードを付けますかい？」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000119.ogg":^"Are you saying my boss sold you out?^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000120.ogg":^  ...Then why would he give you a bodyguard?"^\

bg new_BUI_R1a,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\oko\1\oko_a11_def1.png",22
advsetwindow "11"

;ld r,ENJ_DefA1,80

langjp「私がどんな気紛れを起こすかわからない以上。@小此木社長は私と須磨寺家の双方に貸しを作りたい。@だったら、私の情報を売りつつ、紙一重で私を逃がし、その後も所在を押さえ続ければ、勝負カードを手中にしたまま、私にも須磨寺家にも恩が売れるわ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001684.ogg":^"Since he doesn't know what sort of whims I'm going to act on,^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001685.ogg":^ President Okonogi wants to have both the Sumadera family and me indebted to him.^\:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001686.ogg":^  That way, he can sell information about me, let me slip away by a hair, and keep track of my whereabouts, putting both me and the Sumadera family in his debt while keeping a trump card in his hand."^\

bg black,22
mono 0
advsetwindow "20"

;ld l,AMA_DefA1,80

langjp「そりゃあ、考え過ぎですぜ……。」@
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000121.ogg":^"You're definitely overthinking things there..."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　天草は、取り繕うように苦笑いを浮かべる。\
langen^Amakusa wore a forced smile, trying to smooth things over.^\

bg new_ship_s2af,0
ut_mld c,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a13_def1.png",22
advsetwindow "11"
langjp「須磨寺家は確実に私を追っているわ。@私の行動は、意図的に彼らにリークされているもの。@そして、六軒島で私たちは鉢合わせになる。@そして私は連中に殺される。@そして、あんたは須磨寺家のヒットマンを返り討ちにして、@小此木社長は須磨寺家に対し、交渉のカードを得る。@……私が死ねば、右代宮グループは当面安泰。@その上、須磨寺家には釘も刺せる。@さらに言えば須磨寺家も、持て余し気味の過激派の急先鋒、霞叔母さんを綺麗な形で処分できる。@……両者は痛み分けで手打ちして、めでたしめでたし。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001687.ogg":^"We can be sure that the Sumadera family is chasing me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001688.ogg":^  My actions are being intentionally leaked to them."^\
advsetwindow "11"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001689.ogg":^"Then, we'll bump into each other on Rokkenjima.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001690.ogg":^  I will be killed by them.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001691.ogg":^  After that, you will kill the Sumadera hit men, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001692.ogg":^and President Okonogi will have a trump card to use in negotiations with the Sumaderas.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001693.ogg":^  ...If I die, the Ushiromiya group will be stable for the time being.^\:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001694.ogg":^  Plus, they'll be able to draw the line with the Sumadera family.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001695.ogg":^  On the other side, the Sumadera family itself will be able to neatly do away with Aunt Kasumi, the leader of their overenthusiastic radical faction.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001696.ogg":^  ...Both sides will finish their bargaining with a draw, and everyone'll be happy."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ama\1\ama_a11_def2.png",24
advsetwindow "20"

langjp「……………………ひゅぅ。@……なかなか、面白いシナリオですぜ。」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000122.ogg":^"............Whew.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000123.ogg":^  ...That's a pretty interesting story you've thought up there."^\

mcl c,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_fuman2.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「あんたの持ち込んだ、あのゴルフバッグ。@中身を検めさせてもらったわ。@すごいわね、戦争でも始めそうなすごい銃ばかり。@……でも、あれは狙撃銃だわ。@常に私に寄り添っているはずのボディガードに、必要な銃なのかしら？」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001697.ogg":^"That golf bag you brought with you...^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001698.ogg":^  I've had a look at what's inside.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001699.ogg":^  Are you planning to start a war or something with all those guns?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001700.ogg":^  ...But it had a sniper rifle in it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001701.ogg":^  Would a bodyguard who's always by my side really need something like that?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ama\1\ama_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "20"

langjp「何が起こるかわかりませんもので……。」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000124.ogg":^"Well, you never know what might happen..."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「常に軽装であることが望まれるボディガードが、@その役割を一日放棄してまで、六軒島に渡る直前に調達する必要のある銃かしら。」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001702.ogg":^"Why would a bodyguard, who works best when traveling light,^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001703.ogg":^ choose to abandon his position for a whole day to get a gun like that, and right before we leave for Rokkenjima?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ama\1\ama_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "20"

langjp「………お嬢。@……考え過ぎですぜ……？」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000125.ogg":^"......Lady,^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000126.ogg":^ ...you're over-thinking this, okay...?"^\

;bg black,22
bg new_sea_1cf,22
advsetwindow "11"
;ld c,ENJ_DefA1,80

langjp「私が六軒島に着いたら。@ひとりでゆっくり墓参りをするといい、というような感じにして、私をひとりにする。@それはエサ。@すでに六軒島で待ち構えている須磨寺霞たちを釣り上げるエサ。@あとは、あんたがあの馬鹿でかい銃で一網打尽にしておしまいよ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001704.ogg":^"When I reach Rokkenjima,^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001705.ogg":^ ...you'll suggest that I go visit the place they died or something, getting me on my own.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001706.ogg":^  That's the bait.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001707.ogg":^  The bait to lure in Sumadera Kasumi and the others waiting for me on Rokkenjima.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001708.ogg":^  After that, you'll use that ridiculously huge gun to round them up.  The end."^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "20"

;ld c,AMA_DefA1,80

langjp「……一網打尽、結構じゃねぇですかぃ。@ちゃんと護衛になってますぜ。」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000127.ogg":^"...Well, what's wrong with rounding them up?^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000128.ogg":^  Isn't that what a guard's supposed to do?"^\

bg new_ship_s2bf,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_def1.png",22
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「ゴルフバッグには最新式の狙撃銃の他に、ドイツ製の新型短機関銃も入っていた。」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001709.ogg":^"In addition to a cutting-edge sniper rifle, you also had a modern German submachine gun."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\ama\1\ama_a11_majime1.png",23
advsetwindow "20"

langjp「便利ですぜ。@須磨寺家が何人来ようが、一網打尽です…。」\
;＜天草
langen:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000129.ogg":^"Those are really handy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\20\83000130.ogg":^  No matter how many people the Sumaderas have, I could clean them all up, no trouble..."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「もう一丁あった。@それは拳銃。@……狙撃銃も短機関銃も最新式の素晴らしいものなのに、その拳銃だけは、いやに古ぼけていて旧式だった。@これよ。」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001710.ogg":^"There was one more.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001711.ogg":^  A handgun.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001712.ogg":^  ...Even though the sniper rifle and the submachine gun were the best and the newest models, the handgun alone was beat up and old-fashioned.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001713.ogg":^  See?"^\
;br

