langjp「あぁ、そうだ。@俺の真実に関係なく、お前の真実も同時に存在する。@……それが、この世界だ。@誰にも否定できないから、いくつでも、どんなに相互が矛盾しても、それらの真実は同時に存在できる。@ここでは、想像の数だけ真実があっていいんだ。@それを、誰も一方的に否定してはならない…！」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\50101504.ogg":^"Yeah, that's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50101505.ogg":^  Regardless of my truth, yours can exist at the same time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50101506.ogg":^  ...That's what this world is like.^\:dwave 0, "voice\10\50101507.ogg":^  No one can disprove them, so even if there are various truths and even if they contradict each other wildly, they can exist at the same time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50101508.ogg":^  Here, as many truths exist as you can imagine.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\50101509.ogg":^  No one can just deny that all on their own...!"^\


