advsetwindow "50"

langjp「右代宮縁寿。@本当にご苦労だった。@………我が退屈はそなたの朗読によって癒された。@このフェザリーヌ、数えることも忘れて久しい年月ぶりに、心よりそなたに感謝するぞ…。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000376.ogg":^"Ushiromiya Ange,^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000377.ogg":^ you truly have worked hard.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000378.ogg":^  ......Your reading has soothed my boredom.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000379.ogg":^  I, Featherine, am more grateful to you than I have been for so many years that I cannot remember..."^\

