langjp「……右代宮縁寿。@本当にご苦労だった。@……よくぞ最後まで朗読に付き合ってくれた。@……これにて、我が巫女の任を解く。@そなたは元の世界に戻り、そなたに与えられた運命を、再開するがいい。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000383.ogg":^"...Ushiromiya Ange,^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000384.ogg":^ you really have worked hard.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000385.ogg":^  ...You have done well to keep reading for me until the end.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000386.ogg":^  ...With this, your responsibilities as my miko are lifted.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000387.ogg":^  You may return to your original world and be reunited with the fate you have been given."^\

