langjp　縁寿は、この物語がふざけた創作ではなく、@……六軒島より、真実の一つを知らせるために１２年前より再び流れ着いた、新しいボトルメッセージだと、認めていた…。@
langen^Ange had acknowledged that this tale was no crazy literary work,^@^ ...but a new message bottle, which had drifted here once more from the Rokkenjima of 12 years previous...^@^to tell her of one truth...^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そして、………この物語の語ろうとする真実を、@彼女なりの見方で、見つけられたようだった。\
langen^And, ......it seemed as though she had found her own interpretation of the truth she thought the tale was trying to tell.^\

bg new_FEA_R1c,22
