;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900138.ogg":^"...Thank you for reading until the end.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900139.ogg":^  ...And thank you for your thoughts and opinions.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\64900140.ogg":^  ...I'm sure the very first Endless Witch is happy..."^\

