;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000589.ogg":^"......Wow, so you can bring yourself to say stuff like that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000590.ogg":^  ...If you'd just talk like that from the beginning, you'd have tons more fans."^\

