langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000604.ogg":^"You mean like a deus ex machina plot development?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000605.ogg":^  ...I used to hate them, but recently I've become a big fan.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\62000606.ogg":^  Still, I've become a bit of a picky eater, and simply falling from a skyscraper and ending up unharmed doesn't quite qualify as a miracle to me anymore."^\
