;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100381.ogg":^"It's a path I might never have had to know about if you hadn't told me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100382.ogg":^  ...You're the monster who taught me the taste of flesh.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100383.ogg":^  ...So, you've come back to life,^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100384.ogg":^ ......Featherine Auaurora..."^\

