;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000404.ogg":^"......What are you afraid of?^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000405.ogg":^  I am merely celebrating my reunion with my longest-serving miko so far...^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000406.ogg":^  Did you really find my messenger cat so displeasing?"^\
