langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100392.ogg":^"......I see you're as unpleasant as ever.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100393.ogg":^  ...But I'm happy now.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100394.ogg":^  Imitating you really has been far from boring."^\

