;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100395.ogg":^"You liked rude mikos because they kept you entertained, right...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100396.ogg":^  Tch, ridiculous.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100397.ogg":^  ...If talking will only please you, I'll shut up.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100398.ogg":^  ...So, ...what do you want with me...?"^\

