;ld l,FEA_DefA3,80

langjp「私はベアトのゲームを全て観劇してきた。@……ラムダデルタのゲームも、戦人のゲームも、興味深く観劇させてもらった。@……一応、全ての謎に私なりの答えを用意できたつもりでいる。@………犯人。@動機。@個別のトリック。@……碑文の謎は、最後がぎりぎりわからぬが、@私が実際に六軒島に行き、検証すればわかる程度のレベルまでの推理は持っている。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000419.ogg":^"I have observed all of Beato's games.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000420.ogg":^  ...I also watched Lambdadelta's game and Battler's game with great interest.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000421.ogg":^  ...I believe I have formed an answer for all the riddles in my own way.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000422.ogg":^  ......The culprit.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000423.ogg":^  The motive.^\:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000424.ogg":^  The individual tricks.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000425.ogg":^  ...I'm not yet clear about the very last part of the epitaph's riddle,^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000426.ogg":^ but I have enough of a theory that if I actually went to Rokkenjima and investigated, I should be able to resolve that part as well."^\
advsetwindow "28"
;ffff
langjp「……………それで…？」@
langjp「無論、真実は一つでない以上、私の推理も、許される可能性の中の一つに過ぎぬだろう。@……しかし、それは可能性の範囲内であり、瑣末な問題だ。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100404.ogg":^"......And...?"^\
advsetwindow "50"
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000427.ogg":^"Of course, since there is no single truth, my theory is probably only one of many possibilities.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000428.ogg":^  ...However, that is only a question of possibilities, a trivial problem."^\

