;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000431.ogg":^"So far, you have spiced up this tale as an actor.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000432.ogg":^  In doing that, you have probably come to know many truths.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000433.ogg":^  ...However, even you are unaware of the truth behind several riddles that Beato has cleverly kept hidden, correct...?"^\


