;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000434.ogg":^"After watching a play, reading the pamphlet and learning what goes on behind the scenes is similar to, as you would say it,^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000435.ogg":^ enjoying some black tea after a meal.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\65000436.ogg":^  ...That enjoyment cannot be left undone."^\

