langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100410.ogg":^"You like to play with them and love them while they're alive, then eat their flesh when they die.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100411.ogg":^  ...So, cats are doubly useful to you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\62100412.ogg":^  ......Just die, monster."^\


