langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000014.ogg":^"......^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000015.ogg":^...First they tear me into little bits, then they make me read...^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000016.ogg":^  ...What's next?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000017.ogg":^  Which witch am I supposed to be entertaining this time?"^\
