langjp「縁寿。@……私は右代宮縁寿。@留弗夫と霧江の娘よ。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000018.ogg":^"Ange.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000019.ogg":^  ...I'm Ushiromiya Ange.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000020.ogg":^  Rudolf and Kyrie's daughter."^\

;bg black,22
