langjp「え？！@　え、……縁寿ちゃん……？！@　だって、縁寿ちゃんはまだ６つのはず……。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300645.ogg":^"What?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300646.ogg":^  ...A-Ange-chan...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300647.ogg":^  But you're supposed to be six years old..."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_majime1.png",24
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「…………私が６つだったのは、六軒島で最後の親族会議があったあの年の話よ。@……なるほど。@あんたが、１９８６年の人間であることはわかったわ。@私は１８よ。@そして１９９８年の人間。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000021.ogg":^"......I was six during the year of the final family conference on Rokkenjima.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000022.ogg":^  ...Now I get it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000023.ogg":^  So, you're a person from the year 1986.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000024.ogg":^  I'm 18 years old.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000025.ogg":^  And I'm from the year 1998."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「つ、つまり、……１２年後の未来の、……縁寿ちゃん……？」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300648.ogg":^"I-In other words, ...you're the Ange-chan...of 12 years in the future...?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a13_nayamu1.png",24
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「納得してもらえて嬉しいわ。@でも申し訳ないことに、私にあなたの心当たりがないの。@……あなたは誰？@　親は？」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000026.ogg":^"I'm glad you believe it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000027.ogg":^  But, unfortunately, I don't have a clue who you are.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000028.ogg":^  ...Who are you?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000029.ogg":^  Who are your parents?"^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「父は蔵臼。@母は夏妃です。」@
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300649.ogg":^"My father is Krauss.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300650.ogg":^  Natsuhi is my mother."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「それは朱志香お姉ちゃんだわ。」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000030.ogg":^"That would make you Jessica onee-chan."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「朱志香は妹です。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300651.ogg":^"Jessica is my little sister."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a31_komaru3.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「…………………………。@……どういうこと？@　朱志香お姉ちゃんは一人っ子じゃなかったの…？」\
;＜縁
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000031.ogg":^"......^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000032.ogg":^...What's going on?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000033.ogg":^  Wasn't Jessica onee-chan an only child...?"^\
;br

