langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300655.ogg":^"Sorry to disappoint you, but I'm just an ordinary human.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300656.ogg":^  ...What I just told you is something I heard from the witch called Bernkastel-san."^\


