;br
langjp　席に座っている限り、ある程度の自由はあるが、ここを立ち去る自由は、まったく与えていないようだった。\
langen^As long as I sat here, I had enough slack that I could move about a little, but it looked like there wouldn't be nearly enough for me to get out of this place.^\

