se1 32
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　縁寿は、ジャラリと鎖を鳴らしながら、足を組みかえる。@
langjp　どう足掻いたところで、鎖は外せないのだ。@……慌てても、何も始まらない。@大した肝の据わりようだった。\
langen^Ange crossed her legs, making the chains clank together.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^She realized that no amount of struggling could have broken those chains.^@^  ...Getting panicky wouldn't accomplish anything.^@^  She must've had nerves of steel.^\

bg black,23
bg new_the_1c,0

;ld r,ENJ_NayamuA1,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_majime1.png",23
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「魔女の駒とは？」@
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300667.ogg":^"What do you mean, a witch's piece?"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_fuman2.png",22
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「……あいつらの奴隷みたいなもんよ。@……私は取引したの。@……家族に会いたい、あの日から連れ戻したいって。@魔女は、その可能性を与える代わりに、私を魔女の駒としたわ。@………少なくとも、魔女は約束を守ったわね。@お兄ちゃんに会うことだけは、出来たんだし。」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000047.ogg":^"...It's like being their slave.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000048.ogg":^  ...I made a deal, once.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000049.ogg":^  ...I said I wanted to see my family, to bring them back from that day.^\:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000050.ogg":^  In exchange for making that a possibility, that witch turned me into a witch's piece.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000051.ogg":^  ......At least the witch kept her promise.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000052.ogg":^  I was able to see Onii-chan again."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_def3.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「………戦人くんのこと……？」@
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300668.ogg":^"...You mean Battler-kun...?"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「縁寿だと名乗ることも出来なかったけどね。@……そして、そのささやかな時間と引き換えに、私は今もこうして、魔女の玩具箱の中から永遠に抜け出せない。@……どうやら、あんたもそのお仲間のようね。@……何を契約したの？」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000053.ogg":^"Well, I wasn't even able to tell him who I was.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000054.ogg":^  ...And, in exchange for that short bit of time, I'm now trapped inside the witches' toy box for all eternity.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000055.ogg":^  ...Looks like you are too.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000056.ogg":^  ...Did you make some sort of contract?"^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_majime1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「私は、何も……。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300669.ogg":^"N-Nothing of the sort..."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\enj\1\enj_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「何かを魔女に望んだんじゃないの？」@
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000057.ogg":^"Did you ever ask a witch to grant a wish for you?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_akire2.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「何も。@………私という存在が、どれだけ奇跡であるかを、教えてもらいました。@それだけです。」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300670.ogg":^"Never.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300671.ogg":^  ......She taught me what a miracle my existence is.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300672.ogg":^  That's all."^\


;ld r,ENJ_DefA1,80
bg black,25
bg new_the_1d,25
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「………何れにせよ、私たちはここから逃れられない。@……さぁ、魔女たち！@　今度はどんな余興を見せてくれるの？！@　朗読の次は観劇？@　今度は私が誰かの朗読を見るって言うの？！@　ならば始めてちょうだい。@私はとっくに退屈しているの！」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000058.ogg":^"...Either way, neither of us is getting out of here.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000059.ogg":^  ...Okay, witches!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000060.ogg":^  What kind of show do you have for us this time?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000061.ogg":^  Have we moved from reading aloud to theatergoing?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000062.ogg":^  Am I supposed to watch someone else read aloud this time, or what?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000063.ogg":^  If that's it, then start it up already.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000064.ogg":^  I'm bored enough as it is!"^\
;br

bg black,22
