langjp「私たちを、鎖で縛り付けてまで見せたものが、すでに知っているゲームのわけがない。@……新しいゲームだと考えるべきでしょうね。@ならば、ゲームマスターがいるはず。@……それは誰？@　………あいつ？@　ベルンカステル……？」\
;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000075.ogg":^"There's no way they'd go to the trouble of chaining us down if they just wanted to show us a game we already know.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000076.ogg":^  ...It's probably a new game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000077.ogg":^  That means there should be a Game Master.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000078.ogg":^  ...Who is it?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000079.ogg":^  ...That witch?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000080.ogg":^  Bernkastel...?"^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_fuman1.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

