langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300679.ogg":^"I...can't imagine so.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300680.ogg":^  ...Clair should have vanished already.^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300681.ogg":^  There should be no need to spin up a new tale..."^\

