;＜縁寿
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000081.ogg":^"Beato's game board was hijacked by those evil witches long ago.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000082.ogg":^  Even Beato is nothing more than a piece in their games."^\


