langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300057.ogg":^"That's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300058.ogg":^  The aim of this strange letter is probably to disrupt our unity.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300059.ogg":^  The more we let it affect us, the more things will go the way of this `Beatrice' who sent it."^\

