langjp「主人の言う通りだわ。@こんな子供騙し、真面目に考えるだけ損だわ。@本当に遺産騒動に絡みたい何者かなら、手紙なんて遠回しなことをせず、堂々と姿を現せばいいんだし。」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000060.ogg":^"My husband's right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000061.ogg":^  This is a child's prank, and taking it seriously is just a waste of time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000062.ogg":^  If someone really wanted to shake up the inheritance issue, they'd come forward boldly instead of using something this roundabout."^\
advsetwindow "08"

