langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200064.ogg":^"You've got it right there.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200065_b.ogg":^  Someone probably wants to make us think there's another person trying to make demands about the inheritance, when their real goal is just to pick up the scraps."^\

