langjp「うむ、同感だ。@……まるで、推理小説のようなミステリアスな演出だったので、ついつい私たちも面白がってしまった。@……はっはははは。@我々も余裕がないね。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800085.ogg":^"Indeed, I agree.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800086.ogg":^  ...After that big mysterious show, like something out of a mystery novel, we've all gotten a bit too wrapped up in this.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800087.ogg":^  ...Hahahaha.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800088.ogg":^  It seems we're all taking this too seriously."^\

;bg black,22
bg new_mdin_1ar,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a11_odoroki2.png",24
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「しかし、誰がこんな手紙を。@……腹立たしいことです。」@
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900080.ogg":^"But who did it?^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900081.ogg":^  ...Such an aggravating thing to do."^\

ut_mld c,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b22_akire2go.png",23
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「使用人じゃないなら、私たちの中の誰かが書いたんでしょうよ。@誰とは言わないけれどね？」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000063.ogg":^"If it wasn't a servant, then one of us must have written it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000064.ogg":^  I'm not naming names, of course."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\ros\1\ros_a11_aseru1.png",24
advsetwindow "12"

langjp「よ、よしてよ。@本当に私は知らないの…！」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400143.ogg":^"St-Stop it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400144.ogg":^  I really know nothing about this...!"^\

mcl c,0
bg new_mdin_1gr,26
advsetwindow "06"
;ld r,HID_DefA1,24

langjp「まぁまぁ。@しかし、手紙の言うことも一理あるっちゅうもんや。@……わしらは誰も彼もカネが欲しいんや。@それも出来たら今すぐや。@それに異論がある者はおらんやろ…？」\
;＜秀吉
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\71100041.ogg":^"Settle down.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\71100042.ogg":^  Anyway, what this letter says does make a bit of sense.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\71100043.ogg":^  ...All of us need money.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\71100044.ogg":^  And, if possible, we need it right away.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\71100045.ogg":^  No one here has any objections to that, right...?"^\
advsetwindow "08"

;ld l,RUD_DefA1,23

langjp「……そりゃそうだ。@カネと愛は、いくらあっても困らねぇぜ。」@
;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200068.ogg":^"...Of course not.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200069.ogg":^  Whether it's money or love, you can never have too much."^\
advsetwindow "02"

;ld c,KLA_DefA1,24

langjp「親父殿の遺産は、いつ転がり込んでくるかわからない。@……しかし、碑文の黄金は違う。@見つかれば直ちに山分けだ。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800089.ogg":^"We don't know when Father's inheritance will come to us.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800090.ogg":^  ...However, the gold of the epitaph is different.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800091.ogg":^  If we find it, we could just split it then and there."^\

bg new_gold1,22
advsetwindow "05"
;ld r,EVA_DefA1,24

langjp「ある意味。@お父様の遺産以上に、目の前にあるカネだわ。」@
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000065.ogg":^"In a sense,^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000066.ogg":^ it's even closer to us now than the inheritance is."^\
advsetwindow "12"

;ld l,ROS_DefA1,23

langjp「碑文の謎が解ければの話だけれどね……。」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400145.ogg":^"Assuming we can solve the epitaph..."^\

bg black,22
bg new_mdin_1er,22
_ld c,":b;sprites\kir\1\kir_a11_futeki1.png",23
advsetwindow "09"

langjp「……ここにいる皆さんも、碑文の謎には、それぞれ挑戦されたんでしょう？」@
;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300061.ogg":^"...Everyone here has tried solving it on their own, yes?"^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
;bg black,22
;br
langjp　霧江が一堂にそう問い掛けると、全員が無言で頷く。\
langen^Kyrie asked the room at large, and everyone wordlessly nodded back.^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\kir\1\kir_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "09"

langjp「ここには、出題者であるお父さんの血を引く人間が４人もいながら、それぞれがバラバラに謎に挑戦してる。@効率的ではないと思わない？」\
;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300062.ogg":^"Here, we have four people who have inherited the blood of the one who made that riddle, ...and each has tried solving it on their own.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300063.ogg":^  That doesn't sound very efficient, does it?"^\

bg new_mdin_1ar,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\rud\1\rud_a11_def1.png",0
_ld c,":b;sprites\ros\1\ros_a11_komaru1.png",0
_ld r,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_def1.png",24
_ld l,":b;sprites\rud\1\rud_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "08"

langjp「……だな。@俺たちは、それぞれが欲の皮を突っ張らせて、単独に謎解きをしてた。@……しかしだ。@黄金発見時の分配等については、もう俺たちの中で決着がついている。@そして、兄貴が次期当主であることを認める、ってのもな。」\
;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200070.ogg":^"...True.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200071.ogg":^  We've all been greedy and tried to go it alone.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200072.ogg":^  ...However,^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200073.ogg":^ we've already reached a decision about how we'll split the gold up if it's found.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200074.ogg":^  And about acknowledging Aniki as the Successor."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\cla\1\cla_a11_nayamu1.png",80
advsetwindow "02"

langjp「それを引き換えに、ずいぶんと吹っ掛けてくれたがね。」\
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800092.ogg":^"Though you demanded quite a lot in exchange."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\ros\1\ros_a11_majime1.png",24
advsetwindow "12"

langjp「………私たちで協力して謎解きをしたら、あの碑文も解けるかしら…。」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400146.ogg":^"...I wonder if we can solve that epitaph...if we pool our efforts and work together..."^\

;bg black,22
bg new_mdin_1er,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\kir\1\kir_a27_futeki1.png",24
advsetwindow "09"

langjp「三人寄れば文殊の知恵。@それどころか、私たちは七人もいるわ。」@
;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300064.ogg":^"Two heads are better than one.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300065.ogg":^  And here, we have seven."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_a11_hohoemi1.png",23
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「お父様の遺産問題については、私たちは今日、概ねで合意を得ているわ。@……余興のつもりで、碑文に挑んでみるのもいいんじゃないかしら。」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000067.ogg":^"Today, we reached a general agreement about the inheritance problem.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000068.ogg":^  ...Why not take a shot at the epitaph for a bit of fun on the side?"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\hid\1\hid_a11_def1.png",24
advsetwindow "06"

langjp「せやな。@一服のつもりで、ちょいとやってみるのもええんとちゃうか。」@
;＜秀吉
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\71100046.ogg":^"Nice idea.^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\71100047.ogg":^  Let's give it a try and call it a break."^\

cl r,23
_ld r,":b;sprites\nat\1\nat_a12_nayamu3.png",24
advsetwindow "03"

langjp「……馬鹿馬鹿しい。@隠し黄金などと……。」\
;＜夏妃
langen:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900082.ogg":^"...Ridiculous.^@:dwave 0, "voice\03\70900083.ogg":^  Of course there's no hidden gold..."^\

bg new_mdin_1gr,26

me2v 5,50
advsetwindow "08"

;ld l,RUD_DefA1,24

langjp「まぁまぁ。@余興だと思ってよ。@郷田さんに、冷たいモンでも持ってきてもらおうぜ。@一服しながら、たまには兄弟水入らずで、謎解きごっこをしてみようじゃねぇか。」\
;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200075.ogg":^"Take it easy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200076.ogg":^  Just think of it as a game.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200077.ogg":^  Let's have Gohda-san bring us something cool to drink.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200078.ogg":^  We can take a break and all play with riddles as a big, happy bunch of siblings for once."^\
advsetwindow "02"

;ld c,KLA_DefA1,24

langjp「ふむ。@どうせ夜は長い。@親父殿の寿命について、下らない詮索をするより、よっぽど建設的だと思えるね。」@
;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800093.ogg":^"Hmmm.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800094.ogg":^  Well, the night is long.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800095.ogg":^  It would at least be more productive than pointless inquiries into Father's health."^\
advsetwindow "12"

;ld r,ROS_DefA1,24

langjp「郷田さんに電話するわ。@何か持ってきてもらいましょうよ。」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400147.ogg":^"I'll ring up Gohda-san.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400148.ogg":^  He can bring us something."^\

;bg Mdin_1gN,26

;bg black,22
bg new_mdin_1cr,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_akire2go.png",22
_ld c,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_akire1go.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「お茶とお菓子と。@……あと、台湾の地図でも持って来させる？」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000069.ogg":^"Let's have tea and sweets.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000070.ogg":^  ...Oh, and a map of Taiwan."^\


