langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300119.ogg":^"I want you to take this ring."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_hajirai2.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「じょ、……譲治さま……。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500545.ogg":^"...G-George-sama..."^\


_ld l,":b;sprites\geo\1\geo_a11k_majime2k.png",80
advsetwindow "07"

langjp「君を生涯、愛することを誓う。@……若い今だけじゃない。@老いて、お墓に入るまでの全てを愛し、君を幸せにすることを誓うよ。」\
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300120.ogg":^"I swear to love you all my life.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300121.ogg":^  ...Not just now, while we're young.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300122.ogg":^  I swear to love you and keep you happy until we get old and go to our graves."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_hajirai1.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「……その言葉に、嘘偽りはありませんか。」@
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500546.ogg":^"...And are there any lies or exaggerations in your words?"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\geo\1\geo_a21_majime4.png",80
advsetwindow "07"

langjp「あぁ、ないね。@僕には、君を愛し、幸せな家庭を作る絶対の覚悟と自信がある。」\
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300123.ogg":^"No, not one.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300124.ogg":^  I'm confident in my resolve to love you and build a happy household together with you."^\

bg new_rose_1cN,22
advsetwindow "15"

;ld r,SHA_HajiraiA1,80

langjp「その、幸せな家庭とは、どんなものですか。」@
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500547.ogg":^"And what would this happy household be like?"^\
advsetwindow "07"

;ld l,GEO_MajimeA1,80

langjp「うん。@それは、とても幸せな家庭だよ。@車と庭付きの家。@そして飼い犬が一匹。@庭には家庭菜園。@子供たちが駆け回り、僕たちはバルコニーから微笑ましそうに見下ろすんだ。@それが、僕たちの未来の日曜日の、当り前の光景だよ。」\
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300125.ogg":^"Well,^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300126.ogg":^ it will be full of happiness.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300127.ogg":^  We'll have a house, with a car and a yard.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300128.ogg":^  And one dog.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300129.ogg":^  The yard will have a vegetable garden.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300130.ogg":^  The kids will run around, and we'll smile down on them from the balcony.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300131.ogg":^  That's what our typical future Sunday will look like."^\
advsetwindow "15"

;ld r,SHA_DefA1,80

langjp「それは、素敵な光景ですね……。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500548.ogg":^"That...would be wonderful..."^\

