langjp「ええーー！！@　あの二人、付き合ってるのかよ？！」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100152.ogg":^"Whaaaat?!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100153.ogg":^  Those two're going out?!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\jes\1\jes_a11_atya2.png",24
advsetwindow "04"

langjp「シー！@　声が大きいって！@　真里亞が起きちゃうだろ…？！」\
;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200354.ogg":^"Shhh!^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200355.ogg":^  Why are you so damn loud?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200356.ogg":^  Maria'll wake up...!"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_aseru1.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「そ、そうか。@そうだったかー…。@言われてみれば、何となく、今日もあの二人、いい雰囲気だったしなぁ。@……そうだよなぁ、俺たちももう、恋をする年頃だもんなぁ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100154.ogg":^"I-I see.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100155.ogg":^  So that's how it is...^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100156.ogg":^  Now that you mention it, they seemed to have a pretty good mood going on there.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100157.ogg":^  ...That's right, we're about the age where you fall in love."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\jes\1\jes_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "04"

langjp「この６年で、私たちはずいぶん変わったぜ。@譲治兄さんも、昔は頼りない感じだったけど、今は違う。」\
;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200357.ogg":^"We've changed a lot in the last six years.^@:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200358.ogg":^  George nii-san used to be a bit unreliable, but he isn't anymore."^\

cl c,0
_ld l,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_futeki1.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「それは思ったぜ。@譲治の兄貴、ずいぶんと貫禄が出てたもんなぁ。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100158.ogg":^"That's what I thought.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100159.ogg":^  George-aniki's got that `air of dignity' thing going."^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……しかし、紗音ちゃんと譲治の兄貴ねぇ。@ちょっぴり意外だった。@
langjp　６年前は仲良く遊んでいたが、それほど二人に接点があるようには思えなかった。\
langen^...But still, Shannon-chan and George-aniki.^@^  That's a bit unexpected.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^They played together often enough six years ago, but I didn't think they were that close.^\

bg new_g2f_r1ar,22
_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_def2.png",24
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「……なるほどなぁ、６年だもんなぁ。」@
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100160.ogg":^"...Well, six years is a long time."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\jes\1\jes_a11_def2.png",23
advsetwindow "04"

langjp「この６年は、誰にとっても大きいぜ。」@
;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200359.ogg":^"These six years have been huge for all of us."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_def3.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「だな。@……俺もこの６年、色々あって、正直、六軒島のことはほとんど忘れてた。」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100161.ogg":^"Yep.^@:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100162.ogg":^  ...A lot's happened to me these six years, and to be honest, I've forgotten almost everything about Rokkenjima."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\jes\1\jes_a11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "04"

langjp「まぁ、私も戦人のこと、ほとんど忘れかけてたけどなー。」@
;＜朱志香
langen:dwave 0, "voice\04\70200360.ogg":^"And I'd forgotten almost everything about you too."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\but\1\but_b11_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "10"

langjp「そりゃ酷ぇぜ、いっひっひ〜！」\
;＜戦人
langen:dwave 0, "voice\10\70100163.ogg":^"Now that really hurts, ihihi!"^\
;br

bg new_g1f_r3a,22
advsetwindow "-1"


langjp　こうしてお喋りしていると、みるみるお互いは、６年前に戻っていく気がする。@
langjp　すっかり忘れてしまうほど長い、６年間。@
langjp　だけれども、こうしていると少しずつ蘇ってくる、６年間。\
langjp　………紗音ちゃん、か。@
langjp　６年前には、仲良しグループに混じってて、一緒に色々と遊んだっけ。@
langjp　俺、あの頃、ひょっとしたら紗音ちゃんのこと、……好きだったかもなー。@
langjp　自意識過剰で、恋に恋してたお年頃だ。\
langen^Talking together like this, it felt as though we'd been teleported six years into the past.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Six long years, so long that I forgot almost everything.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^And yet, it's coming back to me, bit by bit.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^......Shannon-chan.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Six years ago, you were part of our group, and we played together a lot, didn't we...^\
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Back then, I think I might've...liked Shannon-chan.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^That was the age when we were all overly self-conscious, in love with love.^\

