langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300160.ogg":^"...You're right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300161.ogg":^  Sorry.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300162.ogg":^  What's got me so shaken, I wonder.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300163.ogg":^  ...I'm probably still jealous of him, now that he's gotten even cooler these past six years.^@:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300164.ogg":^  ...How pathetic."^\

