langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500579.ogg":^"I'm scared too.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500580.ogg":^  I'm sure you'll meet many women in the future who are much more attractive than me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500581.ogg":^  Or, you might tire of me when I don't match up to your expectations.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500582.ogg":^  It scares me to think that I might not be able to grasp hold of your feelings for the rest of my life."^\

