langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500584.ogg":^"...I've fallen for a wonderful man named Ushiromiya George-san.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500585.ogg":^  And this is a man who has sworn to love me all his life, and who has given me a ring as a sign of this oath.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500586.ogg":^  With this ring here on my ring finger, I can give an honest confession."^\
advsetwindow "07"

;ld l,GEO_majimeA1k,23

langjp「うん。」\
;＜譲治
langen:dwave 0, "voice\07\70300167.ogg":^"Sure."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_tokui1.png",24
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「私は、確かに仰る通り。@……６年前、戦人さまのことが、好きでした。@多分、譲治さんより、好きだったと思います。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500587.ogg":^"Yes, as you said,^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500588.ogg":^ ...I did like Battler-sama six years ago.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500589.ogg":^  I think I probably liked him more than you."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\sha\1\sha_a11_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "15"

langjp「でも。@それは６年前の話です。@今の話では、ありません。@戦人さまへのその気持ちは、この６年間で整理され、思い出と一緒に過去へ、決別したのです。@今の私は、あなたを愛するためだけに存在します。」\
;＜紗音
langen:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500590.ogg":^"However, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500591.ogg":^that was six years ago.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500592.ogg":^  Now, things are different.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500593.ogg":^  In these six years, I've sorted out my feelings for Battler-sama, and cut myself off from them along with the memories of the past.^@:dwave 0, "voice\15\70500594.ogg":^  Now, I exist only to love you."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
;bg black,22
langjp　紗音はきっぱりと、そう言い切る…。\
langen^Shannon spoke clearly and strongly...^\

bg new_garden_r1an,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\geo\1\geo_a21k_komaru5k.png",24
advsetwindow "-1"
;ld l,SHA_MajimeA3,23

langjp　譲治は一度だけ頼りなく笑う。@多分、それは６年前の譲治の浮かべた笑いだ。@
langen^George gave a single, uncertain laugh.^@^  It was probably the same sort of laugh the George of six years ago had made.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　そして背筋を毅然と伸ばし、無言で紗音を抱く。@それは彼にとって、６年前の自分と決別した瞬間だった……。\
langen^Then, he stretched resolutely and hugged Shannon without saying a word.^@^  In that moment, he said goodbye to the person he had been six years ago...^\

