langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700591.ogg":^"No.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700592.ogg":^  ...Even this was one of the results of the roulette I wished to create.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700593.ogg":^  This is probably the best outcome for all of you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700594.ogg":^  No one will die, and you can leave this island with the gold.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700595.ogg":^  ...Congratulations.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700596.ogg":^  This game ends with a perfect victory for you all."^\
