langjp「その通りです。@……皆さんは、誰一人犠牲者を出さないという、最善の形でこのゲームを終えられたのです。@……敬意を表すると同時に、心より感服いたします。@私があれだけ長い時間をかけて解いた謎を、７人掛りとはいえ、一晩で。@………それは讃えられるべきです。」\
;＜ベアト
langen:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700646.ogg":^"You are correct.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700647.ogg":^  ...You have ended this game in the best possible way, without there being even a single victim.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700648.ogg":^  ...I wish to convey my respect and admiration.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700649.ogg":^  There may have been seven of you, but you did solve that riddle, which took me so long to solve, in a single night.^@:dwave 0, "voice\27\70700650.ogg":^  ...That is worthy of praise."^\

;bg sub_R1a,26
