;＜蔵臼
langen:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800133.ogg":^"And I admire you for your graciousness and honesty in defeat.^@:dwave 0, "voice\02\70800134.ogg":^  ......We'll decide how to deal with you in the future, but I intend to do all I can to reach a gentlemanly agreement."^\

