langjp「完璧だわ、完璧よッ…！！！@　兄さんたちが死んだのだって事故だもの！@　もう一つ、事故が起こるだけの話だわ！！@　ね、そうでしょう、あんたたち？！@　筋書きは適当に考えるわ！！@　とにかく私たちはたまたま明日の夜、隠し屋敷にいた！@　そこで偶然、爆発事故が起こって難を逃れた！！@　そういう筋書きにすればいいのよ！！」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000231.ogg":^"It's perfect, just perfect...!!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000232.ogg":^  After all, it was an accident that they died anyway!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000233.ogg":^  We're just changing the type of accident!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000234.ogg":^  Isn't that right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000235.ogg":^  We can think up any story we want!!^\:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000236.ogg":^  By chance, the rest of us will happen to be in the hidden mansion tomorrow night!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000237.ogg":^  Then, when the explosion accident occurs, we'll be lucky enough to survive!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000238.ogg":^  That story should work!!"^\

