advsetwindow "12"
langjp「………な、何をどういう筋書きにするつもりよ。@……蔵臼兄さんと夏妃姉さんだけを残して、残り全員が隠し屋敷に行っていて、@私たちだけが都合よく難を逃れるって、一体、どういう筋書きよ…！」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400192.ogg":^"...J-Just what sort of story are you planning on?^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400193.ogg":^  ...What kind of story could explain how the two of them alone remained here ^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400194.ogg":^while the rest of us conveniently went to the hidden mansion and managed to escape...?!"^\


