langjp「それはこれから考えるって言ってるでしょッ、馬鹿楼座ッ！！！@　何でもいいのよ、口裏さえ合わせればどうにでもなるのよ！！@　考えるわよ、考えてるわよッ、あんたたちも考えなさいよッ！！@　誰か考えてぇええぇえええッ！！！」/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000239.ogg":^"That's what we've got to think up now, stupid Rosa!!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000240.ogg":^  It doesn't matter what it is, as long as we all agree to it!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000241.ogg":^  I'll think of something...  I ~ib~am~ib~ thinking...  You all think too!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000242.ogg":^  Someone think of somethiiiiiiiiiiiing!!!"^@/
