langjp「お、落ち着くんや絵羽…。@わしも考える、みんなも考えとる！@　必ずうまく行くんや、思いつくんや！@　お前だけに背負わせとるわけやないで、みんなで背負うんやで…！！@　大丈夫ッ、大丈夫やッ！！@　必ずうまい言い訳が思いつくんや！」\
;＜秀吉
langen:dwave 0, "voice\06\71100110.ogg":^"C-Calm down, Eva...^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\71100111.ogg":^  I'll think about it, and so will everyone else!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\71100112.ogg":^  We'll definitely think of something, and it'll all work out!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\71100113.ogg":^  We'll share the burden.  You won't have to carry it all yourself...!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\71100114.ogg":^  It'll all be okay...  It will!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\06\71100115.ogg":^  I know we'll think of a good excuse!"^\

