advsetwindow "12"

langjp「……それはどんな言い訳なの？@　蔵臼兄さんと夏妃姉さんの二人だけを屋敷に残して、……私たちと子供たちと、あと使用人のみんなも一緒に仲良く地下道を探検して、@みんなで隠し屋敷で夜を過ごすという、どういう言い訳なの？@　うまい言い訳があるわけもない。@……滅茶苦茶だわ！」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400195.ogg":^"...What kind of excuse?^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400196.ogg":^  We took the kids and all the servants to go exploring an underground passageway, leaving just the two of them behind,^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400197.ogg":^ and the rest of us all decided to spend the night in the hidden mansion?^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400198.ogg":^  How could any excuse work?^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400199.ogg":^  ...It's insane!"^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_ikari2.png",22
