langjp「その滅茶苦茶を考えるのが私たちの仕事でしょッ？！？！@　何を他人面してんのよ？！@　あんたたちも考えてよッ、考えなさいよッ！！！」/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000243.ogg":^"And thinking up that insane thing is our job!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000244.ogg":^  Why are you acting like this has nothing to do with you?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000245.ogg":^  You think of something too!!!"^@/
