;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400203.ogg":^"We've finally gotten our hands on 20 billion yen of gold.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400204.ogg":^  And you want to blow it all away...?"^\
advsetwindow "05"

