langjp「そんなの運べばいいじゃないッ、運べばッ！！@　爆発は明日の２４時！@　まるまる１日あるのよ？！@　みんなで運べば何とかッ、」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000247.ogg":^"We can just carry it away...yeah, that's right!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000248.ogg":^  The explosion will happen tomorrow at midnight!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000249.ogg":^  We have a full day!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000250.ogg":^  If we all carry it together, we might-"^\

