langjp「１０ｔあるのよ？@　……お米の袋を担ぐのもやっとの私たちが、一体どの程度の量を、たったの一日で、@島の反対側まで通じる長い地下道を徒歩で往復して運ぶって言うのよ。@それこそ無茶苦茶だわ。」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400205.ogg":^"You realize there's 10 tons of it, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400206.ogg":^  ...Just how much do you think our small group can carry ^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400207.ogg":^back and forth across this long, underground passage that goes all the way across the island?^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400208.ogg":^  You're being absurd."^\


_ld r,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_odoroki2.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「こ、これ！！@　カードがあるじゃない！@　さっき、あの女から受け取った１０億円の入ったカードが！！@　黄金は運べるだけ運べばいい！@　それを別にしても、私たちには１０億円が入ったカードがあるわ！@　三等分しても分け前は最低３億！@　私たちの誰もが、それで充分に金策を凌げるじゃない！！」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000251.ogg":^"H-Here!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000252.ogg":^  We have this card, right?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000253.ogg":^  The card worth a billion yen, the one that woman gave us!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000254.ogg":^  We'll just carry as much gold as we can!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000255.ogg":^  We have the card with a billion yen on top of that!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000256.ogg":^  If we split that three ways, we'll have more than 300 million each!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000257.ogg":^  That should be enough for all of our purposes!!"^\

bg black,1
advsetwindow "12"
;ld c,ROS_DefA1,80

langjp「嫌よ。」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400209.ogg":^"I don't like it."^\


