;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400216.ogg":^"Nee-san,^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400217.ogg":^ please calm down and listen.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400218.ogg":^  This plan will let both of us leave with the maximum amount of money."^\

