langjp「いいじゃない。@別に何十年も食らい込むわけじゃない。@だって事故なんでしょ？　ほんの数年で出て来られるわよ。@……罪を償って綺麗になって戻ってきたら、姉さんの分の黄金、５０億を好きにすればいい。」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400226.ogg":^"It's not so bad, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400227.ogg":^  After all, it's not like they'll keep you in jail for several decades.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400228.ogg":^  It was an accident, right?  You'll be able to get out after just a few years.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400229.ogg":^  ...When you've paid for your sins and come back, then you can do whatever you want with your 5 billion."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_odoroki2.png",24
