langjp　楼座は始めから、絵羽の提案する爆発事故に乗るつもりはない。@
langjp　各自の分け前の最大配分を考えれば、爆発事故は何の得にもならないのだ。@
langen^Rosa had never intended to go along with Eva's proposal.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^If it was a question of maximizing each person's portion, no one had anything to gain from an explosion accident.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　蔵臼たちの死を隠蔽できる。@それ以上の意味は何もないのだ。\
langen^An explosion would conceal Krauss and Natsuhi's deaths.^@^  ...And it would serve no further purpose.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　楼座から見れば、余計な工作などせず、素直に警察に自首してもらえるのが最善なのだ。@
langjp　ただ現場だけを、ここでなく、別の場所にして欲しいだけ。\
langen^From Rosa's perspective, the ideal outcome would be for them to confess to their crimes, without any unnecessary tricks.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^All she wanted was to change the crime scene from here to a different place.^\

