;br
langjp　５０億の分け前が、３億程度に減るのは悔しいが、@彼女が蔵臼からせしめようとしていた当初の金額からすれば、それは充分過ぎるものだ。@
langen^She didn't like having her share shrink from 5 billion to 300 million,^\^ but even that was more than enough to cover the amount she had been trying to wring out of Krauss in the first place.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
