langjp「なぁに、姉さん。その銃は。@……私も暴発ということで殺すの？@　言い訳がますます難しくなるわよ。@それどころか、蔵臼兄さんたちのことも、事故とは言い難くなるんじゃないかしら…？」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400232.ogg":^"What do you think you're doing with that gun, Nee-san?^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400233.ogg":^  ...Are you going to have me die in the explosion too?^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400234.ogg":^  That'll make finding an excuse even harder.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400235.ogg":^  In fact, it'll make it harder to explain away the other two deaths as accidents too..."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ros\1\ros_a14_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "12"

langjp「３人もの死に関わったら、かなりの大事件だわ。@………恐らく、求刑は死刑。@妥当なところで無期懲役。@軽くても１０年以上は食らい込みそうね？」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400236.ogg":^"Three whole deaths means it'll be quite a large-scale crime.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400237.ogg":^  ...It would probably get you the death penalty.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400238.ogg":^  Or life in prison, if you're lucky.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400239.ogg":^  Even in the best case, you'll probably be put away for more than a decade, right?"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ros\1\ros_a14_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "12"

langjp「大人しく自首しなさいよ。@そうすれば、不幸な事故がたまたま重なったことで済ませられるわ。@無論、刑期だって大したことはない。@……譲治くんのことは安心して。@私たちでちゃんと面倒を見ておくわ。@姉さんの取り分の５０億はきっちり、手付かずで残しておいてあげるから安心して。」\
;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400240.ogg":^"Turn yourself in.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400241.ogg":^  If you do, this will be no more than a pair of unfortunate accidents.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400242.ogg":^  Of course, your jail term won't be too terrible either.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400243.ogg":^  ...Don't worry about George-kun.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400244.ogg":^  We'll take good care of him.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400245.ogg":^  And we'll make sure that your entire share of 5 billion yen is waiting for you when you get back."^\

