langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400246.ogg":^"Put the gun down, Nee-san.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400247.ogg":^  Once you calm down, you'll see that my plan is the best one.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400248.ogg":^  ...Jail isn't so bad, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400249.ogg":^  Think of it as a financial strategy."^\

