;＜楼座
langen:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400250.ogg":^"Even if they put you in for ten years, there will be 5 billion waiting for you when you get out.^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400251.ogg":^  That's like working for a 500 million yen salary, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\12\71400252.ogg":^  If you think of it that way, won't you enjoy your job more?"^\


