me1v 16,50
_ld c,":b;sprites\kir\1\kir_a11_warai2.png",22
advsetwindow "09"

langjp「楼座さんの見込みは、少し甘いわ。@……無刻印の、これだけ大量のインゴットを換金するのなんて、@どれだけ大変か、まるでわかってないわ。」\
;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300124.ogg":^"Rosa-san's analysis was a little naive.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300125.ogg":^  ...She has no idea how difficult it would be ^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300126.ogg":^to exchange this many unmarked gold ingots for money."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\rud\1\rud_a11_akuwarai1.png",80
advsetwindow "08"

langjp「………見せ金に使っただけで、右代宮家黄金伝説なんてのが出来ちまうほど、親父の時にだって大きな噂になったんだ。@……無理さ、換金なんて。@換金できねぇ黄金の山なんて、クソの山と同じだぜ。」\
;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200148.ogg":^"...Back in Dad's day, even just showing this gold to get funding was enough to create the massive rumor called the Ushiromiya Legend of the Gold.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200149.ogg":^  ...Exchanging this for cash is impossible.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200150.ogg":^  A pile of gold you can't use is no better than a pile of crap."^\


_ld c,":b;sprites\kir\1\kir_a11_futeki1.png",80
advsetwindow "09"

langjp「１０ｔもの黄金が水面下で換金されていて、次期当主夫婦が怪死。@これで目立つなという方が無理な話だわ。@……警察沙汰にしない方がいい。@この島を吹き飛ばして証拠隠滅。@インゴットに未練があるなら、持てる分だけどうぞご勝手に。@１０億のキャッシュカードだけで、見返りは充分。@……つまり、絵羽姉さんが正しいのよ。」\
;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300127.ogg":^"`10 tons of gold were exchanged for cash on the black market, and the Successor and his wife died mysterious deaths.'^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300128.ogg":^  Expecting that to go unnoticed is what's really unbelievable.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300129.ogg":^  ...We don't want to get the police involved.^\:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300130.ogg":^  We'll blow up this island and destroy all the evidence.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300131.ogg":^  If it's tough parting with the gold, feel free to grab as much as you can hold.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300132.ogg":^  The billion yen on the cash card is more than enough.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300133.ogg":^  ...In other words, Eva nee-san was right."^\

bg new_sub_r1b,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_komaru4.png",23
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「う、………嬉しいわ……。@……あなたと、意見が一致して……。@…け、警察沙汰になれば、何が起こるかわからない。@黄金の換金だってそうだわ。@きっとボロを出すきっかけになるわよ、私たちにはどうにもならなかった…！！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000274.ogg":^"I......I'm glad...^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000275.ogg":^  ...It looks like we're on the same page...^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000276.ogg":^  ...I-If the police get involved, who knows what might happen?^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000277.ogg":^  It's the same with cashing in the gold.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000278.ogg":^  I'm sure that would have tripped us up somewhere, so we had no choice...!!"^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\eva\1\eva_b25_odoroki1.png",80
advsetwindow "05"

langjp「あの女が現金化してくれた１０億が、私たちに手に入れられる唯一のお金なのよ！@　そして１０億の山分けだけでも、私たちには充分過ぎるわ…！@　そして今、楼座が死んで、その分け前はさらに増えたわ…！@　私たちは５億ずつを持って、島から出られる…！」\
;＜絵羽
langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000279.ogg":^"The 1 billion that woman over there exchanged for cash is the only money we'll be able to get our hands on!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000280.ogg":^  And even splitting that billion, it'll be more than enough for what we need...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000281.ogg":^  On top of that, now that Rosa is dead, our shares have increased even more...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000282.ogg":^  We can each leave this island with 500 million...!"^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\kir\1\kir_a11_warai2.png",22
advsetwindow "09"

langjp「そういうことよ。@黄金を換金したいなんて欲さえ捨てれば。@……この島で起こった全てを、なかったことに出来る。@そういう仕掛けが、ここにはあるわ。」\
;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300134.ogg":^"Exactly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300135.ogg":^  As long as we don't let our greedy desire to cash in the gold control us,^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300136.ogg":^ ...we can pretend that everything that occurred on this island never happened.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300137.ogg":^  We have a way to do that right here."^\
;br

