;＜霧江
langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300140.ogg":^"The guns lying at your feet are Krauss nii-san's and Eva nee-san's.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300141.ogg":^  Both of those have been fired.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300142.ogg":^  However, Rosa-san's gun can shoot if you just pull the trigger.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300143.ogg":^  It's hard to reload one of these if you aren't used to a lever action.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300144.ogg":^  An amateur would have some trouble pulling it off."^\


