;＜留弗夫
langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200161.ogg":^"Sorry 'bout this, Aniki, Aneki, Rosa.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200162.ogg":^  ...Well, that's life for you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200163.ogg":^  Give me a break, okay?^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200164.ogg":^  Aniki and Aneki get into a fight, Rosa gets dragged in,^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200165.ogg":^ and I'm the one who picks up the pieces.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200166.ogg":^  ...Just like it's always been, right?"^\
