langen:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200208.ogg":^"Still, I wonder why he wanted to meet you in front of the chapel, of all places.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200209.ogg":^  ...He expects a lot from you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\08\71200210.ogg":^  I think he wants to talk to you alone, not sure what about."^\
