langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300301.ogg":^"Children are bonds used to tie you to your husband.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300302.ogg":^  ...She was a bond to make Rudolf-san acknowledge me, so I could take him back from that woman."^\

