langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300305.ogg":^"Just that right now, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300306.ogg":^I'm the wife of no man, and I have no intention of being a mother.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300307.ogg":^  ...I am me.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300308.ogg":^  Kyrie.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300309.ogg":^  Now that Rudolf-san's dead, I'm not even an Ushiromiya anymore.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300310.ogg":^  I live to benefit me."^\
