langen:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000354.ogg":^"Right, Rudolf is dead, so maybe you aren't a wife anymore.^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000355.ogg":^  But you still have Ange-chan, don't you...?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\05\71000356.ogg":^  You're still a mother, aren't you...?!"^\
