langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300316.ogg":^"Did either of us marry because we wanted children?^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300317.ogg":^  We didn't, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300318.ogg":^  We married because we wanted to live with the man we loved.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300319.ogg":^  And, once you've married, you never want to let that man go, for the rest of your life, correct?^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300320.ogg":^  Children are just weapons to be used for that goal."^\


