langen:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300325.ogg":^"That would be just a bit too sad, so I won't say it to her directly.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300326.ogg":^  I plan to write her a letter asking her to forgive her bad mother, then vanish from her life.^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300327.ogg":^  You've seen what Rosa-san and Maria-chan are like, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\09\71300328.ogg":^  Now that Rudolf-san's gone, Ange's just a chain tying me down."^\


