langjp「縁寿…、どうか落ち着いて…！@　これはゲームです…！@　あれが、あなたのお母さんの本心のわけがない…！@　こんなのゲームマスターが霧江叔母さんの駒に言わせてるだけに過ぎません…！！」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300724.ogg":^"Ange, ...please, calm down...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300725.ogg":^  This is just a game...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300726.ogg":^  That couldn't possibly be what your mother truly feels...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300727.ogg":^  It's just something that the Game Master made Aunt Kyrie's piece say...!!"^\
advsetwindow "-1"

