langjp「これが、真実なのよ。@１９８６年１０月４日からの二日間の、猫箱の中身よ。@この後、絵羽は九羽鳥庵で爆発を逃れて生き残るわ。@……そして、猫箱の中身を欲するあなたに、最後の瞬間まで沈黙を貫くことで、この真実を、永遠に猫箱に閉ざした。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100315.ogg":^"This is the truth.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100316.ogg":^  The insides of the cat box of October 4th and 5th, 1986.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100317.ogg":^  Afterwards, Eva survived the explosion by escaping to Kuwadorian.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100318.ogg":^  ...And, since she never spoke of the inside of the cat box no matter how much you wanted to know, that truth was shut within the cat box for all eternity."^\

