langen^Kinzo decided to present that riddle at the family conference.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　それが解けた者に、次期当主の座を譲るのか。@あるいは、理御の次期当主を考え直すことを約束するのか。\
langen^Did he plan to give the position of Successor to the person who solved it?^@^  Or did he promise to reconsider Lion's position as the Successor if it was solved?^\
advsetwindow "-1"

;ld c,KIN_waraiA2,80

langjp　いずれにせよ、金蔵には自信があった。@
langjp　自分が練り上げたこの難解な謎が、絶対に解かれるわけはないという自信があった。\
langen^Either way, Kinzo was confident.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^He was confident that no one would be able to solve this tough riddle, which he had created himself.^\

bg black,24
mono 0
bg new_m1f_s1ar,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai4.png",24
_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai2.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「あとは、すでに見た真実とまったく同じ展開よ。@あっさりと兄弟たちに解かれ、黄金の山を巡ってひと悶着。@くすくす……。@そして、霧江と留弗夫は、翌朝の事件発覚と、それに伴う騒ぎを未然に防ぐため、深夜に殺人を決行する。@………いとこ部屋に集まっている子供たちを一人ずつ、電話で呼び出して殺したわ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100411.ogg":^"After that, everything happened exactly like the truth you just saw.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100412.ogg":^  The siblings solved it right away, and there was a quarrel over the pile of gold.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100413.ogg":^  *giggle*...^\:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100414.ogg":^  Then, Kyrie and Rudolf decided to prevent any chance of the crime being discovered the next morning and an outcry being raised... by committing murder late that night.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100415.ogg":^  ......They used the phone to call the kids out from the cousin room one by one, then killed them."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_akuwarai3.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「……いとこの筆頭のあなたは、一番最初に呼び出された。@そして客間で、霧江に撃たれて殺されたの。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100416.ogg":^"...As the first of the cousins, you were the first to be called out.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100417.ogg":^  Then, Kyrie shot you dead right here in the parlor."^\

cl r,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai3.png",24
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「………うぅん、違うわね。@あなたは１９８６年１０月４日の夕方の右代宮理御だものね。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100418.ogg":^"...No, that's not quite right.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100419.ogg":^  You're the Ushiromiya Lion from the early evening of October 4th, 1986.^@/
advsetwindow "28"

;ld r,BER_WaraiA4,80

langjpだからこう言うわ。@……あなたは今日の深夜に、客間で霧江に撃たれて殺されるのよ。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100420.ogg":^  So, I'll say it this way.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100421.ogg":^  ...Tonight, Kyrie will shoot you dead in the parlor."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_odoroki1.png",23
advsetwindow "53"

langjp「そんな、…………馬鹿な…………。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300787.ogg":^"That's......insane...^@/

_ld l,":b;sprites\rio\1\rio_a11_ikari1a.png",80
advsetwindow "53"

langjpそれは、……そうだ、確率だ！@　クレルから理御という奇跡が低い確率で生まれるように、@霧江叔母さんがそのような凶行に及ぶのだって、限りなくゼロに近い、わずかの確率に違いないッ！@　あなたは、そのわずかの確率の世界を見つけることが出来る魔女ではありませんか！！」\
;＜理御
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300788.ogg":^  It's...  That's right, probability!^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300789.ogg":^  Just like Lion can be born from Clair thanks to a rare miracle,^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300790.ogg":^ Aunt Kyrie only commits murder with a tiny probability, close to zero!  That must be it!^@:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300791.ogg":^  Aren't you the witch who specializes in finding extremely improbable worlds?!!"^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_def2.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「如何にもその通りよ。@あなたという奇跡の存在を見つけ出すために、２５７万８９１７の中のたった１つのカケラを見つけ出してきた。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100422.ogg":^"That is correct.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100423.ogg":^  I had to find one Fragment out of 2,578,917 in order to discover the miracle that is you.^@/
advsetwindow "28"

;ld r,BER_WaraiA3,80

langjp……でもね。@あなたのこの末路はね、とてもとても簡単に見つけられたのよ。@だって、確率など、ないのだもの。@………私は、わずかの奇跡があれば、それを見つけ出せる魔女。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100424.ogg":^  ...However,^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100425.ogg":^ it was very, very easy to find this result for your world.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100426.ogg":^  After all, probability isn't a factor.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100427.ogg":^  ...I'm a witch who can find any miracle, no matter how unlikely it is."^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai4.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「でもね、ないものは見つけられないの。@……私とて、絶対の魔女に、本当に絶対を保証されたら、勝てないんだから。」\
;＜ベルン
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100428.ogg":^"But I can't find things that don't exist.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100429.ogg":^  ...If the Witch of Certainty really guarantees that something is certain, even I can't win against her."^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "53"
;ld c,RIO_DefA1,80

langjp!s1「そんな、/
langjp!d800………では、/
langjp!d700……私は………………、」/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300792.ogg":!s1^"But...^@/
advsetwindow "53"
langen:delay 1300:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300793.ogg":^...then...^@/
advsetwindow "53"
langen:delay 1000:dwave 0, "voice\53\75300794.ogg":^...I'm......"^@/
langjp!sd\
langen!sd\

;＜理御

bg new_m1f_s1cr,0
_ld c,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_shian1.png",26
_ld c,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai1.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「２５７万８９１７分の２５７万８９１６の確率で。@あなたはクレルとしての世界に生き、逃れ得ぬ運命に翻弄され、気の毒な最期を遂げる。@そして、２５７万８９１７分の１の確率で右代宮理御として生き。@今夜、霧江に殺されるの。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100430.ogg":^"With a 2,578,916 out of 2,578,917 probability,^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100431.ogg":^ you live in the world where you're Clair, get toyed with by an inescapable fate, and reach a tragic end.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100432.ogg":^  And, with a 1 out of 2,578,917 probability, you live as Ushiromiya Lion...^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100433.ogg":^and are killed by Kyrie tonight."^\

cl c,0
_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_warai3.png",23
advsetwindow "28"

langjp「………つまりあなたの、いいえ、あなたたちの運命は、２５７万８９１７分の２５７万８９１７の確率で、@………つまり如何なる奇跡も許されない絶対の運命で、逃れ得ぬ袋小路に、運命の牢獄に囚われているということなのよ！@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100434.ogg":^"...In other words, your fate...no, the fate the two of you share... traps you in an inescapable dead end, a hell of fate, with a 2,578,917 out of 2,578,917 probability.^\:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100435.ogg":^  To put it another way, it's a certain fate, with absolutely no chance for a miracle!^@/

_ld r,":b;sprites\ber\1\ber_a21_akuwarai3.png",80
advsetwindow "28"

langjp　くすくす、うっふふふふふふふふふふ！！/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100436.ogg":^  *giggle*, eheheheheheheheheheh!!^@/

