langjp「ベアトリーチェ。@閉ざされた、逃げ得ぬ絶対の二日間に閉じ込められたあなたは、その二日間の猫箱の中で無限を生み出せる魔女となったわ。@……絶対に救われない、報われないことと引き換えにね。@/
langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100439.ogg":^"Beatrice.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100440.ogg":^  Trapped in that inescapable, certain, locked-away pair of days, you became a witch who could give birth to endless possibilities within that two-day cat box.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100441.ogg":^  ...In exchange, it was absolutely certain that you would not be saved or rewarded.^\/

se1 35
bg new_blood_2c,1
