;＜ベルン
langen@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100451.ogg":^  Yeah, now I feel a lot better about losing that game...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100452.ogg":^  Hey, Beato, are you watching?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100453.ogg":^  Can you see this?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100454.ogg":^  And do you remember?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100455.ogg":^  Remember when I promised you that a miracle wouldn't occur, with certainty?!"^\


