langjp「ご苦労であった、我が巫女よ。@その任を解く。@……私は再び眠りに就く。@この心地良きまどろみを、数百年にわたって楽しみたい。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\75000012.ogg":^"You have done well, my miko.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\75000013.ogg":^  I absolve you of your duty.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\75000014.ogg":^  ...I will return to my slumber.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\75000015.ogg":^  I'd like to enjoy this pleasant dream for a few more centuries."^\

_ld l,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b12_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「そして私が再び飽きる時。@……そなたは私を楽しませるために、また新しい物語を見つけてくるのだ。@……それまでの数百年のひと時。@そなたの自由を許す。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\75000016.ogg":^"And when I grow tired of that,^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\75000017.ogg":^ ...you will find yet another tale to keep me entertained.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\75000018.ogg":^  ...For those centuries, which will pass in the blink of an eye,^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\75000019.ogg":^ I grant you your freedom."^\

