langen:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100557.ogg":^"Hey, pieces of Beato's game...?^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100558.ogg":^  I'm gonna have you spin a incredibly brutal tale that I'll find incredibly entertaining.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100559.ogg":^  Tremble in fear of the certain fate you've been promised.^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100560.ogg":^  ...By the name of Bernkastel, Witch of Miracles,^@:dwave 0, "voice\28\72100561.ogg":^ ...and as the final Game Master of Beato's game, I proclaim it."^\

