langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000167.ogg":^"Today, a kid in class bullied me...^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000168.ogg":^  He said the people on TV were saying Mom had ties to bad people.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000169.ogg":^  ...So, he said that Mom and Dad were the culprits, and that they probably killed everyone...^\:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000170.ogg":^  ...I asked Aunt Eva, hoping she'd say it wasn't true, but she didn't say anything...^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000171.ogg":^  ...Mom and Dad aren't bad people, right?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\72000172.ogg":^  Right...?"^\

