langjp　尊厳なる観劇と戯曲と傍観の魔女は、筆を置き、天井を見上げながら深く息を吐き出すのだった。\
langen^The majestic Witch of Theatergoing, Drama, and Spectating set down her pen, looked at the ceiling, and sighed deeply.^\
bg black,22
bg new_FEA_R1cp,22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　机の上は、書き散らされた膨大な量の原稿用紙が乱雑に積まれている。@
langen^The desk was covered with a scattered mountain of paper covered with writing.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　細やかな、そして尊厳ある者にしか読めぬ情報密度の極めて高い言語が、ぎっしりと書き込まれている。\
langen^Words were packed onto the pages in a thin, high information density language that only the great ones could read.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　その言語の一文字は、ニンゲンの世界での書籍数冊に匹敵する情報量を持つ。@
langjp　それによって、ぎっしりと書き上げられた原稿用紙が、これほどに積み上げられているのだから。@
langen^Each letter of this language carried the same amount of information as several books in the Human world.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^These letters filled every inch of this huge pile of paper.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　……彼女はきっと、何か一つの世界を、書き切ったに違いなかった。\
langen^...Surely, she had written out every little detail of some world.^\

_ld c,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def2.png",2
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「…………書き切ったには、書き切った。@いや、正確には書き切っておらぬのだが。」@
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000182.ogg":^"......Yes, I have written it all.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000183.ogg":^  Though to be accurate, I have not truly written it all."^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　彼女は立ち上がり、お気に入りの揺り椅子に腰を下ろすと、しばらくの間、その緩やかな揺れを楽しんだ。\
langen^She stood up, sat down in her favorite rocking chair, and rocked peacefully for a while.^\

cl c,22

bg new_FEA_R1ep,1
se1 13
quakey 2,200

wait 2000
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「どこまでを描けば、果たして物語を書き切ったと言えるのか。@……私の、物書きとしての長年の悩みだ。@……ニンゲンの冒険は物語としてとても面白い。@しかし、どこまでが冒険で、どこからがそうではないのかが、私をしても、未だによくわからぬのだ。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000184.ogg":^"How far must one write before they can say they've written it all?^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000185.ogg":^  ...That is what has bothered me in all my years of writing.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000186.ogg":^  ...The adventures of Humans can be very interesting as a tale.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000187.ogg":^  However, even I still don't know when that adventure stops being an adventure."^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「……すでに没した私の旧友は、@ニンゲンの人生は、初めから終わりまでが全て冒険であり、筆を置くところなど存在しないと言ったが。@……私はそうは思わぬ。@筆の置き所というものがあると思う。@物語は、適当なところまでを記し、その後の余韻や感想は、観劇者に委ねるべきだと思う。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000188.ogg":^"...My old friend, who is now gone,^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000189.ogg":^ once said that a Human's life is an adventure from beginning to end, so there is never a correct time to set down one's pen.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000190.ogg":^  ...I do not agree.^\:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000191.ogg":^  I think one must put away the pen at some point.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000192.ogg":^  I believe one should write a tale to an appropriate point, then leave the aftertaste and opinions to the minds of the spectators."^\

bg new_fea_r1ap,22
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「……つまり、物語は適当なところで猫箱にしまうべきなのだ。@……猫箱を巡っての長き物語なのだから、その終焉も最後までを記さず、猫箱にしまってしまうのが良いのではあるまいか…？」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000193.ogg":^"...In short, the tale must be put inside a cat box at the appropriate time.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000194.ogg":^  ...The cat box has been the subject of this long tale, so is it not better to refrain from writing its demise, to instead put it in the cat box and leave it there...?"^\

;bg FEA_R1dp,0
ut_mld r,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def2.png",22
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　フェザリーヌは、自分以外に誰もいない書斎で、……誰にともなく、そう語る。@
langjp　もちろん、誰かが相槌を打つわけもない。@
langen^Featherine...spoke to no one inside the empty study.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^Of course, no one commented on her words.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　しかしフェザリーヌには、それが聞こえたらしい。@
langjp　ウンウンと頷くと、にんまり笑う。\
langen^However, Featherine seemed to hear something.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^She nodded and grinned contentedly.^\

ut_mld r,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_b11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "50"

langjp「わかっている。@もう少しだけを書き足し、そこで筆を置こう。@……それで、そなたとはお別れだ。」\
;＜フェザ
langen:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000195.ogg":^"Yes, I know.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000196.ogg":^  I will write a bit further, then lay down my pen.^@:dwave 0, "voice\50\85000197.ogg":^  ...Then, it will be time for us to say our goodbyes."^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　フェザリーヌが、少し暗くせよと指を掲げてくるくる回す。@
langen^Featherine held up a finger and spun it around, a signal that she wanted to darken the room.^@
;br
se1 22
mset2ef 5
advsetwindow "-1"

