;gggg
langjp　そこは大きなホテルの、一番大きなバンケットルーム。@
langjp　大勢の来賓がひしめき、壇上にて受賞盾を受け取る人物を拍手で祝福していた。@
langen^It was the largest banquet hall in this huge hotel.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^The many guests that filled the room chattered and applauded the person receiving an award trophy on top of the stage.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
;gggg
langjp　表看板には、国内有数の大手出版社の受賞式典と書かれている。\
langen^The sign in front said `Awards Ceremony from Japan's Greatest Publishers'.^\

bg black,22
advsetwindow "-1"
;gggg
langjp「続きまして、小説部門に参りたいと思います。@受賞作は、皆さんもご存知。@世界的な一大ムーブメントを巻き起こし、@破竹の快進撃を続ける、ファンタジー冒険小説@『さくたろうの大冒険』です！」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\99\SIKAI8006.ogg":^"And now, I would like to begin the novel category.^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\SIKAI8007.ogg":^  The winner...is that fantasy adventure novel we all know so well,^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\SIKAI8008.ogg":^ the story that started a worldwide movement ^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\SIKAI8009.ogg":^that continues to grow in leaps and bounds, ^@:dwave 0, "voice\99\SIKAI8010.ogg":^`Sakutarou's Great Adventure'!"^\

se1v 76,100
bg white,29
bg new_bui_h1f2,2
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　正面のプロジェクターに、作品の概要が映し出される。@
langjp　それは、すでに８巻を越える、長編ファンタジー冒険小説だ。@
langen^The projector in front of the audience showed a brief summary of the series.^@
advsetwindow "-1"
langen^It was...a lengthy fantasy adventure novel that was already more than 8 installments long.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
;gggg
langjp　臆病な草食らいおん、さくたろうが、仲間たちと出会い切磋琢磨しながら成長して、@「一つのカケラの秘宝」を求めて大冒険する痛快ファンタジーだ。\
langen^The thrilling fantasy story told of the adventures of Sakutarou, a cowardly vegeta-lion who makes friends, learns through his experiences, and grows in his search for the One Fragment.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

;gggg
langjp　主人公さくたろうの名台詞「僕は百獣王になる」は、流行語大賞の候補にもなった。@
langen^The main character's catch phrase, `I'll become the King of the Beasts', was even one of the candidates for the Buzzwords of the Year award.^\
advsetwindow "-1"
;br
langjp　痛快に読める娯楽小説の体裁を取りながらも、子供たちに伝えたいテーマがいくつも織り込まれ、@親子で読みたい冒険小説として高い評価を受けた。\
langen^In addition to being a thrill to read, the books also contained many messages for children to learn from,^@^ earning it high praise as an adventure novel that parents and kids could enjoy reading together.^\
advsetwindow "-1"

langjp　しかし、それは最初から得られた評価ではない。@
langen^However, it hadn't received such praise from the beginning.^@
