langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001804.ogg":^"You regret it...?!!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001805.ogg":^  Did you ever try thinking about how I felt?!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001806.ogg":^  For decades, ...for most of my life...!^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001807.ogg":^  Do you realize what feelings I had to live with...?"^\

