langen:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000074.ogg":^"I feel deeply ashamed for doing something so cruel to you.^@:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000075.ogg":^  ...That's why I've searched for you ever since then.^@:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000076.ogg":^  For your sake and for mine, ...I should have met you much earlier..."^\
