langen:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000079.ogg":^"...Yes.^@:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000080.ogg":^  ...It's true that my memory of my escape from the island is still hazy.^@:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000081.ogg":^  However, I've remembered almost everything else.^@:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000082.ogg":^  ......Like how those pink hair ornaments of yours that you treasure so much...were something I won for you at the game corner in that amusement park."^\
