langen:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000083.ogg":^"I remember a lot more besides that.^@:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000084.ogg":^  ...I remember you giving Mom trouble because you hated eating seaweed.^@:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000085.ogg":^  I remember that you tried to move it to my plate and trick her.^@:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000086.ogg":^  ...And when-"^\
