langjp「……………それが、……私の脳障害なのです。@……いくつもの病院を巡りましたが、どうにもなりませんでした。@……あなたにはわからないでしょう。@ある日、突然、知らない男の記憶が頭一杯に溢れ出すのが、どれほど辛いことか…。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000087.ogg":^"......That's...the result of the damage to my brain.^@:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000088.ogg":^  ...I've been to several hospitals, but it didn't do any good.^@:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000089.ogg":^  ...You probably can't understand it.^@:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000090.ogg":^  You can't know how painful it is to have your mind suddenly filled with the memories of a man you don't know..."^\

