langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001826.ogg":^"...Mr. Tohya,^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001827.ogg":^ ...would you mind meeting with me just one last time?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001828.ogg":^  There's a place I feel I need to show you."^\

