advsetwindow "57"

langjp「………そういえば先生は、小説の他にも、色々とご活躍でいらっしゃいましたね。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\57\86000117.ogg":^"......Come to think of it, you've been involved in a lot of things besides novels, haven't you?"^\
advsetwindow "11"

langjp「その日に、もう一度だけお時間を下さいませんか。@……それで、私も兄も、納得すると思います。@十八先生も兄の記憶の重石から、解放されて良いと思います。」\
langen:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001829.ogg":^"Would you lend me your time just once more, on that day?^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001830.ogg":^  ...That way, I think both me and my brother will be satisfied.^@:dwave 0, "voice\11\82001831.ogg":^  I think...it might also be a chance for you to free yourself from the weight of my brother's memory, Mr. Tohya."^\

_ld r,":b;sprites\fea\1\fea_a11_def1.png",80
advsetwindow "56"
;gggg
langjp「……予定は、……問題ないです。@文庫の後書きさえ終わらせておけば。」@
;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900285.ogg":^"...I...don't believe we have any plans for then.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900286.ogg":^  As long as we can finish the afterword for the book."^\

