;＜八城
langen:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900288.ogg":^"Don't worry about that...^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900289.ogg":^  ...The tales of the future are always woven by children.^@:dwave 0, "voice\56\84900290.ogg":^  ...After all, without them, the tale of Humans will not continue."^\

